    ["trigger5号"] = "Trigger No. 5",
    ["\"This is the power of magic.\""] = "\"This is the power of magic.\"",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Match Rules </>\n The arena uses <Highlight> player's real attributes </>, and the effects of <Highlight> equipment, Sealed Artifacts, marionettes, connections, and Beyonder talent systems </> are all effective. Players will compete as a team, with a maximum of two players of the same pathway per team. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Registration Rules </>\n Once match registration opens, players can form or join a team. Once a team <Highlight> reaches 5 members </>, they can register. \n From the opening of registration until it is locked, the team leader can freely adjust members, and members can freely leave. If a registered team's member count falls below 5 due to changes, registration will be automatically canceled. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Locking Rules </>\n During the registration lock period, registered teams can enter the preparation area. Unregistered teams can still register, and players can join teams, but they cannot leave or be removed by the leader. Registered teams cannot cancel their registration. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battle Rules </>\n After the match officially begins, players must <Highlight> stay in the preparation area </> to ensure they enter the match normally; leaving the preparation area without authorization will result in being unable to participate. \n In the group stage, opponents are randomly matched for a single-game match. There are six rounds in total, and 16 teams are selected to advance based on wins. If wins are tied, <Highlight> Glory Value (based on kills and combat duration) </> will determine the advancer. \n After the group stage, the support phase begins. Before the knockout stage, the knockout bracket is determined based on the <Highlight> sum of support value and Glory Value </>. Support can still be given after the knockout stage begins, but it will no longer affect the bracket. \n The knockout stage will use a <Highlight> best-of-three </> format to determine the winner, and the final will use a <Highlight> best-of-five </> format to determine the champion!"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Match Rules </>\n The arena uses <Highlight> player's real attributes </>, and the effects of <Highlight> equipment, Запечатанный артефактs, Марионеткаs, connections, and Потусторонний talent systems </> are all effective. Players will compete as a team, with a maximum of two players of the same pathway per team. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Registration Rules </>\n Once match registration opens, players can form or join a team. Once a team <Highlight> reaches 5 members </>, they can register. \n From the opening of registration until it is locked, the team leader can freely adjust members, and members can freely leave. If a registered team's member count falls below 5 due to changes, registration will be automatically canceled. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Locking Rules </>\n During the registration lock period, registered teams can enter the preparation area. Unregistered teams can still register, and players can join teams, but they cannot leave or be removed by the leader. Registered teams cannot cancel their registration. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battle Rules </>\n After the match officially begins, players must <Highlight> stay in the preparation area </> to ensure they enter the match normally; leaving the preparation area without authorization will result in being unable to participate. \n In the group stage, opponents are randomly matched for a single-game match. There are six rounds in total, and 16 teams are selected to advance based on wins. If wins are tied, <Highlight> Glory Value (based on kills and combat duration) </> will determine the advancer. \n After the group stage, the support phase begins. Before the knockout stage, the knockout bracket is determined based on the <Highlight> sum of support value and Glory Value </>. Support can still be given after the knockout stage begins, but it will no longer affect the bracket. \n The knockout stage will use a <Highlight> best-of-three </> format to determine the winner, and the final will use a <Highlight> best-of-five </> format to determine the champion!",
    ["<Red>视力损伤</>：异界状态结束后的5秒内陷入视野模糊状态，期间格挡降低*f**，防御降低*f**。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Vision Impairment</>: Within 5 seconds after the Otherworldly state ends, you fall into a blurred vision state, during which Block is reduced by *f** and Defense is reduced by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["BuffType column in the Buff table. After filling in this parameter, it will be immune to all buffs of this BuffType."] = "BuffType column in the Buff table. After filling in this parameter, it will be immune to all buffs of this BuffType.",
    ["\"Seer\" Pathway senior"] = "«Провидец» Путь старший",
    ["“愚者”先生以屏障碎片为基石，于灵界中开辟了一片安全空间，在此建立塔罗学派。"] = "Господин «Дурак» использовал фрагменты Барьера как краеугольный камень, чтобы открыть безопасное пространство в Мире Духов, основав здесь Клуб Таро.",
    ["【LV1】【秘偶技】寻踪魔弹-召唤"] = "[LV1] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon",
    ["<Mark id=\"#159\"> The Hidden Sage </> was initially just an impersonal deity. \n Compared to a god, It was closer to a concept, a natural law, or rather, knowledge itself. \n The Moses Ascetic Order, which believes in It, possesses the potions and advancement methods of the <Mark id=\"#159\"> \"Mystery Pryer\" </> pathway... A maxim circulates within the order—<InvHighlight_HW> Do what you will, but do no harm </>—which is also believed in and practiced by many \"Mystery Pryers.\" \n ... Her Highness Bernadette seems to like it as well."] = "<Mark id=\"#159\"> The Hidden Sage </> was initially just an impersonal deity. \n Compared to a god, It was closer to a concept, a natural law, or rather, knowledge itself. \n The Moses Ascetic Order, which believes in It, possesses the potions and advancement methods of the <Mark id=\"#159\"> \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами\" </> pathway... A maxim circulates within the order—<InvHighlight_HW> Do what you will, but do no harm </>—which is also believed in and practiced by many \"Подглядывающий за Тайнамиs.\" \n ... Her Highness Bernadette seems to like it as well.",
    ["【塔罗会】(2) 全队 +5%攻击力"] = "【Клуб Таро】(2) Вся команда +5% к силе атаки.",
    ["{{\"Skill ID%i\", \"Level Increase\"}}"] = "{{\"Skill ID%i\", \"Level Increase\"}}",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】学徒"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Ученик",
    ["【Rogue】星云咏叹-法术代理"] = "[Rogue] Nebula Aria - Spell Proxy",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1956, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 2264, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 2572, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+1普通\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1368, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1627, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1886, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2普通\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 781, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 991, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1201, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 978, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1132, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1286, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1普通\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 390, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 495, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 600, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p30.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p30.min, data.p30.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1956, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 2264, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 2572, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний+1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1368, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1627, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1886, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 781, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 991, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1201, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 978, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1132, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1286, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 390, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 495, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 600, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p30.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p30.min, data.p30.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice)",
    ["·相关信息：被魔鬼引诱、堕落成恶的前大主教，带着封印物“0-08”潜逃。\n·序列能力：晋升失败的<Tips id=\"#160\">“看门人”</>，“收尸人”途径序列五。\n·外貌特征：发色暗金，瞳孔深蓝近黑，<Tips id=\"#160\">左眼</>盲瞎、留有伤疤。\n·封印物信息：封印物代号<Mark id=\"#159\">“0-08”</>，最高保密等级，原属于黑夜女神教会。外形是一支常见的羽毛笔，但不需要墨水也能书写。"] = "·Relevant information: A former archbishop who was seduced by the devil and fell into evil, absconded with the Запечатанный артефакт \"0-08\".\n·Последовательность ability: A failed <Tips id=\"#160\">\"Gatekeeper\"</>, Последовательность 5 of the \"Corpse Collector\" pathway.\n·Appearance: Dark gold hair, deep blue eyes nearly black, <Tips id=\"#160\">left eye</> blind and scarred.\n·Запечатанный артефакт information: Запечатанный артефакт code <Mark id=\"#159\">\"0-08\"</>, highest security clearance, originally belonging to the Church of the Evernight Goddess. It takes the form of an ordinary quill, but can write without ink.",
    ["【困难难度】已出现，你可以反复向噩梦中的敌人发起挑战！这一次，“剥面人”强尼失去理智，向你亮出了利爪。"] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your Кошмарs! This time, \"Face-Peeler\" Johnny has lost his mind and bared his claws at you.",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演占星人】\n占星爱好者弗洛最近倒霉透顶，他坚信是星星变了位置导致的。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as an Astrologer】 \n Astrology enthusiast Flo has been having terrible luck lately, and he firmly believes it's because the stars have changed positions.",
    ["GTA Gun Parry Tutorial"] = "GTA Gun Parry Tutorial",
    ["Trigger 35% Max Health Shield when HP < 40%"] = "Trigger 35% Max Health Shield when HP < 40%",
    ["[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Life Steal."] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Вампиризм.",
    ["“收尸人”的战斗能力应该是其中最强的，另外两个序列都缺乏直接的对敌手段。"] = "Боевые способности «Собирателя трупов» должны быть самыми сильными среди них; в двух других эпизодах отсутствуют прямые средства противостояния врагам.",
    ["【塔罗会·西尔维娅】档4增量(+25%)→累计140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 4-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["【晋升】序列8,1250340"] = "【Advancement】Последовательность 8, 1250340",
    ["“指证”。当你构建出完整的逻辑链条，就必须以坚定的意志和灵性，将你的推论“呈现”出来。"] = "«Свидетельство». Когда вы строите полную логическую цепочку, вы должны использовать твердую волю и духовность, чтобы «представить» свой вывод.",
    ["　　“魔术师”佛尔思悄然吸了口气道：\n　　“我想求购食灵者的胃袋和20毫升深海枪鱼的血液，用金镑支付。”\n　　我还有430镑，能买得起一件……她默默鼓励了自己一句。\n　　至于剩下那件的钱从哪里来，她一时半会也没有办法。\n       这就是制约许多非凡者晋升的主要原因之一……人呐，真的不能尝试超过本身能力的消费，如果不是为了彻底摆脱满月呓语的影响，成为“戏法大师”，有了相对丰富的超凡手段之后，我都不会再考虑晋升的问题，甚至不再接触这个圈子，写写书，攒攒钱，喝喝茶，和休一起逛逛街，等她完成那件事情后，就到北大陆南大陆不同的地方旅行，不害怕危险和意外，好好享受生活……佛尔思的思绪忽然有些发散。\n\n       ——第二卷《无面人》第一百四十七章 一个困难的问题"] = "\"Фокусник\" Fors quietly took a breath and said:\n \"I would like to purchase the stomach of a Spirit Eater and 20ml of blood from a Deep Sea Marlin, paying with gold pounds.\"\n I still have 430 pounds, I can afford one... she encouraged herself silently.\n As for where the money for the other item would come from, she had no idea for the moment.\n This is one of the main reasons that restricts the advancement of many Потустороннийs... People really shouldn't try to consume beyond their own means. If it weren't for completely getting rid of the influence of the full moon's whispers and becoming a \"Безликий,\" having relatively rich extraordinary means, I wouldn't even consider advancement, or even touch this circle. I'd just write books, save money, drink tea, go shopping with Xio, and after she finishes that matter, travel to different places in the Northern and Southern Continents, not fearing danger or accidents, and enjoy life properly... Fors's thoughts suddenly wandered.\n\n — Volume 2: Безликий, Chapter 147: A Difficult Question",
    ["\"Grade 2\" dangerous object... Dangerous, use with caution and restraint. So, is this action performed because of the special nature of the Sealed Artifact?"] = "\"Grade 2\" dangerous object... Dangerous, use with caution and restraint. So, is this action performed because of the special nature of the Запечатанный артефакт?",
    ["none: No target required; \n owner: The originator of the skill and buff; \n tar: The target of the skill and buff; \n tarlist: Targets in the blackboard."] = "none: No target required; \n owner: The originator of the skill and buff; \n tar: The target of the skill and buff; \n tarlist: Targets in the blackboard.",
    ["[Deprecated] Spectator Attack Form: 10% Damage Boost against targets with Insight Vulnerability status"] = "[Deprecated] Зритель Attack Form: 10% Damage Boost against targets with Insight Vulnerability status",
    ["[True Form] During the Current duration, a static field following the target is generated at the target's feet, continuously dealing damage to enemies within range for 5 seconds."] = "[True Form] During the Current duration, a static field following the target is generated at the target's feet, continuously dealing damage to enemies within range for 5 seconds.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <Scourge Avatar> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Scourge Avatar> trait",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Psychiatrist】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Психиатр】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time.",
    ["【塔罗学院氛围】会议室-浮雕"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Meeting Room - Relief",
    ["... \n \n Use a silver <Mark id=\"#159\"> Ritual Dagger, </> take <InvHighlight> a little blood from both wrists, </> mix it, and smear it on the ritual magic circle, firming the determination to actively bind the soul with one's own will... Take the juice of the Immortal Moss and chant: \"The shell temporarily returns to the eternal night, the true name is hidden in the ashes.\" \n \n ... <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> The body presents all the signs of death, </> and returns to normal after seven days."] = "... \n \n Use a silver <Mark id=\"#159\"> Ritual Dagger, </> take <InvHighlight> a little blood from both wrists, </> mix it, and smear it on the ritual magic circle, firming the determination to actively bind the soul with one's own will... Take the juice of the Immortal Moss and chant: \"The shell temporarily returns to the eternal night, the true name is hidden in the ashes.\" \n \n ... <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> The body presents all the signs of death, </> and returns to normal after seven days.",
    ["trigger3号"] = "Trigger No. 3",
    ["【塔罗会】(7) 全队 +45%攻击力 +1000生命 +15%暴击"] = "【Клуб Таро】(7) Вся команда +45% силы атаки +1000 здоровья +15% критического удара",
    ["<P_Heart>(Selena is most likely praying to an evil existence. If this continues, she will turn into an evil spirit, and everyone present will be in danger... It's best to perform an interrupted ritual immediately.)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Скорее всего, Селена молится злому существованию. Если так будет продолжаться, она превратится в злого духа, и все присутствующие окажутся в опасности... Лучше немедленно провести прерванный ритуал.)</>",
    ["[True Form] When the detonation damage of Nightmare Impact hits 3 or more enemies, it generates a Nightmare Core. After a 1-second delay, the Nightmare Core explodes, dealing area damage."] = "[True Form] When the detonation damage of Кошмар Impact hits 3 or more enemies, it generates a Кошмар Core. After a 1-second delay, the Кошмар Core explodes, dealing area damage.",
    ["{{先生|女士}}，我曾经是一名魔术师，擅长在众目睽睽下逃出笼子。"] = "{{Mr.|Ms.}}, I used to be a Фокусник, skilled at escaping from cages in front of everyone's eyes.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>培养推荐</>\n1.根据非凡者选取的<Highlight>目标场景</>、非凡者<Highlight>当前属性</>和<Highlight>对抗目标的属性</>，自动为非凡者推荐养成<Highlight>期望收益</>较大的属性；\n2.仅计算常见的<Highlight>养成属性</>，部分未显示属性（如攻击速度增幅、获得护盾增幅）不纳入计算范围；\n3.<Highlight>期望收益</>同时受到该属性在<Highlight>目标场景</>的<Highlight>能力提升幅度</>和<Highlight>养成难度</>的影响；\n4.<Highlight>期望收益</>仅考虑当前属性少量增加的情况，部分属性大量提升后（或与对抗目标的对抗属性相差较大时）的收益会<Highlight>显著增加</>或<Highlight>显著减少</>，推荐仅供参考。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Cultivation Recommendation </>\n 1. Based on the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> selected by the Потусторонний, the Потусторонний's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>, automatically recommend attributes with higher <Highlight>Expected Returns</> for the Потусторонний's cultivation; \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Cultivation Attributes</> are calculated; some unshown attributes (such as Скорость атаки Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> are simultaneously influenced by the <Highlight>Ability Improvement Magnitude</> of the attribute in the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> and the <Highlight>Cultivation Difficulty</>; \n 4. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> only consider the situation of a small increase in current attributes. After a large increase in some attributes (or when there is a large difference compared to the opponent's confrontation attributes), the returns will <Highlight>Significantly Increase</> or <Highlight>Significantly Decrease</>. The recommendation is for reference only.",
    ["{{player.name}} has found a precious {{item.name}} amidst the Beyonder convergence; their Beyonder journey extends forward from this point on."] = "{{player.name}} has found a precious {{item.name}} amidst the Потусторонний convergence; their Потусторонний journey extends forward from this point on.",
    ["　　奥黛丽缓缓吐了口气，绽放出优雅明丽的笑容，在父亲和母亲的陪伴下，走出休息室，进入晚会大厅。\n　　她一路走上最前方的高台，在一道道惊艳的目光里，将戴着及肘白纱手套的手递给了王后。\n　　王后牵着她，走向高台边缘，面对所有宾客。稍有停顿，王后微笑道：\n　　“虽然这是贝克兰德历史上的黑暗时段，但我们依然有一颗足以照亮整座城市的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。\n　　“今天，我将她正式介绍给你们。\n　　“奥黛丽·霍尔小姐。”\n　　砰！砰！砰！\n　　落地窗外，烟花升空，炸出一片又一片梦幻的光亮。\n　　1349年最后一天的晚上，奥黛丽在社交意义上正式成年了。\n\n　　——第二卷《无面人》第二百六十九章 辞旧迎新"] = "Одри медленно выдохнула, расцветая элегантной и яркой улыбкой, и в сопровождении отца и матери вышла из гостиной в бальный зал. \n　　Она прошла до высокой платформы впереди и под ошеломляющими взглядами протянула руку, покрытую белыми кружевными перчатками, доходящими до локтей, Королеве. \n　　Королева взяла ее за руку и подошла к краю высокой платформы, лицом ко всем гостям. После небольшой паузы королева улыбнулась: \n　　\"Хотя это темный период в истории Баклунда, у нас все еще есть драгоценный камень, способный осветить весь город. Ее мудрость, ее красота, ее характер и ее этикет безупречны. \n　　\"Сегодня я официально представляю ее вам. \n　　\"Мисс Одри Холл.\" \n　　Бах! Хлопнуть! Хлопнуть! \n　　За окнами от пола до потолка в небо поднялся фейерверк, разбиваясь пятнами мечтательного света. \n　　В ночь последнего дня 1349 года Одри официально стала взрослой в социальном смысле. \n\n　　——Том 2: Безликий, Глава 269: Звонок в старом и звон в новом",
    ["“当初的选择还是太草率了，现在看来不管是学徒还是占卜家，或者偷盗者，都更加好。”"] = "«Первоначальный выбор все еще был слишком опрометчивым. Теперь кажется, что будь то Ученик, Провидец или Мародёр, все они будут лучше.»",
    ["　　Audrey immediately put her mind to work, thinking as she said: \n　　\"You are Mr. Fool, from the Tarot cards. As a regular, long-term, and secret 'gathering,' the titles should be as consistent as possible. Hmm, I'll pick from the Tarot cards too.\" \n　　Her tone gradually became cheerful: \n　　\"Decided, my title is, 'Justice'!\" \n　　This is one of the twenty-two Major Arcana cards. \n\n　　——Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 7: Codename"] = "Одри сразу же приступила к работе, думая, когда она сказала: \n　　\"Вы мистер Дурак, судя по картам Таро. При регулярном, долгосрочном и секретном \"сборе\" названия должны быть как можно более последовательными. Хм, я тоже выберу из карт Таро.\" \n　　Ее тон постепенно стал веселым: \n　　\"Решено, мой титул - \"Справедливость\"!\" \n　　Это одна из двадцати двух карт Старших Арканов. \n\n　　——Том 1: Клоун, Глава 7: Кодовое имя",
    ["　　失败了。\n　　值夜者闯进仪式现场，“审判官”的锯刀挡不住他们，他被当场击毙。核心也碎了，那个我一手带起来的愣头青，我最忠诚的仆人，菲尔，为了守住门口，被子弹打成了筛子。\n　　我浑身像被火烧过一样，但侥幸没有失控。我逃了出来。\n　　回到住处，发现有人等在那里。黑夜教会的人。他们说，已经查清了我做的一切。作为惩罚，他们将抹除我所有的记忆、能力和事迹。从此以后，廷根再也没有我这个人。\n　　曾经的“廷根英雄”，没想到如今走到了这一步。\n　　我想反抗，但动不了。最后一刻，我听见他们说：“市民们会忘记你的名字——崔佛·墨菲，但也许会在心底留下一个影子，一个替他们维系正义的影子。”\n　　那影子……会代替我吗？"] = "Неуспешный. \n Ночные Ястребы ворвались на место проведения ритуала; Пила «Инквизитора» не смогла их остановить, и он был застрелен на месте. Ядро также было разрушено. Тот вспыльчивый ребенок, которого я вырастил собственными руками, мой самый верный слуга Фил, был изрешечен пулями, охраняя дверь. \nВсе мое тело было словно обожжено огнем, но, к счастью, я не потерял контроль. Я сбежал. \n Вернувшись домой, я обнаружил, что там кто-то ждет. Люди из Церкви Вечной Ночи. Они сказали, что уже выяснили все, что я сделал. В наказание они сотрут все мои воспоминания, способности и поступки. Отныне в Тингене больше не будет такого человека, как я. \n Бывший «Герой Тингена», я не ожидал, что сегодня окажусь в таком положении. \nЯ хотел сопротивляться, но не мог пошевелиться. В последний момент я услышал, как они сказали: «Граждане забудут ваше имя — Тревор Мерфи, но, возможно, они оставят тень в своих сердцах, тень, которая сохранит для них справедливость». \n Эта тень... заменит ли она меня?",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道有非凡力量参与？追上去看看！）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Могут ли здесь быть задействованы потусторонние силы? Давайте проследим и посмотрим!) </>",
    ["It has been five years since we graduated. The shadow of war has lifted from our hometown, and everything has returned to how it was, or even better. I imagine Backlund must have recovered even faster than here.\nI heard you have become a great manager now, and I am sincerely happy for your bright future. A girl from a small town has reached such heights; fate has finally rewarded those who deserve it.\nI intended to come to Backlund to congratulate you in person, but little Miller's health hasn't been great lately, so I have to decline your travel invitation for now. But don't worry, my dear, I believe we will have time to meet again in the future."] = "It has been five years since we graduated. The shadow of war has lifted from our hometown, and everything has returned to how it was, or even better. I imagine Бэкланд must have recovered even faster than here.\nI heard you have become a great manager now, and I am sincerely happy for your bright future. A girl from a small town has reached such heights; fate has finally rewarded those who deserve it.\nI intended to come to Бэкланд to congratulate you in person, but little Miller's health hasn't been great lately, so I have to decline your travel invitation for now. But don't worry, my dear, I believe we will have time to meet again in the future.",
    ["<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposed</> effect, revealing up to 1 stack per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> stacks. For every <Yellow>15</> stacks consumed, you can pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's spirit body to deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, reduce incoming Healing by <Yellow>70%</> for <Yellow>3 seconds</>, and reduce movement speed by <Yellow>*f**</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to Stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Super Armor state, re-apply <Yellow>3</> stacks of Weakness Exposed to them."] = "<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposed</> effect, revealing up to 1 stack per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> stacks. For every <Yellow>15</> stacks consumed, you can pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's Духовное тело to deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, reduce incoming Healing by <Yellow>70%</> for <Yellow>3 seconds</>, and reduce Скорость бега by <Yellow>*f**</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to Stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Суперброня state, re-apply <Yellow>3</> stacks of Weakness Exposed to them.",
    ["BOSS 4 - Quality - Medium attack"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — Средняя атака",
    ["[True Form] When releasing gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, allies with the Historical Beacon mark gain an additional Shield, but the Historical Beacon mark is removed. This Shield does not deal damage to surrounding targets when it ends."] = "[True Form] When releasing gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, allies with the Historical Beacon mark gain an additional Shield, but the Historical Beacon mark is removed. This Shield does not deal damage to surrounding targets when it ends.",
    ["{{ Mr.| Ms.}}, could you please light another match for me?"] = "{{ Mr.| Ms.}}, could you please light another match for me?",
    ["【Rougue】戏法演绎-法术代理"] = "[Roguelike] Trick Performance - Spell Proxy",
    ["reminder trigger 2"] = "reminder trigger 2",
    ["<P_Heart>(Could she be a Beast Tamer? Or another Beyonder who can communicate with animals?)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Может ли она быть Укротительницей Зверей? Или другим Потусторонним, умеющим общаться с животными?)</>",
    ["“正义”女士的馈赠，给人一种莫名的安心感。降低你受到的伤害，并把承受过的苦难化作财富，按累积伤害提升防御。财富压身太久，你会不堪重负。"] = "Подарок от госпожи Джастис, дающий необъяснимое чувство покоя. Он уменьшает получаемый вами урон и превращает перенесенные вами страдания в богатство, увеличивая защиту на основе накопленного урона. Если богатство будет тяготить вас слишком долго, вы будете разбиты.",
    ["iOS端暂不支持充值"] = "Recharge is not currently supported on iOS.",
    ["Trigger 1.5s Invincibility when HP is low"] = "Trigger 1.5s Invincibility when HP is low",
    ["……原本它已经被封印了，妥善保管的情况下不会造成新的损害，但，我和同伴受到了它们的蛊惑……"] = "…Originally it had already been sealed, and it wouldn't have caused any new damage if kept properly, but my companions and I were bewitched by them…",
    ["To Beyonder \n May your future be as wealthy as Audrey's. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "To Потусторонний \n Пусть твое будущее будет таким же богатым, как у Одри. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["【本相】梦魇冲击的引爆伤害命中敌人数大于等于3时，生成一个梦魇核心，延迟1秒后梦魇核心发生爆炸，造成范围伤害。"] = "[True Form] When the detonation damage of Кошмар Impact hits 3 or more enemies, it generates a Кошмар Core. After a 1-second delay, the Кошмар Core explodes, dealing area damage.",
    ["<P_Heart>(This lady is really proactive. Participating in such a secret organization has both pros and cons for us. People from different parts of the world exchanging information in this gray fog space...)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Эта дама действительно инициативная. Участие в такой секретной организации имеет для нас как плюсы, так и минусы. Люди из разных уголков мира обмениваются информацией в этом сером туманном пространстве...)</>",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3 Beyonder\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p50     = {score = 2325, min = 1.00, max = 1.20},\n            p70     = {score = 2595, min = 1.20, max = 1.40},\n            p90     = {score = 2865, min = 1.40, max = 1.60},\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder + 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1790, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 2034, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 2278, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder + 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1255, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1473, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1691, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 720, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 912, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1104, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1550, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1730, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1910, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder + 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1015, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1169, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1323, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 480, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 608, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 736, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 775, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 865, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 955, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 240, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 304, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 368, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelseif $1 > data.p90.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p90.min, data.p90.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice + $4)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p50     = {score = 2325, min = 1.00, max = 1.20},\n            p70     = {score = 2595, min = 1.20, max = 1.40},\n            p90     = {score = 2865, min = 1.40, max = 1.60},\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний + 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1790, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 2034, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 2278, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний + 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1255, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1473, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1691, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 720, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 912, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1104, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1550, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1730, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1910, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний + 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1015, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1169, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1323, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 480, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 608, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 736, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 775, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 865, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 955, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 240, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 304, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 368, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelseif $1 > data.p90.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p90.min, data.p90.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice + $4)",
    ["【塔罗会·巨斧骑士】档7增量(+30%)→累计220%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["Perhaps you will never notice the two ordinary audience members from Tingen who sat in the audience last year, but I fell in love with you because of your brilliant performance. Therefore, when I met you in a university lecture, I was ecstatic.\nWhat should I thank for bringing you to Tingen? The academic atmosphere, your mind, or fate? Since you arrived, I have begun to be grateful for everything in life. I truly wish to see your flaws so that my heart might cool down a little. But please do not let me see your tears, because even just the few lines in a magazine describing the tears you shed during your performance made my heart ache. Of course, I understand that this is your talent; you were born for the stage. Thinking of this, my love increases a thousandfold."] = "Возможно, вы никогда не заметите двух обычных зрителей из Тингена, которые сидели в зале в прошлом году, но я влюбился в вас из-за вашего блестящего выступления. Поэтому, когда я встретил вас на университетской лекции, я был в восторге.\nЧему я должен быть благодарен за то, что привел вас в Тинген? Академическая атмосфера, ваш разум или судьба? С тех пор, как ты приехал, я начал быть благодарен за все в жизни. Мне искренне хочется увидеть твои недостатки, чтобы мое сердце хоть немного остыло. Но, пожалуйста, не позволяйте мне видеть ваши слезы, потому что даже несколько строк в журнале, описывающих слезы, которые вы пролили во время выступления, заставили мое сердце защемить. Я, конечно, понимаю, что это ваш талант; ты рожден для сцены. Думая об этом, моя любовь возрастает в тысячу раз.",
    ["Mr. Fool located countless Mythical Creatures from history and used 'Grafting' to transfer their power to Sefirah Castle, obtaining Mythical Fabric."] = "Мистер Дурак обнаружил бесчисленное количество мифических существ из истории и использовал «прививку», чтобы передать их силу замку Сефиры, получив Мифическую Ткань.",
    ["{{\"BuffID%i\",\"Buff Stacks%i\",\"Buff Duration%i\"}}"] = "{{\"BuffID%i\",\"Buff Stacks%i\",\"Buff Duration%i\"}}",
    ["　　生活太<Letter_RedBig>辛苦</>了，像我们这样穷苦的人，生来似乎就是为了劳作的。\n　　如果不劳作，今天吃完了饭，就要操心明天的饭在哪里。\n　　如果运气好，工厂给了我劳作的机会，今天工作结束，又要操心明天的工作。\n　　冷的时候，手上会长<Letter_RedBig>疮口</>，一点一点冻掉我的肉。\n　　热的时候，棉絮会钻进我的肺部，让我一点一点咳出我的<Letter_RedBig>灵魂</>。\n　　对我这样的人来说，明天是一种负担。\n　　“永暗的蜡烛，不毁的身躯”，我想要什么也不管，什么也不顾……直接睡过去。"] = "Жизнь слишком <Letter_RedBig>hard</>. Для таких бедных людей, как мы, мы, кажется, рождены только для того, чтобы трудиться.\n　　Если мы не трудимся, то, закончив сегодняшнюю еду, нам приходится беспокоиться о том, откуда придет завтрашняя.\n　　Если нам повезет и фабрика даст мне возможность работать, то, как только сегодняшняя работа будет сделана, мне придется беспокоиться о завтрашней работе.\n　　Когда холодно, на моих руках растут язвы, <Letter_RedBig>раны</>, которые медленно замораживают мою плоть.\n　　Когда жарко, хлопковые волокна проникают в мои легкие, заставляя меня постепенно откашливать мою <Letter_RedBig>душу</>.\n　　Для кого-то вроде меня завтрашний день - это бремя.\n　　\"Свеча вечной тьмы, нерушимое тело\", я хочу игнорировать все, ни о чем не заботиться... и просто упасть спит.",
    [" Years have passed, and I have climbed step by step from Sequence 9 to Sequence 5, becoming an \"Astronomer.\" Every night I observe the stars and calculate the ritual nodes, and I am only one step away from becoming an \"Alchemist.\" \n But this step requires too many things: money, resources, and... people. \n The matter of the bullets was handled by me; three hundred special ammunition, I call them \"Gold Bullets,\" which can allow people to briefly gain powerful strength. \n I personally altered the files, reported the consumption, and shipped them out in batches. The \"Inquisitor\" is now my loyal servant; he will use these Gold Bullets to attract enough people—thieves, hooligans, killers... whoever they are, let those at the bottom who are dissatisfied with the status quo have a place to go. Once they gather, the ritual can be started. \n They will become sacrifices. It doesn't matter; they are all scum and rot anyway, and cleaning them up is good for Tingen."] = "Прошли годы, и я шаг за шагом поднялся от Последовательности 9 к Последовательности 5, став «Астрономом». Каждую ночь я наблюдаю за звездами и рассчитываю ритуальные узлы, и я всего в одном шаге от того, чтобы стать «Алхимиком». \n Но этот шаг требует слишком многого: денег, ресурсов и... людей. \n Вопрос о пулях решал я; триста специальных боеприпасов, я называю их «Золотыми пулями», которые могут позволить людям ненадолго обрести мощную силу. \nЯ лично изменял файлы, сообщал об их использовании и отправлял их партиями. «Инквизитор» теперь мой верный слуга; он будет использовать эти золотые пули, чтобы привлечь достаточное количество людей — воров, хулиганов, убийц… кем бы они ни были, пусть тем, кто внизу, недовольным статус-кво, будет куда пойти. Как только они соберутся, можно начинать ритуал. \n Они станут жертвами. Это не имеет значения; все равно они все отбросы и гниль, и очистка их пойдет на пользу Тингену.",
    ["“绝望魔镜”卷宗"] = "\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" dossier",
    ["BOSS has entered damage immunity state, please switch targets immediately"] = "БОСС вошел в состояние иммунитета к урону, пожалуйста, немедленно поменяйте цели.",
    ["Enum(抵抗类型)"] = "Enum(Resistance Type)",
    ["“占卜家”途径学姐"] = "«Провидец» Путь старший",
    ["\"Market\" is an important way to acquire castle assets."] = "\"Market\" is an important way to acquire castle assets.",
    ["GVG High Tower Effect Buff Black Emperor"] = "GVG High Tower Effect Buff Black Emperor",
    ["【塔罗会·戴里克】档4增量(+25%)→累计140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 4-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["“魔术师”女士，您小时候……是什么样的？"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, what were you like…… when you were a child?",
    ["\"Woo—\" The silver whistle was blown, like the gentle murmur of a nightingale, like the warm breeze of a summer night. \nThe Out-of-Control Person stopped their attack, and a glimmer of reason actually condensed in their mad eyes. \nThey saw all regrets being mended, all ugliness being wiped away, and all sadness yet to arise. They saw another happy ending. \nHave a beautiful dream; in the dream, nothing has fallen yet. \nSleep forever in the beautiful dream, and bury the pain of this life here. \nThe Nighthawk's Demon Hunter Bullet passed through the wind, taking away the life of the Out-of-Control Person. The terrifying, mutated body swayed and fell, but it was smiling. \n\"May the Goddess protect you.\" The teammate put away the gun and prayed, then stroked the little bird that had affectionately landed on their shoulder. \"This Sealed Artifact is truly harmless; after all, who would consider these birds as a negative effect?\" \nArnold took out the box for storing Sealed Artifacts and gently placed the Nightingale Silver Whistle back, tucking it away securely. \nHis figure was upright, his eyes firm, and his laughter hearty, looking very much like an old friend. \n\"Perhaps it is because a gentle soul once resided within it.\""] = "— Ууу… — Серебряный свисток раздался, как нежный ропот соловья, как теплый ветерок летней ночи. \nВышедший из-под контроля человек прекратил атаку, и в его безумных глазах застыл проблеск разума. \nОни увидели, как все сожаления были исправлены, все уродство исчезло, а вся печаль еще не возникла. Они увидели еще один счастливый конец. \nПриятной мечты; во сне еще ничего не упало. \nСпи вечно прекрасным сном и похорони боль этой жизни здесь. \nПуля Охотника на демонов Ночного Ястреба прошла сквозь ветер, забрав жизнь вышедшего из-под контроля человека. Ужасающее мутировавшее тело покачнулось и упало, но оно улыбалось. \n«Да защитит тебя Богиня». Товарищ по команде убрал пистолет и помолился, а затем погладил маленькую птичку, которая ласково приземлилась ему на плечо. «Этот Запечатанный Артефакт действительно безвреден; в конце концов, кто может считать этих птиц негативным эффектом?» \nАрнольд достал коробку для хранения Запечатанных Артефактов и аккуратно положил Соловьиный Серебряный Свисток обратно, надежно спрятав его. \nЕго фигура была прямой, глаза твердыми, а смех искренним, и он очень напоминал старого друга. \n\"Возможно, это потому, что когда-то в нём жила нежная душа.\"",
    ["{{player.name}}刚刚完成了一次价值超过两百万的<Chat_Highlight>铁路大亨之旅</>，让我们恭喜这位非凡者，这段由谋略与运气交织而成的故事，才刚刚开始。"] = "{{player.name}} has just completed a <Chat_Highlight>Railroad Tycoon Journey</> worth over two million. Let us congratulate this Потусторонний; this story, woven from strategy and luck, has only just begun.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {Justiciar} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with the {Justiciar} entry",
    ["【Tarot Club】(4) Entire team +15% Attack Power +400 Health"] = "【Клуб Таро】(4) Вся команда +15% силы атаки +400 здоровья.",
    ["“知识与智慧之神”向你投来注视。"] = "The God of Knowledge and Wisdom is casting his gaze upon you.",
    ["{{player.name}} 掷骰<Chat_Highlight>两连大成功！</>，森严的概率法则在他面前俯首认输。"] = "{{player.name}} rolled <Chat_Highlight>two consecutive critical successes!</> The stern laws of probability bow and concede before him.",
    ["……好吧。我有个朋友患上<P_Yellow>沉睡症</>，我要用“心脏”调配药剂治疗她。"] = "……Alright. I have a friend suffering from <P_Yellow>Somnolence Disorder</>, and I need to use a “Heart” to concoct a potion to treat her.",
    ["　　最新吸血鬼爱情小说《月下来客》引发抢购热潮！书中描绘的\"黑蔷薇邀请函\"、”月下野餐“等浪漫桥段，正成为年轻人的示爱新风尚。"] = "Последний любовный роман о вампирах «Гостья под луной» вызвал ажиотаж покупателей! Романтические сцены, описанные в книге, такие как «Приглашение к черной розе» и «Пикник под луной», становятся новой тенденцией для молодых людей выражать свою любовь.",
    ["Id(法术场)"] = "Id (Spell Field).",
    ["<Yellow>Hurricane</>: The holder's movement speed is increased by <Yellow>10%</> in combat, and Basic Attack speed is increased by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?20%}</>; \n<Yellow>Lightning</>: When the holder's Basic Attack hits a hostile target, there is a <Yellow>15%</> probability of unleashing a Lightning Strike on the target, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?*d}</> damage. The lightning has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?60%}</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>3-second</> Stagnation effect."] = "<Yellow>Hurricane</>: The holder's Скорость бега is increased by <Yellow>10%</> in combat, and Базовая атака speed is increased by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?20%}</>; \n<Yellow>Lightning</>: When the holder's Базовая атака hits a hostile target, there is a <Yellow>15%</> probability of unleashing a Lightning Strike on the target, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?*d}</> damage. The lightning has a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=1?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=2?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085025)=3?60%}</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>3-second</> Stagnation effect.",
    ["……没有？看来，今天我们都该休息了。嗯，这是不需要灵性直觉也能得到的启示。"] = "……None? It seems we should both rest today. Hmm, this is an revelation one can get without Духовность intuition.",
    ["{{player.name}}对{{targetPlayer.name}}进行了安魂——很显然失败了，自身损失了<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</>点理智。"] = "{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}—it clearly failed, and they lost <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</> Рассудок points.",
    ["【浅见】宁静光环内的友方和自身每次攻击目标可以回复少量生命，1秒最多触发1次，诗意光环半径增加2米。"] = "[Insight] Allies and self within the Tranquility aura can recover a small amount of Health with each attack on a target, triggering at most once per second. The Poetic aura radius is increased by 2 meters.",
