    ["Trigger: Arrive at Pumpkin Stall"] = "Trigger: Arrive at Pumpkin Stall",
    ["Buff列表中随机创建一个Buff"] = "Создайте случайное усиление из списка усилений.",
    ["The Death Archon is casting his gaze upon you."] = "The Death Archon is casting his gaze upon you.",
    ["· After activating this switch, if a Sealed Artifact's triggered effect requires an additional manual button press, it will be automatically released when One-tap Support is enabled. \n · Turning on this switch alone only unlocks the automatic release permission for Sealed Artifact triggered effects; you still need to enable the One-tap Support function for it to take effect normally."] = "· After activating this switch, if a Запечатанный артефакт's triggered effect requires an additional manual button press, it will be automatically released when One-tap Support is enabled. \n · Turning on this switch alone only unlocks the automatic release permission for Запечатанный артефакт triggered effects; you still need to enable the One-tap Support function for it to take effect normally.",
    ["GTA连环杀手自身标记buff"] = "GTA Serial Killer Self Mark Buff",
    ["GTA - Golden Wolf Speech Event - Interaction Triggers Snipe State"] = "GTA - Golden Wolf Speech Event - Interaction Triggers Snipe State",
    ["　　I and a few students have been packing since last night, and we will soon be able to leave this eerie place.\n　　But just last night, two more researchers went missing, and several others ran out of the camp out of fear. I don't think running out of the camp rashly is a rational choice, because the environment in the wild is even harsher.\n　　I can tell that Professor Mans is also very uneasy, but he is the backbone of our group. He seemed to be forcing himself to give instructions today; after all, for humans—the unknown is the oldest and most intense horror."] = "Я и несколько студентов собираем вещи со вчерашнего вечера, и скоро мы сможем покинуть это жуткое место.\n　　Но буквально вчера вечером пропали еще двое исследователей, а еще несколько человек в страхе сбежали из лагеря. Я не думаю, что опрометчивый побег из лагеря - рациональный выбор, потому что окружающая среда в дикой природе еще более сурова.\n　　Я могу сказать, что профессор Манс тоже очень обеспокоен, но он - костяк нашей группы. Он, казалось, заставлял себя сегодня давать указания; в конце концов, для людей неизвестность — самый древний и самый сильный ужас.",
    ["<Yellow>Favor</>: When the wearer performs a Normal Attack or a non-cleansing skill, there is a chance to trigger <Yellow>Luck</> for 10 seconds: each stack increases movement speed by <Yellow>*f**</>, critical hit rate by <Yellow>*d</>, and Skill Enhancement by <Yellow>*d</>. If Luck is not triggered, the probability accumulates for the next skill cast until it triggers. The trigger probability gradually decreases with the number of <Yellow>Luck</> stacks, starting at <Yellow>25%</> and dropping to 0 at 5 stacks."] = "<Yellow>Favor</>: When the wearer performs a Normal Attack or a non-cleansing skill, there is a chance to trigger <Yellow>Luck</> for 10 seconds: each stack increases Скорость бега by <Yellow>*f**</>, critical hit rate by <Yellow>*d</>, and Усиление навыков by <Yellow>*d</>. If Luck is not triggered, the probability accumulates for the next skill cast until it triggers. The trigger probability gradually decreases with the number of <Yellow>Luck</> stacks, starting at <Yellow>25%</> and dropping to 0 at 5 stacks.",
    ["BOSS4先祖骑士-外环污染隐形怪"] = "БОСС 4 Рыцарь-предок - Стелс-монстр порчи Внешнего кольца",
    ["<h>占卜周围是否危险</>"] = "<h>Divinate if the surroundings are dangerous</>",
    ["……真有这么神奇？"] = "...Is it really that magical?",
    ["<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all combat skills are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> attack speed is increased, and their cooldown time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32秒}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 60 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all Боевой навыкs are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> Скорость атаки is increased, and their Перезарядка time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32 seconds}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Перезарядка: 60 seconds.",
    ["Tab轮选测试配置-血量优先-奶妈"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — приоритет HP — целитель",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活动规则</>\n活动开放期间，每日12:00至24:00，可前往霍纳奇斯花海时之门处，申请参与。进入玩法后，玩家将和世界灾厄进行战斗。玩法支持单人或队伍申请，建议<Highlight>完成组队后再进行申请</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活动奖励</>\n世界灾厄死亡时，参与战斗的玩家根据贡献值可获得灾厄残迹。每周最多获得<Highlight>1200个</>。灾厄残迹达到一定档位时可在世界灾厄介绍页领取对应档位的奖励。\n世界灾厄死亡时，根据队伍的输出伤害换算成积分进行排名。每周前1000排名的玩家可获得排名奖励。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>排行榜说明</>\n组队情况下，会取玩家所在队伍成员的<Highlight>输出伤害前5的总和</>作为排名积分。\n在战斗中，队伍成员发生变动时，将自动取消积分排名的资格。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rules </>\n During the event, you may apply to participate at the Gate of Time in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers between 12:00 and 24:00 daily. Upon entering, players will battle the World Calamity. This mode supports solo or team applications; it is recommended to <Highlight> form a team before applying </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rewards </>\n When the World Calamity dies, participating players receive Calamity Remnants based on their contribution. You can earn a maximum of <Highlight> 1200 </> per week. Once your Calamity Remnants reach certain thresholds, you can claim corresponding rewards on the World Calamity introduction page. \n When the World Calamity dies, rankings are calculated based on the team's damage output. The top 1000 players each week receive ranking rewards. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Ranking Explanation </>\n In a team, the <Highlight> sum of the top 5 damage outputs </> from team members is used as the ranking score. \n If team members change during combat, the team is automatically disqualified from the ranking.",
    ["{\"技能标签%i\"}"] = "{\"Skill Tag%i\"}",
    ["……这张悲喜剧面具名为“戏剧大师”，对应学徒途径序列8 戏法大师。戴上面具后，使用者会获得相应的序列能力。"] = "…This comedy-tragedy mask is called 'Drama Master,' corresponding to the Apprentice pathway, Последовательность 8, Trickmaster. After wearing the mask, the user will gain the corresponding Последовательность abilities.",
    ["<P_Heart>(That feeling of being watched hasn't disappeared. Can a Beyonder run faster than a carriage?)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Ощущение, что за тобой наблюдают, не исчезло. Может ли Потусторонний бежать быстрее кареты?)</>",
