    ["I don't know if I can ever return to Lenburg. The weather in Loen is too gloomy, and the rain is not suitable for crop growth. \n \n \n The Bishop asked me to be responsible for logistics and, by the way, research how to accelerate potion digestion. \n \n \n Digesting the Harvest Priest potion... Should I plant something in the temporary stronghold?"] = "I don't know if I can ever return to Lenburg. The weather in Loen is too gloomy, and the rain is not suitable for crop growth. \n \n \n The Bishop asked me to be responsible for logistics and, by the way, research how to accelerate potion digestion. \n \n \n Digesting the Harvest Priest potion... Should I plant something in the temporary stronghold?",
