    ["{\n \"Unspecified\": \"\", \n \"Hit target count (use this parameter after range hit in skills and spell fields)\": \"hitnum\", \n \"Filter target count (use this parameter when using target filtering)\": \"tarnum\", \n \"Class resource change value (including upward overflow value)\": \"propdiff\", \n \"Class resource change value (actual change value)\": \"proprealdiff\" \n}"] = "{\n \"Unspecified\": \"\", \n \"Hit target count (use this parameter after range hit in skills and spell fields)\": \"hitnum\", \n \"Filter target count (use this parameter when using target filtering)\": \"tarnum\", \n \"Class resource change value (including upward overflow value)\": \"propdiff\", \n \"Class resource change value (actual change value)\": \"proprealdiff\" \n}",
    ["【塔罗会】(3) 全队 +10%攻击力 +200生命"] = "【Клуб Таро】(3) Вся команда +10% силы атаки +200 здоровья.",
    ["“门”已经打开，“正义”女士，你准备好对他心理治疗了吗？"] = "The \"Door\" has been opened. Ms. Justice, are you ready to provide him with psychological therapy?",
    ["· <Highlight> When receiving the same type of damage again </>, the severity level will directly increase by one. \n · Accepting <Highlight> Purification but failing </>, there is a probability of directly increasing the severity level by one. \n · Accepting <Highlight> Purification and succeeding </>, you will recover to a normal state and remove the corruption. \n · If left unchecked, there may be three situations: <Highlight> self-healing, no change, or deterioration </>. After ten minutes, the probability of both self-healing and deterioration will increase over time."] = "· <Highlight> When receiving the same type of damage again </>, the severity level will directly increase by one. \n · Accepting <Highlight> Purification but failing </>, there is a probability of directly increasing the severity level by one. \n · Accepting <Highlight> Purification and succeeding </>, you will recover to a normal state and remove the Искажение. \n · If left unchecked, there may be three situations: <Highlight> self-healing, no change, or deterioration </>. After ten minutes, the probability of both self-healing and deterioration will increase over time.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Shocked)</> No, impossible... seventy years have passed? Old Chuck and Little Colley... They have already..."] = "<P_Heart>(в шоке)</> Нет, невозможно... семьдесят лет прошло? Старый Чак и Маленький Колли... Они уже...",
    ["[Insight] When triggering the immediate Health restoration effect below 20%, the target gains an additional 20% Damage Reduction for 5 seconds."] = "[Insight] When triggering the immediate Health restoration effect below 20%, the target gains an additional 20% Снижение урона for 5 seconds.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with {战争主教} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with {Bishop of War} entry",
    ["\"I will recall those dreams we explored together, recall every Beyonder case or Sealed Artifact that once troubled us, recall the direction of the wind, and the shape and color of the moon.\""] = "«Я вспомню те сны, которые мы вместе исследовали, вспомню каждый случай Потустороннего или Запечатанный Артефакт, который когда-то беспокоил нас, вспомню направление ветра, а также форму и цвет луны».",
    ["<P_Yellow>密级</> 机密\n<P_Yellow>报告人</> 伦纳德·米切尔\n<P_Yellow>日期</> 1354年7月\n\n<P_Yellow>事件概述</>\n自1354年6月起，廷根市接连发生多起市民离奇失踪案件。经黑荆棘安保公司介入调查，确认事件背后存在隐秘的非凡力量干预，最终证实为邪神组织“月亮仆从”策划的大规模献祭仪式，其目标是借助知识皇冠与绝望魔镜，将整座城市献祭于“伟大母亲”（经确认，实为▇▇▇▇的化身），以诞育邪神子嗣。\n\n<P_Yellow>失踪案详情</>\n失踪者多为廷根普通市民，涵盖各个阶层：工人、富商、学生等。\n多数失踪者近期接触过罗塞尔大帝相关物品，包括戏剧节铜镜、海报、宣传品。\n部分失踪者在失踪前曾参与五月庄园的高薪短工招募。\n\n<P_Yellow>救援&伤亡情况</>\n救援名单\n……查理……珍妮……莉迪亚……杰克……\n伤亡名单\n……卡尔……约翰逊……琼……\n\n<P_Yellow>相关势力</>\n月亮仆从（详见月亮仆从调查报告）\n\n<P_Yellow>相关封印物</>\n知识皇冠\n绝望魔镜"] = "<P_Yellow> Security Level </> Confidential \n<P_Yellow> Reporter </> Leonard Mitchell \n<P_Yellow> Date </> July 1354 \n\n<P_Yellow> Event Overview </>\n Since June 1354, a series of bizarre disappearance cases of citizens have occurred in Тинген. After the Blackthorn Security Company intervened in the investigation, it was confirmed that there was hidden Потусторонний power intervention behind the events, and it was finally confirmed to be a large-scale Sacrifice Ritual planned by the evil god organization \"Moon Servant.\" Its goal was to use the Crown of Knowledge and the Magic Mirror of Despair to sacrifice the entire city to the \"Great Mother\" (confirmed to be the avatar of ▇▇▇▇) to give birth to the evil god's offspring.\n\n<P_Yellow> Details of Disappearance Cases </>\n Most of the missing persons were ordinary Тинген citizens, covering all walks of life: workers, wealthy merchants, students, etc. \n Most of the missing persons had recently come into contact with items related to Emperor Roselle, including drama festival mirrors, posters, and promotional materials. \n Some of the missing persons had participated in the high-paying short-term job recruitment at May Manor before going missing. \n\n<P_Yellow> Rescue & Casualty Situation </>\n Rescue List \n... Charlie... Jenny... Lydia... Jack... \n Casualty List \n... Karl... Johnson... Joan... \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Factions </>\n Moon Servant (see Moon Servant Investigation Report for details) \n\n<P_Yellow> Related Запечатанный артефактs </>\n Crown of Knowledge \n Magic Mirror of Despair",
    ["{\"第%i个法术场ID\"}"] = "{\"ID of the %ist Spell Field\"}",
    ["self: Self; \n tar: Target; \n buffadder: Buff applier; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by skill/Spell Field calculation."] = "self: Self; \n tar: Target; \n buffadder: Buff applier; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by skill/Spell Field calculation.",
    ["To \"Lord of Mysteries\" game \n Wishing for a successful open beta! May Mr. \"Fool\" bless \n the bug count to be zero, and may the Beyonder digest their potion smoothly! \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "К игре «Повелитель тайн» \n Желаем успешного открытого бета-тестирования! Пусть мистер «Дурак» благословит, чтобы количество насекомых было равно нулю, и пусть Потусторонний беспрепятственно переварит свое зелье! \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["…At the very least, you did not let her harm others, prevented her fall, and protected more Tingen citizens—as a guardian, you have not failed your duty."] = "…At the very least, you did not let her harm others, prevented her fall, and protected more Тинген citizens—as a guardian, you have not failed your duty.",
    ["After reading it, I found it really wasn't just an absurd essay. After space-time was reversed, Emperor Roselle and George III swapped souls, and he became the King of Loen. He won a great victory in the war of 1350 and created countless epoch-making inventions, but he still couldn't untangle the entanglement of the Church of Steam, and eventually lived a complex life.\nAfter George III sat in Roselle's position, he was unusually low-key until he died in madness in his later years.\nFate is like a cunning snake! What a legendary pair of emperors!"] = "After reading it, I found it really wasn't just an absurd essay. After space-time was reversed, Emperor Roselle and George III swapped souls, and he became the King of Loen. He won a great victory in the war of 1350 and created countless epoch-making inventions, but he still couldn't untangle the entanglement of the Church of Steam, and eventually lived a complex life.\nAfter George III sat in Roselle's position, he was unusually low-key until he died in Безумие in his later years.\nFate is like a cunning snake! What a legendary pair of emperors!",
    ["“3”级封印物提升到“2”级封印物的必要素材。"] = "Материал, необходимый для улучшения Запечатанного Артефакта 3-го Уровня до Запечатанного Артефакта 2-го Уровня.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Improvement Assessment </>\n 1. Displays the ability improvement brought by the <Highlight>Attribute Entries</> of this item, without considering the influence of special effects (such as equipment imprints, sets, boon effects, Sealed Artifact Fool entries); \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Attack and Defense Attributes</> are calculated; some special attributes (such as Attack Speed Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. The improvement magnitude will change with the selected <Highlight>Target Scenario</>, the Beyonder's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>. It is not completely accurate and is for reference only. \n 4. When the gap between the Beyonder's <Highlight>Current Attributes</> and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</> is too large, some effect values have reached the upper or lower limit, and the improvement magnitude will decay rapidly or even return to zero. The assessment at this time will be severely distorted."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Improvement Assessment </>\n 1. Displays the ability improvement brought by the <Highlight>Attribute Entries</> of this item, without considering the influence of special effects (such as equipment imprints, sets, boon effects, Запечатанный артефакт Fool entries); \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Attack and Defense Attributes</> are calculated; some special attributes (such as Скорость атаки Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. The improvement magnitude will change with the selected <Highlight>Target Scenario</>, the Потусторонний's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>. It is not completely accurate and is for reference only. \n 4. When the gap between the Потусторонний's <Highlight>Current Attributes</> and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</> is too large, some effect values have reached the upper or lower limit, and the improvement magnitude will decay rapidly or even return to zero. The assessment at this time will be severely distorted.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <催眠师> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Hypnotist> trait",
    ["HP<60%触发80%最大生命护盾"] = "Trigger 80% Max Health Shield when HP < 60%",
    ["<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The wearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the wearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the wearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds.\n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consumes 1 stack per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP.\n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the wearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP. The effect of the Life Staff is reduced while in the Dominator's Clash mode."] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The wearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the wearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the wearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds.\n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consumes 1 stack per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP.\n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the wearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP. The effect of the Life Staff is reduced while in the Dominator's Clash mode.",
    ["LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(Skill), Int()))."] = "LuaList(LuaTuple(IdGroup(Skill), Int())).",
    ["P1 HP Lock Buff"] = "P1 HP Lock Buff",
    ["<Reminder_Red>%s</>被小丑设置了定时炸弹，赶快靠近帮助他分摊伤害。"] = "<Reminder_Red>%s</> has been set with a timed bomb by the Клоун, hurry over to help share the damage.",
    ["{\n\"无限制\": \"0\",\n\"限制技能复活\": \"1\",\n\"限制自身功能复活\": \"2\",\n\"禁止复活\": \"3\"\n}"] = "{\n \"No restriction\": \"0\", \n \"Restrict skill resurrection\": \"1\", \n \"Restrict self-function resurrection\": \"2\", \n \"Prohibit resurrection\": \"3\" \n}",
    ["GTA Serial Killer Self Mark Buff"] = "GTA Serial Killer Self Mark Buff",
    ["<P_Yellow>“堕落母神”</>过于强大，哪怕只是新生者梦中残存的部分污染……"] = "<P_Yellow>Мать-Богиня Разврата</> слишком сильна, даже если это всего лишь остаточная порча во сне Новорожденного...",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nDominator's Clash is a team-based competitive mode where you can form a squad of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering Dominator's Clash, all players receive <Highlight>fair</> attribute adjustments. \nPlayers must defeat all members of the opposing team or deal more damage within the time limit to achieve victory."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\nDominator's Clash is a team-based competitive mode where you can form a squad of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering Dominator's Clash, all players receive <Highlight>fair</> attribute adjustments. \nPlayers must defeat all members of the opposing team or deal more damage within the time limit to achieve victory.",
    ["<Yellow>放牧灵魂</>：穿戴者持续攻击主目标一段时间后，可将其灵魂剥离到自己脚下，<Yellow>10秒</>内触碰灵魂可将其吞噬，根据灵魂主人的类型，造成不同效果：\n吞噬非凡者的灵魂：对其造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并通过囚禁其灵魂获得对应序列的一个技能，使用该技能会释放其灵魂：\n    战士序列：<Yellow>黎明铠甲</>；\n    歌颂者序列：<Yellow>太阳誓约</>；\n    学徒序列：<Yellow>星云咏叹</>；\n    观众序列：<Yellow>心理暗示</>；\n    占卜家序列：<Yellow>诡秘之境</>；\n    窥秘人序列：<Yellow>星光囚笼</>；\n蠕动的饥饿提升危险等级时，对应技能强度随之提升。\n吞噬怪物的灵魂：立刻粉碎灵魂，对目标和周围<Yellow>5</>名怪物造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并给目标施加持续<Yellow>5</>秒的<Yellow>灵魂压制</>效果：buffdisc(*id)\n剥离灵魂效果每20秒最多可触发一次，囚禁的灵魂被释放之前，无法再次从其主人身上剥离灵魂。最多可同时囚禁<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</>个灵魂。"] = "<Yellow>Shepherd Souls</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period of time, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows them to consume it, causing different effects based on the soul's type: \nConsume a Потусторонний's soul: Deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to it and gain one skill of the corresponding Последовательность by imprisoning its soul. Using this skill releases the soul: \n    Warrior Последовательность: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n    Bard Последовательность: <Yellow>Solar Oath</>; \n    Apprentice Последовательность: <Yellow>Nebula Aria</>; \n    Зритель Последовательность: <Yellow>Psychological Suggestion</>; \n    Провидец Последовательность: <Yellow>Realm of Mysteries</>; \n    Подглядывающий за Тайнами Последовательность: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \nWhen Creeping Hunger increases its danger level, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nConsume a monster's soul: Instantly shatter the soul, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to the target and <Yellow>5</> surrounding monsters, and apply <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect to the target for <Yellow>5</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Until the imprisoned soul is released, you cannot strip a soul from its owner again. You can imprison up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls simultaneously.",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Solar High Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Solar High Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner.",
    ["[Placeholder] Klein reached out to touch the red star in the gray fog space, and suddenly water ripples surged on his body; the deep red star erupted with red light. \n In the Forsaken Land of the Gods, Derrick knelt in sadness, praying while facing a crystal ball. \n \"Great God, please cast your gaze once again upon this place abandoned by you.\" \n \"Great God, please let us, the people of darkness, be rid of that fated Curse.\" \n Just as he was about to despair, a mass of deep red erupting from the crystal ball drowned the scene. The tall Derrick appeared above the gray fog, and he looked up at Klein, who was shrouded in gray fog across the long bronze table."] = "[Placeholder] Klein reached out to touch the red star in the gray fog space, and suddenly water ripples surged on his body; the deep red star erupted with red light. \n In the Forsaken Land of the Gods, Derrick knelt in sadness, praying while facing a crystal ball. \n \"Great God, please cast your gaze once again upon this place abandoned by you.\" \n \"Great God, please let us, the people of darkness, be rid of that fated Curse.\" \n Just as he was about to despair, a mass of deep red erupting from the crystal ball drowned the scene. The tall Derrick appeared above the gray fog, and he looked up at Klein, who was shrouded in gray fog across the long bronze table.",
    ["　　子弹追回二十三颗……但死了很多人，这值不值得呢？我不知道。这城市烂透了。但总得有人去挖出这些烂肉——哪怕只剩我一个。\n　　如果下次再有这种事，我可能还得找你。毕竟我也没有其他可以信任的人了。\n　　最近我发现自己好像影子都变淡了，大概是酒喝多了。你也要注意身体。"] = "Двадцать три пули удалось обнаружить… но погибло так много людей. Стоит ли оно того? Я не знаю. Этот город прогнил до глубины души. Но кто-то должен выкопать эту гниющую плоть — даже если я остался один.\nЕсли что-то подобное произойдет снова, возможно, мне придется прийти к вам. В конце концов, мне больше некому доверять.\nНедавно я заметил, что моя тень, кажется, тускнеет; возможно, это потому, что я слишком много пью. Вам также следует позаботиться о своем здоровье.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>改装效果</>\n通过神铸改装，可对车辆的外观和性能进行改变。具体每个部位的改装效果如下：\n<Highlight>涂装：</>改变车漆效果\n<Highlight>车身：</>改变车身造型\n<Highlight>轮胎：</>改变轮胎造型\n<Highlight>车牌：</>改变车牌造型和车牌号码\n<Highlight>引擎：</>改变车辆性能、手感、引擎声浪以及尾焰\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>部位解锁</>\n驭械秘印可在<Highlight>商城-形象铭刻</>中购买获取。改装时，每消耗<Highlight>1个</>驭械秘印，车辆会增加<Highlight>10~12点</>改装值。当改装值累积到一定数量时，会解锁新的改装部位。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>部位锁定</>\n改装时，可以对部位进行锁定，被锁定的部位在改装时不会改变。同时，锁定部位进行改装时，驭械秘印消耗数量会增加。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案品质</>\n每个部位的改装方案按照品质分为：<Quality_3>普通</>/<Quality_4>稀有</>/<Quality_5>非凡</>/<Quality_6>神眷</>/<Quality_7>神铸</>，开放规则具体如下：\n解锁<Highlight>1个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_3>普通</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>2个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_4>稀有</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>3个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_5>非凡</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>4个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_6>神眷</>级方案\n解锁<Highlight>5个</>改装部位时，改装时最高会出现<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案\n风尚度随机范围随方案品质提升，此外随着驭械秘印的消耗数量提升，也将提升风格值的随机范围。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>概率公示</>\n<Quality_3>普通</>级方案概率：55%\n<Quality_4>稀有</>级方案概率：29.7%\n<Quality_5>非凡</>级方案概率：11.4%，每20次改装必定出现<Quality_5>非凡</>及以上方案\n<Quality_6>神眷</>级方案概率：2.9%，每60次改装必定出现<Quality_6>神眷</>及以上方案\n<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案概率：1%，每200次改装必定出现<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案\n锁定四个部位后，<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案概率提升至3.7%，每30次改装必定出现<Quality_7>神铸</>级方案\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>二手车交易</>\n因二手车交易政策限制，拥有车牌（改装值在<Highlight>1600及以上</>）的神铸改装车辆可封装为道具，在交易行进行出售。每辆二手车外观激活后，需等待30日才可再次进行封装。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Modification Effects</>\nThrough God-Forged modifications, you can change the appearance and performance of your vehicle. The specific modification effects for each part are as follows:\n<Highlight>Paint:</>Change the paint effect\n<Highlight>Body:</>Change the body style\n<Highlight>Tires:</>Change the tire style\n<Highlight>License Plate:</>Change the license plate style and number\n<Highlight>Engine:</>Change the vehicle's performance, handling, engine sound, and exhaust flames\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Unlocking</>\nMechanical Seals can be purchased in the <Highlight>Mall - Image Engraving</>. For every <Highlight>1</> Mechanical Seal consumed during modification, the vehicle gains <Highlight>10~12 points</> of Modification Value. When the Modification Value accumulates to a certain amount, new modification parts will be unlocked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Locking</>\nDuring modification, you can lock parts; locked parts will not change during the modification process. Additionally, the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases when modifying while parts are locked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Plan Quality</>\nThe modification plans for each part are categorized by quality:<Quality_3>Common</>/<Quality_4>Rare</>/<Quality_5>Потусторонний</>/<Quality_6>God-Favored</>/<Quality_7>God-Forged</>. The unlocking rules are as follows:\nUnlocking <Highlight>1</> modification part allows for a maximum of <Quality_3>Common</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>2</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_4>Rare</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>3</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_5>Потусторонний</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>4</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>5</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plans during modification.\nThe random range for Style Points increases with plan quality. Furthermore, as the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases, the random range for Style Points will also increase.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Probability Disclosure</>\n<Quality_3>Common</>-level plan probability: 55%\n<Quality_4>Rare</>-level plan probability: 29.7%\n<Quality_5>Потусторонний</>-level plan probability: 11.4%; a <Quality_5>Потусторонний</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 20 modifications.\n<Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plan probability: 2.9%; a <Quality_6>God-Favored</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 60 modifications.\n<Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability: 1%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 200 modifications.\nAfter locking four parts, the <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability increases to 3.7%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 30 modifications.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Used Car Trading</>\nDue to used car trading policy restrictions, God-Forged modified vehicles that possess a license plate (with a Modification Value of <Highlight>1600 or higher</>) can be packaged as items and sold at the Trading House. Once a used car's appearance is activated, you must wait 30 days before it can be packaged again.",
    ["<Red>Light Dissipation</>: When Cage of Light reflects damage, it extends the Cooldown of Proof of Glory by 0.5 seconds, triggering up to 10 times. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Light Dissipation</>: When Cage of Light reflects damage, it extends the Перезарядка of Proof of Glory by 0.5 seconds, triggering up to 10 times. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month Faction Battle based on the finalized factions. Participate in gameplay such as <Highlight> Frost-Fall Lord, Strategic Server City of Dragon Hunting, Club Conquest Decree, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to obtain Club God-Chosen Points and compete for God-Chosen seats based on weekly and final rankings. The God-Chosen seats obtained by the Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive Strategic Skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle. \n <Highlight> Historical Crystals: </> Players can use Historical Crystals to upgrade Sealed Artifacts to Level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Beyonder materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server gameplay can earn Conquest Reputation, which can be used to increase the Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> God-Chosen Glory </> \n After the Faction Battle ends, the <Highlight> Victor's Declaration </> ceremony will begin. After the ceremony, God-Chosen seat rewards and limited-time divine descent will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, this server's <Highlight> Trade War </> will be opened based on each Club's God-Chosen Points; stay tuned."] = "<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month Faction Battle based on the finalized factions. Participate in gameplay such as <Highlight> Frost-Fall Lord, Strategic Server City of Dragon Hunting, Club Conquest Decree, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to obtain Club God-Chosen Points and compete for God-Chosen seats based on weekly and final rankings. The God-Chosen seats obtained by the Club are distributed internally by the Club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive Strategic Skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle. \n <Highlight> Исторические кристаллы: </> Players can use Исторические кристаллы to upgrade Запечатанный артефактs to Level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Потусторонний materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server gameplay can earn Conquest Reputation, which can be used to increase the Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> God-Chosen Glory </> \n After the Faction Battle ends, the <Highlight> Victor's Declaration </> ceremony will begin. After the ceremony, God-Chosen seat rewards and limited-time divine descent will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, this server's <Highlight> Trade War </> will be opened based on each Club's God-Chosen Points; stay tuned.",
    ["<Red>伪证罪</>：携带者的技能公证失败时，该技能本次施放造成的增伤降低60%，治疗增幅降低60%。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Perjury</>: When the carrier's skill Notarization fails, the Damage Boost caused by that skill cast is reduced by 60%, and the Healing Boost is reduced by 60%. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["[PrintAppearanceData]: %s is empty, skipping serialized field splitting"] = "[PrintAppearanceData]: %s пуст, разделение сериализованных полей пропускается.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <守护者> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Guardian> trait",
    ["[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your nightmares! This time, \"Face-Peeler\" Johnny has lost his mind and bared his claws at you."] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your Кошмарs! This time, \"Face-Peeler\" Johnny has lost his mind and bared his claws at you.",
    ["Attack映射，将ID为A的技能映射成ID为B的技能（持续）"] = "Сопоставление атак: сопоставьте навык с идентификатором «A» с навыком с идентификатором «B» (непрерывно).",
    ["<Rank1>\"Level 1\"</> Sealed Artifact only takes effect in the strategic server, this server takes effect <Rank2>\"Level 2\"</> effect"] = "<Rank1>\"Level 1\"</> Запечатанный артефакт only takes effect in the strategic server, this server takes effect <Rank2>\"Level 2\"</> effect",
    ["<Reminder_Red>%s</> has been set with a timed bomb by the Clown, hurry over to help share the damage."] = "<Reminder_Red>%s</> has been set with a timed bomb by the Клоун, hurry over to help share the damage.",
    ["“Artisan”…… This is Sequence 6 of the “Savant” Pathway, capable of crafting mechanical marvels and mystical items."] = "«Ремесленник»…… Это шестая последовательность Пути «Учёного», способная создавать чудеса механики и мистические предметы.",
    ["【死神镰刀】+10%攻击力"] = "【Death Scythe】+10% Attack Power",
    ["[Rogue] Trick Performance - Spell Proxy"] = "[Rogue] Trick Performance - Spell Proxy",
    ["　　我成为了一位“通识者”，靠着魔药的力量，我竟然完整回想起了以前学过的知识，物理，化学，等等，等等。​\n　　不仅回想起，我还深刻地理解和掌握了它们，哈哈，这简直是为我这个异域来客量身定做的“职业”嘛，能最大化地发挥我的优势！不得不说，如果我以这样的状态回去，回到高三，一定能成为状元，要是再有更规范更深入的专业学习，科学家不算太困难的目标。​"] = "Я стал «Ученым». Опираясь на силу зелья, я фактически вспомнил все полученные ранее знания — физику, химию и так далее. \n Я не только запомнил их, но и глубоко понял и освоил. Ха-ха, это просто «профессия», созданная специально для такого постороннего человека, как я; это максимизирует мои преимущества! Должен сказать, что если бы я вернулся в этот штат, в последний год обучения в средней школе, я бы определенно стал лучшим учеником. Если бы у меня была более стандартизированная и глубокая профессиональная подготовка, стать ученым не было бы такой уж сложной задачей.",
    ["<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Beyonder soul imprisoned by the wearer, their own maximum Health is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: After the wearer crushes a monster's soul, their Damage Reduction is lowered by *f** for 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Потусторонний soul imprisoned by the wearer, their own maximum Health is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: After the wearer crushes a monster's soul, their Снижение урона is lowered by *f** for 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【增强】攻击或技能造成伤害后，使目标防御降低<HighLight>45%</>，持续<HighLight>3</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] After dealing damage with an attack or skill, reduce the target's Defense by <HighLight>45%</> for <HighLight>3</> seconds.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡方案</>\n非凡方案是角色技能、天赋、封印物组成的搭配，当前方案会随玩家的当前搭配实时变动。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>方案切换</>\n将特定的搭配保存为方案后，即可通过方案切换，一键更改当前的搭配。战斗状态下无法进行方案切换。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>推荐方案</>\n推荐方案中包含本途径的多种搭配，可以将推荐方案中的搭配一键运用到自身的方案中。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Потусторонний Build</>\nБилд Потусторонний представляет собой комбинацию навыков персонажа, талантов и запечатанных артефактов. Текущая сборка меняется в режиме реального времени в зависимости от ваших текущих настроек. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Build Switch</>\nПосле сохранения определенной настройки в качестве сборки вы можете переключать сборки, чтобы изменить текущую настройку одним нажатием. Сборки нельзя переключать во время боя. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Рекомендуемые сборки</>\nРекомендуемые сборки включают в себя различные настройки для этого пути, которые можно применить к вашей собственной сборке одним нажатием.",
    ["Beyonders of the \"Sleepless\" pathway need to influence surrounding living beings by chanting poems."] = "Находящимся за пределами пути «Бессонных» необходимо воздействовать на окружающих живых существ, распевая стихи.",
    ["[Dungeon System buff] Occupies ID 81002050-81002099."] = "[Dungeon System buff] Occupies ID 81002050-81002099.",
    ["Let me heal the soul of {{him|her}} tormented by nightmares"] = "Let me heal the soul of {{him|her}} tormented by Кошмарs",
    ["<Red>枯竭</>：幸运结束时，佩戴者陷入持续4秒的困顿：移动速度降低*d**、体力恢复速度降低*d**，且期间无法触发幸运。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Depletion</>: When Luck ends, the wearer falls into a state of exhaustion for 4 seconds: Скорость бега is reduced by *d**, stamina recovery speed is reduced by *d**, and Luck cannot be triggered during this period. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute entry becomes ineffective.",
    ["…Originally it had already been sealed, and it wouldn't have caused any new damage if kept properly, but my companions and I were bewitched by them…"] = "…Originally it had already been sealed, and it wouldn't have caused any new damage if kept properly, but my companions and I were bewitched by them…",
    ["\"Grade 2\" Sealed Artifact, dangerous, must be used with caution and restraint..."] = "\"Grade 2\" Запечатанный артефакт, dangerous, must be used with caution and restraint...",
    ["reminder触发器2"] = "reminder trigger 2",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rules </>\n During the event, you may apply to participate at the Gate of Time in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers between 12:00 and 24:00 daily. Upon entering, players will battle the World Calamity. This mode supports solo or team applications; it is recommended to <Highlight> form a team before applying </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rewards </>\n When the World Calamity dies, participating players receive Calamity Remnants based on their contribution. You can earn a maximum of <Highlight> 1200 </> per week. Once your Calamity Remnants reach certain thresholds, you can claim corresponding rewards on the World Calamity introduction page. \n When the World Calamity dies, rankings are calculated based on the team's damage output. The top 1000 players each week receive ranking rewards. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Ranking Explanation </>\n In a team, the <Highlight> sum of the top 5 damage outputs </> from team members is used as the ranking score. \n If team members change during combat, the team is automatically disqualified from the ranking."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rules </>\n During the event, you may apply to participate at the Gate of Time in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers between 12:00 and 24:00 daily. Upon entering, players will battle the World Calamity. This mode supports solo or team applications; it is recommended to <Highlight> form a team before applying </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Event Rewards </>\n When the World Calamity dies, participating players receive Calamity Remnants based on their contribution. You can earn a maximum of <Highlight> 1200 </> per week. Once your Calamity Remnants reach certain thresholds, you can claim corresponding rewards on the World Calamity introduction page. \n When the World Calamity dies, rankings are calculated based on the team's damage output. The top 1000 players each week receive ranking rewards. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Ranking Explanation </>\n In a team, the <Highlight> sum of the top 5 damage outputs </> from team members is used as the ranking score. \n If team members change during combat, the team is automatically disqualified from the ranking.",
    ["【临时】克莱恩伸手触摸灰雾空间中的红色星辰，忽然身上涌出水纹，深红星辰爆发出红色的光芒。\n在神弃之地，戴里克悲伤地跪着，面对着水晶球祈祷着。\n“伟大的神灵啊，请重新将目光投向这个被您遗弃的地方。”\n“伟大的神灵啊，请让我们这些黑暗之民摆脱那宿命的诅咒。”\n正当他要绝望时，水晶球中爆发的一团深红将画面淹没。高大的戴里克出现在灰雾之上，他抬头看着青铜长桌对面被灰雾笼罩的克莱恩。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein reached out to touch the red star in the gray fog space, and suddenly water ripples surged on his body; the deep red star erupted with red light. \n In the Forsaken Land of the Gods, Derrick knelt in sadness, praying while facing a crystal ball. \n \"Great God, please cast your gaze once again upon this place abandoned by you.\" \n \"Great God, please let us, the people of darkness, be rid of that fated Curse.\" \n Just as he was about to despair, a mass of deep red erupting from the crystal ball drowned the scene. The tall Derrick appeared above the gray fog, and he looked up at Klein, who was shrouded in gray fog across the long bronze table.",
    ["【塔罗会·弓箭骑士】档4增量(+25%)→累计140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["Boss狂暴计时结束触发"] = "Срабатывает, когда заканчивается таймер Берсерка Босса.",
    ["<Red>Fragile</>: When the protection effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage absorbed by the paper figurine is reapplied to the master, and the master's Damage Reduction is lowered by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Fragile</>: When the protection effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage absorbed by the Бумажный человечек is reapplied to the master, and the master's Снижение урона is lowered by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["　　阅览后发现，还真不是荒诞的随笔。时空逆转后，罗塞尔大帝与乔治三世灵魂互换，成为了鲁恩国王，他在1350年的战争中获得大胜，创造了无数跨时代的发明，但他仍解不开蒸汽教会的纠缠，最终度过了复杂的一生。\n　　乔治三世坐上罗塞尔的位置后，反而低调异常，直到晚年在疯狂中死去。\n　　命运如一条狡猾的蛇！真是一对传奇帝王啊！"] = "After reading it, I found it really wasn't just an absurd essay. After space-time was reversed, Emperor Roselle and George III swapped souls, and he became the King of Loen. He won a great victory in the war of 1350 and created countless epoch-making inventions, but he still couldn't untangle the entanglement of the Church of Steam, and eventually lived a complex life.\nAfter George III sat in Roselle's position, he was unusually low-key until he died in Безумие in his later years.\nFate is like a cunning snake! What a legendary pair of emperors!",
    ["【本相】插下旗帜的同时，帝国旗帜对范围内敌方目标造成一定伤害，对范围的其他旗帜或有护盾的目标额外造成50%的伤害。"] = "[True Form] Upon planting the flag, the Imperial Flag deals a certain amount of damage to enemy targets within range, and deals an additional 50% damage to other flags or targets with Shields within range.",
    ["　　……\n　　不知从什么时候起，“隐匿贤者”疑似活化。\n　　祂是无处不在的灵数，是知识本身，祂疯狂地追逐着每一个摩斯苦修会的成员，甚至是每一个“窥秘人”，这种现象被称为“知识逐人”。\n　　当海潮般的知识灌注而来时，受灌输者要么放开心灵防线，接受“隐匿贤者”的改造，要么凭毅力支撑。\n　　当知识灌注冲破毅力防线的那一刻，便会引发失控。\n　　但，我想，祂的灌输，未必没有用处。"] = "... \n I do not know when it started, but the \"Hidden Sage\" is suspected to have become active. \n It is the ubiquitous spiritual number, the knowledge itself. It madly pursues every member of the Moses Ascetic Order, and even every \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами.\" This phenomenon is known as \"Knowledge Pursuit.\" \n When the tidal wave of knowledge pours in, the recipient must either open their mental defenses and accept the transformation by the \"Hidden Sage,\" or support themselves with willpower. \n The moment the infusion of knowledge breaks through the defense of willpower, it triggers a loss of control. \n However, I think Its infusion may not be without its uses.",
    ["CS Phase Invincibility"] = "CS Phase Invincibility",
    ["Buff added"] = "Добавлен бафф",
    ["【死神装备】额外提升<HighLight>10%</>攻击。"] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>10%</> Attack.",
    ["……<P_Heart>(Silent for a long time)</>Because I want to take revenge for my friend, so I chose to leave here, to grow, to become stronger."] = "……<P_Heart>(Silent for a long time)</>Because I want to take revenge for my friend, so I chose to leave here, to grow, to become stronger.",
    ["BOSS4-品质-右治疗"] = "BOSS4-Качество-Правильное исцеление",
    ["The combat ability of a 'Corpse Collector' should be the strongest among them; the other two sequences lack direct means of confronting enemies."] = "Боевые способности «Собирателя трупов» должны быть самыми сильными среди них; в двух других эпизодах отсутствуют прямые средства противостояния врагам.",
    ["【Rougue】星云咏叹-法术代理"] = "[Roguelike] Nebula Aria - Spell Proxy",
    ["“猎人”们总攻前最后的休整地，充斥着战意的气息。占领后可攻击战争石碑，固定每分钟获得30点资源。"] = "The final resting place for \"Охотникs\" before their all-out attack, filled with the aura of Battle Intent. After occupying it, you can Attack the War Stele to gain 30 resources every minute.",
    ["　　I know you are the most trustworthy \"Artisan\" I know. This time, I want to commission a magical item that <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">you mentioned could \"conceal one's appearance and blur recognition.\"</> I will bring the core material myself; it is a Beyonder characteristic from a \"Faceless,\" and its state is stable, so you can just take it and process it.\n　　As for the price, 1000 pounds as you previously stated is no problem.\n　　Let's meet at the usual place for the handover. I will confirm in advance that no one is following me."] = "Я знаю, что ты самый надежный «Ремесленник», которого я знаю. На этот раз я хочу заказать магический предмет, который, как вы упомянули, <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">, мог бы «скрыть внешний вид и размыть узнаваемость». </> Я принесу основной материал сам; это характеристика Потустороннего из «Безликого», и его состояние стабильно, так что вы можете просто взять его и обработать.\n　　Что касается цены, то 1000 фунтов, как вы уже говорили, не проблема.\n　　Давайте встретимся в обычном месте для передачи. Заранее подтвержу, что за мной никто не следит.",
    ["【浅见】帝国旗帜对范围内的目标每4秒叠加1层扭曲效果（扭曲：降低控制抵抗），最多3层。"] = "[Insight] The Imperial Flag stacks 1 layer of Distortion effect on targets within range every 4 seconds (Distortion: reduces Control resistance), up to 3 layers.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Sanity </> \n When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's sanity to fluctuate. As sanity continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the etheric body, astral body, mental body, and spirit body. The character will enter different levels of mental states in sequence and produce corresponding effects. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Requiem </> \n Players who join the Requiem Poetry Society can perform Requiem on other players to <Highlight> restore </> the corresponding player's sanity. \n \n After opening spirit vision, click on other players to view their sanity status. When the target player's sanity <Highlight> is below a certain value </>, you can initiate Requiem on them. \n The <Highlight> healing success rate </> of Requiem depends on two factors: the level of the <Highlight> society </> the Requiem performer belongs to, and the current <Highlight> sanity level </> of the person being treated. The higher the society level and the higher the other person's sanity, the higher the probability of a successful Requiem. \n It should be noted that Requiem is not without risk—<Highlight> if Requiem fails </>, both participating parties have a probability of experiencing sanity fluctuations and incurring a certain loss."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Рассудок </> \n When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Рассудок to fluctuate. As Рассудок continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the etheric body, astral body, mental body, and Духовное тело. The character will enter different levels of mental states in Последовательность and produce corresponding effects. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Requiem </> \n Players who join the Requiem Poetry Society can perform Requiem on other players to <Highlight> restore </> the corresponding player's Рассудок. \n \n After opening spirit vision, click on other players to view their Рассудок status. When the target player's Рассудок <Highlight> is below a certain value </>, you can initiate Requiem on them. \n The <Highlight> healing success rate </> of Requiem depends on two factors: the level of the <Highlight> society </> the Requiem performer belongs to, and the current <Highlight> Рассудок level </> of the person being treated. The higher the society level and the higher the other person's Рассудок, the higher the probability of a successful Requiem. \n It should be noted that Requiem is not without risk—<Highlight> if Requiem fails </>, both participating parties have a probability of experiencing Рассудок fluctuations and incurring a certain loss.",
    ["reminder trigger"] = "reminder trigger",
    ["……<P_Heart>（诡异的笔记，成为值夜者和非凡者……哪件事都没办法跟班森商量。）</>"] = "...<P_Heart> (The eerie notebook, becoming a Nighthawk and a Потусторонний... I can't discuss either of these things with Benson.)</>",
    ["... \n I do not know when it started, but the \"Hidden Sage\" is suspected to have become active. \n It is the ubiquitous spiritual number, the knowledge itself. It madly pursues every member of the Moses Ascetic Order, and even every \"Mystery Pryer.\" This phenomenon is known as \"Knowledge Pursuit.\" \n When the tidal wave of knowledge pours in, the recipient must either open their mental defenses and accept the transformation by the \"Hidden Sage,\" or support themselves with willpower. \n The moment the infusion of knowledge breaks through the defense of willpower, it triggers a loss of control. \n However, I think Its infusion may not be without its uses."] = "... \n I do not know when it started, but the \"Hidden Sage\" is suspected to have become active. \n It is the ubiquitous spiritual number, the knowledge itself. It madly pursues every member of the Moses Ascetic Order, and even every \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами.\" This phenomenon is known as \"Knowledge Pursuit.\" \n When the tidal wave of knowledge pours in, the recipient must either open their mental defenses and accept the transformation by the \"Hidden Sage,\" or support themselves with willpower. \n The moment the infusion of knowledge breaks through the defense of willpower, it triggers a loss of control. \n However, I think Its infusion may not be without its uses.",
    ["True: Listen for all Buffs; \n False: Only listen for Buffs matching BuffIDs, BuffTags, BuffTypes"] = "Верно: слушайте все усиления; \n Ложь: прослушивать только усиления, соответствующие BuffID, BuffTags, BuffTypes.",
    ["Tab轮选测试配置-距离优先-奶妈"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет расстояния — Целитель",
    ["GTA Gun Parry Tutorial Auto-Release Gun Parry"] = "GTA Gun Parry Tutorial Auto-Release Gun Parry",
    ["<Yellow>弱点攻击</>：佩戴者攻击主目标时，可对其施加<Yellow>弱点揭露</>效果，每秒最多揭露1层，最多可揭露<Yellow>30</>层。每消耗<Yellow>15</>层，可扣下丧钟的扳机，攻击目标灵体，造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</>点伤害、<Yellow>3秒</>受到治疗增幅降低<Yellow>70%</>和移动速度降低<Yellow>*f**</>效果，另有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</>的基础概率使目标眩晕<Yellow>1秒</>。若目标处于霸体状态，则对其重新施加<Yellow>3</>层弱点揭露。"] = "<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposed</> effect, revealing up to 1 stack per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> stacks. For every <Yellow>15</> stacks consumed, you can pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's Духовное тело to deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, reduce incoming Healing by <Yellow>70%</> for <Yellow>3 seconds</>, and reduce Скорость бега by <Yellow>*f**</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to Stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Суперброня state, re-apply <Yellow>3</> stacks of Weakness Exposed to them.",
    ["The final resting place for \"Hunters\" before their all-out attack, filled with the aura of Battle Intent. After occupying it, you can Attack the War Stele to gain 30 resources every minute."] = "The final resting place for \"Охотникs\" before their all-out attack, filled with the aura of Battle Intent. After occupying it, you can Attack the War Stele to gain 30 resources every minute.",
    ["　　……\n　　1350年\n　　贝克兰德非凡聚会中，有人出售来自南大陆帕斯河谷的“<Mark id=\"#159\">月亮木偶</>”，并引发追杀案件。\n\n　　1352年\n　　廷根技术学院十四名学生在郊外举行邪恶仪式，导致现场<Mark id=\"#159\">植物</>疯狂生长，仅一人幸存。\n\n　　1353年\n　　一片安葬贝克兰德大雾霾死难者的坟墓被河水冲毁，几座空坟中均发现破旧的“月亮木偶”。\n　　……"] = "... \n 1350 \n During a Потусторонний gathering in Бэкланд, someone sold a \"<Mark id=\"#159\">Moon Марионетка</>\" from the Pas River Valley in the Southern Continent, triggering a murder case. \n \n 1352 \n Fourteen students from the Тинген Technical College held an evil ritual in the suburbs, causing <Mark id=\"#159\"> plants </> to grow wildly at the scene, with only one survivor. \n \n 1353 \n A patch of graves burying the victims of the Бэкланд Smog was washed away by the river, and broken, old \"Moon Марионеткаs\" were found in several empty graves. \n ...",
    ["“暗天使”萨斯利尔的躯壳沉睡于巨人王庭， 遭到了混沌海的侵蚀。"] = "Оболочка «Темного ангела» Сасрира покоится во дворе Короля Гигантов, будучи разрушена Морем Хаоса.",
    ["　　“发生了什么事情？”克莱恩心头咯噔了一下。\n　　他害怕这个疯狂的“杂交学家”的实验出了问题，导致“未来号”众人陷入可怕的生态灾难里。\n　　弗兰克呆滞摇头道：\n　　“我不是给你说过那些小东西吗？\n　　“它们原本需要安眠一段时间才有可能生长和繁殖，结果……”\n　　“结果什么？”克莱恩的脸色已变得凝重。\n　　蹲着的弗兰克抬头上望道：\n　　“它们刚才完成了大规模的繁殖，还发生了异变。\n　　“这，这简直是神迹！”\n　　“然后呢？它们去了哪里？还在你的‘实验室’内吗？”克莱恩直觉地认为这不是好事。\n　　弗兰克用两秒钟的时间消化了问题，挽起袖子，露出体毛浓密的手臂。\n　　他敲了敲面前的甲板，露出疑惑的笑容道。\n　　“它们钻进了这里，好像在，在改造‘未来号’……”\n　　沉闷的敲击声中，甲板上突然涌出了一股疑似牛奶的乳白喷泉，溅了弗兰克·李满头满脸。\n　　他舔了嘴边的液体一口，惊喜出声道：\n　　“‘未来号’，‘未来号’产奶了！”\n\n　　——第三卷《旅行家》第一百七十四章 疯狂的异变"] = "“What happened?” Klein’s heart skipped a beat. \n He was afraid that this crazy “Hybridizer’s” experiment had gone wrong, causing the people on the Future to fall into a terrifying ecological disaster. \n Frank shook his head dully and said: \n “Didn’t I tell you about those little things? \n They originally needed to slumber for a period of time before they could grow and reproduce, but as a result…” \n “As a result of what?” Klein’s expression had become grave. \n Frank, who was squatting, looked up and said: \n “They just completed large-scale reproduction, and a mutation occurred. \n This, this is simply a miracle!” \n “Then what? Where did they go? Are they still in your ‘laboratory’?” Klein intuitively felt that this was not a good thing. \n Frank took two seconds to digest the question, rolled up his sleeves, and revealed his hairy arms. \n He knocked on the deck in front of him and said with a puzzled smile. \n “They drilled in here, it seems they are, they are modifying the Future…” \n Amidst the dull knocking sound, a milky white fountain suspected to be milk suddenly gushed out from the deck, splashing Frank Lee all over his head and face. \n He licked the liquid by his mouth and said in surprise: \n “The Future, the Future is producing milk!” \n \n —— Volume 3: Traveler, Chapter 174: Crazy Mutation",
    ["【Seer】(2) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 15% Attack Power distance damage bonus."] = "【Провидец】(2) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 15% Attack Power distance damage bonus.",
    ["<Yellow> Super Armor </>, damage reduction increased by 50%, and reflects <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times damage to the attacker. If the attacker is more than 8 meters away, reflected damage decays with distance."] = "<Yellow> Суперброня </>, Снижение урона increased by 50%, and reflects <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times damage to the attacker. If the attacker is more than 8 meters away, reflected damage decays with distance.",
    ["buffdisc(*id)，持续*f秒，同时获得一点<HighLight>卡牌能量</>和一张<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>。\n\n<FaintYellow>命运黄牌</>/<FaintYellow>灵性蓝牌</>：获得三张<HighLight>命运黄牌</>/<HighLight>灵性蓝牌</>时消耗所有卡牌，使<HighLight>终结技能洗牌</>切换至<HighLight>命运愚弄</>/<HighLight>灵性爆发</>。\n<FaintYellow>卡牌能量</>：最多持有5点，达到5点时<HighLight>终结技能</>切换并锁定为<HighLight>洗牌</>。"] = "buffdisc(*id), длится *f секунд, одновременно получая 1 очко <HighLight>Card Energy</> и одну <HighLight>Духовность Blue Card</>. \n\nЖелтая карта <FaintYellow>Fate</>/<FaintYellow>Синяя карта духовности</>: когда получены 3 <HighLight>Желтые карты Fate</>/<HighLight>Синие карты духовности</>, израсходуйте все карты, чтобы <HighLight>Finisher Skill Shuffle Cards</> переключился на <HighLight>Обман Судьба</>/<HighLight>Всплеск духовности</>. \n<FaintYellow>Card Energy</>: вмещает до 5 баллов; при достижении 5 очков <HighLight>Finisher Skill</> переключается и фиксируется на <HighLight>Shuffle Cards</>.",
    ["...It's all free, completely free, not a single penny will be charged, please rest assured."] = "...It's all free, completely free, not a single penny will be charged, please rest assured.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Sanity</>\nWhen acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Sanity to fluctuate. As Sanity continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually erode the Ether Body, Mental Body, Astral Body, and Spirit Body. The character will enter different levels of mental states in sequence, producing corresponding effects. \n\nWhen Sanity is sufficient, the character is in the <Highlight>\"Mental Anchor\"</> state, with reduced stamina consumption and increased damage reduction; when it drops to a normal level, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Sober\"</> state, which has no effects. \n\nAs Sanity decreases further, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Restlessness,\" \"Self-Doubt,\" and \"Whispers Haunting\"</> states in sequence. Stamina and sprint stability will be weakened to varying degrees, and whispers will appear to interfere with the surroundings. \n\nWhen Sanity drops to a low range, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Falling into Madness\"</> state; movement restrictions are completely lifted, and both damage dealt and damage received are increased. \n\nWhen Sanity drops to the minimum, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Edge of Loss of Control\"</> state, <Highlight>Damage Increase</>, but damage received also increases, and healing effects received are reduced. The character emits a red glow, and their vision becomes frenzied. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Restore Sanity</>\nWhen Sanity drops to a certain level, players can seek help from members of the Requiem Poetry Society to restore Sanity. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Loss of Control</>\nIf a character remains in a \"loss of control\" state for a long time without being purified, the erosion of the five bodies will continue to deepen, which may lead to unpredictable and serious consequences."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Рассудок</>\nWhen acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Рассудок to fluctuate. As Рассудок continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually erode the Ether Body, Mental Body, Astral Body, and Духовное тело. The character will enter different levels of mental states in Последовательность, producing corresponding effects. \n\nWhen Рассудок is sufficient, the character is in the <Highlight>\"Mental Anchor\"</> state, with reduced stamina consumption and increased Снижение урона; when it drops to a normal level, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Sober\"</> state, which has no effects. \n\nAs Рассудок decreases further, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Restlessness,\" \"Self-Doubt,\" and \"Whispers Haunting\"</> states in Последовательность. Stamina and sprint stability will be weakened to varying degrees, and whispers will appear to interfere with the surroundings. \n\nWhen Рассудок drops to a low range, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Falling into Безумие\"</> state; movement restrictions are completely lifted, and both damage dealt and damage received are increased. \n\nWhen Рассудок drops to the minimum, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Edge of Loss of Control\"</> state, <Highlight>Damage Increase</>, but damage received also increases, and healing effects received are reduced. The character emits a red glow, and their vision becomes frenzied. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Restore Рассудок</>\nWhen Рассудок drops to a certain level, players can seek help from members of the Requiem Poetry Society to restore Рассудок. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Loss of Control</>\nIf a character remains in a \"loss of control\" state for a long time without being purified, the erosion of the five bodies will continue to deepen, which may lead to unpredictable and serious conПоследовательностьs.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Archer Knight】Tier 7 increment (+30%) → cumulative 220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 7-го уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["<Reminder_Red> quickly break the shield </> to interrupt the casting of the full-screen damage skill."] = "<Reminder_Red> quickly break the shield </> to interrupt the casting of the full-screen damage skill.",
    ["{{PlayerName}}, it seems you also have a talent for being a food critic."] = "{{PlayerName}}, it seems you also have a talent for being a food critic.",
    ["[True Form] Adds a second-stage skill—Ensemble Poem: After release, gain the Ensemble effect: If self and allies with the Ensemble effect deal damage to the same target, deal an additional 10% of the target's lost Health as damage (not exceeding 23.7% of own Attack). The same target can only trigger this once every 2 seconds, lasting 10 seconds."] = "[True Form] Adds a second-stage skill—Ensemble Poem: After release, gain the Ensemble effect: If self and allies with the Ensemble effect deal damage to the same target, deal an additional 10% of the target's lost Health as damage (not exceeding 23.7% of own Attack). The same target can only trigger this once every 2 seconds, lasting 10 seconds.",
    ["The ultimate form of Flash is \"omnipresence.\""] = "The ultimate form of Flash is \"omnipresence.\"",
    ["【切断】秩序之网的能量源，捡回困在网中的混乱大剑"] = "【Sever】 the energy source of the Web of Order and retrieve the Chaos Greatsword trapped in the web",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演武器大师】\n集市上有人在卖生锈的旧枪，只能当装饰品挂在墙上。你觉得有意思，特意过去淘货。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Weapon Master】 \n Someone at the market is selling rusty old guns that can only be hung on the wall as decorations. You find it interesting and go over to hunt for treasures.",
    ["{\n \"All players\": \"0\", \n \"Skill/buff holder\": \"1\", \n \"Locked target\": \"2\" \n}"] = "{\n \"All players\": \"0\", \n \"Skill/buff holder\": \"1\", \n \"Locked target\": \"2\" \n}",
    ["<P_Yellow>Clown</>: That guy... always thinks he is the master of the extraordinary, unaware that a single mistake is an abyss."] = "<P_Yellow>Клоун</>: That guy... always thinks he is the master of the extraordinary, unaware that a single mistake is an abyss.",
    ["Buff移除"] = "Buff removed",
    ["{\"Buff Tag%i\"}"] = "{\"Buff Tag%i\"}",
    ["<h>试试占卜</>"] = "<h>Try Гадание</>",
    ["Captain of the \"Blue Avenger.\" One of the founding members of the Tarot Club, codenamed \"The Hanged Man.\""] = "Капитан «Синего мстителя». Один из основателей Клуба Таро под кодовым названием «Повешенный».",
    ["[LV1] [Marionette Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon"] = "[LV1] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon",
    ["HUD_WatchGame_Skill_Common:RefreshSkill 找不到技能配置 skillId=%s"] = "HUD_WatchGame_Skill_Common:RefreshSkill could not find Skill configuration, skillId=%s",
    ["……Perhaps. But as far as I know, materials for higher Sequences are even more expensive."] = "……Perhaps. But as far as I know, materials for higher Последовательностьs are even more expensive.",
    ["“魔术师”女士，我读过您的《暴风山庄》，非常精彩！"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, I have read your “Storm Villa”, it is very wonderful!",
    ["【浅见】暗影能量爆炸命中的玩家目标30%概率附加恐惧，持续时间为1.2秒，恐惧效果实际命中率和时长受眩晕相关属性影响。"] = "[Insight] Player targets hit by the shadow energy explosion have a 30% chance to be inflicted with Horror for 1.2 seconds. The actual hit rate and duration of the Horror effect are affected by Stun-related attributes.",
    ["　　<Mark id=\"#159\">隐匿贤者</>最初只是一名非人格化的神灵。\n　　相比起神灵，祂更接近于一种理念，一种自然法则，或者说，知识本身。\n　　信仰祂的摩斯苦修会掌握着<Mark id=\"#159\">“窥秘人”</>途径的魔药与晋升方式……会内流传着一句格言——<InvHighlight_HW>为所欲为，但勿伤害</>——这也为许多“窥秘人”所信奉并践行。\n　　……贝尔纳黛殿下似乎也很喜欢。"] = "<Mark id=\"#159\"> The Hidden Sage </> was initially just an impersonal deity. \n Compared to a god, It was closer to a concept, a natural law, or rather, knowledge itself. \n The Moses Ascetic Order, which believes in It, possesses the potions and advancement methods of the <Mark id=\"#159\"> \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами\" </> pathway... A maxim circulates within the order—<InvHighlight_HW> Do what you will, but do no harm </>—which is also believed in and practiced by many \"Подглядывающий за Тайнамиs.\" \n ... Her Highness Bernadette seems to like it as well.",
    ["《惊情德古拉》？是本吸血鬼爱情小说。"] = "\"Dracula\"? It's a vampire romance novel.",
    ["[Model] Home - Ritual Candle"] = "[Model] Home - Ritual Candle",
    ["Additional 15% damage reduction when HP < 50%"] = "Additional 15% Снижение урона when HP < 50%",
    ["<Yellow>锈弹</>：攻击命中主目标时，有概率对其发射一枚墨绿的毒丸，使其身体腐蚀溃烂，每秒造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#占位#)</>点伤害，持续<Yellow>5</>秒，冷却时间5秒，期间攻击该目标，会触发<Yellow>毒液溅射</>效果，对<Yellow>8</>米范围内的最多6名其他敌对目标造成伤害，每2秒最多造成一次溅射。"] = "<Yellow>Rust Bullet</>: When an attack hits the main target, there is a chance to fire a dark green venom pellet, causing their body to suffer from Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds. Перезарядка is 5 seconds. Attacking the target during this period will trigger the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within a <Yellow>8</>-meter radius. Splash damage can occur at most once every 2 seconds.",
    ["　　\n\n　　知识是被扛在肩上的，它有重量，会消耗体力，背负者必须为它付出代价。\n　　这个古老民族或许比后世许多哲学体系更早地触及了一个真相——知道得越多，承受得越重。\n　　遗憾的是，现存文献大多残损。本书所能依赖的，仅有零星出土的陶片刻铭、后世抄本中的引述，以及邻近语族中若干可疑的同源词。这些材料足以暗示方向，却不足以支撑定论。\n　　笔者如实呈现证据的匮乏，而非用推测填补空白——在语源学这门学科里，承认无知本身就是一种诚实。"] = "\n \n Knowledge is carried on the shoulders; it has weight and consumes physical strength, and the bearer must pay a price for it. \n This ancient nation perhaps touched a truth earlier than many later philosophical systems—the more you know, the heavier you bear. \n Regrettably, most existing documents are damaged. What this book can rely on are only sporadic inscriptions on unearthed pottery shards, citations in later manuscripts, and several suspicious cognate words in neighboring language families. These materials are enough to suggest a direction, but not enough to support a conclusion. \n The author presents the lack of evidence truthfully, rather than filling the gaps with speculation—in the discipline of etymology, admitting ignorance itself is a kind of honesty.",
    ["…Hey, when you borrow a Sealed Artifact, try to be nice to them… don't let them get rained on."] = "…Hey, when you borrow a Запечатанный артефакт, try to be nice to them… don't let them get rained on.",
    ["Daly smiled with difficulty, fighting against the white fluff and pitch-black scales constantly emerging from her skin:\n \"So it was you...\n \"Didn't you ask me before why I didn't take the initiative, take the initiative to confess to Dunn and push him onto the bed?\"\n She took a breath and smiled bitterly:\n \"I've had too much indulgence in the past. He, he is a conservative person, and I, I am very insecure.\"\n She could no longer control herself and was about to turn into a monster.\n At this moment, she heard Klein Moretti respond:\n \"The Captain actually liked you very much, but you were too outstanding and too young, and he was also very insecure.\"\n Daly smiled, and then in her hazy vision, she saw the man in the black trench coat with a high hairline and deep gray eyes. She saw him place his hand on his chest, bow, and extend his palm to invite her to dance.\n She reached out her hand, and her thoughts became stagnant.\n The gray-eyed man in the black trench coat pulled up Daly, whose mutation was gradually receding. Under Leonard's gaze, in the dilapidated square with turbulent fountain water, they danced a light dance.\n Materials flew out one by one—golden grapevines, an ugly rubber mask—and under the guidance of spirituality, they gradually merged together and were poured into a small metal bottle.\n In the midst of the beautiful dance, Daly leaned forward gently and rested in Dunn's arms.\n\n — Volume 4: Undying, Chapter 213: The End of the Story"] = "Дейли с трудом улыбнулась, борясь с белым пухом и черными чешуйками, постоянно появлявшимися на ее коже:\n \"Так это была ты...\n \"Разве ты не спрашивал меня раньше, почему я не взяла на себя инициативу, не взяла на себя инициативу признаться Данну и не толкнула его на кровать?\"\n Она вздохнула и горько улыбнулась:\n \"В прошлом я была слишком снисходительна. Он, он консервативный человек, а я, я очень неуверен в себе.\n Она больше не могла контролировать себя и собиралась превратиться в монстра.\n В этот момент она услышала ответ Клейн Моретти:\n «Капитану ты действительно очень нравился, но ты был слишком выдающимся и слишком молодым, а он тоже был очень неуверенным в себе».\n Дейли улыбнулась, а затем в своём смутном видении она увидела мужчину в чёрном плаще с высокой линией роста волос и глубокими серыми глазами. Она видела, как он положил руку на грудь, поклонился и протянул ладонь, приглашая ее на танец.\n Она протянула руку, и мысли ее замерли.\n Сероглазый мужчина в черном плаще подтянул Дейли, мутация которого постепенно отступала. Под взглядом Леонарда, на полуразрушенной площади с бурлящей фонтанной водой, они танцевали легкий танец.\n Материалы вылетали один за другим — золотые виноградные лозы, уродливая резиновая маска — и под его руководством духовности, они постепенно слились воедино и были перелиты в маленькую металлическую бутылку.\n В разгар прекрасного танца Дейли осторожно наклонился вперед и отдохнул в объятиях Данна.\n\n — Том 4: Бессмертие, Глава 213: Конец истории",
    ["invId slotIndex freezeTime; example: 2 10 1731808912."] = "invId slotIndex freezeTime; example: 2 10 1731808912.",
    ["[May Manor] Believer Number One - Little Girl - Delayed Damage Allocation Target - Random 6 People"] = "[May Manor] Believer Number One - Little Girl - Delayed Damage Allocation Target - Random 6 People",
    ["\"I have said it ten thousand times, the key to a potion is not mastery and excavation, but digestion and Acting.\""] = "«Я говорил это десять тысяч раз: ключ к зелью — не мастерство и раскопки, а пищеварение и действие».",
    ["【浅见】死亡之爪生成的仪式魔法会附加5%减速和30%重伤效果，持续4秒。减速效果可以叠加。"] = "[Insight] The Ritual Magic generated by Grasp of Death applies a 5% Slow and 30% Grievous Injury effect for 4 seconds. The Slow effect can stack.",
    ["Tab Selection Test Configuration - Distance Priority - Healer"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет расстояния — Целитель",
    ["【Tarot Club】(6) Entire team +30% Attack Power +800 Health +10% Critical Hit"] = "【Клуб Таро】(6) Вся команда +30% силы атаки +800 здоровья +10% критического удара",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {正义导师} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with the {Justiciar} entry",
    ["To《诡秘之主》游戏\n祝公测大卖！“愚者”先生庇佑\nBug归零，非凡者魔药顺利消化！\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "К игре «Повелитель тайн» \n Желаем успешного открытого бета-тестирования! Пусть мистер «Дурак» благословит, чтобы количество насекомых было равно нулю, и пусть Потусторонний беспрепятственно переварит свое зелье! \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["BOSS4-Quality-Post-Attack-Left"] = "BOSS4-Качество-После Атаки-Слева",
    ["Buff层数"] = "Buff layers",
    ["<P_Heart>（震撼）</>追逐了这么多年，终于……见到了……"] = "<P_Heart>(в шоке)</> После стольких лет погони, наконец... я увидел это...",
    ["{\n\"Listen for destruction (default)\": \"false\", \n\"Listen for Death Skill\": \"true\"\n}"] = "{\n\"Listen for destruction (default)\": \"false\", \n\"Listen for Death Skill\": \"true\"\n}",
