    ["{\"Buff类型%i\"}"] = "{\"Buff Type%i\"}",
    ["【塔罗会·侍女】档5增量(+25%)→累计165%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】Tier 5 increment (+25%) → cumulative 165%",
    ["[LV3] [Marionette Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon"] = "[LV3] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Summon",
    ["《Shocking: Delicatessen Owner Adds That Thing to the Meat》—this headline makes one unable to resist reading the full article."] = "《Shocking: Delicatessen Owner Adds That Thing to the Meat》—this headline makes one unable to resist reading the full article.",
    ["[C Placeholder] A spiritual woman appears, pasting matchboxes. \n Woman: My chest feels so tight... \n Although charity medical care is free... it takes a whole day... forget it, if I don't work today, I won't have food tomorrow..."] = "[C Placeholder] A spiritual woman appears, pasting matchboxes. \n Woman: My chest feels so tight... \n Although charity medical care is free... it takes a whole day... forget it, if I don't work today, I won't have food tomorrow...",
    ["<Red>尖啸虚弱</>：携带者脱离尖啸刺激时，若依然身处战斗之中，则会陷入虚弱，降低5%的攻击、15%移动速度。直至离开战斗，或者再次戴上面具，才能摆脱虚弱。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Screech Weakness</>: When the wearer leaves Screech Stimulation, if they are still in combat, they will fall into Weakness, reducing Attack by 5% and Скорость бега by 15%. This persists until leaving combat or putting the mask back on. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material entry attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {Bishop of Fear} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with the {Bishop of Fear} entry",
    ["The “Angel of Life” is the crystallization of wisdom and the undying spirituality within everyone."] = "The “Angel of Life” is the crystallization of wisdom and the undying Духовность within everyone.",
    ["【占位-动画】调配魔药动画"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Potion brewing animation.",
    ["GTA-奥黛丽疗愈-咖啡杯"] = "GTA - Audrey healing - Coffee cup",
    ["【Last Page】Trigger"] = "【Last Page】Trigger",
    ["<Red>招惹蚊虫</>：佩戴者持有护盾时，每秒减少2.5%生命值上限等额的护盾值。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Attracting Insects</>: When the wearer has a Shield, they lose an amount of Shield value equal to 2.5% of their maximum Health per second. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<P_Heart>（阿罗德斯大人好严苛……但它不会说话，还要“正义”女士代劳，真是非凡啊……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Лорд Арродес такой строгий... но он не может говорить, и его рупором должна выступать мисс Джастис; насколько это действительно необычно...)</>",
    ["【塔罗会·戴里克】档5增量(+25%)→累计165%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 5-го уровня (+25%) → совокупно 165%",
    ["[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 30%."] = "[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 30%.",
    ["……看起来命运的指点已经降下，今天您还是适合进入俱乐部，找一名真正的占卜师占卜一下。"] = "...It seems the guidance of fate has already descended. Today, it is still suitable for you to enter the club and find a real Гадание master to perform a Гадание.",
    ["{{player.name}} 掷骰<Chat_Highlight>两连大失败！</>据说下次掷出大成功时，整个廷根都会听到他的欢呼，前提是他还敢再掷。"] = "{{player.name}} rolled <Chat_Highlight>a double critical failure!</> It is said that the next time they roll a critical success, all of Тинген will hear their cheers, provided they dare to roll again.",
    ["【02】 Break Up"] = "【02】 Break Up",
    ["<Yellow>弱点攻击</>：佩戴者攻击主目标时，可对其施加<Yellow>弱点揭露</>效果，每秒最多揭露1层，最多可揭露<Yellow>30</>层。每消耗<Yellow>15</>层，可扣下丧钟的扳机，攻击目标灵体，造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</>点伤害、<Yellow>3秒</>受治疗效果降低<Yellow>70%</>和<Yellow>1秒</>移动速度降低<Yellow>90%</>效果，另有<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</>的基础概率使目标眩晕<Yellow>1秒</>。若目标处于霸体状态，则对其重新施加<Yellow>5</>层弱点揭露。"] = "<Yellow>Weakness Attack</>: When the wearer attacks the main target, they can apply the <Yellow>Weakness Exposure</> effect, revealing up to 1 layer per second, for a maximum of <Yellow>30</> layers. Every <Yellow>15</> layers consumed allows the wearer to pull the trigger of Death Knell, attacking the target's Духовное тело, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?*d}</> damage, <Yellow>3 seconds</> of 70% healing reduction <Yellow>70%</>, and <Yellow>1 second</> of 90% Скорость бега reduction <Yellow>90%</>. Additionally, there is a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=1?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=2?80%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085001)=3?100%}</> base probability to stun the target for <Yellow>1 second</>. If the target is in a Суперброня state, re-apply <Yellow>5</> layers of Weakness Exposure to them.",
    ["【塔罗学院氛围】贝克兰德"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Бэкланд",
    ["【塔罗会·侍女】+10%攻击力"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】+10% Attack Power",
    ["Respected {{先生|女士}}, you can take a long-distance carriage to Lamud Castle here!"] = "Уважаемый {{Sir|Madam}}, здесь вы можете сесть в карете дальнего следования до замка Ламуд!",
    ["invId slotIndex freezeTime 示例 2 10 1731808912"] = "invId slotIndex freezeTime; example: 2 10 1731808912.",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位母亲陷入了长久的沉默之中，似乎在思索该怎样说出让全世界都能理解并赞同的话语。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Эта мать долго молчала, по-видимому, обдумывая, как сказать что-то, что весь мир мог бы понять и с чем согласился бы.) </>",
    ["\"It seems I need to prove myself.\"\n She walked slowly to the door, extended her right palm, and pressed it against the handle.\n Suddenly, Audrey's vision blurred, and she seemed to see Ms. Fors turn into a phantom and pass through the door.\n She was horrified and looked again, only to find that Fors was no longer in her original spot.\n A few seconds later, the handle turned, and the locked door was opened directly. Fors Wall walked in from outside with a smile, while the maid Annie, who was guarding not far from the door, had not noticed what happened behind her at all.\n \"This is truly a magical ability,\" Gregrace exclaimed.\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 107: Fors"] = "\"It seems I need to prove myself.\"\n She walked slowly to the door, extended her right palm, and pressed it against the handle.\n Suddenly, Audrey's vision blurred, and she seemed to see Ms. Fors turn into a phantom and pass through the door.\n She was horrified and looked again, only to find that Fors was no longer in her original spot.\n A few seconds later, the handle turned, and the locked door was opened directly. Fors Wall walked in from outside with a smile, while the maid Annie, who was guarding not far from the door, had not noticed what happened behind her at all.\n \"This is truly a magical ability,\" Gregrace exclaimed.\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 107: Fors",
    ["[Database Error] Character deserialization failed."] = "[Ошибка базы данных] Не удалось выполнить десериализацию символов.",
    ["【塔罗学院氛围】生命之脉"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Pulse of Life",
    ["【幸运悖论】的三层灵性完全充盈，能抵挡子爵夫人的致命一击。"] = "The three layers of Духовность of the [Paradox of Luck] are fully charged, capable of blocking the Viscountess's fatal blow.",
    ["…Madly chasing after me…"] = "…Madly chasing after me…",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Modification Effects</>\nThrough God-Forged modifications, you can change the appearance and performance of your vehicle. The specific modification effects for each part are as follows:\n<Highlight>Paint:</>Change the paint effect\n<Highlight>Body:</>Change the body style\n<Highlight>Tires:</>Change the tire style\n<Highlight>License Plate:</>Change the license plate style and number\n<Highlight>Engine:</>Change the vehicle's performance, handling, engine sound, and exhaust flames\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Unlocking</>\nMechanical Seals can be purchased in the <Highlight>Mall - Image Engraving</>. For every <Highlight>1</> Mechanical Seal consumed during modification, the vehicle gains <Highlight>10~12 points</> of Modification Value. When the Modification Value accumulates to a certain amount, new modification parts will be unlocked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Locking</>\nDuring modification, you can lock parts; locked parts will not change during the modification process. Additionally, the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases when modifying while parts are locked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Plan Quality</>\nThe modification plans for each part are categorized by quality:<Quality_3>Common</>/<Quality_4>Rare</>/<Quality_5>Beyonder</>/<Quality_6>God-Favored</>/<Quality_7>God-Forged</>. The unlocking rules are as follows:\nUnlocking <Highlight>1</> modification part allows for a maximum of <Quality_3>Common</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>2</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_4>Rare</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>3</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_5>Beyonder</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>4</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>5</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plans during modification.\nThe random range for Style Points increases with plan quality. Furthermore, as the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases, the random range for Style Points will also increase.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Probability Disclosure</>\n<Quality_3>Common</>-level plan probability: 55%\n<Quality_4>Rare</>-level plan probability: 29.7%\n<Quality_5>Beyonder</>-level plan probability: 11.4%; a <Quality_5>Beyonder</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 20 modifications.\n<Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plan probability: 2.9%; a <Quality_6>God-Favored</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 60 modifications.\n<Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability: 1%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 200 modifications.\nAfter locking four parts, the <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability increases to 3.7%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 30 modifications.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Used Car Trading</>\nDue to used car trading policy restrictions, God-Forged modified vehicles that possess a license plate (with a Modification Value of <Highlight>1600 or higher</>) can be packaged as items and sold at the Trading House. Once a used car's appearance is activated, you must wait 30 days before it can be packaged again."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Modification Effects</>\nThrough God-Forged modifications, you can change the appearance and performance of your vehicle. The specific modification effects for each part are as follows:\n<Highlight>Paint:</>Change the paint effect\n<Highlight>Body:</>Change the body style\n<Highlight>Tires:</>Change the tire style\n<Highlight>License Plate:</>Change the license plate style and number\n<Highlight>Engine:</>Change the vehicle's performance, handling, engine sound, and exhaust flames\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Unlocking</>\nMechanical Seals can be purchased in the <Highlight>Mall - Image Engraving</>. For every <Highlight>1</> Mechanical Seal consumed during modification, the vehicle gains <Highlight>10~12 points</> of Modification Value. When the Modification Value accumulates to a certain amount, new modification parts will be unlocked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Part Locking</>\nDuring modification, you can lock parts; locked parts will not change during the modification process. Additionally, the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases when modifying while parts are locked.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Plan Quality</>\nThe modification plans for each part are categorized by quality:<Quality_3>Common</>/<Quality_4>Rare</>/<Quality_5>Потусторонний</>/<Quality_6>God-Favored</>/<Quality_7>God-Forged</>. The unlocking rules are as follows:\nUnlocking <Highlight>1</> modification part allows for a maximum of <Quality_3>Common</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>2</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_4>Rare</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>3</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_5>Потусторонний</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>4</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plans during modification.\nUnlocking <Highlight>5</> modification parts allows for a maximum of <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plans during modification.\nThe random range for Style Points increases with plan quality. Furthermore, as the number of Mechanical Seals consumed increases, the random range for Style Points will also increase.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Probability Disclosure</>\n<Quality_3>Common</>-level plan probability: 55%\n<Quality_4>Rare</>-level plan probability: 29.7%\n<Quality_5>Потусторонний</>-level plan probability: 11.4%; a <Quality_5>Потусторонний</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 20 modifications.\n<Quality_6>God-Favored</>-level plan probability: 2.9%; a <Quality_6>God-Favored</> or higher level plan is guaranteed every 60 modifications.\n<Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability: 1%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 200 modifications.\nAfter locking four parts, the <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan probability increases to 3.7%; a <Quality_7>God-Forged</>-level plan is guaranteed every 30 modifications.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Used Car Trading</>\nDue to used car trading policy restrictions, God-Forged modified vehicles that possess a license plate (with a Modification Value of <Highlight>1600 or higher</>) can be packaged as items and sold at the Trading House. Once a used car's appearance is activated, you must wait 30 days before it can be packaged again.",
    ["BOSS4-Quality-Left Attack"] = "BOSS4-Качество-Левая атака",
    ["trigger-画外音2"] = "Trigger: Voiceover 2",
    ["< Silent Disciple >"] = "< Silent Disciple >",
    ["《Ultimate Poker Crash Course Guide》"] = "《Ultimate Poker Crash Course Guide》",
    ["Boss战_触发器_初始"] = "Битва с боссом_Trigger_Initial",
    ["...I have two Sequence 9 potion formulas on hand, \"Sailor\" and \"Spectator\"."] = "...I have two Последовательность 9 potion formulas on hand, \"Sailor\" and \"Зритель\".",
    ["【Tarot Club · Sylvia】Tier 6 increment (+25%) → cumulative 190%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["《背叛者指环》也不错，是贝克兰德王国大剧院原版阵容。"] = "The 'Traitor's Ring' is also quite good; it's the original cast from the Бэкланд Kingdom Theater.",
    ["“2”级封印物提升到“1”级封印物的必要素材。"] = "Necessary material to upgrade a Grade 2 Запечатанный артефакт to a Grade 1 Запечатанный артефакт.",
    ["GTA堕落神父破防"] = "GTA Fallen Priest Armor Break",
    ["After the materials for the “divine descent” ritual are all prepared, I will accompany you to start the ritual and witness the miraculous moment of divine descent."] = "After the materials for the “divine descent” ritual are all prepared, I will accompany you to start the ritual and witness the miraculous moment of divine descent.",
    ["tar：目标；\nself：自己；\ntarlist：目标清单黑板值；\nall：技能/法术场结算筛到的所有对象"] = "tar: Target; \n self: Self; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by skill/Spell Field calculation.",
    ["<Yellow>生命能量</>：携带者每隔<Yellow>20秒</>获得1点生命能量，持有上限为3点。携带者对自身或友方单位造成的累计有效治疗超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>50%</>时，消耗1点生命能量，对目标附加3层<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>效果，持续6秒，并获得1枚<Yellow>生命之种</>，持有上限为3枚。\n\n<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>：生命值不满时，每秒消耗1层，恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</>点生命值。\n<Yellow>生命之种</>：携带者受到伤害时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则自动消耗1枚生命之种，固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。"] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The carrier gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a holding limit of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing the carrier causes to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own Max HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 layers of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 6 seconds, and 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</> is gained, with a holding limit of 3. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, consume 1 layer per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the carrier takes damage, if HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of Max HP.",
    ["……这么快就出事了？你确实应该成为非凡者，这样才能更从容地应对那些古怪诡异的事件。"] = "...Something happened so soon? You should indeed become a Потусторонний so that you can deal with those strange and eerie events more calmly.",
    ["“魔术师”女士"] = "Miss Фокусник",
    ["[Enhanced] After dealing damage with an attack or skill, reduce the target's Defense by <HighLight>45%</> for <HighLight>3</> seconds."] = "[Enhanced] After dealing damage with an attack or skill, reduce the target's Defense by <HighLight>45%</> for <HighLight>3</> seconds.",
    ["\"The Pirate Queen pinned the noble lady against the wall and smirked, 'Even if you scream until your throat breaks, no one will come to save you!' Before the words faded, Gehrman descended from the sky, forcing the Queen back: 'Let her go.'\""] = "«Королева пиратов прижала благородную даму к стене и ухмыльнулась: «Даже если ты будешь кричать до тех пор, пока у тебя не перебьется горло, никто не придет тебя спасти!» Прежде чем слова исчезли, Герман спустился с неба, заставив королеву отступить: «Отпусти ее».",
    ["<Yellow>恶灵</>：恶灵随主人进入战斗而苏醒，从第5秒开始，每隔<Yellow>10秒</>，恶灵出现在场上，锁定一名随机敌对目标追踪移动，对触碰到的敌对单位执行复仇然后短暂沉睡。复仇造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?*d}</>点伤害、以<Yellow>100%</>的基础概率造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?1.5}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?2.5}</>秒的眩晕效果，并对其刻上持续10秒的<Yellow>仇敌</>印记，使其移动速度降低<Yellow>20%</>。恶灵下一次出现时，<Yellow>优先锁定</>带仇敌印记的目标。\n同一时间，恶灵只能将1个目标标记为仇敌。"] = "<Yellow>Evil Spirit</>: The Evil Spirit awakens as its master enters combat. Starting from the 5th second, every <Yellow>10 seconds</>, the Evil Spirit appears on the field, locking onto a random hostile target to track and move towards. Upon touching a hostile unit, it executes vengeance and then briefly falls asleep. Vengeance deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?*d}</> damage, has a <Yellow>100%</> base probability of causing a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=1?1.5}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=2?2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085024)=3?2.5}</>-second Stun effect, and marks the target with a 10-second <Yellow>Enemy</> mark, reducing their Скорость бега by <Yellow>20%</>. When the Evil Spirit appears next, it <Yellow>prioritizes locking onto</> targets with the Enemy mark. \nAt any given time, the Evil Spirit can only mark 1 target as an Enemy.",
    ["[Placeholder] Someone suddenly raises their hands, while others' bodies twist stiffly and begin to attack those around them. The crowd screams and scatters."] = "[Placeholder] Someone suddenly raises their hands, while others' bodies twist stiffly and begin to attack those around them. The crowd screams and scatters.",
    ["——在那个世界里，梅高欧丝一战无人牺牲。圣堂随后给予守护了全廷根的值夜者小队任职贝克兰德的机会，但邓恩和弗莱都拒绝了。\n\n      戴莉从贝克兰德赶回来时已是深夜，她照例拎了一瓶邓恩和弗莱都爱喝的酒。\n      “所以，你真拒绝了圣堂的邀请？”她靠在桌边，目光落在邓恩脸上。\n      邓恩抬起头，看向她。火光在他灰色的眼睛里轻轻晃了晃。\n      “你比我更适合那里。”他说，声音平静而厚重，“在廷根，这里的人认得我，我也认得每一条街、每一扇窗。我想留在这里，继续守护着它。”\n      弗莱默默给自己倒了一杯，举起来：“我也是。”\n      戴莉沉默片刻，轻声笑了一下：“就知道你会这么说。”\n      她拎过酒瓶也满上。三只杯子在壁炉前碰到一起，清脆的一声响。\n      窗外的廷根，在不眠的守护者注视中，安安静静地睡着。"] = "—In that world, no one sacrificed their life in the battle against Megose. The Cathedral subsequently gave the Ночные Ястребы squad that guarded all of Тинген the opportunity to take up posts in Бэкланд, but Dunn and Frye both refused. \n\n      Daly returned from Бэкланд late at night; she brought a bottle of the wine that both Dunn and Frye loved, as was her custom. \n      \"So, you really refused the Cathedral's invitation?\" She leaned against the table, her gaze resting on Dunn's face. \n      Dunn looked up at her. The firelight flickered gently in his gray eyes. \n      \"You are more suited for that place than I am,\" he said, his voice calm and heavy. \"In Тинген, the people here know me, and I know every street, every window. I want to stay here and continue guarding it.\" \n      Frye silently poured himself a glass and raised it: \"Me too.\" \n      Daly was silent for a moment, then laughed softly: \"I knew you would say that.\" \n      She grabbed the bottle and filled her own glass. Three glasses clinked together in front of the fireplace with a crisp sound. \n      Outside the window, Тинген slept quietly under the watchful eyes of the Бессонный Guardians.",
    ["　　请同学们自觉抵制“内部资料”，诚信参考。如有发现购买者，将按校规予以<Letter_Highlight>严格惩罚</>。"] = "Студентам предлагается сознательно сопротивляться «внутренним материалам» и сдавать экзамен честно. Если будут обнаружены покупатели, они будут <Letter_Highlight>строго наказаны</> в соответствии со школьными правилами.",
    ["[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, dealing effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center, and knocks back."] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] A combo of Template 7 skill, dealing effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center, and knocks back.",
    ["【塔罗会·子嗣守护】档4增量(+25%)→累计140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["Id (Aura)"] = "Id (Aura)",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with {Chaos Walker} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with {Chaos Walker} entry",
    ["……疯狂地追逐着我……"] = "…Madly chasing after me…",
    ["trigger-检视南瓜"] = "trigger - Inspect pumpkin",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?",
    ["【占位】闪回梦境占卜中温妮失踪前的一幕。"] = "【Placeholder】 Flashback to the scene before Winnie went missing in the dream Гадание.",
    ["“密契仪式”能够影响目标的精神体、星灵体、心智体、以太体，密契非凡觉醒对应的则是个体对于不同领域的掌握能力。选择发展不同的密契非凡觉醒，对相应领域的能力掌握程度也会不同。"] = "«Ритуал Мистического Пакта» может воздействовать на духовное тело, астральную проекцию, ментальное и эфирное тело цели. Мистические пробуждения Потустороннего соответствуют овладению человеком различными областями. Выбор развития различных пробуждений Mystic Потусторонний приведет к разным уровням мастерства в соответствующих областях.",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1956, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 2264, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 2572, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder+1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1368, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1627, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1886, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 781, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 991, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1201, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 978, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1132, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1286, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 390, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 495, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 600, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p30.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p30.min, data.p30.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1956, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 2264, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 2572, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний+1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 1368, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1627, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1886, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 781, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 991, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1201, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 978, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 1132, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 1286, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p30     = {score = 390, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p50     = {score = 495, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            p70     = {score = 600, min = 1.50, max = 1.70},\n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p30.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p30.min, data.p30.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice)",
    ["[Roguelike] Nebula Aria - Spell Proxy"] = "[Roguelike] Nebula Aria - Spell Proxy",
    ["HitBack, -- Knockback \nHitDown, -- Knockdown \nHitFly, -- Knockup \nHitFloat, -- Aerial \nHitDrag, -- Drag \nHitStiff, -- Stiff Attack"] = "HitBack, -- Knockback \nHitDown, -- Knockdown \nHitFly, -- Knockup \nHitFloat, -- Aerial \nHitDrag, -- Drag \nHitStiff, -- Stiff Attack",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位小姐真是主动，参与隐秘组织有利有弊……但或许可以从中找到回家的线索。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Эта женщина очень активна. Участие в секретной организации имеет свои плюсы и минусы... но, возможно, я смогу найти подсказки, чтобы вернуться домой.) </>",
    ["Recently, a citizen in this city suddenly fainted in a divination venue and was rushed to the hospital. The reporter learned that the citizen has been in a coma for over seven days. Their vital signs are stable, but the specific cause of the illness remains unclear. \n The hospital and the police have established a joint investigation team to determine the cause of the incident as soon as possible."] = "Недавно житель этого города внезапно потерял сознание в месте гаданий и был доставлен в больницу. Репортеру стало известно, что гражданин находится в коме более семи дней. Их жизненные показатели стабильны, но конкретная причина заболевания остается неясной. \n Больница и полиция создали совместную следственную группу, чтобы как можно скорее определить причину инцидента.",
    ["Boss破防锁定"] = "Прорыв брони босса заблокирован",
    ["　　Ms. Wall said that a true writer must be a chronicler, delving into the most authentic scenes to personally feel the breath of the story. \n　　What's a snow monster? I'm going to write the most heart-shaking legend of hunting giant beasts! \n　　Wait, why are those groups of explorers fighting? Was that a gunshot? \n　　Oh my god, what treasure are they fighting over? This is much more exciting than my original plan! \n　　Decided. I'm not writing about magic snow monsters anymore. I'll write \"The Snowy Mountain Shootout\" when I get back! \n　　Wait, why are they coming towards me?"] = "Г-жа Уолл сказала, что настоящий писатель должен быть летописцем, вникающим в самые достоверные сцены, чтобы лично почувствовать дыхание истории. \n　　Что такое снежный монстр? Я собираюсь написать самую душераздирающую легенду об охоте на гигантских зверей! \n　　Подождите, почему эти группы исследователей сражаются? Это был выстрел? \n　　Боже мой, за какое сокровище они сражаются? Это гораздо интереснее моего первоначального плана! \n　　Решено. Я больше не пишу о волшебных снежных монстрах. Я напишу «Перестрелку в Снежной Горе», когда вернусь! \n　　Подождите, почему они идут ко мне?",
    ["【增强】暴击提供持续<HighLight>5</>秒的<HighLight>5%</>伤害加深，可叠加至多<HighLight>4</>次。"] = "[Enhanced] Critical hits provide <HighLight>5</> seconds of <HighLight>5%</> increased damage, stacking up to <HighLight>4</> times.",
    ["【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle, 1250309"] = "【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle, 1250309",
    ["【实证】电流效果持续时间加1秒，伤害增加5%。"] = "[Proof] Current effect duration increased by 1 second, damage increased by 5%.",
    ["True: Listen to all Skills; \nFalse: Only listen to Skills matching SkillIDs, SkillTags, SkillTypes"] = "Верно: слушайте все навыки; \nFalse: прослушивать только те навыки, которые соответствуют SkillID, SkillTags, SkillTypes.",
    ["……普通人调查失控非凡者，你应该庆幸自己还活着。让我看看你的状态。"] = "…For an ordinary person to investigate a Потусторонний who has lost control, you should be thankful you are still alive. Let me check your condition.",
    ["【五月庄园-简单】召唤管家幻影召唤锁头小狗-筛任意1人加buff"] = "[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter Any 1, Add Buff",
    ["<Red>挥发性</>：战斗中每隔1秒，携带者会染上3种毒素中的随机一种，持续8秒。当携带者对攻击者染毒时，有65%概率优先将自身承受的毒素传递出去。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Volatility</>: Every 1 second during combat, the carrier will be infected with one of the 3 toxins at random, lasting 8 seconds. When the carrier infects an attacker, there is a 65% probability of prioritizing the transfer of toxins they are currently suffering from. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["The Sequence name \"Spectator\" might lead people to mistakenly think this is a Pathway only good at observation and support. But in reality, it is also a form of disguise, a disguise that makes people underestimate the user."] = "The Последовательность name \"Зритель\" might lead people to mistakenly think this is a Pathway only good at observation and support. But in reality, it is also a form of disguise, a disguise that makes people underestimate the user.",
    ["NPC头顶生命值"] = "NPC Overhead Health",
    ["【成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演观众】\n在金秋湖车站旁，你看到一个奇怪的人，他自称是一朵蘑菇。"] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Зритель】\n At the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.",
    ["[Insight] After Nightmare Assault hits a target, it reduces the target's Shield by a certain value. If the target does not have a Shield, this skill additionally weakens the target's Skill Block."] = "[Insight] After Кошмар Assault hits a target, it reduces the target's Shield by a certain value. If the target does not have a Shield, this skill additionally weakens the target's Блок навыков.",
    ["{{player.name}} has just completed a <Chat_Highlight>Railroad Tycoon Journey</> worth over two million. Let us congratulate this Beyonder; this story, woven from strategy and luck, has only just begun."] = "{{player.name}} has just completed a <Chat_Highlight>Railroad Tycoon Journey</> worth over two million. Let us congratulate this Потусторонний; this story, woven from strategy and luck, has only just begun.",
    ["Id (Damage correction)"] = "Id (Damage correction)",
    ["Proficient in various divination methods, skilled in palmistry, face reading, and other divination methods, 8 pence <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> </> per session."] = "Владеющий различными методами гадания, хиромантией, чтением по лицу и другими методами гадания, 8 пенсов <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> </> за сеанс.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>提升评估</>\n1.展示此物品的<Highlight>属性词条</>带来的能力提升，不考虑特殊效果（如装备的烙印、套装、恩赐效果，封印物愚者词条）的影响；\n2.仅计算常见的<Highlight>攻防属性</>，部分特殊属性（如攻击速度增幅、获得护盾增幅）不纳入计算范围；\n3.提升幅度会随选取的<Highlight>目标场景</>、非凡者<Highlight>当前属性</>和<Highlight>对抗目标的属性</>变动，并非完全准确，仅供参考。\n4.当非凡者<Highlight>当前属性</>与<Highlight>对抗目标的属性</>差距过大时，部分效果值已达上限或下限，提升幅度会迅速衰减甚至归零，此时的评估会严重失真。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Improvement Assessment </>\n 1. Displays the ability improvement brought by the <Highlight>Attribute Entries</> of this item, without considering the influence of special effects (such as equipment imprints, sets, boon effects, Запечатанный артефакт Fool entries); \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Attack and Defense Attributes</> are calculated; some special attributes (such as Скорость атаки Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. The improvement magnitude will change with the selected <Highlight>Target Scenario</>, the Потусторонний's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>. It is not completely accurate and is for reference only. \n 4. When the gap between the Потусторонний's <Highlight>Current Attributes</> and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</> is too large, some effect values have reached the upper or lower limit, and the improvement magnitude will decay rapidly or even return to zero. The assessment at this time will be severely distorted.",
    ["To 非凡者\n    不属于这个时代的愚者，\n    灰雾之上的神秘主宰，\n    执掌好运的黄黑之王。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "Потустороннему \n Дураку,\n не принадлежащему этой эпохе, \n таинственному правителю над серым туманом, \n Королю Желтого и Чёрного, приносящему удачу. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>秘宝简介</>\n1、秘宝分为<Highlight>世界冒险秘宝</>、<Highlight>以战养战秘宝</>、<Highlight>社交馈赠秘宝</>，不同秘宝进度与奖励彼此独立。\n2、开启秘宝可获得对应装等的装备，<Highlight>世界冒险和以战养战秘宝</>可获得<Highlight>丰富的养成资源</>，<Highlight>社交馈赠秘宝</>可获得<Highlight>可交易的资源</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获得秘宝</>\n1、参与对应玩法可<Highlight>累积秘宝进度</>，秘宝进度满后可自动转化为获得对应类型的秘宝。\n2、35装等、45装等、55装等的秘宝进度转化秘宝有次数上限，最多<Highlight>10</>次，超过进度将<Highlight>自动存储</>，新装等的秘宝解锁后<Highlight>转化为新秘宝</>。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>开启次数累计</>\n从周一开始时，每日新增并累积共享开启次数，直到下周一重置。若当周次数未使用，将会被清空。具体规则如下：\n1. 周一到周五每天新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数；\n2. 从开服第二周开始，周六到周日<Highlight>不限次</>；\n3. 开服首周的周五、周六、周日仍然会每日新增并累积<Highlight>10</>次共享开启次数。\n4. 已获得但未开启的秘宝在解锁新的秘宝后可手动进行丢弃。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>活力消耗规则</>\n共享开启次数消耗的活力将随着非凡者已开启次数增加。具体规则如下：\n1-5次：消耗<Highlight>20</>活力；\n6-10次：消耗<Highlight>50</>活力；\n11-20次：消耗<Highlight>100</>活力；\n21-30次：消耗<Highlight>150</>活力；\n30次以后：消耗<Highlight>200</>活力。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Secret Treasure Introduction</>\n1. Secret Treasures are divided into <Highlight>World Adventure Secret Treasures</>, <Highlight>War-to-War Secret Treasures</>, and <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</>. The progress and rewards for different Secret Treasures are independent of each other. \n2. Opening Secret Treasures can grant equipment of the corresponding item level. <Highlight>World Adventure and War-to-War Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>abundant cultivation resources</>, while <Highlight>Social Gift Secret Treasures</> can grant <Highlight>tradable resources</>. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Obtaining Secret Treasures </>\n1. Participate in corresponding gameplay to <Highlight>accumulate Secret Treasure progress</>. Once the progress is full, it will automatically convert into obtaining the corresponding type of Secret Treasure. \n2. There is a limit to the number of times Secret Treasure progress can be converted for item levels 35, 45, and 55, up to a maximum of <Highlight>10</> times. Excess progress will be <Highlight>automatically stored</> and <Highlight>converted into new Secret Treasures</> after the new item level Secret Treasures are unlocked. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cumulative Opening Times </>\nStarting from Monday, new shared opening times are added and accumulated daily until they reset the following Monday. If the times for the current week are not used, they will be cleared. The specific rules are as follows: \n1. From Monday to Friday, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times are added and accumulated daily; \n2. Starting from the second week of the server launch, there is <Highlight>no limit</> on Saturday and Sunday; \n3. On Friday, Saturday, and Sunday of the first week of the server launch, <Highlight>10</> shared opening times will still be added and accumulated daily. \n4. Secret Treasures that have been obtained but not opened can be manually discarded after unlocking new Secret Treasures. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Vitality Consumption Rules </>\nThe Vitality consumed by shared opening times will increase as the Потусторонний's number of openings increases. The specific rules are as follows: \n1-5 times: consume <Highlight>20</> Vitality; \n6-10 times: consume <Highlight>50</> Vitality; \n11-20 times: consume <Highlight>100</> Vitality; \n21-30 times: consume <Highlight>150</> Vitality; \nAfter 30 times: consume <Highlight>200</> Vitality.",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Delayed Damage Buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Delayed Damage Buff",
    ["<P_Heart>(This absolutely cannot be told to him! But the divination has already shown such a result, what should I do...)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Этого ему категорически нельзя говорить! Но гадание уже показало такой результат, что мне делать...)</>",
    ["GTA - Street Hunt - Crow monster connecting to boss buff"] = "GTA - Street Hunt - Crow monster connecting to boss buff",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 延迟伤害buff2"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Delayed Damage Buff 2",
    ["“我要建立一座由蒸汽驱动的浮空国度，它应当拥有思考能力和情绪，贯彻机械与蒸汽的至高美学。”罗塞尔说道。那时，他刚刚成为通识者途径序列2知识导师，站在世界的顶点，眼中充满无限可能。\n但这个愿望没来得及实现，纵使站在时代浪尖的罗塞尔本人也没有想到，畅想这一未来的时刻竟是他人生最高峰。权力的血雨腥风紧随而来，时代浪潮能裹挟着他冲上天空，也能将他沉入海底。\n蒸汽之国，最终成了一座只存在于构想中的神国，只有他死去时佩戴的王冠记得这一切——这究竟是幸运还是不幸？苏醒的王冠依靠污染的力量将其化作实体，新生的机械之城一刻不停地成长着，轰鸣声、齿轮声和发条转动声代替了脉搏与心跳的声音。罗塞尔的野心，在他死后以一种意想不到的方式不断蔓延……"] = "«Я хочу построить летающее королевство, приводимое в движение паром; оно должно обладать способностью думать и испытывать эмоции, воплощая высшую эстетику машин и пара», — сказала Розель. В то время он только что стал Наставником Знаний Последовательности 2 пути Саванта, стоя на вершине мира, его глаза были полны безграничных возможностей. \nНо этому желанию так и не удалось осуществиться. Даже сам Розель, стоявший на вершине эпохи, никогда не предполагал, что момент, когда он представил себе это будущее, станет пиком его жизни. Кровавые бури власти последовали за ним; приливы эпохи могли унести его на небо, но могли и потопить в бездну. \nКоролевство Steam со временем стало божественным королевством, существовавшим лишь в теории; обо всем этом помнит только корона, которую он носил, когда умер, — счастье это или несчастье? Пробужденная корона полагалась на силу порчи, чтобы воплотить ее в реальность, и новорожденный Город Машин рос без малейшей паузы. Звуки рева, шестерёнок и часового механизма заменили звуки пульса и сердцебиения. Амбиции Розеллы продолжили распространяться после его смерти неожиданным образом...",
    ["True:监听所有Buff；\nFalse:只监听匹配BuffIDs、BuffTags、BuffTypes的Buff"] = "Верно: слушайте все усиления; \n Ложь: прослушивать только усиления, соответствующие BuffID, BuffTags, BuffTypes.",
    ["[Insight] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, increase own Control resistance for 10 seconds."] = "[Insight] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, increase own Control resistance for 10 seconds.",
    ["【最后一页】触发"] = "【Last Page】Trigger",
    ["【实证】每次叠加扭曲效果时会同时造成一次伤害，若目标身上有护盾，则伤害变为1.5倍。"] = "[Proof] Each time a Distortion effect is stacked, it simultaneously deals damage. If the target has a Shield, the damage becomes 1.5 times.",
    ["{{他|她}}怎么冲上去了，不会也想猎龙吧？"] = "{{He|She}} charged up there—don't tell me {{he|she}} wants to hunt dragons too?",
    ["[True Form] The Ritual Magic generated after Nightmare hits will expand twice, and the damage dealt will increase accordingly."] = "[True Form] The Ritual Magic generated after Кошмар hits will expand twice, and the damage dealt will increase accordingly.",
    ["HP<50%额外15%伤减"] = "Additional 15% Снижение урона when HP < 50%",
    ["CBT2副本用测试属性buff"] = "CBT2 Dungeon Test Attribute Buff",
    ["[Right Stick Mode 4] Attacks enemies within a rectangular range in front. Note that the target filtering length and width parameters are related to the Right Stick Mode warning parameters."] = "[Right Stick Mode 4] Attacks enemies within a rectangular range in front. Note that the target filtering length and width parameters are related to the Right Stick Mode warning parameters.",
    ["【20】主动搭话"] = "【20】Initiate Conversation",
    ["<h>回忆</>转运仪式"] = "<h>Recall</> the Fortune-Turning Ritual",
    ["boss连线时针充能buff"] = "Усилитель зарядки руки Boss Connection Час",
    ["　　克莱恩看着那很难说是一杯还是一块的深蓝色粘稠液体，艰难地吞了口唾沫道：\n　　“就这样喝下去？”\n　　“不需要另外的准备吗？比如仪式、咒文或者祈祷语？”\n　　老尼尔“呃”了一声道：\n　　“准备？有的，你先来杯因蒂斯的奥尔米尔葡萄酒，再抽上一根迪西雪茄，然后哼一节悠扬的旋律，跳一段轻快的宫廷舞，你喜欢踢踏舞也可以，最后再来局昆特牌……”\n　　见克莱恩的表情越来越呆愣，老尼尔笑了笑，给出前面描述的总结：\n　　“如果你感觉紧张。”\n　　……你还挺幽默嘛……克莱恩嘴角抽搐了两下，忍住了拔枪的冲动。\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第三十四章 灵视"] = "Клейн посмотрел на темно-синюю вязкую жидкость, трудно было сказать, была ли это чашка или блок, и тяжело сглотнул: \n «Просто выпей ее вот так?» \n «Разве тебе не нужны другие приготовления? Например, ритуалы, заклинания или молитвы?» \n Старина Нил сказал «э-э» и сказал: \n «Приготовления? Есть некоторые. Сначала вы выпиваете чашку вина Intis Olmier, затем выкуриваете Dicy». сигару, затем напевайте мелодичную мелодию, станцуйте легкий придворный танец — если хотите, можете танцевать чечетку — и, наконец, сыграйте в Гвинт...» \n Видя, как выражение лица Клейна становится все более ошеломленным, Старина Нил улыбнулся и кратко изложил предыдущее описание: \n «Если ты нервничаешь». \n ...Ты довольно юмористический... Губы Клейна дважды дернулись, и он подавил желание вытащить пистолет. \n \n —— Том 1 «Клоун», Глава 34, Духовное видение",
    ["Ms. Magician, what kind of existence is Mr. Fool to you?"] = "Ms. Фокусник, what kind of existence is Mr. Fool to you?",
    ["“神降”仪式进度 %s%%\n%s"] = "\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress %s %% \n %s",
    ["<player>%s</> starts a \"Villa Party\", inviting all Beyonders to attend!"] = "<player>%s</> начинает «Вечеринку на вилле», приглашая всех Потустороннийs принять участие!",
    ["Tab Selection Test Configuration - Camera Priority - Healer"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет камеры — Целитель",
    ["【增强】生命值低于<HighLight>40%</>时，获得相当于<HighLight>35%</>最大生命值的护盾，持续<HighLight>5</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] When Health is below <HighLight>40%</>, gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>35%</> Max Health for <HighLight>5</> seconds.",
    ["<Yellow>Paper Figurine Protection</>: When the master receives fatal damage, it triggers an <Yellow>8</>-second Paper Figurine Protection effect. During this time, the paper figurine absorbs excess damage for the master, increases the master's Control Dodge by <Yellow>*d</> and Control Block by <Yellow>*d</>, and makes the master immune to movement speed reduction effects. The total excess damage absorbed by the paper figurine cannot exceed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</> of the master's maximum Health. When the limit is reached, the protection effect ends prematurely. \nThe protection effect can be triggered at most once every 120 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Бумажный человечек Protection</>: When the master receives fatal damage, it triggers an <Yellow>8</>-second Бумажный человечек Protection effect. During this time, the Бумажный человечек absorbs excess damage for the master, increases the master's Control Dodge by <Yellow>*d</> and Control Block by <Yellow>*d</>, and makes the master immune to Скорость бега reduction effects. The total excess damage absorbed by the Бумажный человечек cannot exceed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</> of the master's maximum Health. When the limit is reached, the protection effect ends prematurely. \nThe protection effect can be triggered at most once every 120 seconds.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演太阳神官】\n艾米丽·莫里森，一个看不见光的盲人女孩。但她用指尖触摸世界，用故事温暖黑暗，她是街角最明亮的小太阳。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Sun Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner.",
    ["[Rogue] Wanderer Inscription - Periodic Damage"] = "[Rogue] Wanderer Inscription - Periodic Damage",
    ["Luper, the Alpha Wolf, has gone completely mad and bared his fangs at you."] = "Люпер, Альфа-Волк, совсем сошел с ума и обнажил на тебя клыки.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <天灾化身> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Scourge Avatar> trait",
    ["[Enhanced] Gain Super Armor and immunity to crowd control for <HighLight>25</> seconds after combat starts."] = "[Enhanced] Gain Суперброня and immunity to crowd control for <HighLight>25</> seconds after combat starts.",
    ["To 非凡者\n    凡有言，必被知。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Потусторонний \n Что бы ни было сказано, будет известно. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["SpeedDown, -- Slow \nSleep, -- Slumber \nStuck, -- Imprisonment \nDizzy, -- Stun \nSilent, -- Silence \nDodgeLimit, -- Stagnation"] = "SpeedDown, -- Замедление \nСон, -- Сон \nЗастрял, -- Заключение \nГоловокружение, -- Оглушение \nТихий, -- Тишина \nDodgeLimit, -- Стагнация",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演格斗学者】\n巷子里传来一阵骚动。一只大花猫堵住了一只小老鼠，老鼠缩在墙角瑟瑟发抖。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner.",
    ["<P_Heart>（难道是驯兽师？或者其他能与动物沟通的非凡者？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Может ли она быть Укротительницей Зверей? Или другим Потусторонним, умеющим общаться с животными?)</>",
    ["n选1放置法术场"] = "Place Spell Field (N choose 1).",
    ["{{player.name}}在非凡聚合中，凝聚出携有<Chat_Highlight>{{relic_word.name}}</>词条的{{item.name}}，得到了执掌好运的黄黑之王的眷顾！"] = "{{player.name}} condensed a {{item.name}} carrying the <Chat_Highlight>{{relic_word.name}}</> affix during a Потусторонний Convergence, receiving the favor of the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck!",
    ["Hello, {{sir|madam}}. As you can see, I am researching a... magical bill regarding sewage treatment."] = "Hello, {{sir|madam}}. As you can see, I am researching a... magical bill regarding sewage treatment.",
    ["{{player.name}}的“神降”仪式获得了“愚者”先生的恩赐——<Chat_Highlight>君临·火焰</>！赞美祂！<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},444460680\">[前往赞美]</>"] = "{{player.name}}'s \"Divine Descent\" ritual has received Mr. Fool's blessing—<Chat_Highlight>Monarch's Flame</>! Praise Him! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},444460680\">[Go to Praise]</>",
    ["{{He|She}} charged up there—don't tell me {{he|she}} wants to hunt dragons too?"] = "{{He|She}} charged up there—don't tell me {{he|she}} wants to hunt dragons too?",
    ["<Yellow>镇定情绪</>：战斗中激活，安抚携带者周围的敌方目标。若敌方目标身处携带者8米范围内超过3秒，则会进入持续4秒的<Yellow>迷失</>状态。敌方若攻击携带者，则会加速这一进程，触发加速的间隔为<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?0.5}</>秒，敌方受到伤害则会延缓这一过程，触发延缓的间隔为2秒。\n每<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?10}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?8}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?7}</>秒最多使周围目标进入一次迷失状态。\n\n<Yellow>迷失</>：buffdisc(*id)"] = "<Yellow>Calming Emotions</>: Activated in combat, pacifying enemy targets around the carrier. If an enemy target remains within 8 meters of the carrier for more than 3 seconds, they will enter a <Yellow>Lost</> state lasting 4 seconds. If the enemy attacks the carrier, this process is accelerated, with the acceleration interval being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?0.5}</> seconds. If the enemy takes damage, this process is delayed, with the delay interval being 2 seconds. \nEvery <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?10}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?8}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?7}</> seconds, targets nearby can be made to enter the Lost state at most once. \n\n<Yellow>Lost</>: buffdisc(*id)",
    ["<Yellow>Rusty Bullet</>: When an attack hits the primary target, there is a probability of firing a dark green toxin pill at them, causing their body to suffer Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#占位#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds, with a 5-second Cooldown. During this period, attacking the target triggers the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within <Yellow>8</> meters, with a maximum of one splash per 2 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Rusty Bullet</>: When an attack hits the primary target, there is a probability of firing a dark green toxin pill at them, causing their body to suffer Corrosion and Rot, dealing <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=1?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=2?#Placeholder#}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085028)=3?#Placeholder#)</> damage per second for <Yellow>5</> seconds, with a 5-second Перезарядка. During this period, attacking the target triggers the <Yellow>Venom Splash</> effect, dealing damage to up to 6 other hostile targets within <Yellow>8</> meters, with a maximum of one splash per 2 seconds.",
    ["“观众”的序列名，会让人误以为这是一个只擅长观察与辅助的途径。但实际上，这也是一种伪装，让人更轻敌的伪装。"] = "The Последовательность name \"Зритель\" might lead people to mistakenly think this is a Pathway only good at observation and support. But in reality, it is also a form of disguise, a disguise that makes people underestimate the user.",
    ["Miss \"Magician\"'s new book"] = "Miss \"Фокусник\"'s new book",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 变身仓鼠击倒"] = "[May Manor]-[Believer Number One]- Transform into Hamster Knockdown",
    ["\"Divine Descent\" ritual"] = "\"Divine Descent\" ritual",
    ["【本相】电流持续期间目标脚下会生成一个跟随目标的静电立场，对范围内的敌人持续造成伤害，持续5秒。"] = "[True Form] During the Current duration, a static field following the target is generated at the target's feet, continuously dealing damage to enemies within range for 5 seconds.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>理智值</>\n在非凡世界中行动时，各类事件将使玩家的理智值发生波动。当理智值持续降低，异常状态将从肉体开始，逐步向以太体、心智体、星灵体、精神体蔓延侵蚀，角色将依次进入不同程度的精神状态，并产生对应的效果。 \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>安魂</>\n加入安魂诗社的玩家可以对其他玩家进行安魂，<Highlight>回复</>对应玩家的理智值。\n\n打开灵视之后，点击其他玩家可以查看他的理智值状态。当目标玩家的理智值<Highlight>低于一定值</>时，即可对其发起安魂。\n安魂的<Highlight>治疗成功率</>取决于两个因素：安魂者所在<Highlight>社团的等级</>，以及被安魂者当前的<Highlight>理智值高低</>。社团等级越高、对方理智值越高，安魂成功的概率也越高。\n需要注意的是，安魂并非没有风险——<Highlight>若安魂失败</>，参与双方的理智值均有概率受到波动，产生一定损耗。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Рассудок </> \n When acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Рассудок to fluctuate. As Рассудок continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually spread to erode the etheric body, astral body, mental body, and Духовное тело. The character will enter different levels of mental states in Последовательность and produce corresponding effects. \n \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Requiem </> \n Players who join the Requiem Poetry Society can perform Requiem on other players to <Highlight> restore </> the corresponding player's Рассудок. \n \n After opening spirit vision, click on other players to view their Рассудок status. When the target player's Рассудок <Highlight> is below a certain value </>, you can initiate Requiem on them. \n The <Highlight> healing success rate </> of Requiem depends on two factors: the level of the <Highlight> society </> the Requiem performer belongs to, and the current <Highlight> Рассудок level </> of the person being treated. The higher the society level and the higher the other person's Рассудок, the higher the probability of a successful Requiem. \n It should be noted that Requiem is not without risk—<Highlight> if Requiem fails </>, both participating parties have a probability of experiencing Рассудок fluctuations and incurring a certain loss.",
    ["To Beyonder \n We are Guardians, but also a group of \n poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness. \n \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "To Потусторонний\n Мы - Стражи, а также группа бедняг\n, постоянно борющихся с опасностью и безумием. \n \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["【增强】攻击和技能造成持续<HighLight>5</>秒的<HighLight>1.5%</>灼烧和<HighLight>50%</>重伤效果。"] = "[Enhanced] Attack and skill damage inflict <HighLight>5</> seconds of <HighLight>1.5%</> Burn and <HighLight>50%</> Grievous Injury.",
    ["trigger7号"] = "Trigger No. 7",
    ["BOSS隐身无敌buff"] = "БОСС Невидимость Бафф неуязвимости",
    ["【副本】五月庄园·城堡·普通,1250309"] = "【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Normal, 1250309",
    ["<Red>Perjury</>: When the carrier's skill Notarization fails, the Damage Boost caused by that skill cast is reduced by 60%, and the Healing Boost is reduced by 60%. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Perjury</>: When the carrier's skill Notarization fails, the Damage Boost caused by that skill cast is reduced by 60%, and the Healing Boost is reduced by 60%. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Tips_BrownTitle>增益</>"] = "<Tips_BrownTitle> Buff </>",
    ["[Position] Windmill - Jirel sets up a Wall of Spirituality"] = "[Position] Windmill - Jirel sets up a Wall of Духовность",
    ["Combo窗口时长"] = "Combo Window Duration",
    ["[Placeholder] \"Her flowers bloom overnight until dawn \n But when the day opens its eyes \n Ashamed of being under the Gaze, with nowhere to hide \n She withers and falls in a Stun...\""] = "[Placeholder] \"Her flowers bloom overnight until dawn \n But when the day opens its eyes \n Ashamed of being under the Gaze, with nowhere to hide \n She withers and falls in a Stun...\"",
    ["【Sever】 the energy source of the Web of Order and retrieve the Chaos Greatsword trapped in the web"] = "【Sever】 the energy source of the Web of Order and retrieve the Chaos Greatsword trapped in the web",
    ["【】makes people healthy"] = "【】makes people healthy",
    ["<P_Heart>(In the Beyonder world, every choice made comes with a corresponding price...)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(В мире Потусторонний за каждый сделанный выбор приходится соответствующая цена...)</>",
    ["“绝望魔镜”对应序列4的绝望魔女非凡特性，要比序列1的“知识皇冠”容易解决。"] = "\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" corresponds to the Последовательность 4 Despair Witch Потусторонний characteristic, which is easier to solve than the Последовательность 1 \"Knowledge Crown\".",
    ["To 窥秘人\n     为所欲为，但勿伤害。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "Мистери Прайеру \n Делай, что хочешь, но не причиняй вреда. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["{\n    \"轻攻击\": \"LightHit\",\n    \"击退\": \"HitBack\",\n    \"击倒\": \"HitDown\",\n    \"击飞\": \"HitFly\",\n    \"挑空\": \"HitFloat\",\n    \"拖拽\": \"HitDrag\",\n    \"僵直攻击\": \"HitStiff\",\n    \"拳击玩法轻受击\": \"BoxHitLight\",\n    \"拳击玩法重受击\": \"BoxHitHeavy\"\n}"] = "{\n \"Light Attack\": \"LightHit\", \n \"Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Drag\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stiff Attack\": \"HitStiff\", \n \"Boxing light hit\": \"BoxHitLight\", \n \"Boxing heavy hit\": \"BoxHitHeavy\" \n}",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演太阳神官】\n艾米丽·莫里森，一个看不见光的盲人女孩。但她用指尖触摸世界，用故事温暖黑暗，她是街角最明亮的小太阳。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Solar High Priest】 \n Emily Morrison, a blind girl who cannot see the light. But she touches the world with her fingertips and warms the darkness with stories; she is the brightest little sun on the street corner.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Hunting Time event time</>\n<Highlight>Open daily from 19:00—20:00; additionally open every Saturday and Sunday from </><Highlight>14:00—15:00</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Royal City area limited-time event</>\nDuring Hunting Time, you can summon a limited-time <Highlight>Fate Marionette</> at the [Mutated Camp] in the center of the Royal City. Defeating it will grant Crimson Relic materials.\n10 minutes after<Highlight> the Hunting Time event begins on Friday night</>, i.e., at <Highlight>19:10</>, a <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. When the dragon is repelled, the team with the highest effective damage contribution will receive auction rewards. During each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the final kill auction qualification for the <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> at most 1 time; players who have already obtained this qualification cannot obtain it again during the current event.\nExcept for the Friday night session, 10 minutes after<Highlight> other Hunting Time events begin</>, a <Highlight>Royal City Guardian</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. After defeating the Royal City Guardian, the team members who land the final blow will share the corresponding rewards.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Double Rank Point Gains</>\nDuring Hunting Time, killing hostile players allows you to plunder <Highlight>double Rank Points</>; when killed, the Rank Points lost are also doubled."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Hunting Time event time</>\n<Highlight>Open daily from 19:00—20:00; additionally open every Saturday and Sunday from </><Highlight>14:00—15:00</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Royal City area limited-time event</>\nDuring Hunting Time, you can summon a limited-time <Highlight>Fate Марионетка</> at the [Mutated Camp] in the center of the Royal City. Defeating it will grant Crimson Relic materials.\n10 minutes after<Highlight> the Hunting Time event begins on Friday night</>, i.e., at <Highlight>19:10</>, a <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. When the dragon is repelled, the team with the highest effective damage contribution will receive auction rewards. During each Hunting Time event, each player can obtain the final kill auction qualification for the <Highlight>Dragon - Projection</> at most 1 time; players who have already obtained this qualification cannot obtain it again during the current event.\nExcept for the Friday night session, 10 minutes after<Highlight> other Hunting Time events begin</>, a <Highlight>Royal City Guardian</> will spawn in the center of the Royal City. After defeating the Royal City Guardian, the team members who land the final blow will share the corresponding rewards.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Double Rank Point Gains</>\nDuring Hunting Time, killing hostile players allows you to plunder <Highlight>double Rank Points</>; when killed, the Rank Points lost are also doubled.",
    ["[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter 1 Not Tracked by Hound, No Bell, Add Buff"] = "[May Manor-Simple] Summon Butler Phantom to Summon Locking Dog - Filter 1 Not Tracked by Hound, No Bell, Add Buff",
    ["　　近日，金秋湖连续出现多起少女死亡事件。所有死者颈部均留有清晰的穿刺创口。\n　　案发现场均呈现诡异的一致性：屋内散落着银质烛台与大量枯萎的玫瑰花瓣，似乎被刻意布置成古典婚礼现场。据调查，这些少女生前均热衷阅读《暮色之城》《惊情德古拉》等<Highlight>吸血鬼</>爱情小说。"] = "Recently, there have been a series of deaths of young girls at Golden Autumn Lake. All the victims had clear puncture wounds on their necks. \n　　The crime scenes all displayed an eerie consistency: silver candlesticks and a large number of withered rose petals were scattered throughout the rooms, as if they had been deliberately arranged to resemble a classical wedding scene. According to the investigation, all these young girls were avid readers of vampire romance novels such as \"City of Twilight\" and \"Dracula\" before their deaths. <Highlight>vampire</>",
    ["...Have you ever cast it?"] = "...Have you ever cast it?",
    ["<P_Heart> (Need to sneak in? The spirit body threads ability in the Leano notes that Ms. Fors lent me might come in handy. I can try to use it to control </> <P_Yellow> mice </> <P_Heart> to go in and create chaos...) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Нужно пробраться внутрь? Способность духовного тела соединяться в заметках Леано, которую мне одолжила г-жа Форс, может пригодиться. Я могу попробовать использовать ее для управления </> <P_Yellow> мышами </> <P_Heart>, чтобы войти и создать хаос...) </>",
    ["GTA - Audrey Healing - Teacup"] = "GTA - Audrey Healing - Teacup",
    [" \n \n Knowledge is carried on the shoulders; it has weight and consumes physical strength, and the bearer must pay a price for it. \n This ancient nation perhaps touched a truth earlier than many later philosophical systems—the more you know, the heavier you bear. \n Regrettably, most existing documents are damaged. What this book can rely on are only sporadic inscriptions on unearthed pottery shards, citations in later manuscripts, and several suspicious cognate words in neighboring language families. These materials are enough to suggest a direction, but not enough to support a conclusion. \n The author presents the lack of evidence truthfully, rather than filling the gaps with speculation—in the discipline of etymology, admitting ignorance itself is a kind of honesty."] = "\n \n Knowledge is carried on the shoulders; it has weight and consumes physical strength, and the bearer must pay a price for it. \n This ancient nation perhaps touched a truth earlier than many later philosophical systems—the more you know, the heavier you bear. \n Regrettably, most existing documents are damaged. What this book can rely on are only sporadic inscriptions on unearthed pottery shards, citations in later manuscripts, and several suspicious cognate words in neighboring language families. These materials are enough to suggest a direction, but not enough to support a conclusion. \n The author presents the lack of evidence truthfully, rather than filling the gaps with speculation—in the discipline of etymology, admitting ignorance itself is a kind of honesty.",
    ["<player>%s</>开启“别野派对”，邀请各位非凡者参加！"] = "<player>%s</> начинает «Вечеринку на вилле», приглашая всех Потустороннийs принять участие!",
    ["Bestselling novelist Fors Wall's brand new masterpiece <Highlight> \"The Great Adventurer\" </> Part 2 is now being hotly serialized! Once published, it became an essential topic for social balls... \n Ms. Fors revealed that in the second part, the adventurer who travels the world by sea will continue to explore unknown territories and meet new companions. Let us look forward to the adventurer's brand new journey!"] = "Совершенно новый шедевр <Highlight> «Великий авантюрист» </> Part 2, написанный бестселлером Форсом Уоллом, сейчас активно выходит в сериале! После публикации она стала важной темой для социальных балов... \n Г-жа Форс рассказала, что во второй части искатель приключений, путешествующий по миру по морю, продолжит исследовать неизведанные территории и встретит новых спутников. Будем с нетерпением ждать нового путешествия искателя приключений!",
    ["Id(伤害修正)"] = "Id (Damage correction)",
    ["【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Bard】 \n On the street corner bench, the young man's shoulders are trembling slightly. He has a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he can't bring himself to reach out."] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Bard】 \n On the street corner bench, the young man's shoulders are trembling slightly. He has a bouquet of flowers and a letter in front of him, but he can't bring himself to reach out.",
    ["did破防2"] = "did Armor Break 2",
    ["　　奥黛丽当即开动脑筋，边思索边说道：\n　　“您是‘愚者’先生，来自塔罗牌，那作为一个定期的、长期的、隐秘的‘聚会’，称号得尽量一致，嗯，我也从塔罗牌里挑吧。”\n　　她的口吻慢慢变得愉快：\n　　“决定了，我的称号是，‘正义’！”\n　　这是塔罗牌二十二张主牌之一。\n\n　　——第一卷《小丑》第七章 代号"] = "Одри сразу же приступила к работе, думая, когда она сказала: \n　　\"Вы мистер Дурак, судя по картам Таро. При регулярном, долгосрочном и секретном \"сборе\" названия должны быть как можно более последовательными. Хм, я тоже выберу из карт Таро.\" \n　　Ее тон постепенно стал веселым: \n　　\"Решено, мой титул - \"Справедливость\"!\" \n　　Это одна из двадцати двух карт Старших Арканов. \n\n　　——Том 1: Клоун, Глава 7: Кодовое имя",
    ["GVG高塔特效buff黑皇"] = "GVG High Tower Effect Buff Black Emperor",
    ["【替代3D检视】法阵的中央空着一块，要把什么摆上去呢？"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] The center of the magic circle is empty. What should be placed there?",
    ["【占位-动画】接着，他飞快地点燃蜡烛、激活了净化仪式。"] = "[Placeholder-Animation] Next, he quickly lights the candles and activates the purification ritual.",
    ["【浅见】触发低于20%立即恢复生命效果时目标额外获得减伤20%，持续5秒。"] = "[Insight] When triggering the immediate Health restoration effect below 20%, the target gains an additional 20% Снижение урона for 5 seconds.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Better use divination to see if the room is dangerous first.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Лучше сначала использовать гадание, чтобы узнать, опасна ли комната.) </>",
    ["Attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Bishop of Fear></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Skill Enhancement increased.\""] = "Атакуйте <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с аффиксом <Highlight><Bishop of Fear></>: «Все уровни навыков +1, улучшение навыков увеличено».",
    ["· Open a second perspective of your eyes to glimpse the truth hidden beneath reality. \n · <Yellow> Highlight </> key clues in the scene: You can see the lingering shadows of the deceased wandering at street corners and capture the faint glimmer of spirituality emitted by Beyonder items. \n · Identify the aura status of living beings with <Yellow> different colors </>: The auras of living beings have nowhere to hide before you, and the brightness of their ether bodies tells of their health and mood. \n · With the improvement of <Yellow> TRPG Talent </>, you can interpret deeper information and even glimpse the waxing and waning of the flames of life."] = "· Open a second perspective of your eyes to glimpse the truth hidden beneath reality. \n · <Yellow> Highlight </> key clues in the scene: You can see the lingering shadows of the deceased wandering at street corners and capture the faint glimmer of Духовность emitted by Потусторонний items. \n · Identify the aura status of living beings with <Yellow> different colors </>: The auras of living beings have nowhere to hide before you, and the brightness of their ether bodies tells of their health and mood. \n · With the improvement of <Yellow> TRPG Talent </>, you can interpret deeper information and even glimpse the waxing and waning of the flames of life.",
    ["【LV5】【秘偶技】寻踪魔弹-代理主技能"] = "[LV5] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演读心者】\n诊所的霍普医生最近总是眉头紧锁，似乎在为什么事情困扰。"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Reader】 \n Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something.",
    ["　　……\n　　不知从什么时候起，<Mark id=\"#159\">隐匿贤者</>疑似活化。\n　　祂疯狂地追逐着每一个摩斯苦修会的成员，甚至是每一个“窥秘人”，这种现象被称为<Mark id=\"#159\">“知识逐人”</>。\n　　当海潮般的知识灌注而来时，受灌输者要么放开心灵防线，接受祂的<Hide id=\"#157\">改造</>，要么凭毅力支撑。\n　　当知识灌注冲破毅力防线的那一刻，便会引发<Hide id=\"#157\">失控</>。\n　　但，我想，祂的灌输，未必没有用处。"] = "... \n I do not know when it started, but the <Mark id=\"#159\"> Hidden Sage </> is suspected to have become active. \n It madly pursues every member of the Moses Ascetic Order, and even every \"Подглядывающий за Тайнами.\" This phenomenon is known as <Mark id=\"#159\"> \"Knowledge Pursuit.\" </> \n When the tidal wave of knowledge pours in, the recipient must either open their mental defenses and accept Its <Hide id=\"#157\"> transformation, </> or support themselves with willpower. \n The moment the infusion of knowledge breaks through the defense of willpower, it triggers <Hide id=\"#157\"> loss of control. </> \n However, I think Its infusion may not be without its uses.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Could there be Beyonder powers involved? Let's follow it and see!)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Могут ли здесь быть задействованы потусторонние силы? Давайте проследим и посмотрим!) </>",
    ["Enum (All Skill Slots)"] = "Enum (All Skill Slots)",
    ["……我被驯兽师占卜了命运？"] = "...Was my fate divined by a Beast Tamer?",
    ["【成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演学徒】\n一间旧公寓，锁匠大师的孩子把自己反锁在房间里，连大师本人都打不开。"] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as an Apprentice】\n In an old apartment, the locksmith master's child locked himself in the room, and even the master himself couldn't open it.",
    ["【Combat Air Wall】Out-of-control Seer"] = "【Combat Air Wall】Out-of-control Провидец",
    ["“魔术师”女士佛尔思利用空间隐匿能力将部分失控区域隐藏，留下的特殊图腾。"] = "A special totem left behind by Miss Фокусник Fors after using her space concealment ability to hide parts of the loss of control area.",
    ["【塔罗会·戴里克】档3增量(+15%)→累计114%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["The corruption is initially sealed, but the will of {{他|她}} has been repeatedly ravaged. Should we wake {{他|她}} up in the real world like this?"] = "Первоначально порча была запечатана, но воля {{him|her}} неоднократно разрушалась. Должны ли мы разбудить {{him|her}} в реальном мире вот так?",
    ["HP<40%触发3秒无敌"] = "Trigger 3s Invincibility when HP < 40%",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Pugilist】 \n A commotion comes from the alley. A large tabby cat has cornered a small mouse, and the mouse is shivering in the corner.",
    ["“愚者”先生是得到所有教会认可的正神，塔罗学派的成功修建也是得益于他的帮助。"] = "Господин Дурак — истинный Бог, признанный всеми церквями, и успешное строительство Клуба Таро также произошло благодаря его помощи.",
    ["BOSS4-品质-中治疗"] = "БОСС 4 – Качество – Среднее исцеление",
    ["“门”领域对致命伤害的封印锁链缠绕你的心脏。单次受伤造成的生命值损失不得超过最大生命值的25%。"] = "\"Door\" domain seals of fatal damage wrap around your heart. Single-instance damage cannot exceed 25% of your maximum HP.",
    ["Skill Enhancement increased by <Mark>50</>. Gains additional effects based on the total corruption value of nearby squad members. \nTotal corruption value <Mark>30</>: Attack increased by <Mark>30</>{1,2,（Activated）}\nTotal corruption value <Mark>60</>: Crit rate increased by <Mark>30</>{1,3,（Activated）}\nTotal corruption value <Mark>120</>: Monster Specialization increased by <Mark>30</>{1,4,（Activated）}"] = "Улучшение навыков увеличено на <Mark>50</>. Получает дополнительные эффекты в зависимости от общего значения порчи ближайших членов отряда. \nОбщее значение коррупции <Mark>30</>: атака увеличено на <Mark>30</>{1,2,（Activated）} \nОбщее значение коррупции <Mark>60</>: вероятность критического удара увеличено на <Mark>30</>{1,3,（Activated）} \nОбщее значение коррупции <Mark>120</>: специализация монстров увеличена на <Mark>30</>{1,4,（Activated）}",
    ["\"Selina Wood accidentally and coincidentally saw the true incantation for mirror divination from her occult teacher, Haines... \n Her bold attempt happened to encounter Klein, and the latter successfully solved this Beyonder case..."] = "\"Selina Wood accidentally and coincidentally saw the true incantation for mirror Гадание from her occult teacher, Haines... \n Her bold attempt happened to encounter Klein, and the latter successfully solved this Потусторонний case...",
    ["【LV3】【秘偶技】寻踪魔弹-代理主技能"] = "[LV3] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill",
    ["<Yellow>Almir's Crown</>: Replaces the wearer's Control Break Skill with the more powerful <Yellow>Proof of Glory</>: \nRemoves all control effects from yourself and enter a 4-second <Yellow>Cage of Light</> state, during which you gain <Yellow>Super Armor</> and <Yellow>50%</> Damage Reduction. Any portion of damage received that does not exceed 10% of your maximum Health is reflected back to the attacker at <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times the value (for targets beyond 8 meters, the reflected damage is further reduced, down to a minimum of 20% of the damage within 8 meters). <Yellow>When the Cage of Light</> ends, deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</> damage to up to 6 hostile targets within 8 meters, and apply a <Yellow>10</>-second <Yellow>Dazzle</> effect, reducing their Attack by <Yellow>*d</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 30 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Almir's Crown</>: Replaces the wearer's Control Break Skill with the more powerful <Yellow>Proof of Glory</>: \nRemoves all control effects from yourself and enter a 4-second <Yellow>Cage of Light</> state, during which you gain <Yellow>Суперброня</> and <Yellow>50%</> Снижение урона. Any portion of damage received that does not exceed 10% of your maximum Health is reflected back to the attacker at <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times the value (for targets beyond 8 meters, the reflected damage is further reduced, down to a minimum of 20% of the damage within 8 meters). <Yellow>When the Cage of Light</> ends, deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</> damage to up to 6 hostile targets within 8 meters, and apply a <Yellow>10</>-second <Yellow>Dazzle</> effect, reducing their Attack by <Yellow>*d</>. \nSkill Перезарядка: 30 seconds.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <神明之手> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Hand of God> trait",
    ["{{《Young Man Secretly Meets Sheriff》|《Sheriff Secretly Meets Mysterious Woman》}}? 'Breaking! University Student Arrested'? 'Carnivore Raids Restaurant at Night, Tremors Felt in Residential Building'?"] = "{{《Young Man Secretly Meets Sheriff》|《Sheriff Secretly Meets Mysterious Woman》}}? 'Breaking! University Student Arrested'? 'Carnivore Raids Restaurant at Night, Tremors Felt in Residential Building'?",
    ["ring2修正传入trigger"] = "ring2 correction incoming trigger",
    ["GTA - Mechanical Creation - Restore Super Armor"] = "GTA - Mechanical Creation - Restore Суперброня",
    ["<Yellow>眷顾</>：佩戴者施放普攻和非解控类技能时，有概率触发持续10秒的<Yellow>幸运</>：每层提高移动速度<Yellow>*f**</>、暴击<Yellow>*d</>、技能增强<Yellow>*d</>。未触发幸运则积攒概率至下一次技能施放，直至触发。触发概率随持有<Yellow>幸运</>的层数逐渐降低，初始概率为<Yellow>25%</>，5层时触发概率降至0。"] = "<Yellow>Favor</>: When the wearer performs a Normal Attack or a non-cleansing skill, there is a chance to trigger <Yellow>Luck</> for 10 seconds: each stack increases Скорость бега by <Yellow>*f**</>, critical hit rate by <Yellow>*d</>, and Усиление навыков by <Yellow>*d</>. If Luck is not triggered, the probability accumulates for the next skill cast until it triggers. The trigger probability gradually decreases with the number of <Yellow>Luck</> stacks, starting at <Yellow>25%</> and dropping to 0 at 5 stacks.",
    ["【本相】死亡之握每命中一个目标，降低自身冷却时间1秒，最多降低4秒。\n死亡之握每命中一个目标都会汲取目标的一个灵魂碎片，汲取10个灵魂碎片后在目标位置生成一个亡灵，亡灵在3秒后进行灵魂收割，对周围目标造成伤害。\n如果伤害击杀目标则算作汲取2个碎片。"] = "[True Form] Each target hit by Grasp of Death. reduces own Перезарядка by 1 second, up to 4 seconds. \n Each target hit by Grasp of Death. will extract a Soul Fragment from the target. After extracting 10 Soul Fragments, a Wraith is generated at the target's location. The Wraith performs a Soul Harvest after 3 seconds, dealing damage to surrounding targets. \n If the damage kills the target, it counts as extracting 2 fragments.",
    ["<Yellow>生命能量</>：携带者每隔<Yellow>20秒</>获得1点生命能量，持有上限为3点。携带者对自身或友方单位造成的累计有效治疗超过自身生命值上限的<Yellow>50%</>时，消耗1点生命能量，对目标附加3层<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>效果，持续10秒，并获得1枚<Yellow>生命之种</>，持有上限为3枚。\n\n<Yellow>蓬勃生长</>：生命值不满时，每秒消耗1层，恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</>点生命值。\n<Yellow>生命之种</>：携带者受到伤害时，如果生命值低于<Yellow>50%</>，则自动消耗1枚生命之种，固定恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</>上限的生命值。"] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The bearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the bearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the bearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, 1 stack is consumed per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the bearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed amount of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP.",
    ["“点燃深眠花梗驱邪”……一些神秘学偏方？"] = "\"Light the Deep Sleep Flower stalk to exorcise evil\"… Some occult folk remedies?",
    ["BOSS 4 - Quality - Healing"] = "БОСС 4 – Качество – Исцеление",
    ["Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Servant of Concealment></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Skill Block increased.\""] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Servant of Concealment></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Блок навыков increased.\"",
    ["【成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演占卜家】\n霍纳奇斯花海，一位女士站在许愿树下，着急地四处张望着……"] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Diviner】\n In the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands under the wishing tree, looking around anxiously...",
    ["【浅见】明灯的护盾结束时造成一次爆炸，对护盾周围至多2个目标造成伤害。"] = "[Insight] When the Beacon's Shield ends, it causes an Explosion, dealing damage to up to 2 targets around the Shield.",
    ["[Alternative 3D Inspection] The center of the magic circle is empty. What should be placed there?"] = "[Alternative 3D Inspection] The center of the magic circle is empty. What should be placed there?",
    ["[Insight] Player targets hit by the shadow energy explosion have a 30% chance to be inflicted with Horror for 1.2 seconds. The actual hit rate and duration of the Horror effect are affected by Stun-related attributes."] = "[Insight] Player targets hit by the shadow energy explosion have a 30% chance to be inflicted with Horror for 1.2 seconds. The actual hit rate and duration of the Horror effect are affected by Stun-related attributes.",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】占位"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Заполнитель",
    ["GVG高塔特效buff夜皇"] = "GVG High Tower Effect Buff Night Emperor",
    ["Recently, <Highlight> bizarre cases have occurred frequently </> in Tingen. \n A citizen claimed that red mushrooms grew on their head. The vines in a wealthy man's conservatory grew wildly, strangling him on his gold-inlaid toilet... \n The police remind citizens that strange rumors are mostly hallucinations. If you encounter such events, please call the police immediately or go to the nearest church for help."] = "Recently, <Highlight> bizarre cases have occurred frequently </> in Тинген. \n A citizen claimed that red mushrooms grew on their head. The vines in a wealthy man's conservatory grew wildly, strangling him on his gold-inlaid toilet... \n The police remind citizens that strange rumors are mostly hallucinations. If you encounter such events, please call the police immediately or go to the nearest church for help.",
    ["Id (Skill Wheel)."] = "Id (Skill Wheel).",
    ["The best souvenir from Lamud Castle! {{先生|女士}}, this is the perfect choice for picking out gifts for your family and friends!"] = "Лучший сувенир из замка Ламуд! {{Sir|Madam}}, это идеальный выбор для выбора подарков для вашей семьи и друзей!",
    ["《关于猫其实是非凡生物的论证》"] = "\"Proof that Cats are Actually Потусторонний Creatures\"",
    ["buff层数按list顺序映射，若当前bufflayer下没对应元素，返回list最末尾的元素"] = "Слои баффа отображаются в соответствии с порядком списка. Если под текущим слоем усиления нет соответствующего элемента, верните последний элемент списка.",
    ["[chenhonghua] Club Cargo: Help request message is on cooldown"] = "[chenhonghua] Club Cargo: сообщение с просьбой о помощи находится на перезарядке.",
    ["【Tarot Club】(7) Entire team +45% Attack Power +1000 Health +15% Critical Hit"] = "【Клуб Таро】(7) Вся команда +45% силы атаки +1000 здоровья +15% критического удара",
    ["<h>Prepare the ritual</> to head above the gray fog."] = "<h>Prepare the ritual</> to head above the gray fog.",
    ["The three layers of spirituality of the [Paradox of Luck] are fully charged, capable of blocking the Viscountess's fatal blow."] = "The three layers of Духовность of the [Paradox of Luck] are fully charged, capable of blocking the Viscountess's fatal blow.",
    ["trigger-卖鱼摊"] = "trigger-Fish Stall",
    ["“不眠者”途径的非凡者需要通过吟唱诗篇来影响周围生灵。"] = "Находящимся за пределами пути «Бессонных» необходимо воздействовать на окружающих живых существ, распевая стихи.",
    ["Enum(攻击中心)"] = "Enum (Attack Center).",
    ["<Red>后怕</>：嫁祸效果结束后的10秒内，减伤降低10%。连续触发危险直觉之后的冷却期内，控制命中、控制抗性降低。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Lingering Fear</>: Within 10 seconds after the Frame effect ends, Снижение урона is lowered by 10%. During the Перезарядка period after continuously triggering Danger Intuition, control hit and control resistance are reduced. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【17】 Break up a marriage"] = "【17】 Break up a marriage",
    ["I should go. Help me pass this note to {{PlayerName}}. Entering the fog of history consumed too much spirituality. Let {{him|her}} have a good rest at Blackthorn tonight."] = "I should go. Help me pass this note to {{PlayerName}}. Entering the fog of history consumed too much Духовность. Let {{him|her}} have a good rest at Blackthorn tonight.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Could it be that I need to act as a Seer?) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Может быть, мне нужно действовать как Провидец?) </>",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演魔术师】\n廷根街头有个疯疯癫癫的老太太，总是说绅士的帽子里有鸽子……"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Фокусник】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Тинген who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...",
    ["{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. Although well-intentioned, the technique was slightly lacking, causing <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</> Sanity points of loss. A good deed that backfired."] = "{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. Although well-intentioned, the technique was slightly lacking, causing <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</> Рассудок points of loss. A good deed that backfired.",
    ["　　Students are requested to consciously resist \"internal materials\" and take the exam with integrity. If any buyers are discovered, they will be <Letter_Highlight>strictly punished</> according to school regulations."] = "Студентам предлагается сознательно сопротивляться «внутренним материалам» и сдавать экзамен честно. Если будут обнаружены покупатели, они будут <Letter_Highlight>строго наказаны</> в соответствии со школьными правилами.",
    ["<h>占卜</>确认安全"] = "<h>Divinate</> to confirm safety",
    ["true 的话，则本次击杀才触发事件"] = "If true, the event triggers only on this kill",
    ["<h>Move your character</> to draw a wall of spirituality"] = "<h>Move your character</> to draw a wall of Духовность",
    ["[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Pulse of Life"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Pulse of Life",
    ["Action Damage Absorption Limit Formula ID"] = "Идентификатор формулы предела поглощения урона действиями",
    ["<h>放置</>仪式物品"] = "<h>Place</> the ritual items",
    ["[Under Construction] Player attributes increased when the number of Sequence types in the party equals 6."] = "[Under Construction] Player attributes increased when the number of Последовательность types in the party equals 6.",
    ["{{Sir|Madam}} Look, it's truly magical"] = "{{Sir|Madam}} Look, it's truly magical",
    ["【占卜家】(2) 距离越远伤害越高，最高追加15%攻击力的距离增伤。"] = "【Провидец】(2) The further the distance, the higher the damage, up to 15% Attack Power distance damage bonus.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {恐惧主教} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with the {Bishop of Fear} entry",
    ["“当最后一根轴承断裂”"] = "«Когда ломается последний подшипник»",
    ["“2”级封印物，危险，须谨慎且节制地利用……"] = "\"Grade 2\" Запечатанный артефакт, dangerous, must be used with caution and restraint...",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Magician】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Tingen who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat..."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Фокусник】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Тинген who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...",
    ["CS阶段无敌"] = "CS Phase Invincibility",
    ["【增强】战斗开始时获得相当于<HighLight>30%</>最大生命值的护盾，持续<HighLight>8</>秒。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain a Shield equal to <HighLight>30%</> Max Health for <HighLight>8</> seconds at the start of combat.",
    ["【增强】造成或承受伤害时获得<HighLight>2%</>攻击加成，最高叠加<HighLight>15</>层。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain <HighLight>2%</> Attack bonus when dealing or taking damage, stacking up to <HighLight>15</> times.",
    ["【塔罗学院氛围】屏障碎片"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Barrier Fragment",
    ["Ms. “Magician”, how did you obtain your powers?"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, how did you obtain your powers?",
    ["Miss Justice witnessed your fall, and she also witnessed you standing back up; the will that has been seen will not be easily extinguished. Damage taken reduced by 30%, damage dealt increased by 40%."] = "Мисс Джастис была свидетельницей вашего падения, а также была свидетельницей того, как вы снова встали; увиденную волю нелегко погасить. Получаемый урон уменьшен на 30%, наносимый урон увеличен на 40%.",
    ["<Red>欲望剥离</>：战斗中每隔7秒，携带者也会进入迷失状态，持续1秒。携带者受到伤害或治疗均会延缓这一进程。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Desire Stripping</>: Every 7 seconds during combat, the carrier also enters the Lost state for 1 second. Taking damage or receiving healing will delay this process. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["true: Only listen for critical damage"] = "true: Only listen for critical damage",
    ["“绝望魔镜”是进入镜中廷根的唯一入口。"] = "\"Magic Mirror of Despair\" is the only entrance to Тинген in the Mirror.",
    ["<h>Place</> the ritual items"] = "<h>Place</> the ritual items",
    ["【Tarot Club · Derrick】+10% Critical Hit"] = "【Клуба Таро · Вышка】+10% критического удара",
    ["　　好久不见。\n　　自廷根湖异变后，值夜者封锁了廷根湖边区域处理遗留的污染，目前已经处理完毕，重新解除了封锁。\n　　不过最近巡逻的同事告诉我，湖边近日忽然多了几张桌椅和帐篷，应该解除封锁后，有人来到这边进行了活动。\n　　保险起见，值夜者需要调查来到这边的人是否安全。如果你有时间的话，我希望你可以来廷根湖这边协助我们调查。\n　　新同事，期待着与你再一次见面。"] = "Давно не виделись. \n После аномалии озера Тинген Ночные Ястребы изолировали территорию возле озера Тинген, чтобы справиться с остаточной коррупцией. Сейчас оно обработано, и блокада снята. \n Однако недавно коллеги из патруля рассказали мне, что у озера внезапно появилось несколько столов, стульев и палаток. Кажется, здесь кто-то действовал с момента снятия блокады. \n Чтобы обезопасить себя, «Ночным ястребам» необходимо выяснить, в безопасности ли люди, пришедшие сюда. Если у вас есть время, я надеюсь, вы сможете приехать на озеро Тинген и помочь нам в расследовании. \n Новый коллега, с нетерпением ждем встречи с вами снова.",
    ["“愚者”先生向你投来注视。"] = "Мистер Дурак смотрит на вас.",
    ["[Proof] During the gray fog Blessing duration, releasing a skill increases own Health by an additional 2 points."] = "[Proof] During the gray fog Blessing duration, releasing a skill increases own Health by an additional 2 points.",
    ["HP<40%触发35%最大生命护盾"] = "Trigger 35% Max Health Shield when HP < 40%",
    ["{\n\"None\": \"\", \n\"Slow\": \"SpeedDown\", \n\"Slumber\": \"Sleep\", \n\"Imprisonment\": \"Stuck\", \n\"Stun\": \"Dizzy\", \n\"Silence\": \"Silent\", \n\"Horror\": \"CharTerror\", \n\"Stiff\": \"Stiff\", \n\"Stagnation\": \"DodgeLimit\"\n}"] = "{\n\"None\": \"\", \n\"Slow\": \"SpeedDown\", \n\"Slumber\": \"Sleep\", \n\"Imprisonment\": \"Stuck\", \n\"Stun\": \"Dizzy\", \n\"Silence\": \"Silent\", \n\"Horror\": \"CharTerror\", \n\"Stiff\": \"Stiff\", \n\"Stagnation\": \"DodgeLimit\"\n}",
    ["【Tarot Club · Offspring Protection】Tier 7 increment (+30%) → cumulative 220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["【塔罗会·子嗣守护】档6增量(+25%)→累计190%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["【Tarot Club · Sylvia】Tier 7 increment (+30%) → cumulative 220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["C级-占卜推理祭台"] = "C-Rank - Гадание Reasoning Altar",
    ["【增强】生命值低于<HighLight>50%</>时，额外获得<HighLight>20%</>伤害减免。"] = "[Enhanced] Gain an additional <HighLight>20%</> Снижение урона when Health is below <HighLight>50%</>.",
    ["The \"Door\" has been opened. Ms. Justice, are you ready to provide him with psychological therapy?"] = "The \"Door\" has been opened. Ms. Justice, are you ready to provide him with psychological therapy?",
    ["……\n\n暂未发现有非凡能力的残留，已抓获的作案者都是普通人、并无<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">非凡能力</>或持有<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">神奇物品</>，但无法完全排除此案件没有<Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\">非凡者</>的参与。提议<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Normal\" u=\"4\" id=\"#160\">阿霍瓦郡警察厅特殊行动部第五、六、七小组</>提高警惕，加强巡逻。\n\n……"] = "...\n\n No residual Потусторонний abilities have been found yet. The perpetrators who have been captured are all ordinary people, without <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Потусторонний abilities </> or in possession of <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> mystical items </>, but it cannot be completely ruled out that this case did not involve <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Потустороннийs </>. It is proposed that the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Normal\" u=\"4\" id=\"#160\"> 5th, 6th, and 7th squads of the Special Operations Department of the Awwa County Police Department </> increase vigilance and strengthen patrols. \n\n...",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <通灵者> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Spirit Medium> trait",
    ["……普通人调查失控非凡者，你应该庆幸自己还活着。但你的状态……"] = "…For an ordinary person to investigate a Потусторонний who has lost control, you should be thankful you are still alive. But your condition…",
    ["Miss Magician? Are you... alright? Do you need any help?"] = "Miss Фокусник? Are you... alright? Do you need any help?",
    ["{{PlayerName}}，辛苦你替教会回收这件封印物。"] = "{{PlayerName}}, thank you for recovering this Запечатанный артефакт for the Church.",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演学徒】\n一间旧公寓，锁匠大师的孩子把自己反锁在房间里，连大师本人都打不开。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as an Apprentice】 \n In an old apartment, the locksmith master's child has locked themselves in the room, and even the master himself cannot open it.",
    ["\"November 18th. What a magical thing. Through a whimsical experiment, I discovered a poor fellow trapped in a storm and lost in the depths of darkness.\""] = "\"November 18th. What a magical thing. Through a whimsical experiment, I discovered a poor fellow trapped in a storm and lost in the depths of darkness.\"",
    ["<Red>恋家</>：布偶回到主人身上后，需要休息10秒，才能再次被转移出去。\n<Red>祸心</>：被唤醒的布偶停留在主人身上期间，主人也会遭受厄运缠身效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Homesick</>: After the doll returns to the master, it needs to rest for 10 seconds before it can be transferred again. \n<Red>Malicious Heart</>: While the awakened doll is on the master, the master will also suffer from the Beset by Misfortune effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Backlund"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Бэкланд",
    ["<Yellow>Calming Emotions</>: Activated in combat, pacifying enemy targets around the carrier. If an enemy target remains within 8 meters of the carrier for more than 3 seconds, they will enter a <Yellow>Lost</> state lasting 4 seconds. If the enemy attacks the carrier, this process is accelerated, with the acceleration interval being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?0.5}</> seconds. If the enemy takes damage, this process is delayed, with the delay interval being 2 seconds. \nEvery <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?10}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?8}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?7}</> seconds, targets nearby can be made to enter the Lost state at most once. \n\n<Yellow>Lost</>: buffdisc(*id)"] = "<Yellow>Calming Emotions</>: Activated in combat, pacifying enemy targets around the carrier. If an enemy target remains within 8 meters of the carrier for more than 3 seconds, they will enter a <Yellow>Lost</> state lasting 4 seconds. If the enemy attacks the carrier, this process is accelerated, with the acceleration interval being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?0.5}</> seconds. If the enemy takes damage, this process is delayed, with the delay interval being 2 seconds. \nEvery <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=1?10}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=2?8}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085016)=3?7}</> seconds, targets nearby can be made to enter the Lost state at most once. \n\n<Yellow>Lost</>: buffdisc(*id)",
    ["Buff表里的Tags列"] = "Tags column in the Buff table.",
    ["<P_Heart>（这位小姐真是主动，参与这样的隐秘组织对我们都有利有弊。处在世界不同地方的人，在这片灰雾空间里交流信息……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Эта дама действительно инициативная. Участие в такой секретной организации имеет для нас как плюсы, так и минусы. Люди из разных уголков мира обмениваются информацией в этом сером туманном пространстве...)</>",
    ["Attack攻击命中"] = "Удар атаки",
    ["GVG High Tower Effect Buff Night Emperor"] = "GVG High Tower Effect Buff Night Emperor",
    ["【实证】羁绊【风闻】削弱的技能抵挡进一步提高。"] = "[Proof] The Блок навыков weakened by the [Rumor] bond is further increased.",
    ["　　\n　　……人类理性在其知识的某个门类里有一种特殊的命运，就是为一些它无法摆脱的问题所困扰。因为这些问题是由理性自身的本性向自己提出来的，但它又不能回答它们。因为它超越了人类理性的一切能力。\n　　这种困境并非源于无知，而是源于理性自身的冲动——它渴望超越经验的界限，去追问那些无法被感官验证的终极。于是理性陷入了永久的自我撕裂：它既不能停止追问，又无法给出确证的答案。"] = "\n ...Human reason has a special fate in a certain category of its knowledge, which is that it is troubled by some problems it cannot escape. Because these problems are proposed to it by the nature of reason itself, yet it cannot answer them. Because they transcend all the capabilities of human reason. \n This predicament does not stem from ignorance, but from the impulse of reason itself—it longs to transcend the boundaries of experience and question those ultimates that cannot be verified by the senses. Thus, reason falls into a permanent self-tearing: it can neither stop questioning nor provide a confirmed answer.",
    ["Attack <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><神明之手></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Armor Break increased.\""] = "Атакуйте <Highlight>Mutated Material</> с аффиксом <Highlight><Hand of God></>: «Все уровни навыков +1, пробитие брони увеличено».",
    ["GTA player stun"] = "GTA player stun",
    ["Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Disciple of Silence></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Anti-Critical Hit increased.\""] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Disciple of Silence></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Anti-Critical Hit increased.\"",
    ["BOSS4-品质-攻击后-右"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — После атаки — Справа",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>啊！！！<P_Heart>（他、他会在一周后杀了我……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(в шоке)</> Ах!!! <P_Heart>(Он, он убьет меня через неделю...)</>",
    ["<Red>Regicide</>: The Evil Spirit views its master as a hostile unit, and when the master enters combat, they will be marked with an Enemy mark lasting 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds."] = "<Red>Regicide</>: The Evil Spirit views its master as a hostile unit, and when the master enters combat, they will be marked with an Enemy mark lasting 10 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Near Blackthorn Security Company... need to ask the Nighthawks for help, but this might expose me.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Рядом с охранной компанией Blackthorn... нужно обратиться за помощью к «Ночным ястребам», но это может разоблачить меня.) </>",
    ["【Death Sect】(5) Entire team +20% Attack Power +5% Life Steal"] = "【Death Sect】(5) Entire team +20% Attack Power +5% Вампиризм",
    ["{{player.name}}对{{targetPlayer.name}}进行了安魂，但仪式遭遇神秘干扰，过程彻底崩溃，失控的灵性影响彼此，令安魂方的理智值<Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.N}}</>，被安魂方的理智值<Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.M}}</>。"] = "{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}, but the ritual encountered mysterious interference. The process collapsed completely, and the out-of-control Духовность affected both parties, causing the Requiem performer's Рассудок to decrease by <Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.N}}</>, and the target's Рассудок to decrease by <Chat_Highlight>-{{eventMessageParams.M}}</>.",
    ["【模型】家-仪式蜡烛"] = "[Model] Home - Ritual Candle",
    ["Behind the desk, a middle-aged man wearing a skull captain's hat and a pale face watched Alger walk over step by step, saying through gritted teeth in anger:\n \"I will not submit!\"\n \"I believe you can do it.\" Alger was as calm as if he were saying the weather today wasn't very good.\n \"You...\" The middle-aged man was stunned, as if he hadn't expected such an answer.\n Just then, Alger's body arched slightly, and he suddenly lunged forward, instantly closing the distance between the two to just the desk.\n Slap!\n His shoulder tightened, and his right hand reached out violently, gripping the middle-aged man's throat.\n Without giving the opponent a chance to react, phantom fish scales appeared on the back of his hand, and his five fingers exerted crazy force.\n\n — Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 8: A New Era"] = "Behind the desk, a middle-aged man wearing a skull captain's hat and a pale face watched Alger walk over step by step, saying through gritted teeth in anger:\n \"I will not submit!\"\n \"I believe you can do it.\" Alger was as calm as if he were saying the weather today wasn't very good.\n \"You...\" The middle-aged man was stunned, as if he hadn't expected such an answer.\n Just then, Alger's body arched slightly, and he suddenly lunged forward, instantly closing the distance between the two to just the desk.\n Slap!\n His shoulder tightened, and his right hand reached out violently, gripping the middle-aged man's throat.\n Without giving the opponent a chance to react, phantom fish scales appeared on the back of his hand, and his five fingers exerted crazy force.\n\n — Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 8: A New Era",
    ["E点触发器"] = "Point E Trigger",
    ["<P_Heart>(Shocked)</> After chasing for so many years, finally... I've seen it..."] = "<P_Heart>(в шоке)</> После стольких лет погони, наконец... я увидел это...",
    ["——摘录于宫廷诗会集，1859页。\n经典的罗塞尔式韵律，形象地表达了知识的沉重，让在场的所有人沉默。"] = "—Excerpted from the Court Poetry Collection, page 1859.\nThe classic Roselle-style rhythm vividly expresses the weight of knowledge, leaving everyone present in silence.",
    ["People these days will do anything against their conscience for profit. May the Earth Mother bless you with health, {{先生|女士}}."] = "People these days will do anything against their conscience for profit. May the Earth Mother bless you with health, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["“头狼”鲁珀彻底疯狂，向你亮出了獠牙。"] = "Люпер, Альфа-Волк, совсем сошел с ума и обнажил на тебя клыки.",
    ["【占】魔镜碎裂之际，子爵夫人出现。\n子爵夫人：不得无礼！"] = "[Placeholder] As the magic mirror shatters, the Viscountess appears.\n Viscountess: Do not be rude!",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演心理医生】\n深夜的街道上，一个年轻人坐在路灯下，眼神空洞，显然已经很久没有好好睡过一觉了。"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Психиатр】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time.",
    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>邓恩和戴莉认识之后，戴莉就以“自己的羽毛掉光了，好冷”为理由在邓恩头上筑了巢，并为他重复每个被遗忘的信息；邓恩则载着它巡视森林，用厚厚的灰色皮毛为它挡风，用鹿角为它摘下最高处的浆果。</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>戴莉喜欢趴在它脑袋靠后一些的位置，时常抱怨它额前的毛发不够厚实。</>"] = "<InvDefault_HW>After Dunn and Daly got to know each other, Daly built a nest on Dunn's head under the pretext that \"my feathers have all fallen out, I'm so cold,\" and repeated every forgotten piece of information to him; Dunn would carry her to patrol the forest, using its thick gray fur to shield her from the wind and its antlers to pick berries from the highest branches.</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>Daly liked to lie on the back of its head, often complaining that the fur on its forehead wasn't thick enough.</>",
    ["Attack hit"] = "Удар атаки",
    ["[Dungeon System Buff] Occupies IDs 81002000-81002099"] = "[Dungeon System Buff] Occupies IDs 81002000-81002099",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Horror Skill Buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Horror Skill Buff",
    ["“看见了真实造物主的清晰形象 受到了巨大的伤害……”"] = "\"Saw the clear image of the True Creator and suffered immense damage……\"",
    ["\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress %s %% \n %s"] = "\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress %s %% \n %s",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>魔药配方</>\n晋升至更高序列的必须品，包含主材料和辅助材料。集齐下一序列的魔药配方中的所有魔药材料后，才能进行制作对应序列的魔药，完成晋升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>魔药材料获取</>\n到达相应的消化进度之后，非凡者将获得灵性指引，引导其完成相应的任务，获得魔药材料。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Формулы Зелий</>\nНеобходимые предметы для перехода на более высокую последовательность, содержащую основные ингредиенты и вспомогательные ингредиенты. Только после сбора всех материалов для зелий в формуле зелья следующей последовательности вы сможете создать соответствующее зелье последовательности и завершить продвижение.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Получение материалов для зелий</>\nПосле достижения соответствующего прогресса пищеварения Потусторонние получат духовное руководство, которое поможет им выполнить соответствующие квесты и получить материалы для зелий.",
    ["Buff ID List"] = "Список идентификаторов усилений",
    ["When the midnight bell tolls, when the stars twinkle in the sky, when you wander on the boundary between dreams and reality—do you hear it? The whisper from the depths, the call of peace. \n\n We are the Requiem Poetry Society. \n\n Under the Goddess's gaze, we are the guardians of the night, the singers for the dead, and the keepers of secrets. We believe: \n\n The night is not the source of horror, but a dwelling of peace. Death is not the sorrow of an ending, but the beginning of liberation. We use poetry to soothe the insomniac, rituals to pacify the spirits, and silence to guard the secrets that cannot be spoken. \n\n If you are willing to join us, please come to the depths of Raphael Cemetery on the night of the new moon and recite the prayer: \n\n \"Goddess, please let peace descend, \n Let dreams wrap the weary soul, \n Let the night shelter the lost lamb.\" \n\n We will welcome you in the darkness. \n We will recognize you in the silence. \n We will remember you in poetry. \n\n But remember, becoming a member of the Requiem Poetry Society means you will take on corresponding responsibilities—staying awake while others sleep, remaining silent when the world is noisy, and embracing the darkness when the light is intense. \n\n Are you ready? May the night shelter you, may peace be with you."] = "Когда звонит полуночный колокол, когда на небе мерцают звезды, когда ты блуждаешь по границе между сном и реальностью — ты слышишь это? Шепот из глубин, зов мира. \n\n Мы — Общество поэзии-реквиема. \n\n Под взглядом Богини мы — хранители ночи, певцы умерших и хранители тайн. Мы верим: \n\n Ночь – не источник ужаса, а жилище покоя. Смерть — это не печаль конца, а начало освобождения. Мы используем поэзию, чтобы успокоить страдающих бессонницей, ритуалы, чтобы умиротворить дух, и молчание, чтобы сохранить тайны, о которых невозможно рассказать. \n\n Если вы готовы присоединиться к нам, пожалуйста, придите в глубины кладбища Рафаэля в ночь новолуния и прочтите молитву: \n\n «Богиня, пожалуйста, пусть снизойдет мир, \n Пусть сны окутают утомленную душу, \n Пусть ночь укроет заблудшего ягненка». \n\n Мы встретим вас во тьме. \n Мы узнаем тебя в тишине. \n Мы будем помнить вас в стихах. \n\n Но помните: стать членом Общества поэзии-реквиема означает, что вы возьмете на себя соответствующие обязанности: бодрствовать, пока другие спят, хранить молчание, когда в мире шумно, и принимать тьму, когда свет яркий. \n\n Вы готовы? Пусть ночь укроет тебя, пусть мир будет с тобой.",
    ["“看见我”源于观众途径序列6催眠师的能力。"] = "“See Me” originates from the Hypnotist ability of the Зритель Pathway Последовательность 6.",
    ["<Title_HW> January 3 </> \n The initial choice was too rash. Looking at it now, whether it is <InvHighlight_HW> Apprentice, </> or <InvHighlight_HW> Seer, </> <InvHighlight_HW> Marauder, </> would have been better. \n Unfortunately, there is no way to turn back. \n <Title_HW> January 4 </> \n Why are my children so stupid! I have said it ten thousand times, do not be fooled by those charlatans. No, perhaps those charlatans were fooled themselves. \n The key to potions is not mastery, but digestion; not digging, but Acting. And the name of the potion is not only the core symbol, but also the concrete imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion. \n ..."] = "<Title_HW> January 3 </> \n The initial choice was too rash. Looking at it now, whether it is <InvHighlight_HW> Apprentice, </> or <InvHighlight_HW> Провидец, </> <InvHighlight_HW> Marauder, </> would have been better. \n Unfortunately, there is no way to turn back. \n <Title_HW> January 4 </> \n Why are my children so stupid! I have said it ten thousand times, do not be fooled by those charlatans. No, perhaps those charlatans were fooled themselves. \n The key to potions is not mastery, but digestion; not digging, but Acting. And the name of the potion is not only the core symbol, but also the concrete imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion. \n ...",
    ["trigger4号"] = "Trigger No. 4",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Beyonder Rating </> \n The Beyonder Rating is a comprehensive evaluation of a Beyonder's combat ability and development status, which can be used as a reference to assess your own development. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Development Details </> \n Click on the Beyonder Rating in the bottom right corner of the character display interface to view the detailed development status of each of your modules (some development caps are unlocked as the season progresses). \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rating Improvement </> \n Click on the module you want to improve in the Beyonder Rating system to learn about the relevant information and acquisition channels for the materials needed for development."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Рейтинг Потустороннего </> \n Рейтинг Потустороннего — это всесторонняя оценка боевых способностей и статуса развития Потустороннего, которую можно использовать в качестве ориентира для оценки вашего собственного развития. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Подробности разработки </> \n Нажмите на рейтинг Потусторонний в правом нижнем углу интерфейса отображения персонажей, чтобы просмотреть подробный статус разработки каждого из ваших модулей (некоторые ограничения развития открываются по ходу сезона). \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Улучшение рейтинга </> \n Нажмите на модуль, который вы хотите улучшить, в системе Потусторонний Rating, чтобы узнать о соответствующей информации и каналах получения материалов, необходимых для разработки.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with {Matriarch of Depravity} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with {Matriarch of Depravity} entry",
    ["A Covenant is not easily made, and breaking it requires even more caution. This is a promise you wove together; do you really want to tear it up now? Think about it again, {{Sir|Madam}}."] = "Завет нелегко заключить, и его нарушение требует еще большей осторожности. Это обещание, которое вы сплели вместе; ты действительно хочешь разорвать его сейчас? Подумай об этом еще раз, {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["{ {skillType1, 1.0}, {skillType2, 2.0}} means increasing the speed of skillType1 skills by 1x and skillType2 skills by 2x."] = "{ {skillType1, 1.0}, {skillType2, 2.0}} means increasing the speed of skillType1 skills by 1x and skillType2 skills by 2x.",
    ["Round 1: Daisy was not a customer who came for divination, <InvHighlight> but a diviner. </> \n Round 2: Daisy did not die from the cut, but <InvHighlight> died from the magic circle. </> \n Round 3: Daisy's death has nothing to do with an evil ritual, <InvHighlight> but with her divination. </> \n Round 4: Daisy's death has nothing to do with the locked divination room, but <InvHighlight> with the result of the divination and the customer who came for it. </> \n \n Clues on the table: A book \"Ritual Magic: The Art of Praying to Gods,\" with two pages dog-eared, namely \"Feigned Death and Resurrection\" and \"Exchange of Fate,\" which record <InvHighlight> different ritual magic contents. </>"] = "Раунд 1: Дейзи была не клиенткой, которая пришла за гаданием, <InvHighlight>, а прорицателем. </> \n Раунд 2: Дейзи не умерла от пореза, но <InvHighlight> умерла от магического круга. </> \n Раунд 3: Смерть Дейзи не имеет ничего общего со злым ритуалом, <InvHighlight>, а с ее предсказанием. </> \n Раунд 4: Смерть Дейзи не имеет ничего общего с запертой комнатой для гаданий, а <InvHighlight> с результатом гадания и пришедшим за ним покупателем. </> \n \n Подсказки на столе: Книга «Ритуальная магия: искусство молиться богам» с двумя потрепанными страницами, а именно «Притворная смерть и воскрешение» и «Обмен судьбами», в которых записано различное содержание ритуальной магии <InvHighlight>. </>",
    ["Enum (Buff distribution)"] = "Enum (Buff distribution)",
    ["Mr. “Fool” used fragments of the Barrier as a cornerstone to open up a safe space in the Spirit World, establishing the Tarot Club here."] = "Господин «Дурак» использовал фрагменты Барьера как краеугольный камень, чтобы открыть безопасное пространство в Мире Духов, основав здесь Клуб Таро.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <Guardian> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Guardian> trait",
    ["{{PlayerName}}，你应该察觉到了，知识皇冠造成的污染比我们预想的更加严重。"] = "{{PlayerName}}, you should have noticed that the Искажение caused by the Crown of Knowledge is more serious than we expected.",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Become Wood! Mark Buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Become Wood! Mark Buff",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n神座之争为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成6人队伍参与匹配。神座之争玩法内，所有玩家采用与玩法外相同的<Highlight>真实</>属性进行战斗。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获胜条件</>\n限时时间内击败敌方队伍内所有玩家获胜，若对局时间结束时双方队伍均有成员存活，则顺次按照击败人数、存活人数、伤害总量、存活血量判定较高的一方获胜。在神座之争玩法里，每个队伍拥有<Highlight>2次复活</>死亡队友的机会。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n Battle for the Throne of God is a team competition mode, where up to 6 players can form a team to participate in matchmaking. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, all players use the same <Highlight>Real</> attributes as outside the mode for combat. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Winning Conditions</>\nDefeat all players in the enemy team within the time limit to win. If both teams have members alive when the match time ends, the side with more kills, more survivors, higher total damage, and higher remaining health will be judged the winner in order. In the Battle for the Throne of God mode, each team has <Highlight>2 opportunities to resurrect</> dead teammates.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Beyonder trade?) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (За пределами торговли?) </>",
    ["{{player.name}}的“神降”仪式获得黑夜女神的恩赐——<Chat_Highlight>隐秘之拥</>！赞美祂！<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[前往赞美]</>"] = "{{player.name}}'s \"Divine Descent\" ritual has received the Evernight Goddess's blessing—<Chat_Highlight>Embrace of Concealment</>! Praise Her! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[Go to Praise]</>",
    ["Citywalk - Pray at the Church of the River and Sea (Sanity Loss)"] = "Citywalk - Pray at the Church of the River and Sea (Рассудок Loss)",
    ["The latest vampire romance novel \"Guest Under the Moon\" has sparked a buying frenzy! The romantic scenes described in the book, such as the \"Black Rose Invitation\" and \"Picnic Under the Moon,\" are becoming a new trend for young people to express their love."] = "Последний любовный роман о вампирах «Гостья под луной» вызвал ажиотаж покупателей! Романтические сцены, описанные в книге, такие как «Приглашение к черной розе» и «Пикник под луной», становятся новой тенденцией для молодых людей выражать свою любовь.",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Connection Interruption Buff 1"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Connection Interruption Buff 1",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <Hand of God> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Hand of God> trait",
    ["[May Manor Normal] Butler - Cage - Non-Healer/T"] = "[May Manor Normal] Butler - Cage - Non-Healer/T",
    [" Failed. \n The Nighthawks broke into the ritual site; the \"Inquisitor's\" saw blade couldn't stop them, and he was shot dead on the spot. The core was also shattered. That hot-headed kid I raised with my own hands, my most loyal servant, Phil, was riddled with bullets while guarding the door. \n My whole body felt like it had been burned by fire, but I luckily didn't lose control. I escaped. \n Returning to my residence, I found someone waiting there. People from the Church of the Evernight. They said they had already found out everything I had done. As punishment, they would erase all my memories, abilities, and deeds. From now on, Tingen will no longer have a person like me. \n The former \"Hero of Tingen,\" I didn't expect to end up at this point today. \n I wanted to resist, but I couldn't move. At the last moment, I heard them say: \"The citizens will forget your name—Trevor Murphy, but perhaps they will leave a shadow in their hearts, a shadow that maintains justice for them.\" \n That shadow... will it replace me?"] = "Неуспешный. \n Ночные Ястребы ворвались на место проведения ритуала; Пила «Инквизитора» не смогла их остановить, и он был застрелен на месте. Ядро также было разрушено. Тот вспыльчивый ребенок, которого я вырастил собственными руками, мой самый верный слуга Фил, был изрешечен пулями, охраняя дверь. \nВсе мое тело было словно обожжено огнем, но, к счастью, я не потерял контроль. Я сбежал. \n Вернувшись домой, я обнаружил, что там кто-то ждет. Люди из Церкви Вечной Ночи. Они сказали, что уже выяснили все, что я сделал. В наказание они сотрут все мои воспоминания, способности и поступки. Отныне в Тингене больше не будет такого человека, как я. \n Бывший «Герой Тингена», я не ожидал, что сегодня окажусь в таком положении. \nЯ хотел сопротивляться, но не мог пошевелиться. В последний момент я услышал, как они сказали: «Граждане забудут ваше имя — Тревор Мерфи, но, возможно, они оставят тень в своих сердцах, тень, которая сохранит для них справедливость». \n Эта тень... заменит ли она меня?",
    ["[LV1] [Marionette Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill"] = "[LV1] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill",
    ["<Title_HW>一月三日</>\n　　当初的选择还是太草率了，现在看来，不管是<InvHighlight_HW>学徒</>，还是<InvHighlight_HW>占卜家</>，<InvHighlight_HW>偷盗者</>，都更加好。\n　　　　可惜，没办法再回头了。\n<Title_HW>一月四日</>\n　　为什么我的孩子们会那么蠢！我说过一万遍了，不要被那些神棍忽悠。不，那些神棍或许自己也被忽悠了。\n　　魔药的关键不是掌握，是消化；不是挖掘，是扮演。而魔药的名称也不仅仅是核心象征，还是具体意象，更是消化的钥匙。\n　　……"] = "<Title_HW> January 3 </> \n The initial choice was too rash. Looking at it now, whether it is <InvHighlight_HW> Apprentice, </> or <InvHighlight_HW> Провидец, </> <InvHighlight_HW> Marauder, </> would have been better. \n Unfortunately, there is no way to turn back. \n <Title_HW> January 4 </> \n Why are my children so stupid! I have said it ten thousand times, do not be fooled by those charlatans. No, perhaps those charlatans were fooled themselves. \n The key to potions is not mastery, but digestion; not digging, but Acting. And the name of the potion is not only the core symbol, but also the concrete imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion. \n ...",
    ["\"Great Mother\", now confirmed to be an avatar of ▇▇▇▇, the symbol of reproduction and fertility, mastering the conception of life and the proliferation of flesh and blood, occupying the ▇▇▇▇ authority. Organizations that believe in Her include the ▇▇ Mother, the Rose School of Thought, and the Primordial Moon.\nPraying to Her will grant vigorous reproductive ability, but one will gradually lose their sanity, become fanatical, seek the taboos of life and the essence of spirituality, and fall into the desire for birth and reproduction...\nThe secret ritual of sacrifice requires a large amount of flesh, blood, and life, and the process is accompanied by extreme madness and chaos...\nDuring the Tingen crisis, the Moon Servant sacrificed the entire city as the price to create a vessel for the descent of the evil god's offspring, bringing about a devastating catastrophe..."] = "«Великая Мать», теперь подтвержденная как аватар ▇▇▇▇, символа воспроизводства и плодородия, овладевшая концепцией жизни и размножением плоти и крови, занимающая власть ▇▇▇▇. Организации, которые верят в Нее, включают ▇▇ Мать, Школу мысли Розы и Первичную Луну.\nМолитва Ей дарует энергичную репродуктивную способность, но человек постепенно теряет рассудок, становится фанатичным, ищет табу жизни и сущности духовности и впадает в желание рождения и размножения...\nТайный ритуал жертвоприношения требует большого количества плоти, крови и жизни, и этот процесс сопровождается крайним безумием и хаос...\nВо время кризиса Тингена Лунный Слуга пожертвовал всем городом в качестве платы за создание корабля для спуска потомков злого бога, что привело к разрушительной катастрофе...",
    ["【五月庄园】一号信徒-小女孩-延迟伤害分配对象-随机三个N+DPS"] = "[May Manor] Believer Number One - Little Girl - Delayed Damage Allocation Target - Random Three N+DPS",
    ["{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. The ritual was conducted by the book, but nothing happened. Both parties stared at each other in silence."] = "{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. The ritual was conducted by the book, but nothing happened. Both parties stared at each other in silence.",
    ["【死神装备】额外获得<HighLight>5%</>伤害减免。"] = "[Death Equipment] provides an additional <HighLight>5%</> Снижение урона.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>发起宣战</>\n1.可发起宣战的时间为：<Highlight>周一至周五17:00-23:00；周六至周日11:00-23:00</>。\n2.可宣战的时间点为：<Highlight>周一至周四12:00-14:00、20:00-23:00；周五12:00-14:00、21:00-23:00；周六至周日12:00-18:00、22:00-23:00</>。\n3.发起宣战将消耗俱乐部资金，资金根据俱乐部等级、实力差别及血仇值进行扣除。\n4.若宣战方获胜，则返还<Highlight>30%</>俱乐部资金，失败则不返还；若被宣战方失败则根据俱乐部等级扣除相应资金，获胜则不扣除。\n5.若连续宣战同一俱乐部并获胜，再次宣战消耗俱乐部资金将提升<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n6.若连续被同一俱乐部宣战并失败，再次被宣战消耗俱乐部资金将减少<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n1.俱乐部宣战将在霍纳奇斯山脉大世界地图进行自由战斗，宣战开始后，仅互相宣战的双方互相进入对决状态。\n2.立旗：发起方首先获得立旗权，<Highlight>（会长、副会长、理事）</>中任意一人立旗后，俱乐部立旗技能将消失。立旗后在旗帜周围根据存活时间以获得积分。\n3.旗帜轮换：旗帜归属时间结束后，立旗权将轮换至对方俱乐部，或可以通过<Highlight>抢旗成功</>后轮换立旗权。\n4.击败对手或参与击败对手，也将获得积分。\n5.整场宣战将持续<Highlight>30分钟</>，结算时积分高的一方获胜，若分数相同，则被发起宣战的一方获胜。\n6.宣战期间，可使用<Highlight>\"集结·俱乐部宣战\"</>道具在霍纳奇斯山脉中<Highlight>发起集结</>，道具可在同行商店-俱乐部中查看。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Initiate War Declaration</>\n1. The time to initiate a war declaration is: <Highlight>Monday to Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 11:00-23:00</>. \n2. The time points for declaring war are: <Highlight>Monday to Thursday 12:00-14:00, 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00, 21:00-23:00; Saturday to Sunday 12:00-18:00, 22:00-23:00</>. \n3. Initiating a war declaration will consume Club Funds, which are deducted based on the club's level, strength difference, and Blood Feud value. \n4. If the declaring party wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the Club Funds will be refunded; if they lose, they will not be refunded. If the declared party loses, corresponding funds will be deducted based on the club's level; if they win, no funds will be deducted. \n5. If you continuously declare war on the same club and win, the Club Funds consumed for declaring war again will increase <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n6. If you are continuously declared war on by the same club and lose, the Club Funds consumed for being declared war on again will decrease <Highlight>(resets at 8:00 every Monday)</>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Gameplay Introduction</>\n1. Club war declaration will take place in the Hornacis Mountain Range open world map for free combat. After the war declaration begins, only the two parties who declared war on each other will enter a duel state. \n2. Plant Flag: The initiating party first obtains the right to plant the flag. After any one of the <Highlight>(President, Vice President, Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill will disappear. After planting the flag, you will gain points based on the survival time around the flag. \n3. Flag Rotation: After the flag ownership time ends, the right to plant the flag will rotate to the other club, or the right to plant the flag can be rotated after <Highlight>successfully seizing the flag</>. \n4. Defeating opponents or participating in defeating opponents will also grant points. \n5. The entire war declaration will last for <Highlight>30 minutes</>. At the time of settlement, the party with the higher points wins. If the scores are the same, the party that was declared war on wins. \n6. During the war declaration, you can use the <Highlight>\"Assemble - Club War Declaration\"</> item to <Highlight>initiate an assembly</> in the Hornacis Mountain Range. The item can be viewed in the Companion Shop - Club.",
    ["The \"Angel of Mercury\" is the avatar of fate, the angel most favored by my Lord; the \"Angel of Death\" is the existence that has followed my Lord the longest, the administrator of the Underworld; the \"Angel of Redemption\" is the horn of my Lord, the messenger of His oracle; the \"Angel of Life\" is the crystallization of wisdom, the inextinguishable spirituality within every person."] = "The \"Angel of Mercury\" is the avatar of fate, the angel most favored by my Lord; the \"Angel of Death\" is the existence that has followed my Lord the longest, the administrator of the Underworld; the \"Angel of Redemption\" is the horn of my Lord, the messenger of His oracle; the \"Angel of Life\" is the crystallization of wisdom, the inextinguishable Духовность within every person.",
    ["……非凡物品提前崩溃，这种情况很少见。"] = "…It is rare for a Потусторонний item to break down prematurely.",
    ["BOSS4-Quality-Left Healing"] = "BOSS4-Качество-Левое исцеление",
    ["GTA Fallen Priest Super Armor"] = "GTA Fallen Priest Суперброня",
    ["\"Your Excellency, how should we address you?\" \n Alger nodded slightly and followed up solemnly: \n \"Your Excellency, how should we address you?\" \n Zhou Mingrui was stunned for a moment, his fingers tapping gently on the bronze long table, and the content of his previous divination flashed through his mind. \n He leaned back, withdrew his right hand, clasped his fingers together against his chin, and looked at the two of them with a smile: \n \"You may address me as...\" \n Having said this, he paused, and spoke in a gentle and calm tone: \n \"The Fool.\" \n \n —Volume 1 \"Clown\", Chapter 6: Beyonder"] = "\"Your Excellency, how should we address you?\" \n Alger nodded slightly and followed up solemnly: \n \"Your Excellency, how should we address you?\" \n Zhou Mingrui was stunned for a moment, his fingers tapping gently on the bronze long table, and the content of his previous Гадание flashed through his mind. \n He leaned back, withdrew his right hand, clasped his fingers together against his chin, and looked at the two of them with a smile: \n \"You may address me as...\" \n Having said this, he paused, and spoke in a gentle and calm tone: \n \"Шут.\" \n \n —Volume 1 \"Клоун\", Chapter 6: Потусторонний",
    ["[Proof] Current effect duration increased by 1 second, damage increased by 5%."] = "[Proof] Current effect duration increased by 1 second, damage increased by 5%.",
    ["The \"Red Gloves\" have an emergency mission, and I need to leave for a few days.\nBlackthorn Security Company is where Mr. Fool's extraordinary journey began. Whether you want to learn more about Mr. Fool or start your own extraordinary story, becoming a member of the Nighthawks squad here is a good choice. Frye is a trustworthy captain. Finally, keep the gold coin left by Mr. Fool safe."] = "The \"Red Gloves\" have an emergency mission, and I need to leave for a few days.\nBlackthorn Security Company is where Mr. Fool's extraordinary journey began. Whether you want to learn more about Mr. Fool or start your own extraordinary story, becoming a member of the Ночные Ястребы squad here is a good choice. Frye is a trustworthy captain. Finally, keep the gold coin left by Mr. Fool safe.",
    ["《纯粹理性批判》"] = "《Critique of Pure Reason》",
    ["【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Sequence 7, try acting as a Psychiatrist】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time."] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Психиатр】 \n On the street late at night, a young man sits under a street lamp with hollow eyes, clearly having not had a good night's sleep in a long time.",
    ["【五月庄园】一号信徒-小女孩-延迟伤害分配对象-随机6个人"] = "[May Manor] Believer Number One - Little Girl - Delayed Damage Allocation Target - Random 6 People",
    ["[True Form] If the immediate Health restoration effect below 20% is not triggered, reduce the skill's Cooldown by an additional 2 seconds."] = "[True Form] If the immediate Health restoration effect below 20% is not triggered, reduce the skill's Перезарядка by an additional 2 seconds.",
    ["'Such a currency system is simply counter-intuitive; it must be one of the stupidest currency systems in the world.' Klein teased the Loen currency system in confusion. \n 'No, not one of.' Benson corrected seriously, 'You should understand that to formulate a reasonable and simple currency system, there is a prerequisite, which is knowing how to count! Unfortunately, among those big shots, such talents are too rare.'"] = "'Such a currency system is simply counter-intuitive; it must be one of the stupidest currency systems in the world.' Klein teased the Loen currency system in confusion. \n 'No, not one of.' Benson corrected seriously, 'You should understand that to formulate a reasonable and simple currency system, there is a prerequisite, which is knowing how to count! Unfortunately, among those big shots, such talents are too rare.'",
    ["——在那个平行世界里，奥黛丽和苏茜合作解决了佛尔思同伴的案件。\n\n      贝克兰德，霍尔家的花园。奥黛丽坐在吊椅上，阳光透过藤蔓洒下斑驳的光影。\n      几天前，佛尔思·沃尔来访时的神情又浮现在她眼前。那位气质慵懒的作家露出郑重的神色：“我有位同伴被关入了监狱，正等待着最后的审判，我希望你们能够救她出来，无论用什么办法。”\n      而同行的格莱林特子爵派人咨询了熟悉的大律师，对方说有把握只是轻判，但无罪辩护的难度很高，除非当事人能拿到精神有问题或者心智发育不健全的医疗证明……\n      奥黛丽记得自己当时答应了佛尔思会认真考虑。作家小姐离开时还回头看了一眼，淡蓝色的眼睛里藏着期待。\n      “医疗证明……”奥黛丽轻声自语，眉头微蹙。她不是没想过用霍尔家的影响力去疏通，但那会暴露她和佛尔思、休之间的关系。况且，那位黑帮头目虽然出具了原谅声明，严重伤害的案件却依然可能被起诉。\n      身旁趴着的苏茜竖起耳朵，用只有奥黛丽能听见的声音小声说：“那个黑帮头目，还在医院里？”\n      奥黛丽低头看她，目光微动。\n      “我去试一试。”苏茜摇了摇尾巴提议道。\n      当天夜里，苏茜悄悄潜入病房。她用“观众”的能力温和地引导那位“体面的绅士”回忆——对方终于记起，是自己先动了手，休只是自卫。醒来后，他主动向检察官更正了证词。\n      几天后，休被无罪释放。佛尔思来霍尔家道谢时，感慨“检察官突然发现了新证据，运气真好”。\n      奥黛丽微笑着点头：“是啊，运气真好。”\n      苏茜趴在她脚边，尾巴拍打着地毯，心满意足。"] = "—In that parallel world, Audrey and Susie worked together to solve the case involving Fors's companion. \n\n      Бэкланд, the Hall family garden. Audrey sat on a hanging chair, sunlight casting dappled light and shadows through the vines. \n      A few days ago, the expression on Fors Wall's face when she visited appeared in her mind again. That lazy-tempered writer had shown a solemn look: \"I have a companion who has been thrown into prison and is waiting for the final verdict. I hope you can save her, no matter what method you use.\" \n      And the accompanying Viscount Glaint had sent someone to consult a well-known lawyer, who said there was a chance for a light sentence, but an acquittal was very difficult unless the defendant could obtain a medical certificate stating they had mental issues or were mentally underdeveloped... \n      Audrey remembered that she had promised Fors she would consider it carefully. When the writer left, she had looked back, anticipation hidden in her light blue eyes. \n      \"Medical certificate...\" Audrey whispered to herself, her brows slightly furrowed. It wasn't that she hadn't thought about using the Hall family's influence to pull strings, but that would expose her relationship with Fors and Xio. Moreover, although the gang leader had issued a statement of forgiveness, the case of grievous injury could still be prosecuted. \n      Susie, lying beside her, pricked up her ears and whispered in a voice only Audrey could hear: \"That gang leader, is he still in the hospital?\" \n      Audrey looked down at her, her gaze flickering. \n      \"I'll go give it a try,\" Susie suggested, wagging her tail. \n      That night, Susie quietly snuck into the hospital room. She used her Зритель ability to gently guide the \"decent gentleman\" to recall—the other party finally remembered that he had struck first and that Xio was only acting in self-defense. After waking up, he took the initiative to correct his testimony to the prosecutor. \n      A few days later, Xio was acquitted. When Fors came to the Hall residence to thank her, she sighed, \"The prosecutor suddenly found new evidence; what good luck.\" \n      Audrey smiled and nodded: \"Yes, what good luck.\" \n      Susie lay at her feet, her tail thumping against the carpet, feeling satisfied.",
    ["Battle:改变Boss破防锁"] = "Битва: изменить замок пробития брони босса.",
    ["Klein looked at the dark blue viscous liquid, which was hard to say if it was a cup or a block, and swallowed hard: \n \"Just drink it like this?\" \n \"Don't you need other preparations? Like rituals, incantations, or prayers?\" \n Old Neil went \"uh\" and said: \n \"Preparations? There are some. First, you have a cup of Intis Olmier wine, then smoke a Dicy cigar, then hum a melodious tune, dance a light court dance—you can do tap dance if you like—and finally, play a game of Gwent...\" \n Seeing Klein's expression becoming increasingly dazed, Old Neil smiled and gave a summary of the previous description: \n \"If you feel nervous.\" \n ...You're quite humorous... Klein's mouth twitched twice, and he resisted the urge to draw his gun. \n \n —— Volume 1 \"Clown\", Chapter 34, Spirit Vision"] = "Клейн посмотрел на темно-синюю вязкую жидкость, трудно было сказать, была ли это чашка или блок, и тяжело сглотнул: \n «Просто выпей ее вот так?» \n «Разве тебе не нужны другие приготовления? Например, ритуалы, заклинания или молитвы?» \n Старина Нил сказал «э-э» и сказал: \n «Приготовления? Есть некоторые. Сначала вы выпиваете чашку вина Intis Olmier, затем выкуриваете Dicy». сигару, затем напевайте мелодичную мелодию, станцуйте легкий придворный танец — если хотите, можете танцевать чечетку — и, наконец, сыграйте в Гвинт...» \n Видя, как выражение лица Клейна становится все более ошеломленным, Старина Нил улыбнулся и кратко изложил предыдущее описание: \n «Если ты нервничаешь». \n ...Ты довольно юмористический... Губы Клейна дважды дернулись, и он подавил желание вытащить пистолет. \n \n —— Том 1 «Клоун», Глава 34, Духовное видение",
    ["Mr. Fool is casting his gaze upon you."] = "Мистер Дурак смотрит на вас.",
    ["NPC Old Neil - Spirit Body Material"] = "NPC Old Neil - Духовное тело Material",
    ["【Tarot Club · Offspring Protection】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>On the last day of that year, the forest encountered a blizzard unseen in a century. The Owl Elder convened an emergency meeting.</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>\"The snow above the cave in the north has collapsed. The bat family that hibernates there is still inside; we cannot leave them to their fate.\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>All the animals fell into silence. They basically didn't interact with the bats. Only Dunn had been to that cave last spring, but it had long since forgotten what it looked like inside.</>"] = "<InvDefault_HW>On the last day of that year, the forest encountered a blizzard unseen in a century. The Owl Elder convened an emergency meeting.</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>\"The snow above the cave in the north has collapsed. The bat family that hibernates there is still inside; we cannot leave them to their fate.\"</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>All the animals fell into silence. They basically didn't interact with the bats. Only Dunn had been to that cave last spring, but it had long since forgotten what it looked like inside.</>",
    ["“愚者”先生为你嫁接了来自未来的命运，你可以使用更高序列的力量。随着你的实力越来越强大，你学会的技能种类和威力也将不断增长。技能分为普通技能、特殊技能、扮演技能三类，最多同时装配四个普通技能或者扮演技能。特殊技能无需装配，包括普通攻击、解控技能和终结技能。"] = "Мистер Дурак привил вам судьбу из будущего, позволяя вам использовать силы высших последовательностей. По мере того, как вы становитесь сильнее, разнообразие и сила изучаемых вами навыков также будут увеличиваться. Навыки разделены на три категории: обычные навыки, специальные навыки и навыки ролевой игры. Вы можете использовать до четырех обычных навыков или навыков ролевой игры одновременно. Специальные навыки не требуют использования и включают в себя базовые атаки, навыки контроля и завершающие навыки.",
    ["{\"ID of the %ist Spell Field\"}"] = "{\"ID of the %ist Spell Field\"}",
    ["{\n \"Interrupt with state end\": \"0\", \n \"Interrupt with skill end\": \"1\", \n \"Do not interrupt\": \"2\" \n}"] = "{\n \"Interrupt with state end\": \"0\", \n \"Interrupt with skill end\": \"1\", \n \"Do not interrupt\": \"2\" \n}",
    ["[Placeholder B] The mirror surface converges, presenting a memory. Trissy and a hooded woman stand face to face. \nHooded Woman: Well done, Tingen has become even more chaotic... Fear and death are always the best nourishment. \nMan: I have completed the quest. You promised me the materials for advancement. \nHooded Woman: Of course, the next Sequence for advancement is—Witch. \nMan: Witch?! I'm to advance to a Witch? Are you kidding me?"] = "[Placeholder B] The mirror surface converges, presenting a memory. Trissy and a hooded woman stand face to face. \nHooded Woman: Well done, Тинген has become even more chaotic... Fear and death are always the best nourishment. \nMan: I have completed the quest. You promised me the materials for advancement. \nHooded Woman: Of course, the next Последовательность for advancement is—Witch. \nMan: Witch?! I'm to advance to a Witch? Are you kidding me?",
    ["<Red>灵魂重负</>：穿戴者每囚禁一个非凡者灵魂，期间自身生命值上限降低*f**。\n<Red>贪食血肉</>：穿戴者吞噬怪物灵魂，获得灵魂压制期间，受到伤害提高*f**。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Soul Burden</>: For every Потусторонний soul the wearer imprisons, their own Max HP is reduced by *f** during that period. \n<Red>Gluttonous Flesh</>: When the wearer devours a monster soul and gains Soul Suppression, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Tips_GrayTitle>领域特性提升解锁</>"] = "<Tips_GrayTitle> Domain Characteristic Enhancement Unlocked </>",
    ["<Yellow>Notarization</>: When the carrier casts basic skills and Finisher Skills in combat, Notarization of the skill is automatically triggered, with a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</> probability of successful Notarization, granting <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</> stack(s) of Notarization. There is a 10% probability of failure, losing 1 stack of Notarization. Each stack of Notarization increases the carrier's Attack by <Yellow>*f</> and Skill Enhancement by <Yellow>*f</>. \nNotarization can accumulate up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</> stacks. When the stacks triggered by skills exceed the maximum limit, the excess stacks are automatically consumed, each stack increasing the Damage Boost of the current skill cast by <Yellow>10%</> and Healing Boost by <Yellow>10%</>. \nWhen leaving the scene, all Notarization stacks are cleared."] = "<Yellow>Notarization</>: When the carrier casts basic skills and Finisher Skills in combat, Notarization of the skill is automatically triggered, with a <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?80%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?65%/15%/10%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?50%/20%/20%}</> probability of successful Notarization, granting <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?1/2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?1/2/3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?1/2/3}</> stack(s) of Notarization. There is a 10% probability of failure, losing 1 stack of Notarization. Each stack of Notarization increases the carrier's Attack by <Yellow>*f</> and Усиление навыков by <Yellow>*f</>. \nNotarization can accumulate up to <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=1?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=2?50}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085029)=3?60}</> stacks. When the stacks triggered by skills exceed the maximum limit, the excess stacks are automatically consumed, each stack increasing the Damage Boost of the current skill cast by <Yellow>10%</> and Healing Boost by <Yellow>10%</>. \nWhen leaving the scene, all Notarization stacks are cleared.",
    ["【介绍途径、序列的cs】"] = "[CS for introducing pathways and Последовательностьs]",
    ["　　名称：看见我\n　　外观描述：一块<Letter_Highlight>透明水晶</>，约拇指大小，清澈无瑕。\n　　能力评估：持有者可“看见”他人的真实情绪与表层想法。持续注视目标可使其产生短暂的“认同感”，从而微妙引导对方行为。\n　　副作用警示：每次使用，持有者<Letter_Highlight>随机丢失</>一段属于自己的<Letter_Highlight>记忆</>。\n\n　　备注：三周前失窃，占卜显示仍处于<Letter_Highlight>激活</>状态。"] = "Имя: Увидеть меня \n Внешний вид Описание: Прозрачный кристалл <Letter_Highlight> </> размером с большой палец, чистый и безупречный. \n Оценка способностей: обладатель может «видеть» истинные эмоции и поверхностные мысли других. Непрерывный взгляд на цель может вызвать у них кратковременное «чувство согласия», тем самым тонко управляя поведением другой стороны. \n Предупреждение о побочных эффектах: при каждом использовании владелец <Letter_Highlight> случайно теряет </> сегмент своей собственной памяти <Letter_Highlight> </>. \n\n Примечание: украдено три недели назад; гадание показывает, что он все еще находится в активном состоянии <Letter_Highlight> </>.",
    ["[Rogue] Exile - Spell Proxy"] = "[Rogue] Exile - Spell Proxy",
    ["Buff类型列表"] = "Buff Type List",
    ["<P_Heart> (shocked) </> How do you know? Are you stalking me, trying to steal my business?"] = "<P_Heart> (в шоке) </> Откуда ты знаешь? Вы преследуете меня, пытаетесь украсть мой бизнес?",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>你是那个顾客？！那你怎么会被困在这个塔罗牌里……"] = "<P_Heart>(в шоке)</> Ты тот клиент?! Тогда как же вы могли оказаться в ловушке этой карты Таро...",
    ["　　“红手套”有紧急任务，我需要暂时离开几天。\n　　黑荆棘安保公司是“愚者”先生非凡之旅的开始之地，无论你想进一步了解“愚者”先生，还是开始属于自己的非凡故事，在这里成为值夜者小队成员，将是一个不错的选择，弗莱是一位值得信赖的队长。最后保管好“愚者”先生留下的金币。"] = "The \"Red Gloves\" have an emergency mission, and I need to leave for a few days.\nBlackthorn Security Company is where Mr. Fool's extraordinary journey began. Whether you want to learn more about Mr. Fool or start your own extraordinary story, becoming a member of the Ночные Ястребы squad here is a good choice. Frye is a trustworthy captain. Finally, keep the gold coin left by Mr. Fool safe.",
    ["Where to Find Beyonder Creatures"] = "Where to Find Потусторонний Creatures",
    ["《神秘学入门》《符咒大全》《第四纪秘史》，好多书……"] = "Introduction to Mysticism, Encyclopedia of Charms, Secret History of the Fourth Epoch, so many books...",
    ["BOSS 4 - Quality - Medium Healing"] = "БОСС 4 – Качество – Среднее исцеление",
    ["HUD_WatchGame_Skill_Common:RefreshSkill could not find Skill configuration, skillId=%s"] = "HUD_WatchGame_Skill_Common:RefreshSkill could not find Skill configuration, skillId=%s",
    ["Id(光环)"] = "Id (Aura)",
    ["【实证】仪式魔法造成的伤害增加40%。"] = "[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 40%.",
    ["{\"Tag%iClear Buff Count\"}"] = "{\"Tag%iClear Buff Count\"}",
    ["　　“审判官”带我见了个人。穿着黑袍，说话像机器，自称是“蒸汽与机械之神教会”的使徒。他说非凡力量是通往更高存在的阶梯，只要我愿意，他可以帮我踏入非凡。为了向我展示这一点，他们当着我的面让一个瘦子变成了狼人！真是一群疯子。\n　　我问他，需要付出什么。\n　　他说，忠诚。\n　　我心里骂了他十遍。我只忠诚于廷根。但我没说出口。我需要他的力量，等我变强了，谁忠诚谁还不一定。\n　　但狼人也太他妈丑了，“通识者”也许不错。"] = "The \"Inquisitor\" brought me to meet someone. He was wearing a black robe, spoke like a machine, and claimed to be an Apostle of the God of Steam and Machinery. He said that Потусторонний power is a ladder to a higher existence, and as long as I am willing, he can help me step into the extraordinary. To show me this, they turned a skinny man into a werewolf right in front of me! They are truly a bunch of madmen. \n I asked him what I needed to pay. \n He said, loyalty. \n I cursed him ten times in my heart. I am only loyal to Тинген. But I didn't say it out loud. I need his power; once I become stronger, it's not certain who will be loyal to whom. \n But the werewolf is also too damn ugly; \"Savants\" might be good.",
    ["trigger-到达南瓜摊"] = "Trigger: Arrive at Pumpkin Stall",
    ["\"When the last bearing breaks\""] = "«Когда ломается последний подшипник»",
    ["tar: Target; \n self: Self; \n buffadder: Buff applier; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by the skill/spell field settlement."] = "tar: Target; \n self: Self; \n buffadder: Buff applier; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by the skill/spell field settlement.",
    ["{\n\"不指定类型\": \"\",\n\"中性Buff\": \"0\",\n\"增益Buff\": \"1\",\n\"减益Buff\": \"2\"\n}"] = "{\n \"Not specified type\": \"\", \n \"Neutral Buff\": \"0\", \n \"Buff\": \"1\", \n \"Debuff\": \"2\" \n}",
    ["[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Meeting Room - Relief"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Meeting Room - Relief",
    ["<Rate>80%</>概率出现许愿秘偶,若未出现,则下次必定出现"] = "<Rate>80%</> chance for a Wishing Марионетка to appear; if it doesn't appear, it is guaranteed to appear next time",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>发起宣战</>\n1.可发起宣战的时间为：<Highlight>周一至周五17:00-23:00；周六至周日11:00-23:00</>。\n2.可宣战的时间点为：<Highlight>周一至周四12:00-14:00、20:00-23:00；周五12:00-14:00、21:00-23:00；周六至周日12:00-18:00、22:00-23:00</>。\n3.发起宣战将消耗俱乐部资金，资金根据俱乐部等级、实力差别及血仇值进行扣除。\n4.若宣战方获胜，则返还<Highlight>30%</>俱乐部资金，失败则不返还；若被宣战方失败则根据俱乐部等级扣除相应资金，获胜则不扣除。\n5.若连续宣战同一俱乐部并获胜，再次宣战消耗俱乐部资金将提升<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n6.若连续被同一俱乐部宣战并失败，再次被宣战消耗俱乐部资金将减少<Highlight>（每周一8点重置）</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n1.俱乐部宣战将在霍纳奇斯山脉大世界地图进行自由战斗，宣战开始后，仅互相宣战的双方互相进入对决状态。\n2.立旗：发起方首先获得立旗权，<Highlight>（会长、副会长、理事）</>中任意一人立旗后，俱乐部立旗技能将消失。立旗后在旗帜周围根据存活时间以获得积分。\n3.旗帜轮换：旗帜归属时间结束后，立旗权将轮换至对方俱乐部，或可以通过<Highlight>抢旗成功</>后轮换立旗权。\n4.击败对手或参与击败对手，也将获得积分。\n5.整场宣战将持续<Highlight>30分钟</>，结算时积分高的一方获胜，若分数相同，则被发起宣战的一方获胜。当一方积分大于另一方积分超过15000时，则积分高的一方直接获胜。\n6.宣战期间，可使用<Highlight>\"集结·俱乐部宣战\"</>道具在霍纳奇斯山脉中<Highlight>发起集结</>，道具可在同行商店-俱乐部中查看。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Declare War</>\n1. War can be declared during: <Highlight>Monday-Friday 17:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 11:00-23:00</>.\n2. Available battle time slots: <Highlight>Monday-Thursday 12:00-14:00 and 20:00-23:00; Friday 12:00-14:00 and 21:00-23:00; Saturday-Sunday 12:00-18:00 and 22:00-23:00</>.\n3. Declaring war consumes club funds. The amount is based on club level, the difference in strength, and Blood Feud value.\n4. If the declaring side wins, <Highlight>30%</> of the club funds are refunded; no funds are refunded after a loss. If the challenged side loses, funds are deducted according to club level; none are deducted if it wins.\n5. After repeatedly declaring war on and defeating the same club, the cost of declaring war on it again will increase <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n6. After repeatedly being challenged by and losing to the same club, the challenger's cost to declare war again will decrease <Highlight>(resets every Monday at 8 o'clock)</>.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Rules</>\n1. Club War is fought freely on the Hornacis Mountains open-world map. Once it begins, only the two clubs at war enter a combat state with each other.\n2. Planting the flag: the declaring side receives the first right to plant it. After any <Highlight>(President, Vice President, or Director)</> plants the flag, the club's flag-planting skill disappears. Members earn points around the flag based on survival time.\n3. Flag rotation: when a club's ownership period ends, the right to plant the flag rotates to the opposing club. It can also rotate after a <Highlight>successful flag capture</>.\n4. Defeating opponents or assisting in their defeat also awards points.\n5. The war lasts <Highlight>30 minutes</>. The side with more points at settlement wins; if tied, the challenged side wins. If one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the leading side wins immediately.\n6. During Club War, use the <Highlight>\"Rally · Club War\"</> item to <Highlight>start a rally</> in the Hornacis Mountains. The item is available in Companion Shop - Club.",
    ["The Church has received news that Sealed Artifact 2-327 \"See Me\" has been stolen. Divination indicates the clues point to Heywood Manor. \n Baron Heywood is hosting a ball tonight. We need someone good at observing to infiltrate the ball and investigate—you are a Sequence 9 \"Spectator,\" and there is no one more suitable than you. \n Your identity has been arranged: an emerging merchant from Backlund, invited to the banquet after hearing about investment opportunities in the manor. \n Remember, the Spectator does not take the stage. \n Observe, do not alert the enemy."] = "Церковь получила известие о том, что Запечатанный Артефакт 2-327 «Увидь Меня» был украден. Гадание указывает на подсказки, указывающие на поместье Хейвуд. \n Барон Хейвуд сегодня вечером устраивает бал. Нам нужен кто-то, кто хорошо умеет наблюдать, чтобы проникнуть на мяч и провести расследование — вы «Наблюдатель» из девятой серии, и нет никого более подходящего, чем вы. \n Ваша личность установлена: начинающий торговец из Баклунда, приглашенный на банкет после того, как узнал об инвестиционных возможностях в поместье. \n Помните, Зритель не выходит на сцену. \n Наблюдайте, не предупреждайте врага.",
    ["　　嘿，我亲爱的玩家！\n　　既然你要和“国王”玩选择游戏，不了解规则可不行。所以我亲自为你编写了这份终极傻瓜……哦不，是《终极扑克速成指南》！\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>五条</>：五张完全一样的扑克。\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>顺子</>：数字连续的五张扑克。\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>同花</>：花色相同的五张扑克。\n\n　　<Letter_Highlight>同花顺</>：花色相同，且数字连续的五张扑克。\n\n　　祝你好运……或者，祝你能看穿“好运”背后的把戏！"] = "Привет, мой дорогой игрок! \n　　Поскольку вы хотите сыграть в игру с «Королем», вы не сможете сделать это, не зная правил. Итак, я лично написал этот идеальный манекен... о нет, «Ускоренный курс покера»! \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Пятерка </>: Пять одинаковых покерных карт. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Straight </>: пять покерных карт с последовательными номерами. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Flush </>: Пять покерных карт одной масти. \n\n　　<Letter_Highlight> Стрит-Флеш </>: Пять покерных карт одной масти с последовательными номерами. \n\n　　Удачи... или, надеюсь, вы сможете разглядеть хитрости, скрывающиеся за «удачей»!",
    ["To Mystery Pryer \n Do as you will, but do no harm. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "Мистери Прайеру \n Делай, что хочешь, но не причиняй вреда. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["<h>Continue divining</> to confirm the direction"] = "<h>Continue divining</> to confirm the direction",
    ["BOSS4先祖骑士-法术场污染隐形怪"] = "БОСС 4 Рыцарь-предок - Стелс-монстр с повреждением поля заклинаний",
    ["The shell of the \"Dark Angel\" Sasrir sleeps in the Giant King's Court, having been eroded by the Sea of Chaos."] = "Оболочка «Темного ангела» Сасрира покоится во дворе Короля Гигантов, будучи разрушена Морем Хаоса.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Derrick】Tier 3 increment (+15%) → cumulative 114%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["\"Proof that Cats are Actually Beyonder Creatures\""] = "\"Proof that Cats are Actually Потусторонний Creatures\"",
    ["\"Door\" domain seals of fatal damage wrap around your heart. Single-instance damage cannot exceed 25% of your maximum HP."] = "\"Door\" domain seals of fatal damage wrap around your heart. Single-instance damage cannot exceed 25% of your maximum HP.",
    ["“幽蓝复仇者”号船长。“塔罗会”创始成员之一，代号“倒吊人”。"] = "Капитан «Синего мстителя». Один из основателей Клуба Таро под кодовым названием «Повешенный».",
    ["　　日前，本市一名市民在一家占卜场所内突发晕厥，并被紧急送医。记者了解到，该市民已持续昏迷超过七日，生命体征平稳，但具体病因仍未明确。\n　　医院与警方已成立联合调查组，以期尽快查明事件原委。"] = "Недавно житель этого города внезапно потерял сознание в месте гаданий и был доставлен в больницу. Репортеру стало известно, что гражданин находится в коме более семи дней. Их жизненные показатели стабильны, но конкретная причина заболевания остается неясной. \n Больница и полиция создали совместную следственную группу, чтобы как можно скорее определить причину инцидента.",
    ["<P_Yellow>“月亮仆从”的核心成员</>\n代号“教授”，真实身份不详，下落不明，疑似整个献祭计划的策划者。\n代号“夫人”，五月庄园主人，收尸人途径序列4，主持献祭与新生仪式。\n代号“管家”，窥秘人途径序列5，知识皇冠的直接持有者。\n代号“风信子”……\n代号“蒲公英”……"] = "<P_Yellow>Основные члены «Лунных Слуг» </>\nКодовое имя «Профессор», настоящая личность неизвестна, местонахождение неизвестно, предположительно является вдохновителем всего плана жертвоприношения.\nКодовое имя «Виконтесса», владелица Мэйского поместья, последовательность 4 пути Собирателя трупов, руководит ритуалами жертвоприношения и возрождения.\nКодовое имя «Дворецкий», Последовательность 5 пути Тайного Жреца, непосредственный обладатель Короны Знаний.\nКодовое имя \"Гиацинт\"...\nКодовое имя \"Одуванчик\"...",
    ["【Template Skill】Divination ID 85000350-85000399"] = "【Template Skill】Гадание ID 85000350-85000399",
    ["Ms. “Magician” asked me to bring this book to you."] = "Ms. “Фокусник” asked me to bring this book to you.",
    ["{{PlayerName}}, thank you for recovering this Sealed Artifact for the Church."] = "{{PlayerName}}, thank you for recovering this Запечатанный артефакт for the Church.",
    ["【实证】诗意光环持续时间增加1秒。"] = "[Proof] Poetic aura duration increased by 1 second.",
    ["…The corruption has been cleared; you may leave."] = "…The Искажение has been cleared; you may leave.",
    ["[Right Stick Mode 4] Attack enemies in a rectangle in front."] = "[Right Stick Mode 4] Attack enemies in a rectangle in front.",
    ["[Rogue] Consciousness Manipulation - Spell Proxy"] = "[Rogue] Consciousness Manipulation - Spell Proxy",
    ["　　If you forget your lines, just say the spirit body is too powerful and I need more Sol to continue communicating.\n　　Note: Please use this method cautiously; the possibility of attracting an Unknown Existence is not zero. Once some gazes are cast, they will not move away."] = "Если вы забудете свои реплики, просто скажите, что духовное тело слишком мощное и мне нужно больше Сола, чтобы продолжить общение.\n　　Примечание: пожалуйста, используйте этот метод осторожно; возможность привлечения Неизвестного Существования не равна нулю. Как только некоторые взгляды будут брошены, они не отойдут.",
    ["　　教会传来消息，封印物2-327“看见我”失窃。占卜显示线索指向黑伍德庄园。\n　　黑伍德男爵今晚举办舞会。我们需要一个善于观察的人混入舞会调查——你是序列9“观众”，没有比你更合适的人选。\n　　你的身份已安排妥当：贝克兰德来的新兴商人，听闻庄园有投资机会，受邀赴宴。\n　　记住，观众不登台。\n　　观察，不要打草惊蛇。"] = "Церковь получила известие о том, что Запечатанный Артефакт 2-327 «Увидь Меня» был украден. Гадание указывает на подсказки, указывающие на поместье Хейвуд. \n Барон Хейвуд сегодня вечером устраивает бал. Нам нужен кто-то, кто хорошо умеет наблюдать, чтобы проникнуть на мяч и провести расследование — вы «Наблюдатель» из девятой серии, и нет никого более подходящего, чем вы. \n Ваша личность установлена: начинающий торговец из Баклунда, приглашенный на банкет после того, как узнал об инвестиционных возможностях в поместье. \n Помните, Зритель не выходит на сцену. \n Наблюдайте, не предупреждайте врага.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mystery World </>\n In the Mystery World tab, you can view the progress of the <Highlight> Order World </> and <Highlight> City Dark Side </> maps and claim <Highlight> progress rewards </>. \n<Highlight> Fashion Salon and Era Quests </> do not count toward Order World completion. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> TRPG Talents </>\n In the TRPG Talents tab, you can obtain TRPG-related <Highlight> talent bonuses </> based on your Order World completion. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Fun Modes </>\n Fun Modes contains tutorials for various gameplay events encountered during your adventure. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Treasured Moments </>\n Treasured Moments stores the precious records collected during your adventure."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mystery World </>\n In the Mystery World tab, you can view the progress of the <Highlight> Order World </> and <Highlight> City Dark Side </> maps and claim <Highlight> progress rewards </>. \n<Highlight> Fashion Salon and Era Quests </> do not count toward Order World completion. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> TRPG Talents </>\n In the TRPG Talents tab, you can obtain TRPG-related <Highlight> talent bonuses </> based on your Order World completion. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Fun Modes </>\n Fun Modes contains tutorials for various gameplay events encountered during your adventure. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Treasured Moments </>\n Treasured Moments stores the precious records collected during your adventure.",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 123木头人标记buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Become Wood! Mark Buff",
    ["“眠于红茧的纯白之人，主宰新生与堕落的神子，末日最后的可能性。”"] = "\"The pure white one sleeping in the red cocoon, the divine child who rules over rebirth and Искажение, the final possibility of the apocalypse.\"",
    ["【浅见】释放二段技能灰雾加持或者灰雾压制后，10秒内提升自身控制抵挡。"] = "[Insight] After releasing the second-stage skill gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, increase own Control resistance for 10 seconds.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Maid】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】Tier 4 increment (+25%) → cumulative 140%",
    ["The <P_Yellow>Seer</> Club..."] = "Клуб <P_Yellow>Провидец</>...",
    ["BuffID列表"] = "Список идентификаторов усилений",
    ["did Grants Player Execution Skill 2"] = "did Grants Player Execution Skill 2",
    ["Codename 3-888, named \"Mobius Strip\" during the era of Emperor Roselle, also known as the \"Endless Lost Path.\" \n \n ... A rectangular piece of gold foil, with one end twisted 180 degrees and then connected to the other end, forming a ring with only one plane... \n ... The starting point is the end point. \n \n Created by a Sequence 6 mechanical expert of the \"Savant\" pathway... \n ... Due to a mistake during a ritual, he communicated with an evil god, further losing control and turning into a monster... \n ... Sealed Artifact 3-888 was contaminated by his blood after death, and its characteristics changed. \n \n \n Originally taken over by the Tarot Club, it went missing recently while executing a mission <Mark id=\"#159\"> </>."] = "Codename 3-888, named \"Mobius Strip\" during the era of Emperor Roselle, also known as the \"Endless Lost Path.\" \n \n ... A rectangular piece of gold foil, with one end twisted 180 degrees and then connected to the other end, forming a ring with only one plane... \n ... The starting point is the end point. \n \n Created by a Последовательность 6 mechanical expert of the \"Savant\" pathway... \n ... Due to a mistake during a ritual, he communicated with an evil god, further losing control and turning into a monster... \n ... Запечатанный артефакт 3-888 was contaminated by his blood after death, and its characteristics changed. \n \n \n Originally taken over by the Клуб Таро, it went missing recently while executing a mission <Mark id=\"#159\"> </>.",
    ["<P_Heart>（面色潮红）</>我就能独占吸血鬼大人了！"] = "<P_Heart>(покраснел)</> Тогда я смогу полностью принадлежать Лорду Вампиру!",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演戏法大师】\n村庄里的无赖以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Trickmaster】 \n The ruffians in the village make a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out, but this time...",
    ["　　You open your eyes and see the familiar Tingen Lake—the place where everything began. \n　　But you clearly remember <M_Red> that you had already lost your last bit of sanity. Memories shattered in madness, consciousness was swallowed by darkness, and a certain cold power even began to erase the traces of you being \"human.\" </>\n　　At the very end of falling into the abyss of madness, you saw the boundless gray fog. And that gray fog passed through the Underworld, arrived before the River of Eternal Darkness, and pulled you back from the end of eternal sleep. \n\n　　Your current sanity value is <M_Orange>30</>, and your maximum sanity value has temporarily dropped to <M_Orange>70</>. The cracks in your spirit cannot disappear on their own, but <M_Orange>the Soul Soothing bestowed by other Beyonders</> can help you restore your maximum sanity value. \n　　In the next <M_Orange>month</>, that power from the gray fog will still follow you, guarding your clarity and ensuring your sanity value will not drop below <M_Orange>1</>. \n\n　　<M_Link>This is a miracle personally bestowed by The Fool. </>\n　　　<M_Link>Praise The Fool! </>"] = "You open your eyes and see the familiar Тинген Lake—the place where everything began. \n　　But you clearly remember <M_Red> that you had already lost your last bit of Рассудок. Memories shattered in Безумие, consciousness was swallowed by darkness, and a certain cold power even began to erase the traces of you being \"human.\" </>\n　　At the very end of falling into the abyss of Безумие, you saw the boundless gray fog. And that gray fog passed through the Underworld, arrived before the River of Eternal Darkness, and pulled you back from the end of eternal sleep. \n\n　　Your current Рассудок value is <M_Orange>30</>, and your maximum Рассудок value has temporarily dropped to <M_Orange>70</>. The cracks in your spirit cannot disappear on their own, but <M_Orange>the Soul Soothing bestowed by other Потустороннийs</> can help you restore your maximum Рассудок value. \n　　In the next <M_Orange>month</>, that power from the gray fog will still follow you, guarding your clarity and ensuring your Рассудок value will not drop below <M_Orange>1</>. \n\n　　<M_Link>This is a miracle personally bestowed by Шут. </>\n　　　<M_Link>Praise Шут! </>",
    ["To Beyonder \n Whatever is spoken, shall be known. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "To Потусторонний \n Что бы ни было сказано, будет известно. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["【本相】释放灰雾加持或者灰雾压制时，使身上具有历史明灯标志的友方额外获得护盾，但是会移除历史明灯标志，该护盾结束时不会对周围目标造成伤害。"] = "[True Form] When releasing gray fog Blessing or gray fog Suppression, allies with the Historical Beacon mark gain an additional Shield, but the Historical Beacon mark is removed. This Shield does not deal damage to surrounding targets when it ends.",
    ["【五月庄园】-【一号信徒】- 变身小象击倒"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Transform into Little Elephant Knockdown",
    ["<P_Red>所有灵性力量的母亲……</>"] = "<P_Red>Мать всех духовных сил...</>",
    ["<Red>污染词条</>可通过灰雾隔离净化为普通或非凡词条"] = "<Red>Искажение Affixes</> can be purified into Normal or Потусторонний Affixes via the gray fog",
    ["<沉默门徒>"] = "< Silent Disciple >",
    ["[Enhanced] Critical hits provide <HighLight>5</> seconds of <HighLight>5%</> increased damage, stacking up to <HighLight>4</> times."] = "[Enhanced] Critical hits provide <HighLight>5</> seconds of <HighLight>5%</> increased damage, stacking up to <HighLight>4</> times.",
    ["Let me heal the soul of {{他|她}} tormented by nightmares"] = "Let me heal the soul of {{him|her}} tormented by Кошмарs",
    ["【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Spectator】 \n Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom."] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Зритель】 \n Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.",
    ["　　近日，廷根市警察局多次接到报案，有青少年在公共盥洗室内点燃蜡烛，向自称“盥洗室之主”的未知神灵进行祈祷。警方提醒市民：请树立正确信仰，远离一切非正统祈祷活动。 "] = "Недавно в полицейское управление города Тинген поступило множество сообщений о том, что подростки зажигают свечи в общественных туалетах и ​​молятся неизвестному божеству, называющему себя «Повелителем туалета». Полиция напоминает гражданам: пожалуйста, придерживайтесь правильных убеждений и держитесь подальше от всех неортодоксальных молитвенных действий.",
    ["【Rogue】戏法演绎-法术代理"] = "[Rogue] Trick Performance - Spell Proxy",
    ["　　进了尖塔，戴里克直奔三楼，根据印象，找到了摆放神话资料和相应古籍的书架。\n　　他刚看中一本涉及创世神话的典籍，正打算抽出，却发现一只五指修长，皮肤白皙，形态好看的手掌抢先一步，拿走了那本图书。\n　　戴里克循着手臂望去，只看了一眼，就低下脑袋，以手按胸，沉声问候：\n　　“你好，洛薇雅长老。”\n　　拿走那本典籍的正是“六人议事团”成员，“牧羊人”洛薇雅。\n　　洛薇雅身穿绣有诸多神秘紫纹的黑色长袍，银灰色的头发茂密但带着点卷曲地披着。\n　　她脸庞光滑白嫩，眉眼大气艳丽，看起来也就三十出头，一双淡灰色的眼眸仿佛能洞穿灵魂。\n　　“嗯。”面对戴里克的问好，洛薇雅轻轻点了下头，没有多说什么，沉默地拿着那本典籍离开了两排书架之间。\n　　洛薇雅长老似乎变正常了，不像之前，总是在不同的状态间没有规律地切换，有时哭泣，有时冷笑，有时怒哼，有时漠然……戴里克下意识便闪过了这样的念头。\n　　突然，他莫名有些害怕。\n　　因为洛薇雅长老正常了……\n　　正常了……\n　　……\n\n　　——第2卷《无面人》 第一百零二章 重返丰收教堂"] = "Entering the spire, Derrick headed straight for the third floor and, based on his memory, found the bookshelf containing mythological materials and corresponding ancient texts. \n He had just taken a fancy to a classic involving creation myths and was about to pull it out when he found a palm with slender fingers, fair skin, and a beautiful shape snatching the book away first. \n Derrick followed the arm and looked up, and after just one glance, he lowered his head, pressed his hand to his chest, and asked in a deep voice: \n \"Hello, Elder Lovia.\" \n The one who took the classic was indeed a member of the \"Six-Member Council,\" the Shepherd Lovia. \n Lovia wore a black robe embroidered with many mysterious purple patterns, and her silver-gray hair was thick but slightly curly. \n Her face was smooth and fair, her features grand and beautiful, and she looked to be only in her early thirties, with a pair of light gray eyes that seemed to be able to pierce through the soul. \n \"Hmm.\" Facing Derrick's greeting, Lovia nodded slightly, didn't say much, and silently walked away between the two rows of bookshelves with the classic. \n Elder Lovia seems to have returned to normal, unlike before, where she was always switching between different states without any pattern, sometimes crying, sometimes sneering, sometimes snorting in anger, sometimes indifferent... Derrick subconsciously flashed such a thought. \n Suddenly, he felt inexplicably afraid. \n Because Elder Lovia was normal... \n Normal... \n ... \n \n —— Volume 2 \"Безликий\", Chapter 102, Returning to the Harvest Church",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</>这……这是蒙特利？！"] = "<P_Heart> (в шоке) </> Это... это Монтерей?!",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Friend/Enemy Relationship </> \n Members of the same team, group, or Club are considered allies; <Highlight> all other players are hostile </> and can be attacked freely. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Team Settlement </> \n When defeating a hostile player, the killer and up to <Highlight> 29 </> team members who meet the assist criteria participate in this Crimson Relic and Rank Point settlement. \n The distributable Crimson Relics are divided equally among the participants and rounded down. If there is a remainder, the killer gets priority for 1 extra, and the rest are distributed randomly among other participants, with each person receiving at most 1 extra. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Plunder Rules </> \n After defeating a hostile player, you can plunder <Highlight> Rank Points </> and the <Highlight> Crimson Relics </> they hold from the target. The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Crimson Relics that can be plundered; for every <Highlight> 500 </> fragments above the head, the plunder percentage increases accordingly. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Protection </> \n Players with a rank lower than <Highlight> Earl Tier 1 </> will not lose Rank Points when killed. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Point Decay </> \n Daily <Highlight> 01:00—08:00 </>, Rank Points obtained from killing players are adjusted to <Highlight> 10% </> of the normal value; Rank Points provided by hunting progress are not affected. \n When the same player kills the same target repeatedly within 10 minutes, the 1st—3rd times grant 100% Rank Points, the 4th time grants 50%, the 5th time grants 20%, and the 6th time and onwards grant none. When both decay rules are in effect simultaneously, the final result is calculated by multiplying the proportions."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Friend/Enemy Relationship </> \n Members of the same team, group, or Club are considered allies; <Highlight> all other players are hostile </> and can be attacked freely. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Team Settlement </> \n When defeating a hostile player, the killer and up to <Highlight> 29 </> team members who meet the assist criteria participate in this Crimson Relic and Rank Point settlement. \n The distributable Crimson Relics are divided equally among the participants and rounded down. If there is a remainder, the killer gets priority for 1 extra, and the rest are distributed randomly among other participants, with each person receiving at most 1 extra. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Plunder Rules </> \n After defeating a hostile player, you can plunder <Highlight> Rank Points </> and the <Highlight> Crimson Relics </> they hold from the target. The more fragments displayed above a player's head, the higher the percentage of Crimson Relics that can be plundered; for every <Highlight> 500 </> fragments above the head, the plunder percentage increases accordingly. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Protection </> \n Players with a rank lower than <Highlight> Earl Tier 1 </> will not lose Rank Points when killed. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Rank Point Decay </> \n Daily <Highlight> 01:00—08:00 </>, Rank Points obtained from killing players are adjusted to <Highlight> 10% </> of the normal value; Rank Points provided by hunting progress are not affected. \n When the same player kills the same target repeatedly within 10 minutes, the 1st—3rd times grant 100% Rank Points, the 4th time grants 50%, the 5th time grants 20%, and the 6th time and onwards grant none. When both decay rules are in effect simultaneously, the final result is calculated by multiplying the proportions.",
    ["{{PlayerName}}，看来你也有当美食评论家的天分。"] = "{{PlayerName}}, it seems you also have a talent for being a food critic.",
    ["　　准备好了。“审判官”从教会偷来了“机械之灵核心”，先藏在炼钢工厂，就等着仪式启动。他现在喜欢称我为“主人”，他说等我晋升成功，就能重塑肉体，成为半神，到时候他就是我的首席打手。\n　　我把核心握在手里，凉得刺骨。\n　　为了这个，死了很多人，包括警队内部的兄弟，安迪、老柯林、小玛莎……\n　　那一刻我突然想问自己：值得吗？\n　　但答案没有意义了，已经走得太远，没法回头了。"] = "Готовый. «Инквизитор» украл «Ядро механического духа» из церкви и спрятал его на сталелитейном заводе, ожидая начала ритуала. Теперь он любит называть меня «Мастер»; он говорит, что как только я успешно продвинусь, я смогу изменить свое тело и стать полубогом, и к тому времени он будет моим главным силовиком. \nЯ держал ядро ​​в руке; было пронизывающе холодно. \n За это погибло много людей, в том числе братья из полиции, Энди, Старый Колин, Маленькая Марта... \n В этот момент мне вдруг захотелось спросить себя: стоит ли оно того? \n Но ответ бессмыслен; Я уже зашел слишком далеко и не могу повернуть назад.",
    ["　　比星空更崇高，比永恒更久的黑夜女神，祂是隐秘之母，厄难与恐惧的女皇，安眠和寂静的领主。"] = "Богиня Вечной Ночи, более возвышенная, чем звездное небо, и долговечная, чем вечность, — это Мать Сокрытия, Императрица Бедствий и Ужасов, Повелительница Сна и Тишины.",
    ["PlayerInfoBuffs:RefreshBuffs 实体不存在 %s"] = "PlayerInfoBuffs:RefreshBuffs entity does not exist %s",
    ["BOSS 4 Ancestor Knight - Outer Ring Corruption Stealth Monster"] = "БОСС 4 Рыцарь-предок - Стелс-монстр порчи Внешнего кольца",
    ["Combo Window Duration"] = "Combo Window Duration",
    ["【Rogue】放逐-终结"] = "[Rogue] Exile - Finish",
    ["[Insight] Allies and self within the Tranquility aura can recover a small amount of Health with each attack on a target, triggering at most once per second. The Poetic aura radius is increased by 2 meters."] = "[Insight] Allies and self within the Tranquility aura can recover a small amount of Health with each attack on a target, triggering at most once per second. The Poetic aura radius is increased by 2 meters.",
    ["【晋升至序列8后解锁，尝试扮演戏法大师】\n村庄里的无赖以碰瓷为生，故意摔倒后讹诈钱财，村民敢怒不敢言，这一次……"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Trickmaster】 \n The ruffians in the village make a living by staging accidents to extort money. The villagers are angry but dare not speak out, but this time...",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>非凡途径与序列等级</>\n非凡途径又称神之途径，是以魔药为核心的一整套晋升体系。每条途径分为10个序列，从9到0，序列数字越低，品阶越高，能力越强。\n非凡者可以通过收集魔药配方，服用序列魔药以提升序列等级，并提升消化序列魔药的进度，提升实力。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋升</>\n完成所有晋升的前置条件后，即可领取晋升任务，制作并服用下一序列的魔药，提升序列等级。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Пути за гранью и уровни последовательности</>\nПути за гранью, также известные как Божественные пути, представляют собой полноценную систему развития, основанную на зельях. Каждый путь разделен на 10 последовательностей, от 9 до 0. Чем ниже номер последовательности, тем выше ранг и тем сильнее способность.\nПотусторонние могут повысить уровень и силу своей последовательности, собирая формулы зелий, потребляя зелья последовательности и прогрессируя в их переваривании.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Advancement</>\nКак только все предварительные условия для продвижения будут выполнены, вы можете принять квест продвижения, создайте и употребите зелье следующей последовательности и повысьте свой уровень последовательности.",
    ["GTA Priest Throw Skill Stun"] = "GTA Priest Throw Skill Stun",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>玩法介绍</>\n主宰争锋为组队竞技玩法，最多可组成3人队伍参与匹配。进入主宰争锋玩法后，所有玩家获得<Highlight>公平</>的属性调整，<Highlight>封印物统一为“3级”</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>获胜条件</>\n进入玩法后，死亡的玩家<Highlight>无法</>被观众途径<Highlight>复活</>。玩家需要击败敌方队伍内的所有玩家，或者限时内伤害更高才能取得对局胜利。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n Dominator's Clash is a team competition mode where you can form a team of up to 3 players to matchmake. Upon entering, all players receive <Highlight> fair </> attribute adjustments, and <Highlight> Запечатанный артефактs are standardized to \"Level 3\" </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n Once in the mode, players who die <Highlight> cannot </> be resurrected by the Зритель <Highlight> pathway </>. Players must defeat all members of the enemy team or have higher damage output within the time limit to win the match.",
    ["buff控制状态列表"] = "Список статусов контроля баффов",
    ["<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all combat skills are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> attack speed is increased, and their cooldown time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32 seconds}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Cooldown: 60 seconds."] = "<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all Боевой навыкs are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> Скорость атаки is increased, and their Перезарядка time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32 seconds}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Перезарядка: 60 seconds.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Flushed)</> Then I can have Lord Vampire all to myself!"] = "<P_Heart>(покраснел)</> Тогда я смогу полностью принадлежать Лорду Вампиру!",
    ["【浅见】电流期间目标受到的电流伤害有概率产生波动，波动区间为100%-150%。"] = "[Insight] During the Current effect, the Current damage dealt to the target has a chance to fluctuate, with a fluctuation range of 100%-150%.",
    ["{\n \"Skill/buff object target (holder/originator)\": \"0\", \n \"Level/scene as target\": \"1\", \n \"Objects in range as target\": \"2\", \n \"Target filter as target\": \"3\", \n \"Blackboard tarlist\": \"4\" \n}"] = "{\n \"Skill/buff object target (holder/originator)\": \"0\", \n \"Level/scene as target\": \"1\", \n \"Objects in range as target\": \"2\", \n \"Target filter as target\": \"3\", \n \"Blackboard tarlist\": \"4\" \n}",
    ["Id(脱手技能)"] = "Id (Detached Skill).",
    ["The \"Mystic Pact Ritual\" can affect a target's spirit body, astral projection, mental body, and ether body. Mystic Beyonder awakenings correspond to an individual's mastery over different domains. Choosing to develop different Mystic Beyonder awakenings will result in different levels of mastery over the corresponding domains."] = "«Ритуал Мистического Пакта» может воздействовать на духовное тело, астральную проекцию, ментальное и эфирное тело цели. Мистические пробуждения Потустороннего соответствуют овладению человеком различными областями. Выбор развития различных пробуждений Mystic Потусторонний приведет к разным уровням мастерства в соответствующих областях.",
    ["<Red>Homesick</>: After the doll returns to the master, it needs to rest for 10 seconds before it can be transferred again. \n<Red>Malicious Heart</>: While the awakened doll is on the master, the master will also suffer from the Beset by Misfortune effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds."] = "<Red>Homesick</>: After the doll returns to the master, it needs to rest for 10 seconds before it can be transferred again. \n<Red>Malicious Heart</>: While the awakened doll is on the master, the master will also suffer from the Beset by Misfortune effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["{{player.name}}对{{targetPlayer.name}}进行了安魂，仪式进行得有板有眼，但无事发生。双方面面相觑。 "] = "{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. The ritual was conducted by the book, but nothing happened. Both parties stared at each other in silence.",
    ["《镜内的世界：魔镜占卜入门》、《灵数，一种神启》、《占卜材料的解析》……都是些难啃的专著。"] = "\"The World Within the Mirror: Introduction to Magic Mirror Гадание\", \"Numerology, A Divine Revelation\", \"Analysis of Гадание Materials\"... these are all tough monographs to crack.",
    ["<Yellow>苏勒防身</>：携带者减伤提高<Yellow>*f**</>。\n<Yellow>苦难财富</>：携带者受到伤害时，根据累积受到伤害值提高防御，持续<Yellow>30秒</>，防御最多提高<Yellow>*d</>点。"] = "<Yellow>Sule's Self-Defense</>: The carrier's Снижение урона is increased by <Yellow>*f**</>. \n<Yellow>Wealth of Misery</>: When the carrier takes damage, Defense is increased based on the cumulative damage received, lasting <Yellow>30 seconds</>, with Defense increasing by up to <Yellow>*d</> points.",
    ["{\n                        \"轻攻击\": \"LightHit\",\n                        \"默认击退\": \"HitBack\",\n                        \"击退100cm_控制0.3秒\": \"HitBack_100_9F\",\n                        \"击退200cm_控制0.3秒\": \"HitBack_200_9F\",\n                        \"击退300cm_控制0.3秒\": \"HitBack_300_9F\",\n                        \"击倒\": \"HitDown\",\n                        \"击飞\": \"HitFly\",\n                        \"挑空\": \"HitFloat\",\n                        \"拖拽\": \"HitDrag\",\n                        \"僵直攻击\": \"HitStiff\"\n                    }"] = "{\n \"Light Attack\": \"LightHit\", \n \"Default Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockback 100cm_Control 0.3s\": \"HitBack_100_9F\", \n \"Knockback 200cm_Control 0.3s\": \"HitBack_200_9F\", \n \"Knockback 300cm_Control 0.3s\": \"HitBack_300_9F\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Drag\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stiff Attack\": \"HitStiff\" \n}",
    ["GTA-通用回血药品"] = "GTA - Universal Healing Item",
    ["“魔术师”小姐托我把这本书带给您。 "] = "Ms. “Фокусник” asked me to bring this book to you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（这绝对不能告诉他！但是占卜已经显示这样的结果了，我该怎么办……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Этого ему категорически нельзя говорить! Но гадание уже показало такой результат, что мне делать...)</>",
    ["　　工匠之神的教会给了我两个选择，两条序列途径的起始，一个是“通识者”，这属于他们自身所掌握的那个完整序列链条，一个是“窥秘人”，从摩斯苦修会得到，缺乏更高的序列。​"] = "Церковь Бога Парохода и Машин предоставила мне два выбора, начало двух путей Последовательности: один — «Савант», который принадлежит к полной цепочке последовательностей, которой они сами обладают, и другой — «Таинственный Жрец», полученный от Аскетического Ордена Моисея, в котором отсутствуют более высокие последовательности.",
    ["<Red>异变</>：携带者每消耗1点生命能量，身体会积攒1层异变，降低移动速度5%，降低防御5%。异变效果最多累积10层。脱离战斗后，或者站立不动时，异变会随时间逐渐消散。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Mutation</>: For every 1 point of Life Energy consumed, the bearer accumulates 1 stack of Mutation, reducing Скорость бега by 5% and defense by 5%. Mutation effects can stack up to 10 times. After exiting combat or standing still, Mutation will gradually dissipate over time. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attribute entries become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["[Insight] During Death Erosion, the target gains 66% Grievous Injury."] = "[Insight] During Death Erosion, the target gains 66% Grievous Injury.",
    ["{{\"Skill Type (see hover note)\", \"Increase Level\"}}"] = "{{\"Skill Type (see hover note)\", \"Increase Level\"}}",
    ["A gift from Ms. Justice, giving one an inexplicable sense of peace. It reduces the damage you take and turns the suffering you have endured into wealth, increasing defense based on accumulated damage. If the wealth weighs on you for too long, you will be overwhelmed."] = "Подарок от госпожи Джастис, дающий необъяснимое чувство покоя. Он уменьшает получаемый вами урон и превращает перенесенные вами страдания в богатство, увеличивая защиту на основе накопленного урона. Если богатство будет тяготить вас слишком долго, вы будете разбиты.",
    ["【实证】灰雾加持时间内，释放技能自身体力值额外增加2点。"] = "[Proof] During the gray fog Blessing duration, releasing a skill increases own Health by an additional 2 points.",
    ["<Red>渴血症</>：作为强制召唤秘偶的代价，指环会吞噬自身5%的最大生命值。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Bloodthirst Syndrome</>: As the cost for the forced summon of the Марионетка, the ring will consume 5% of your maximum Health. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["A点触发器"] = "Точка триггера",
    ["{{player.name}}对{{targetPlayer.name}}成功进行了安魂，对方躁动的灵性重归宁静，恢复了<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</>点理智。赞美女神，一切的归宿是安宁！"] = "{{player.name}} has successfully performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. The other party's restless Духовность has returned to tranquility, restoring <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</> points of Рассудок. Praise the Goddess, for the destination of all things is peace!",
    ["<Red>Attracting Insects</>: When the wearer has a Shield, they lose an amount of Shield value equal to 2.5% of their maximum Health per second. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Attracting Insects</>: When the wearer has a Shield, they lose an amount of Shield value equal to 2.5% of their maximum Health per second. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Red>Wealth Burden</>: After the carrier has held Wealth of Misery for more than 20 seconds, if they are still in combat, they will fall into an Overburdened state lasting 5 seconds every 10 seconds: reducing *f** movement speed and *f** Stamina recovery speed. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Wealth Burden</>: After the carrier has held Wealth of Misery for more than 20 seconds, if they are still in combat, they will fall into an Overburdened state lasting 5 seconds every 10 seconds: reducing *f** Скорость бега and *f** Stamina recovery speed. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["<Yellow>Full Moon</>: Strengthens your own and your teammates' combat skills, increasing their level by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>, which can stack; \n<Yellow>Gate of Summoning</>: Strengthens the marionette, increasing the damage and healing effects of Marionette Skills by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>. When a Marionette Skill is on Cooldown, using Basic Attacks and combat skills on a target has a chance to force the marionette to be summoned, casting one Marionette Skill. Within a single Cooldown cycle of a Marionette Skill, the forced summon effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time."] = "<Yellow>Full Moon</>: Strengthens your own and your teammates' Боевой навыкs, increasing their level by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?+1}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?+2}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?+3}</>, which can stack; \n<Yellow>Gate of Summoning</>: Strengthens the Марионетка, increasing the damage and healing effects of Марионетка Skills by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=1?50%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=2?60%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085020)=3?70%}</>. When a Марионетка Skill is on Перезарядка, using Базовая атакаs and Боевой навыкs on a target has a chance to force the Марионетка to be summoned, casting one Марионетка Skill. Within a single Перезарядка cycle of a Марионетка Skill, the forced summon effect can trigger at most <Yellow>1</> time.",
    ["Create a random Buff from the Buff list"] = "Создайте случайное усиление из списка усилений.",
    ["{{\"技能Type（参看悬停注释）\",\"增加等级\"}}"] = "{{\"Skill Type (see hover note)\", \"Increase Level\"}}",
    ["<Yellow>Land of Black-Faced Grass</>: Causes the carrier to enter a near-cursed state, which transforms into the <Yellow>Bearing the Curse</> state after 5 minutes. When dying in this state, an activated land with a radius of 8 meters will grow on the spot, lasting 10 seconds, applying the following effects to up to 10 friendly players in the range: \nRestores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</> of the carrier's maximum Health per second, prioritizing friendly units with lower remaining Health; if there are more than 5 people, the healing amount is reduced; \nGains an Attack Boost effect, with the increase value being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</> of the carrier's Attack, effective for up to 10 people; \nExempts <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</> instances of control effects. \nAfter the effect is triggered, or when switching scenes, the near-cursed state begins to take effect again."] = "<Yellow>Land of Black-Faced Grass</>: Causes the carrier to enter a near-cursed state, which transforms into the <Yellow>Bearing the Curse</> state after 5 minutes. When dying in this state, an activated land with a radius of 8 meters will grow on the spot, lasting 10 seconds, applying the following effects to up to 10 friendly players in the range: \nRestores <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?6%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?7.5%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?9%}</> of the carrier's maximum Health per second, prioritizing friendly units with lower remaining Health; if there are more than 5 people, the healing amount is reduced; \nGains an Attack Boost effect, with the increase value being <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?15%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?20%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?25%}</> of the carrier's Attack, effective for up to 10 people; \nExempts <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=1?30}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=2?40}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085030)=3?50}</> instances of control effects. \nAfter the effect is triggered, or when switching scenes, the near-cursed state begins to take effect again.",
    ["【44】虚伪丈夫"] = "【44】 Hypocritical Husband",
    ["\"When a Sealed Artifact's historical projection dissipates, it leaves behind a trace of its unique historical aura.\" \n \"What is the use of these?\" \n \"Of course, historical aura can increase a Sealed Artifact's grade and ability, up to Grade 1, which is a highly dangerous state.\" \n \"Can it be upgraded to Grade 0?\" \n \"Grade 0? You naive little heads really dare to think; at least wait until you reach mid-sequence before considering such things!\""] = "\"Когда историческая проекция Запечатанного Артефакта рассеивается, он оставляет после себя след своей уникальной исторической ауры.\" \n \"Какая в этом польза?\" \n \"Конечно, историческая аура может повысить уровень и способности Запечатанного Артефакта до уровня 1, что является очень опасным состоянием.\" \n \"Можно ли его повысить до уровня 0?\" \n \"Уровня 0? Вы, наивные маленькие головы, действительно смеете так думать подумай, по крайней мере, подожди, пока дойдешь до середины, прежде чем думать о таких вещах!»",
    ["[True Form] Upon planting the flag, the Imperial Flag deals a certain amount of damage to enemy targets within range, and deals an additional 50% damage to other flags or targets with Shields within range."] = "[True Form] Upon planting the flag, the Imperial Flag deals a certain amount of damage to enemy targets within range, and deals an additional 50% damage to other flags or targets with Shields within range.",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，并释放连击技能，连击完成后进入冷却"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] Use self as the center to deal effects to a sector in front, and release a combo skill; enters Перезарядка after the combo is completed.",
    ["· After activation, one-tap support is enabled. <Yellow> Using the Basic Attack button </> (default E key) will <Yellow> release skills in sequence </>. <Yellow> Holding the Basic Attack button </> (default E key) for 2 seconds will enter the <Yellow> auto-skill release </> state. \n · After entering the auto-skill release state, exiting combat or manually clicking a skill can interrupt the automatic state. \n · You can switch between Move Priority mode or Skill Priority mode in Settings-Combat-Operation-Auto-Combat Mode. This setting determines whether \"One-tap Support\" will attempt to release skills while the character is moving."] = "· After activation, one-tap support is enabled. <Yellow> Using the Базовая атака button </> (default E key) will <Yellow> release skills in Последовательность </>. <Yellow> Holding the Базовая атака button </> (default E key) for 2 seconds will enter the <Yellow> auto-skill release </> state. \n · After entering the auto-skill release state, exiting combat or manually clicking a skill can interrupt the automatic state. \n · You can switch between Move Priority mode or Skill Priority mode in Settings-Combat-Operation-Auto-Combat Mode. This setting determines whether \"One-tap Support\" will attempt to release skills while the character is moving.",
    ["[Proof] Damage of Grasp of Death. increased by an additional 30%."] = "[Proof] Damage of Grasp of Death. increased by an additional 30%.",
    ["【Unlocked after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Warrior】\n By the wooden house on the shore of Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble..."] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Warrior】\n By the wooden house on the shore of Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble...",
    ["　　<InvDefault_HW>After Dunn and Daly got to know each other, Daly built a nest on Dunn's head under the pretext that \"my feathers have all fallen out, I'm so cold,\" and repeated every forgotten piece of information to him; Dunn would carry her to patrol the forest, using its thick gray fur to shield her from the wind and its antlers to pick berries from the highest branches.</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>Daly liked to lie on the back of its head, often complaining that the fur on its forehead wasn't thick enough.</>"] = "<InvDefault_HW>After Dunn and Daly got to know each other, Daly built a nest on Dunn's head under the pretext that \"my feathers have all fallen out, I'm so cold,\" and repeated every forgotten piece of information to him; Dunn would carry her to patrol the forest, using its thick gray fur to shield her from the wind and its antlers to pick berries from the highest branches.</>\n\n　　<InvDefault_HW>Daly liked to lie on the back of its head, often complaining that the fur on its forehead wasn't thick enough.</>",
    ["<h>Concoct Potion</>"] = "<h>Concoct Potion</>",
    ["... \n June 13th \n <InvHighlight> North Borough </> In the homes of fifty residents <Mark id=\"#159\"> sewers </> were blocked, and during cleaning, it was discovered that the pipes were stuffed with <Mark id=\"#159\"> plant vines </>. \n \n June 14th \n Wealthy merchant Miguel died in a <InvHighlight> glass conservatory in the North Borough </>, and when discovered, his body was covered in purple-red grapes. \n \n June 18th \n Textile worker Beth found three candles and a wooden arm in the <InvHighlight> South District </>, and there were traces of an <Mark id=\"#159\"> evil ritual </> at the scene. \n ..."] = "... \n June 13th \n <InvHighlight> North Borough </> In the homes of fifty residents <Mark id=\"#159\"> sewers </> were blocked, and during cleaning, it was discovered that the pipes were stuffed with <Mark id=\"#159\"> plant vines </>. \n \n June 14th \n Wealthy merchant Miguel died in a <InvHighlight> glass conservatory in the North Borough </>, and when discovered, his body was covered in purple-red grapes. \n \n June 18th \n Textile worker Beth found three candles and a wooden arm in the <InvHighlight> South District </>, and there were traces of an <Mark id=\"#159\"> evil ritual </> at the scene. \n ...",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】生命之脉"] = "[Клуб Таро Atmosphere] Pulse of Life",
    ["　　哈珀说大麦比水稻更容易生长，还给了我一瓶促生长药剂。有道理，在地下弄水田是有些麻烦……\n\n\n　　种植培育记录得改改：\n　　《“生命之语”非凡药剂对作物种子萌发及幼苗生长的促进作用研究：以不肯发芽的大麦田为例》"] = "Харпер сказал, что ячмень выращивать легче, чем рис, и дал мне бутылку зелья, стимулирующего рост. Это имеет смысл; создать рисовое поле под землей немного хлопотно... \n \n \n Необходимо изменить записи о посадке и выращивании: \n \"Исследование по стимуляции прорастания семян сельскохозяйственных культур и роста рассады с помощью зелья Потусторонний \"Слово жизни\": пример ячменного поля, которое отказывается прорастать\"",
    ["<P_Heart>（震惊）</> 你……是告解室？！<P_Heart>（左右张望）</> 神职人员呢？"] = "<P_Heart> (в шоке) </> Ты... исповедальня?! <P_Heart> (Смотрит налево и направо) </> Где священнослужитель?",
    ["true时：充能技能充能次数减少为0时也会返回true"] = "When true: Returns true even when the charges of a chargeable skill are reduced to 0.",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3非凡\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡+1普通\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+2普通\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3普通\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+1普通\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2普通\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1普通\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nreturn Round(baseprice + $4)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3 Потусторонний\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний+2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний+1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nreturn Round(baseprice + $4)",
    ["【浅见】梦魇突袭命中目标后减少目标护盾一定值，若目标不存在护盾，则该技能额外削弱目标技能抵挡。"] = "[Insight] After Кошмар Assault hits a target, it reduces the target's Shield by a certain value. If the target does not have a Shield, this skill additionally weakens the target's Блок навыков.",
    ["· Beyonders can obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Beyonder to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Beyonder performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts."] = "· Потустороннийs can obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Потусторонний to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Потусторонний performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts.",
    [" The \"Inquisitor\" brought me to meet someone. He was wearing a black robe, spoke like a machine, and claimed to be an Apostle of the God of Steam and Machinery. He said that Beyonder power is a ladder to a higher existence, and as long as I am willing, he can help me step into the extraordinary. To show me this, they turned a skinny man into a werewolf right in front of me! They are truly a bunch of madmen. \n I asked him what I needed to pay. \n He said, loyalty. \n I cursed him ten times in my heart. I am only loyal to Tingen. But I didn't say it out loud. I need his power; once I become stronger, it's not certain who will be loyal to whom. \n But the werewolf is also too damn ugly; \"Savants\" might be good."] = "The \"Inquisitor\" brought me to meet someone. He was wearing a black robe, spoke like a machine, and claimed to be an Apostle of the God of Steam and Machinery. He said that Потусторонний power is a ladder to a higher existence, and as long as I am willing, he can help me step into the extraordinary. To show me this, they turned a skinny man into a werewolf right in front of me! They are truly a bunch of madmen. \n I asked him what I needed to pay. \n He said, loyalty. \n I cursed him ten times in my heart. I am only loyal to Тинген. But I didn't say it out loud. I need his power; once I become stronger, it's not certain who will be loyal to whom. \n But the werewolf is also too damn ugly; \"Savants\" might be good.",
    ["LuaList(LuaTuple(Str(),IdGroup(技能),Str()))"] = "LuaList(LuaTuple(Str(), IdGroup(Skill), Str())).",
    ["{ {skillTag1, 1.0}, {skillTag2, 2.0}} 意思是把skillTag1的技能提升1倍速率，skillTag2的技能提升2倍速率"] = "{ {skillTag1, 1.0}, {skillTag2, 2.0}} means increasing the speed of skillTag1 skills by 1x and skillTag2 skills by 2x.",
    ["【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Warrior】 \n Beside the wooden house by Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble..."] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Warrior】 \n Beside the wooden house by Golden Autumn Lake, you see two rough thugs giving a girl trouble...",
    ["<Red>灌注灵性</>：佩戴者扣下扳机时，消耗自身20点体力值作为代价，若体力不足20点，则清空体力，并在接下来的2秒内无法恢复体力。\n<Red>弱点反噬</>：佩戴者使用丧钟后的3秒内，无法继续揭露弱点。期间受到伤害提高*f**。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Infuse Духовность</>: When the wearer pulls the trigger, they consume 20 points of their own Stamina as a price. If Stamina is less than 20, it is emptied, and Stamina cannot be recovered for the next 2 seconds. \n<Red>Weakness Backlash</>: Within 3 seconds after the wearer uses Death Knell, they cannot continue to reveal weaknesses. During this period, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演魔术师】\n廷根街头有个疯疯癫癫的老太太，总是说绅士的帽子里有鸽子……"] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Фокусник】 \n There is a crazy old lady on the streets of Тинген who always says there are pigeons in a gentleman's hat...",
    ["\"January 1st, 1184. A grand New Year's party. Mrs. Flonal is truly a stunner.\""] = "\"January 1st, 1184. A grand New Year's party. Mrs. Flonal is truly a stunner.\"",
    ["The corruption is initially sealed, but the will of {{him|her}} has been repeatedly ravaged. Should we wake {{him|her}} up in the real world like this?"] = "Первоначально порча была запечатана, но воля {{him|her}} неоднократно разрушалась. Должны ли мы разбудить {{him|her}} в реальном мире вот так?",
    ["【临时占位】克莱恩下定决心，干脆地一口喝下了魔药。\n很快他不由自主地抽搐起来，眼前迅速变得模糊。"] = "[Placeholder] Klein made up his mind and decisively drank the potion in one gulp. \n Soon, he began to twitch uncontrollably, and his vision rapidly blurred.",
    ["“2”级危险物……危险、谨慎且节制使用，所以做这个动作是因为封印物的特殊性？"] = "\"Grade 2\" dangerous object... Dangerous, use with caution and restraint. So, is this action performed because of the special nature of the Запечатанный артефакт?",
    ["【Right Stick Mode 1】 Deals multiple types of damage with different effects to all enemies within the selected range."] = "【Right Stick Mode 1】 Deals multiple types of damage with different effects to all enemies within the selected range.",
    ["“魔术师”小姐的信件"] = "Letter from Miss Фокусник",
    ["trigger - Inspect pumpkin"] = "trigger - Inspect pumpkin",
    ["A special totem left behind by Miss Magician Fors after using her space concealment ability to hide parts of the loss of control area."] = "A special totem left behind by Miss Фокусник Fors after using her space concealment ability to hide parts of the loss of control area.",
    ["{\n\"不指定\":\"\",\n\"命中目标数（技能和法术场中的范围命中后使用该参数）\":\"hitnum\",\n\"筛选目标数（使用目标筛选时使用该参数）\": \"tarnum\",\n\"职业资源改变值（包括向上溢出值）\": \"propdiff\",\n\"职业资源改变值（实际改变值）\": \"proprealdiff\"\n}"] = "{\n \"Unspecified\": \"\", \n \"Hit target count (use this parameter after range hit in skills and spell fields)\": \"hitnum\", \n \"Filter target count (use this parameter when using target filtering)\": \"tarnum\", \n \"Class resource change value (including upward overflow value)\": \"propdiff\", \n \"Class resource change value (actual change value)\": \"proprealdiff\" \n}",
    ["<P_Heart> (Shocked) </> This... is this Monterey?!"] = "<P_Heart> (в шоке) </> Это... это Монтерей?!",
    ["<Red>Infuse Spirituality</>: When the wearer pulls the trigger, they consume 20 points of their own Stamina as a price. If Stamina is less than 20, it is emptied, and Stamina cannot be recovered for the next 2 seconds. \n<Red>Weakness Backlash</>: Within 3 seconds after the wearer uses Death Knell, they cannot continue to reveal weaknesses. During this period, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Infuse Духовность</>: When the wearer pulls the trigger, they consume 20 points of their own Stamina as a price. If Stamina is less than 20, it is emptied, and Stamina cannot be recovered for the next 2 seconds. \n<Red>Weakness Backlash</>: Within 3 seconds after the wearer uses Death Knell, they cannot continue to reveal weaknesses. During this period, damage taken is increased by *f**. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【临时占位】“她的花一夜开到天明\n但待到白昼睁开了眼睛\n被凝视羞得无处可躲\n她便在眩晕中蔫萎掉落……”"] = "[Placeholder] \"Her flowers bloom overnight until dawn \n But when the day opens its eyes \n Ashamed of being under the Gaze, with nowhere to hide \n She withers and falls in a Stun...\"",
    ["“我们是守护者，也是一群时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的可怜虫。”"] = "«Мы Стражи, а также группа несчастных, постоянно борющихся с опасностью и безумием».",
    ["To Beyonder \n The Fool that doesn't belong to this era, \n the mysterious ruler above the gray fog, \n the King of Yellow and Black who wields good luck. \n Squid Who Loves to Dive"] = "Потустороннему \n Дураку,\n не принадлежащему этой эпохе, \n таинственному правителю над серым туманом, \n Королю Желтого и Чёрного, приносящему удачу. \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["<P_Heart>（赛琳娜大概率是向邪恶的存在祈祷，这样下去她会变成恶灵，在场的所有人都有危险……最好立刻进行中断仪式。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Скорее всего, Селена молится злому существованию. Если так будет продолжаться, она превратится в злого духа, и все присутствующие окажутся в опасности... Лучше немедленно провести прерванный ритуал.)</>",
    ["【Advancement】Sequence 7, 1250340"] = "【Advancement】Последовательность 7, 1250340",
    ["……不管怎么说，我不能放任一个超凡生物在外游荡。"] = "……In any case, I cannot leave a Потусторонний creature wandering outside.",
    ["<P_Heart>（非凡世界里，所做的一切选择都要付出相应的代价……）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(В мире Потусторонний за каждый сделанный выбор приходится соответствующая цена...)</>",
    ["<Red>Bloodthirst Syndrome</>: As the cost for the forced summon of the marionette, the ring will consume 5% of your maximum Health. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Bloodthirst Syndrome</>: As the cost for the forced summon of the Марионетка, the ring will consume 5% of your maximum Health. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【塔罗会·弓箭骑士】档6增量(+25%)→累计190%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь-лучник】Прирост 6 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 190%",
    ["【塔罗会·戴里克】档7增量(+30%)→累计220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Вышка】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["【Tarot Club · Alienated Hound】Tier 3 increment (+15%) → cumulative 114%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Чужая гончая】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["<Yellow>异界祝福</>：战斗状态下施放灵视时，灵视效果缩短至<Yellow>5秒</>，灵视技能冷却延长至<Yellow>20秒</>，期间获得灵体生物的祝福，每秒恢复<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</>上限生命值，并提高减伤<Yellow>*f**</>。\n该治疗效果受减疗和重伤效果影响。"] = "<Yellow>Otherworldly Blessing</>: When using spirit vision while in combat, the spirit vision effect is shortened to <Yellow>5 seconds</>, the spirit vision skill Перезарядка is extended to <Yellow>20 seconds</>, and you gain the blessing of spirit entities, restoring <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=1?3%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=2?4%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085022)=3?5%}</> of your maximum Health per second and increasing Снижение урона by <Yellow>*f**</>. \nThis healing effect is affected by Healing Reduction and Grievous Injury.",
    ["“赛琳娜，生日快乐，这是给你的礼物。”伊丽莎白将护符递给生日宴会的主角，赛琳娜立刻将它戴在了脖颈上。\n“谢谢你，伊丽莎白！我太喜欢这个护身符了。”赛琳娜握住了好朋友的手，高兴地摇晃着，“我现在感觉很放松，身体好像更健康了！”\n“你喜欢就好。”伊丽莎白微笑起来，然后陪好友一起去门口迎接客人。\n她想着，有机会一定要谢谢地下市场那位神秘的绅士，是他帮助自己挑选了这个最好的礼物。"] = "'Selina, happy birthday, this is a gift for you.' Elizabeth handed the amulet to the protagonist of the birthday party, and Selina immediately put it around her neck. \n 'Thank you, Elizabeth! I love this amulet so much.' Selina held her best friend's hand and shook it happily, 'I feel very relaxed now, my body seems to be healthier!' \n 'As long as you like it.' Elizabeth smiled, then accompanied her friend to the door to greet guests. \n She thought that if she had the chance, she must thank the mysterious gentleman in the underground market; it was he who helped her choose this best gift.",
    ["{{player.name}}在廷根的圣赛琳娜教堂开启了<Chat_Highlight>“神降”仪式</>，祈祷“愚者”先生的注视与恩赐。前往协助，或许也有机会获得祂的祝福。<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},444460680\">[前往协助]</>"] = "{{player.name}} has initiated a <Chat_Highlight>\"Divine Descent\" ritual</> at Saint Selena Cathedral in Тинген, praying for Mr. Fool's gaze and blessing. Go to assist, and perhaps you too will have a chance to receive His blessing. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},444460680\">[Go to Assist]</>",
    ["[Tarot Club Atmosphere] Barrier Fragment - Stained Glass"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Фрагмент Барьера – Витраж",
    ["……也许吧。但据我所知，高序列的材料会更加昂贵。"] = "……Perhaps. But as far as I know, materials for higher Последовательностьs are even more expensive.",
    ["<Red>脆弱</>：庇护效果结束时，纸人所承受溢出伤害的15%会重新作用到主人身上，并使主人在接下来的15秒内，受到伤害提高15%。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Fragile</>: When the Shelter effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage taken by the Бумажный человечек is reapplied to the owner, and the owner's damage taken is increased by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Viscountess, 1250309"] = "【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Viscountess, 1250309",
    ["“愚者”先生是得到所有教会认可的正神，塔罗学院的成功修建也是得益于他的帮助。"] = "Господин Дурак – истинный бог, признанный всеми церквями, и успешное строительство Академии Таро также произошло благодаря его помощи.",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】贝克兰德"] = "[Клуб Таро Atmosphere] Бэкланд",
    ["[PrintAppearanceData]: %s serialized field splitting failed, data length = %s"] = "[PrintAppearanceData]: не удалось разделить сериализованное поле %s, длина данных = %s",
    ["GTA枪反教学"] = "GTA Gun Parry Tutorial",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Affix Saving</>\nEquipment comes with random affixes when produced. \nWhen you obtain <Highlight>equipment with Beyonder affixes</>, the affix combination <Highlight>will be saved</>, and you can <Highlight>apply</> the saved affix combination in the \"Blessing\" section on the right side of the Reshape interface. \nFor parts where the Reshape function is not unlocked, <Highlight>you can still use</> this save and apply function. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Random Reshape</>\nFor parts where the Reshape function is unlocked, you can reshape the random affixes of equipped gear by consuming <Highlight>reshaping materials</>. After reshaping, the number of affixes and all affix <Highlight>attribute types and values</> will be randomized. \nTriggering multiple Beyonder affixes will grant additional Blessing effects, which vary depending on the different Beyonder affixes and the number of affixes. \nWhen replacing equipment, reshaped affixes are <Highlight>transferred without loss</> (does not take effect if the corresponding part is not equipped)."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Affix Saving</>\nEquipment comes with random affixes when produced. \nWhen you obtain <Highlight>equipment with Потусторонний affixes</>, the affix combination <Highlight>will be saved</>, and you can <Highlight>apply</> the saved affix combination in the \"Blessing\" section on the right side of the Reshape interface. \nFor parts where the Reshape function is not unlocked, <Highlight>you can still use</> this save and apply function. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Random Reshape</>\nFor parts where the Reshape function is unlocked, you can reshape the random affixes of equipped gear by consuming <Highlight>reshaping materials</>. After reshaping, the number of affixes and all affix <Highlight>attribute types and values</> will be randomized. \nTriggering multiple Потусторонний affixes will grant additional Blessing effects, which vary depending on the different Потусторонний affixes and the number of affixes. \nWhen replacing equipment, reshaped affixes are <Highlight>transferred without loss</> (does not take effect if the corresponding part is not equipped).",
    ["Sophia proposed a bold suggestion: if we make some improvements during the process of planting peas and add Beyonder influence, could they become a weapon? \n \n \n Cultivation prediction: \n First generation: Trap Pea * Striking Pea \n Second generation: All are Trap Peas \n Third generation: Trap and Striking Pea, Trap and Non-Striking Pea, Striking and No-Trap Pea, Non-Striking and No-Trap Pea... \n The planting and cultivation record... let's just do it like this: \n \"Research on the Mechanism of 'Harvest Priest' Abilities and Plant Hybridization: A Case Study of Trap Peas and Striking Peas\""] = "София выдвинула смелое предложение: если мы внесем некоторые улучшения в процесс посадки гороха и добавим влияние Потустороннего, смогут ли они стать оружием? \n \n \n Прогноз выращивания: \n Первое поколение: горох-ловушка * Горох-ловушка \n Второе поколение: все — горох-ловушка \n Третье поколение: горох-ловушка и горох, который горох-ловушка и не-ловушка, горох-ловушка и без ловушки, горох без ловушки и горох без ловушки... \n Записи о посадке и выращивании... давайте просто сделаем это так: \n \"Исследование механизма способностей «жреца урожая» и гибридизации растений: пример гороха-ловушки и гороха-ударника »",
    ["<P_Yellow>\"We are guardians, but also a group of poor wretches who are constantly fighting against danger and madness.\"</>"] = "<P_Yellow>\"Мы стражи, но также и группа бедняков, которые постоянно борются с опасностью и безумием.\"</>",
    ["<Yellow>Graze Soul</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows it to be devoured, causing different effects based on the soul owner's type: \nDevour Beyonder soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them, and by imprisoning their soul, gain one corresponding Sequence skill. Using this skill releases their soul: \n Warrior Sequence: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n Bard Sequence: <Yellow>Sun Oath</>; \n Apprentice Sequence: <Yellow>Nebula Chant</>; \n Spectator Sequence: <Yellow>Psychological Inculcation</>; \n Seer Sequence: <Yellow>Mystery Realm</>; \n Secrets Supplicant Sequence: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \n When Creeping Hunger's danger level increases, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nDevour monster soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them and gains the <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect for <Yellow>20</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Before the imprisoned soul is released, another soul cannot be stripped from its owner. A maximum of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls can be imprisoned simultaneously."] = "<Yellow>Graze Soul</>: After the wearer continuously attacks the main target for a period, they can strip its soul to their feet. Touching the soul within <Yellow>10 seconds</> allows it to be devoured, causing different effects based on the soul owner's type: \nDevour Потусторонний soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them, and by imprisoning their soul, gain one corresponding Последовательность skill. Using this skill releases their soul: \n Warrior Последовательность: <Yellow>Dawn Armor</>; \n Bard Последовательность: <Yellow>Sun Oath</>; \n Apprentice Последовательность: <Yellow>Nebula Chant</>; \n Зритель Последовательность: <Yellow>Psychological Inculcation</>; \n Провидец Последовательность: <Yellow>Mystery Realm</>; \n Secrets Supplicant Последовательность: <Yellow>Starlight Cage</>; \n When Creeping Hunger's danger level increases, the corresponding skill strength increases accordingly. \nDevour monster soul: Deals <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?*d}</> damage to them and gains the <Yellow>Soul Suppression</> effect for <Yellow>20</> seconds: buffdisc(*id)\n The soul stripping effect can trigger at most once every 20 seconds. Before the imprisoned soul is released, another soul cannot be stripped from its owner. A maximum of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=1?3}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=2?4}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085019)=3?5}</> souls can be imprisoned simultaneously.",
    ["Enum(全技能槽位)"] = "Enum (All Skill Slots)",
    ["“Suddenly, a cry of surprise: ‘There!’ Gehrman Sparrow had already leaped into the air, one shot, two shots, three shots…… along with the blooming of blood, the name of the Madman adventurer echoed!”"] = "«Вдруг крик удивления: «Вот!» Герман Воробей уже подпрыгнул в воздух, один выстрел, два выстрела, три выстрела…… вместе с кровотечением крови прозвучало имя Безумного авантюриста!»",
    ["Point B Trigger"] = "Point B Trigger",
    ["【Tarot Club】(3) Entire team +10% Attack Power +200 Health"] = "【Клуб Таро】(3) Вся команда +10% силы атаки +200 здоровья.",
    ["Boss Battle_Trigger_Initial"] = "Битва с боссом_Trigger_Initial",
    ["《仪式魔法进阶——向神明祈求之术》"] = "Advanced Ritual Magic: Techniques for Praying to Deities",
    ["Introduction to Mysticism, Encyclopedia of Charms, Secret History of the Fourth Epoch, so many books..."] = "Introduction to Mysticism, Encyclopedia of Charms, Secret History of the Fourth Epoch, so many books...",
    ["<img id=\"03\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>伤害：<HighLight>130%</>*攻击"] = "<img id=\"03\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\"/>Damage: <HighLight>130%</>* attack",
    ["Tab Selection Test Configuration - Distance Priority (Degraded 1) - Healer"] = "Конфигурация теста выбора вкладки — Приоритет расстояния (пониженный 1) — Целитель",
    ["{\"Slot Number\"=\"Skill ID\"}"] = "{\"Slot Number\"=\"Skill ID\"}",
    ["citywalk-河与海教堂祈祷（掉san）"] = "Citywalk - Pray at the Church of the River and Sea (Рассудок Loss)",
    ["did破防（一阶段）"] = "did Armor Break (Phase 1)",
    ["{ {skillType1, 1.0}, {skillType2, 2.0}} 意思是把skillType1的技能提升1倍速率，skillType2的技能提升2倍速率"] = "{ {skillType1, 1.0}, {skillType2, 2.0}} means increasing the speed of skillType1 skills by 1x and skillType2 skills by 2x.",
    ["Buff layers"] = "Buff layers",
    ["\"Magician\" Fors quietly took a breath and said:\n \"I would like to purchase the stomach of a Spirit Eater and 20ml of blood from a Deep Sea Marlin, paying with gold pounds.\"\n I still have 430 pounds, I can afford one... she encouraged herself silently.\n As for where the money for the other item would come from, she had no idea for the moment.\n This is one of the main reasons that restricts the advancement of many Beyonders... People really shouldn't try to consume beyond their own means. If it weren't for completely getting rid of the influence of the full moon's whispers and becoming a \"Faceless,\" having relatively rich extraordinary means, I wouldn't even consider advancement, or even touch this circle. I'd just write books, save money, drink tea, go shopping with Xio, and after she finishes that matter, travel to different places in the Northern and Southern Continents, not fearing danger or accidents, and enjoy life properly... Fors's thoughts suddenly wandered.\n\n — Volume 2: Faceless, Chapter 147: A Difficult Question"] = "\"Фокусник\" Fors quietly took a breath and said:\n \"I would like to purchase the stomach of a Spirit Eater and 20ml of blood from a Deep Sea Marlin, paying with gold pounds.\"\n I still have 430 pounds, I can afford one... she encouraged herself silently.\n As for where the money for the other item would come from, she had no idea for the moment.\n This is one of the main reasons that restricts the advancement of many Потустороннийs... People really shouldn't try to consume beyond their own means. If it weren't for completely getting rid of the influence of the full moon's whispers and becoming a \"Безликий,\" having relatively rich extraordinary means, I wouldn't even consider advancement, or even touch this circle. I'd just write books, save money, drink tea, go shopping with Xio, and after she finishes that matter, travel to different places in the Northern and Southern Continents, not fearing danger or accidents, and enjoy life properly... Fors's thoughts suddenly wandered.\n\n — Volume 2: Безликий, Chapter 147: A Difficult Question",
    ["【Tarot Club · Axe Knight】Tier 3 increment (+15%) → cumulative 114%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Рыцарь с топором】Прирост 3-го уровня (+15%) → совокупно 114%",
    ["【本相】梦魇命中敌方目标后令敌方目标在6秒内带有宁静光环，该光环可减少周围敌方目标技能抵挡。"] = "[True Form] After Кошмар hits an enemy target, it inflicts a Tranquility aura on the enemy target for 6 seconds. This aura reduces the Блок навыков of surrounding enemy targets.",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演观众】\n在金秋湖车站旁，你看到一个奇怪的人，他自称是一朵蘑菇。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Зритель】 \n Beside the Golden Autumn Lake station, you see a strange person who claims to be a mushroom.",
    ["{\n\"无\": \"\",\n\"击退\": \"HitBack\",\n\"击倒\": \"HitDown\",\n\"击飞\": \"HitFly\",\n\"挑空\": \"HitFloat\",\n\"拖拽\": \"HitDrag\",\n\"僵直\": \"HitStiff\"\n}"] = "{\n \"None\": \"\", \n \"Knockback\": \"HitBack\", \n \"Knockdown\": \"HitDown\", \n \"Knockup\": \"HitFly\", \n \"Launch\": \"HitFloat\", \n \"Pull\": \"HitDrag\", \n \"Stagger\": \"HitStiff\" \n}",
    ["……你投到过吗？"] = "...Have you ever cast it?",
    ["{\n\"无\": \"\",\n\"减速\": \"SpeedDown\",\n\"睡眠\": \"Sleep\",\n\"禁锢\": \"Stuck\",\n\"眩晕\": \"Dizzy\",\n\"沉默\": \"Silent\",\n\"恐惧\": \"CharTerror\",\n\"僵直\": \"Stiff\",\n\"滞涩\": \"DodgeLimit\"\n}"] = "{\n\"None\": \"\", \n\"Slow\": \"SpeedDown\", \n\"Slumber\": \"Sleep\", \n\"Imprisonment\": \"Stuck\", \n\"Stun\": \"Dizzy\", \n\"Silence\": \"Silent\", \n\"Horror\": \"CharTerror\", \n\"Stiff\": \"Stiff\", \n\"Stagnation\": \"DodgeLimit\"\n}",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Reader】 \n Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Reader】 \n Dr. Hope at the clinic has been frowning lately, seemingly troubled by something.",
    ["GVG高塔特效buff血皇"] = "GVG High Tower Effect Buff Blood Emperor",
    ["“未来号”大副，称号“毒素专家”，对生物研究有着极大的兴趣和高超的技术，培养出的神奇蘑菇为神弃之地的人们提供了更好的生存环境。"] = "Первый помощник «Будущего» по прозвищу «Эксперт по токсинам». Он проявляет большой интерес к биологическим исследованиям и владеет превосходными методами. Волшебные грибы, которые он выращивал, обеспечили лучшую среду обитания людям в Забытой Земле Богов.",
    ["GTA - Bonnie Finale - Benjamin generates shield"] = "GTA - Bonnie Finale - Benjamin generates shield",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>比赛规则</>\n赛场使用<Highlight>玩家真实属性</>，<Highlight>装备、封印物、秘偶、人脉、非凡天赋系统效果</>均可生效。玩家将以战队形式进行比赛，每个战队内同途径玩家最多为两名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>报名规则</>\n比赛报名开启后，玩家即可组建或加入战队，战队成员<Highlight>达到5名</>后即可报名。\n开启报名至锁定报名期间，战队队长可自由调整战队成员，成员也可自由离开战队，已报名战队若成员变动导致成员数量小于5名后将自动取消报名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>锁定规则</>\n锁定报名期间，已报名战队可以进入准备场地，未报名战队仍可以进行报名操作，玩家也可以加入战队，但不可以主动离开或队长请离战队，已报名战队将不允许取消报名。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>对战规则</>\n比赛正式开始后，玩家需要<Highlight>停留在准备场地</>以保证正常进入比赛，擅自离开准备场地将导致无法正常参加比赛。\n小组赛阶段，每轮随机匹配对手进行单局比赛，共进行六轮，根据胜场数选出16支队伍晋级，胜场数相同会根据<Highlight>荣耀值决出晋级者（荣耀值参考击杀数、战斗时长）</>。\n小组赛结束后进入助力阶段，淘汰赛开始前根据<Highlight>助力值和荣耀值总和</>确定淘汰赛位次，淘汰赛开始后仍可进行助力，但不再影响淘汰赛位次。\n淘汰赛阶段将进行<Highlight>三局两胜</>来确定胜负，决赛将进行<Highlight>五局三胜</>决出冠军！"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Match Rules </>\n The arena uses <Highlight> player's real attributes </>, and the effects of <Highlight> equipment, Запечатанный артефактs, Марионеткаs, connections, and Потусторонний talent systems </> are all effective. Players will compete as a team, with a maximum of two players of the same pathway per team. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Registration Rules </>\n Once match registration opens, players can form or join a team. Once a team <Highlight> reaches 5 members </>, they can register. \n From the opening of registration until it is locked, the team leader can freely adjust members, and members can freely leave. If a registered team's member count falls below 5 due to changes, registration will be automatically canceled. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Locking Rules </>\n During the registration lock period, registered teams can enter the preparation area. Unregistered teams can still register, and players can join teams, but they cannot leave or be removed by the leader. Registered teams cannot cancel their registration. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battle Rules </>\n After the match officially begins, players must <Highlight> stay in the preparation area </> to ensure they enter the match normally; leaving the preparation area without authorization will result in being unable to participate. \n In the group stage, opponents are randomly matched for a single-game match. There are six rounds in total, and 16 teams are selected to advance based on wins. If wins are tied, <Highlight> Glory Value (based on kills and combat duration) </> will determine the advancer. \n After the group stage, the support phase begins. Before the knockout stage, the knockout bracket is determined based on the <Highlight> sum of support value and Glory Value </>. Support can still be given after the knockout stage begins, but it will no longer affect the bracket. \n The knockout stage will use a <Highlight> best-of-three </> format to determine the winner, and the final will use a <Highlight> best-of-five </> format to determine the champion!",
    ["【副本】五月庄园·城堡·子爵夫人,1250309"] = "【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Viscountess, 1250309",
    ["[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your nightmares! This time, \"Alpha Wolf\" Luper has gone completely mad and bared his fangs at you."] = "[Hard Difficulty] has appeared. You can repeatedly challenge the enemies in your Кошмарs! This time, \"Alpha Wolf\" Luper has gone completely mad and bared his fangs at you.",
    ["【塔罗会·西尔维娅】档7增量(+30%)→累计220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Сильвия】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["[Insight] During the Current effect, the Current damage dealt to the target has a chance to fluctuate, with a fluctuation range of 100%-150%."] = "[Insight] During the Current effect, the Current damage dealt to the target has a chance to fluctuate, with a fluctuation range of 100%-150%.",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Shared Damage Warning Buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Shared Damage Warning Buff",
    ["{\"Quantity of %ist Spell Field\"}"] = "{\"Quantity of %ist Spell Field\"}",
    ["<h>Recall</> the Fortune-Turning Ritual"] = "<h>Recall</> the Fortune-Turning Ritual",
    ["【塔罗会】(5) 全队 +20%攻击力 +600生命 +5%暴击"] = "【Клуб Таро】(5) Вся команда +20% силы атаки +600 здоровья +5% критического удара",
    ["【Advancement】Sequence advancement cap increased to 7, 1250340"] = "【Advancement】Последовательность advancement cap increased to 7, 1250340",
    ["BOSS4-品质-治疗"] = "БОСС 4 – Качество – Исцеление",
    ["Grade B Animation:\nKlein recalled the divination from this period, a yellow crystal appeared in his mind, and he suddenly had some realizations."] = "Grade B Animation:\nKlein recalled the Гадание from this period, a yellow crystal appeared in his mind, and he suddenly had some realizations.",
    ["<P_Heart>（轻笑）</>累了吧？我一直看着你呢……看着你强撑清醒的样子，真让人，心疼。"] = "<P_Heart> (тихо посмеивается) </>TУстал? Я наблюдал за тобой... Наблюдать за тем, как ты изо всех сил пытаешься не заснуть, действительно душераздирающе.",
    ["The “Angel of Life”, He is the radiance of the Lord's wisdom, the undying spirituality within everyone, and the gift the Lord gives to the earth."] = "The “Angel of Life”, He is the radiance of the Lord's wisdom, the undying Духовность within everyone, and the gift the Lord gives to the earth.",
    ["<P_Heart> (That rat is a Beyonder!) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Эта крыса — Потусторонний!) </>",
    ["　　因突发事件和任务需要，现特批准许廷根市值夜者小队文职人员克莱恩·莫雷蒂先生成为非凡者：序列9“占卜家”。\n　　请协助克莱恩·莫雷蒂完成序列晋升。"] = "В связи с неожиданными событиями и требованиями миссии, г-н Клейн Моретти, гражданский сотрудник Тингенских Ночных Ястребов, настоящим удостоен звания Чрезвычайного: «Провидец» серии 9.\nПожалуйста, помогите Клейну Моретти в завершении его продвижения по последовательности.",
    ["[Placeholder] Klein made up his mind and decisively drank the potion in one gulp. \n Soon, he began to twitch uncontrollably, and his vision rapidly blurred."] = "[Placeholder] Klein made up his mind and decisively drank the potion in one gulp. \n Soon, he began to twitch uncontrollably, and his vision rapidly blurred.",
    ["Buff Tag List"] = "Buff Tag List",
    ["【Unlocked after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Seer】\n There is a small house on the old street in the East District. The owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night."] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Провидец】\n There is a small house on the old street in the East District. The owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.",
    ["<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month faction battle with the finally determined factions. Participate in activities such as <Highlight> Frostfall Lord, Strategic Server Hunting City Battle, Club Conquest Declaration, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to earn Club Divine Selection Points and compete for Divine Selection Seats based on weekly and final rankings. The Divine Selection Seats obtained by a club are distributed internally by the club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive strategic skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle situation. \n <Highlight> History Crystals: </> Players can use History Crystals to upgrade Sealed Artifacts to level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Beyonder materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server activities can earn Conquest Prestige, which can be used to increase your Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> Divine Selection Glory </> \n After the faction battle ends, the <Highlight> Victory Declaration Ceremony </> will begin. After the ceremony, Divine Selection Seat rewards and limited-time top luxury items will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, <Highlight> Trade Wars </> for this server will be opened based on each club's Divine Selection Points; stay tuned."] = "<Title> Faction Battle </> \n Clubs participating in the Strategic Server will start a one-month faction battle with the finally determined factions. Participate in activities such as <Highlight> Frostfall Lord, Strategic Server Hunting City Battle, Club Conquest Declaration, and Strategic Server Final Hunt </> to earn Club Divine Selection Points and compete for Divine Selection Seats based on weekly and final rankings. The Divine Selection Seats obtained by a club are distributed internally by the club management. \n \n <Title> Strategic Preparation </> \n This Strategic Server will open three exclusive strategic preparations: \n <Highlight> Strategic Skills: </> Each Pathway can obtain exclusive strategic skills; using them reasonably will have a significant impact on the battle situation. \n <Highlight> History Crystals: </> Players can use History Crystals to upgrade Запечатанный артефактs to level 1 and gradually unlock additional slots for equipping Потусторонний materials. \n <Highlight> Emperor's Journey: </> Participating in various Strategic Server activities can earn Conquest Prestige, which can be used to increase your Strategic Server military rank. \n <Highlight> The above preparations only take effect within the Strategic Server </>. \n \n <Title> Divine Selection Glory </> \n After the faction battle ends, the <Highlight> Victory Declaration Ceremony </> will begin. After the ceremony, Divine Selection Seat rewards and limited-time top luxury items will be distributed uniformly. Subsequently, <Highlight> Trade Wars </> for this server will be opened based on each club's Divine Selection Points; stay tuned.",
    ["【模型】风车-仪式"] = "[Model] Windmill-Ritual",
    ["【Rogue】放逐-法术代理"] = "[Rogue] Exile - Spell Proxy",
    ["<h>询问</>这些序列的信息"] = "<h>Ask</> about information on these Последовательностьs",
    ["skilldisc(*id)，随后化身残影，快速造成六次*d点伤害，期间buffdisc(*id)。*f秒后使律令爆发spellfielddisc(*id)。"] = "skilldisc(*id), then transform into an afterimage, quickly dealing six instances of *d damage, during which buffdisc(*id) is active. After *f seconds, cause the Law Judgment to explode, dealing spellfielddisc(*id).",
    ["{{\"第%i个按键的资源名\",\"对应的技能ID\",\"对应的键盘按键（仅可填Q/W/E/R/A/S/D/F之一）\"}}"] = "{{\"Resource name of the %ind button\", \"Corresponding Skill ID\", \"Corresponding keyboard key (can only be Q/W/E/R/A/S/D/F)\"}}",
    ["【完成主线·时代的浪潮，成为序列9后解锁，尝试扮演窥秘人】\n东区老街上有一间小屋，主人去世三个月了。邻居说每晚都能听见屋里有人翻东西的声音。"] = "【Complete Main Quest: Waves of the Era, unlock after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Подглядывающий за Тайнами】 \n There is a small house on the old street in the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.",
    ["Point E Trigger"] = "Point E Trigger",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Butterfly Appearance Buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Butterfly Appearance Buff",
    ["<Red>Volatility</>: Every 1 second during combat, the carrier will be infected with one of the 3 toxins at random, lasting 8 seconds. When the carrier infects an attacker, there is a 65% probability of prioritizing the transfer of toxins they are currently suffering from. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Volatility</>: Every 1 second during combat, the carrier will be infected with one of the 3 toxins at random, lasting 8 seconds. When the carrier infects an attacker, there is a 65% probability of prioritizing the transfer of toxins they are currently suffering from. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["“魔术师”小姐拜托你将一本新上市的小说转交给“月亮”先生。"] = "Miss Фокусник has asked you to pass a newly released novel to Mr. Moon.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a Club to participate in various Club activities, obtain rich event rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club shop.\nClubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs, which can be adjusted in the Club information modification section. Leisure Clubs will not display Beyonder ratings in the member list.\nClub member locking rules: During Club-based gameplay activities (such as Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), Clubs do not allow members to join or leave.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating a Responsive Club</>\nWhen your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a Club or create one yourself.\nCreating a Club requires paying a creation fee. If the number of responses reaches 4 within 24 hours after creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor active cancellation of creation will refund the creation fee."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a Club to participate in various Club activities, obtain rich event rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club shop.\nClubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs, which can be adjusted in the Club information modification section. Leisure Clubs will not display Потусторонний ratings in the member list.\nClub member locking rules: During Club-based gameplay activities (such as Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), Clubs do not allow members to join or leave.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating a Responsive Club</>\nWhen your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a Club or create one yourself.\nCreating a Club requires paying a creation fee. If the number of responses reaches 4 within 24 hours after creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor active cancellation of creation will refund the creation fee.",
    ["Trigger Entrance"] = "Trigger Entrance",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>理智值</>\n在非凡世界中行动时，各类事件将使玩家的理智值发生波动。当理智值持续降低，异常状态将从肉体开始，逐步向以太体、心智体、星灵体、精神体蔓延侵蚀，角色将依次进入不同程度的精神状态，并产生对应的效果。 \n\n理智值充足时，角色处于<Highlight>「心智锚定」</>状态，体力消耗下降且减伤提升；降至正常水平则进入<Highlight>「清醒」</>状态，该状态没有任何效果。\n\n随着理智值进一步下降，角色依次进入<Highlight>「心神不宁」「自我存疑」「低语缠身」</>状态，体力与冲刺稳定性受到不同程度的削弱，周遭将出现呓语干扰。\n\n当理智值降至较低区间，角色进入<Highlight>「陷入疯狂」</>状态，行动限制完全解除，伤害与受到伤害均有所提升。\n\n理智值跌至最低时，角色进入<Highlight>「失控边缘」</>状态，<Highlight>伤害提升</>，但受到伤害同步增加，且受到的治疗效果降低，自身发出红光，视野变得疯狂。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>恢复理智</>\n当理智值降至一定程度时，玩家可向安魂诗社成员寻求帮助以恢复理智值。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>失控</>\n若角色长时间处于「失控」状态而未得到净化，五体的侵蚀将持续加深，届时可能引发难以预料的严重后果。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Рассудок</>\nWhen acting in the Extraordinary World, various events will cause the player's Рассудок to fluctuate. As Рассудок continues to decrease, abnormal states will begin from the physical body and gradually erode the Ether Body, Mental Body, Astral Body, and Духовное тело. The character will enter different levels of mental states in Последовательность, producing corresponding effects. \n\nWhen Рассудок is sufficient, the character is in the <Highlight>\"Mental Anchor\"</> state, with reduced stamina consumption and increased Снижение урона; when it drops to a normal level, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Sober\"</> state, which has no effects. \n\nAs Рассудок decreases further, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Restlessness,\" \"Self-Doubt,\" and \"Whispers Haunting\"</> states in Последовательность. Stamina and sprint stability will be weakened to varying degrees, and whispers will appear to interfere with the surroundings. \n\nWhen Рассудок drops to a low range, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Falling into Безумие\"</> state; movement restrictions are completely lifted, and both damage dealt and damage received are increased. \n\nWhen Рассудок drops to the minimum, the character enters the <Highlight>\"Edge of Loss of Control\"</> state, <Highlight>Damage Increase</>, but damage received also increases, and healing effects received are reduced. The character emits a red glow, and their vision becomes frenzied. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Restore Рассудок</>\nWhen Рассудок drops to a certain level, players can seek help from members of the Requiem Poetry Society to restore Рассудок. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Loss of Control</>\nIf a character remains in a \"loss of control\" state for a long time without being purified, the erosion of the five bodies will continue to deepen, which may lead to unpredictable and serious conПоследовательностьs.",
    ["B级动画：\\n克莱恩回想着这段时间的占卜，脑中浮现出黄水晶，突然有一些感悟。"] = "Grade B Animation:\nKlein recalled the Гадание from this period, a yellow crystal appeared in his mind, and he suddenly had some realizations.",
    ["{\"标签%i清除Buff数量\"}"] = "{\"Tag%iClear Buff Count\"}",
    ["“工匠”……这是“通识者”途径的序列6，能够制作机械奇物和非凡物品。"] = "«Ремесленник»…… Это шестая последовательность Пути «Учёного», способная создавать чудеса механики и мистические предметы.",
    ["{{player.name}} rolled <Chat_Highlight>two consecutive critical successes!</> The stern laws of probability bow and concede before him."] = "{{player.name}} rolled <Chat_Highlight>two consecutive critical successes!</> The stern laws of probability bow and concede before him.",
    ["Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><沉默门徒></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Anti-Critical Hit increased.\""] = "Defense <Highlight>Mutated Material</> with the affix <Highlight><Disciple of Silence></>: \"All Skill levels +1, Anti-Critical Hit increased.\"",
    ["Due to unexpected events and mission requirements, Mr. Klein Moretti, a civilian staff member of the Tingen Nighthawks, is hereby specially approved to become an Extraordinary: Sequence 9 \"Seer\".\nPlease assist Klein Moretti in completing his sequence advancement."] = "В связи с неожиданными событиями и требованиями миссии, г-н Клейн Моретти, гражданский сотрудник Тингенских Ночных Ястребов, настоящим удостоен звания Чрезвычайного: «Провидец» серии 9.\nПожалуйста, помогите Клейну Моретти в завершении его продвижения по последовательности.",
    ["【62】体能"] = "[62] Physical fitness",
    ["<P_Heart> (Shocked) </> You... are the confessional?! <P_Heart> (Looking left and right) </> Where is the clergyman?"] = "<P_Heart> (в шоке) </> Ты... исповедальня?! <P_Heart> (Смотрит налево и направо) </> Где священнослужитель?",
    ["{\n \"No restriction\": \"0\", \n \"Restrict skill resurrection\": \"1\", \n \"Restrict self-function resurrection\": \"2\", \n \"Prohibit resurrection\": \"3\" \n}"] = "{\n \"No restriction\": \"0\", \n \"Restrict skill resurrection\": \"1\", \n \"Restrict self-function resurrection\": \"2\", \n \"Prohibit resurrection\": \"3\" \n}",
    ["Mr. “The Hanged Man”, how did you join the Tarot Club back then?"] = "Господин «Повешенный», как вы тогда вступили в Клуб Таро?",
    ["【Dungeon】Inheritance of Memory · Corruption, 1302526"] = "【Dungeon】Inheritance of Memory · Искажение, 1302526",
    ["Id (Detached Skill)."] = "Id (Detached Skill).",
    ["·非凡者每日可获得5次全人脉共享的邀约函集次数，最高累计15次（全人脉角色共享），但是需要非凡者解锁【愚者福音】才可使用该邀约函集次数。\n·非凡者与人脉角色快速互动时，优先消耗人脉本身的邀约函集次数，再消耗全人脉共享的次数。"] = "· Потустороннийs can obtain 5 invitation collection attempts shared across all contacts daily, up to a maximum of 15 (shared across all contacts), but this requires the Потусторонний to unlock [Fool's Gospel] to use these attempts. \n · When a Потусторонний performs quick interactions with a contact, the contact's own invitation collection attempts are consumed first, followed by the attempts shared across all contacts.",
    ["……殿下，这是一种血肉魔法，通过被吞食的方式让灵体寄生于他人体内，并逐渐控制吞食者的身体，达到灵体永生的目的……"] = "...Your Highness, this is a type of Flesh Magic. By being consumed, a spirit parasite enters another's body and gradually takes control of the host, achieving the goal of eternal life for the spirit...",
    ["Grade 0 Sealed Artifact?"] = "Grade 0 Запечатанный артефакт?",
    ["【右摇杆模式3】以自身为圆心对前方扇形造成效果，可释放连击技能，连击完成后进入冷却"] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] Deals effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center. Can release combo skills; enters Перезарядка after the combo is finished.",
    ["……污染已经清除，你可以走了。"] = "…The Искажение has been cleared; you may leave.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>俱乐部说明</>\n加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>创建响应俱乐部</>\n角色等级到达20级，可以选择加入俱乐部或自行创建俱乐部。\n创建俱乐部需要缴纳创建费用，创建后24小时内响应人数达到4人则创建成功，超时将创建失败。\n创建失败和主动取消创建，都不会返还创建费用。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a club to participate in various club activities, earn generous activity rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club Shop.\nClub Member Lock Rule: During club-based gameplay activities (such as the Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), clubs are not allowed to add or remove members.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating/Responding to a Club</>\nOnce your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a club or create one yourself.\nCreating a club requires a creation fee. If 4 people respond within 24 hours of creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor voluntary cancellation will refund the creation fee.",
    ["【塔罗会】(4) 全队 +15%攻击力 +400生命"] = "【Клуб Таро】(4) Вся команда +15% силы атаки +400 здоровья.",
    ["【02】拆散"] = "【02】 Break Up",
    ["【常驻触发】报纸"] = "[Permanent Trigger] Newspaper",
    ["Id(技能轮盘)"] = "Id (Skill Wheel).",
    ["“火种二号”，能窃取对方的非凡能力。"] = "“Fire Seed No. 2”, capable of stealing the target's Потусторонний powers.",
    ["“神降”仪式进度"] = "\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with {Bishop of War} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with {Bishop of War} entry",
    ["<Yellow>纸人庇护</>：主人受到致命伤害时，触发<Yellow>8</>秒的纸人庇护效果，期间纸人代主人承受过量伤害，提高主人的控制闪避<Yellow>*d</>和控制抵挡<Yellow>*d</>，使主人免疫移动速度降低效果。纸人承受的过量伤害总额不超过主人生命值上限的<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</>。达到上限时，庇护效果提前结束。\n庇护效果每120秒最多触发一次。"] = "<Yellow>Бумажный человечек Protection</>: When the master receives fatal damage, it triggers an <Yellow>8</>-second Бумажный человечек Protection effect. During this time, the Бумажный человечек absorbs excess damage for the master, increases the master's Control Dodge by <Yellow>*d</> and Control Block by <Yellow>*d</>, and makes the master immune to Скорость бега reduction effects. The total excess damage absorbed by the Бумажный человечек cannot exceed <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=1?56%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=2?70%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085026)=3?84%}</> of the master's maximum Health. When the limit is reached, the protection effect ends prematurely. \nThe protection effect can be triggered at most once every 120 seconds.",
    ["Enum (All Skill Slots including Empty)"] = "Enum (All Skill Slots including Empty)",
    ["……我的琴声能让人分手？"] = "……My piano playing can make people break up?",
    ["Clowns swarmed over, some performing by stepping on carriage wheels without falling, some crawling on huge leather balls, some throwing tennis balls into the sky, and catching them one by one with funny movements. \n Melissa watched these performances, her expression as calm as if the other party didn’t exist. Benson tried several times and cheered loudly, but couldn’t stir up his sister’s emotions, and he himself slowly became depressed. \n Klein pursed his lips, watching this scene from afar, wanting to approach but not daring to. \n Suddenly, he touched the wallet in his pocket and had an idea. \n Benson and Melissa continued to move forward, watching various performances in silence. \n After a while, they saw a clown painted with red, yellow, white, and other oil paints run over, first throwing tennis balls into the sky, and then when people’s attention was attracted to the air, he produced a bouquet of flowers from nowhere, a bouquet of Zinnia. \n This bouquet was brought to Melissa and Benson’s eyes, golden in color, symbolizing happiness. \n Melissa and Benson looked at the clown opposite with a slightly dazed look, only to see the corners of his mouth, which was full of red, yellow, white, and other oil paints, raised high, fixing a happy smile, an exaggerated smile, a funny smile. \n \n —— Volume 1: Clown, Chapter 213: Take Another Look"] = "Клоунs swarmed over, some performing by stepping on carriage wheels without falling, some crawling on huge leather balls, some throwing tennis balls into the sky, and catching them one by one with funny movements. \n Melissa watched these performances, her expression as calm as if the other party didn’t exist. Benson tried several times and cheered loudly, but couldn’t stir up his sister’s emotions, and he himself slowly became depressed. \n Klein pursed his lips, watching this scene from afar, wanting to approach but not daring to. \n Suddenly, he touched the wallet in his pocket and had an idea. \n Benson and Melissa continued to move forward, watching various performances in silence. \n After a while, they saw a Клоун painted with red, yellow, white, and other oil paints run over, first throwing tennis balls into the sky, and then when people’s attention was attracted to the air, he produced a bouquet of flowers from nowhere, a bouquet of Zinnia. \n This bouquet was brought to Melissa and Benson’s eyes, golden in color, symbolizing happiness. \n Melissa and Benson looked at the Клоун opposite with a slightly dazed look, only to see the corners of his mouth, which was full of red, yellow, white, and other oil paints, raised high, fixing a happy smile, an exaggerated smile, a funny smile. \n \n —— Volume 1: Клоун, Chapter 213: Take Another Look",
    ["【塔罗会·子嗣守护】档7增量(+30%)→累计220%"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】Прирост 7 уровня (+30%) → совокупно 220%",
    ["... \n \n Take the hair of the subject and the <Mark id=\"#159\"> hair </> of the caster, mix it 1:1 with the juice extracted from the roots of the Twin Grass and <InvHighlight> the blood from the caster's palm, </> and soak it overnight. Before sunrise, use this liquid to draw a magic circle and chant: \"Oh, stars that reflect each other, leave the established orbit. This star is dim, that star shines long.\" \n \n ... The fate is derailed, <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> and the one who must die is reborn. </>"] = "... \n \n Take the hair of the subject and the <Mark id=\"#159\"> hair </> of the caster, mix it 1:1 with the juice extracted from the roots of the Twin Grass and <InvHighlight> the blood from the caster's palm, </> and soak it overnight. Before sunrise, use this liquid to draw a magic circle and chant: \"Oh, stars that reflect each other, leave the established orbit. This star is dim, that star shines long.\" \n \n ... The fate is derailed, <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight\" id=\"#160\"> and the one who must die is reborn. </>",
    ["self：自己；\ntar：目标；\nbuffadder：Buff施加者；\ntarlist：目标清单黑板值；\nall：技能/法术场结算筛到的所有对象"] = "self: Self; \n tar: Target; \n buffadder: Buff applier; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by skill/Spell Field calculation.",
    ["【副本】五月庄园·城堡·困难,1250311"] = "【Dungeon】May Manor · Castle · Hard, 1250311",
    ["[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Barrier Fragment - Stained Glass"] = "[Tarot Academy Atmosphere] Barrier Fragment - Stained Glass",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Cultivation Recommendation </>\n 1. Based on the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> selected by the Beyonder, the Beyonder's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>, automatically recommend attributes with higher <Highlight>Expected Returns</> for the Beyonder's cultivation; \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Cultivation Attributes</> are calculated; some unshown attributes (such as Attack Speed Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> are simultaneously influenced by the <Highlight>Ability Improvement Magnitude</> of the attribute in the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> and the <Highlight>Cultivation Difficulty</>; \n 4. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> only consider the situation of a small increase in current attributes. After a large increase in some attributes (or when there is a large difference compared to the opponent's confrontation attributes), the returns will <Highlight>Significantly Increase</> or <Highlight>Significantly Decrease</>. The recommendation is for reference only."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Cultivation Recommendation </>\n 1. Based on the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> selected by the Потусторонний, the Потусторонний's <Highlight>Current Attributes</>, and the <Highlight>Attributes of the Opponent Target</>, automatically recommend attributes with higher <Highlight>Expected Returns</> for the Потусторонний's cultivation; \n 2. Only common <Highlight>Cultivation Attributes</> are calculated; some unshown attributes (such as Скорость атаки Boost, Shield Gain Boost) are not included in the calculation range; \n 3. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> are simultaneously influenced by the <Highlight>Ability Improvement Magnitude</> of the attribute in the <Highlight>Target Scenario</> and the <Highlight>Cultivation Difficulty</>; \n 4. <Highlight>Expected Returns</> only consider the situation of a small increase in current attributes. After a large increase in some attributes (or when there is a large difference compared to the opponent's confrontation attributes), the returns will <Highlight>Significantly Increase</> or <Highlight>Significantly Decrease</>. The recommendation is for reference only.",
    ["　　索菲亚提出来一个大胆的建议，如果种植豌豆的过程里进行一些改良，加入非凡影响，是不是可以变成一种武器？\n\n\n　　培育预测情况：\n　　第一代：陷阱豌豆*打人豌豆\n　　第二代：都是陷阱豌豆\n　　第三代：陷阱且打人豌豆、陷阱不打人豌豆、打人无陷阱豌豆、不打人也无陷阱豌豆……\n　　种植培育记录……就这样吧：\n　　《“丰收祭司”能力与植物杂交的机制研究：以陷阱豌豆和打人豌豆为例》"] = "София выдвинула смелое предложение: если мы внесем некоторые улучшения в процесс посадки гороха и добавим влияние Потустороннего, смогут ли они стать оружием? \n \n \n Прогноз выращивания: \n Первое поколение: горох-ловушка * Горох-ловушка \n Второе поколение: все — горох-ловушка \n Третье поколение: горох-ловушка и горох, который горох-ловушка и не-ловушка, горох-ловушка и без ловушки, горох без ловушки и горох без ловушки... \n Записи о посадке и выращивании... давайте просто сделаем это так: \n \"Исследование механизма способностей «жреца урожая» и гибридизации растений: пример гороха-ловушки и гороха-ударника »",
    ["Buff控制状态列表"] = "Buff Control State List",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>阵营与基础规则</>\n<Highlight>4家俱乐部</>同场竞技，每家俱乐部可以出战<Highlight>60名正式成员</>，单局共240名玩家展开激战。同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Highlight>16人</>，请合理规划阵容配置。每场比赛持续<Highlight>23分钟</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>胜负规则</>\n<Highlight>率先获得3000积分</>的俱乐部即刻锁定胜局；若对局结束时无人达到3000分，则按当前积分高低排定名次。积分相同时，依次比较<Highlight>总击杀数</>、<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>局内积分获取</>\n局内积分的唯一来源为<Highlight>占领守卫及守卫归属结算</>：首次占领守卫可获得<Highlight>50积分</>；每5秒进行一次小归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>1积分</>；每30秒进行一次大归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>18积分</>。<Highlight>守卫归属高倍积分结算</>将在比赛第4、8、12、16、20分钟随机刷新，并提前90秒预告。高倍结算期间，每个已占领守卫在大归属结算时可提供<Highlight>72积分或108积分</>，分别对应四倍与六倍积分收益，具体倍率根据刷新的守卫位置决定。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>守卫争夺</>\n地图中共设有<Highlight>5位守卫</>。完成对守卫最后一击的俱乐部将获得该守卫的控制权。占领成功后，守卫将立即重生并归属本方。守卫<Highlight>无法被治疗</>，但周围没有敌人时可以缓慢自动恢复生命。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>资源与指挥权限</>\n<Highlight>击败敌方玩家</>或<Highlight>占领守卫</>均可获得资源点，并自动积累<Highlight>士气等级</>。<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可以消耗资源点释放指挥技能。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>指挥技能</>\n<Highlight>克敌宣言</>：消耗1000资源点，使本方全体成员的全途径压制提高15%，持续20秒。冷却时间180秒。<Highlight>急行进军</>：消耗600资源点，使本方全体成员的移动速度提高60%，持续10秒。冷却时间120秒。<Highlight>归零敕令</>：消耗1500资源点，立即清除本方全体成员当前的复活等待；随后5秒内阵亡的本方成员同样可以立即复活。冷却时间240秒。<Highlight>召集传送</>：消耗2400资源点，将本方全体成员召集至指定集结点。冷却时间240秒。<Highlight>圣域庇佑</>：消耗1000资源点，使本方所有守卫恢复相当于其最大生命值50%的生命。冷却时间180秒。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Factions and Basic Rules </>\n<Highlight> 4 Clubs </> compete on the same field, with each Club fielding <Highlight> 60 official members </>, totaling 240 players in a single match. A single Pathway can have a maximum of <Highlight> 16 players </> from the same Club on the field; please plan your lineup configuration reasonably. Each match lasts <Highlight> 23 minutes </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n<Highlight> The first Club to reach 3000 points </> immediately secures victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is determined by the current points. If points are tied, the <Highlight> total kills </> and <Highlight> total Club Потусторонний rating </> are compared in order. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> In-Match Point Acquisition </>\n The only source of in-match points is <Highlight> occupying Guardians and Guardian ownership settlement </>: The first occupation of a Guardian grants <Highlight> 50 points </>; a minor ownership settlement occurs every 5 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 1 point </>; a major ownership settlement occurs every 30 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 18 points </>. <Highlight> High-multiplier Guardian ownership settlement </> will refresh randomly at the 4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes of the match, with a 90-second advance notice. During high-multiplier settlements, each occupied Guardian can provide <Highlight> 72 points or 108 points </> during the major ownership settlement, corresponding to four times and six times the point yield, respectively, with the specific multiplier determined by the refreshed Guardian location. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Guardian Contention </>\n There are <Highlight> 5 Guardians </> on the map. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian will gain control of it. After a successful occupation, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to your side. Guardians <Highlight> cannot be healed </>, but they can slowly recover Health automatically when there are no enemies nearby. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Resources and Command Authority </>\n<Highlight> Defeating enemy players </> or <Highlight> occupying Guardians </> will grant resource points and automatically accumulate <Highlight> Morale Level </>. <Highlight> The President, Vice President, and Council Members </> can consume resource points to unleash Command Skills. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Command Skills </>\n<Highlight> Declaration of Defeating the Enemy </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to increase the all-Pathway Suppression of all your members by 15% for 20 seconds. Перезарядка 180 seconds. <Highlight> Forced March </>: Consumes 600 resource points to increase the Скорость бега of all your members by 60% for 10 seconds. Перезарядка 120 seconds. <Highlight> Zero-Order Edict </>: Consumes 1500 resource points to immediately clear the current Resurrection wait time for all your members; members of your side who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds can also be resurrected immediately. Перезарядка 240 seconds. <Highlight> Summon Teleport </>: Consumes 2400 resource points to summon all your members to a designated assembly point. Перезарядка 240 seconds. <Highlight> Sanctuary Protection </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to restore 50% of the maximum Health of all your Guardians. Перезарядка 180 seconds. \n",
    ["...\n\n No residual Beyonder abilities have been found yet. The perpetrators who have been captured are all ordinary people, without <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Beyonder abilities </> or in possession of <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> mystical items </>, but it cannot be completely ruled out that this case did not involve <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Beyonders </>. It is proposed that the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Normal\" u=\"4\" id=\"#160\"> 5th, 6th, and 7th squads of the Special Operations Department of the Awwa County Police Department </> increase vigilance and strengthen patrols. \n\n..."] = "...\n\n No residual Потусторонний abilities have been found yet. The perpetrators who have been captured are all ordinary people, without <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Потусторонний abilities </> or in possession of <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> mystical items </>, but it cannot be completely ruled out that this case did not involve <Hide stylename=\"Transparent\" id=\"#161\"> Потустороннийs </>. It is proposed that the <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Normal\" u=\"4\" id=\"#160\"> 5th, 6th, and 7th squads of the Special Operations Department of the Awwa County Police Department </> increase vigilance and strengthen patrols. \n\n...",
    ["【占】玩家终于甩开了绯色洪流，到达了中央广场，弗莱已经在这里等候。\n绯红月色下，教授正在举行献祭仪式，疯狂的市民涌向广场中央，化作信息洪流献祭给母神。"] = "[Placeholder] The player finally shakes off the crimson torrent and reaches the Central Plaza, where Frye is already waiting.\n Under the crimson moonlight, the professor is holding a sacrifice ritual, and the crazed citizens are pouring into the center of the plaza, turning into a torrent of information to be sacrificed to the Mother Goddess.",
    ["“神降”仪式进度 %s%%"] = "\"Divine Descent\" ritual progress %s %%",
    ["[Right Stick Mode 3] Deals effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center. Can release combo skills; enters cooldown after the combo is finished."] = "[Right Stick Mode 3] Deals effects to a fan-shaped area in front with self as the center. Can release combo skills; enters Перезарядка after the combo is finished.",
    ["\"Declaration on the Distinction Between 'Sanguine' and 'Vampire'\""] = "\"Declaration on the Distinction Between 'Sanguine' and 'Vampire'\"",
    ["[Proof] Poetic aura duration increased by 1 second."] = "[Proof] Poetic aura duration increased by 1 second.",
    ["【Tarot Club · Maid】+10% Attack Power"] = "【Клуб Таро · Maid】+10% Attack Power",
    ["【副本】记忆的传承·污染,1302526"] = "【Dungeon】Inheritance of Memory · Искажение, 1302526",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Clown】 \n There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a clown performance."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Клоун】 \n There is a little girl in the children's ward who hasn't smiled in a long time. Her greatest wish is to see a Клоун performance.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <恐惧主教> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Bishop of Fear> trait",
    ["·激活本开关后，若封印物触发效果需额外按键手动施放，一键辅助启用时将自动释放该效果。\n·单独开启本开关仅解锁封印物触发效果的自动释放权限，仍需开启一键辅助功能方可正常生效。"] = "· After activating this switch, if a Запечатанный артефакт's triggered effect requires an additional manual button press, it will be automatically released when One-tap Support is enabled. \n · Turning on this switch alone only unlocks the automatic release permission for Запечатанный артефакт triggered effects; you still need to enable the One-tap Support function for it to take effect normally.",
    ["【完成晋升任务，晋升至序列7后解锁，尝试扮演巫师】\n午夜时分，居然还有营业的书店？"] = "【Unlock after completing the Advancement Quest and advancing to Последовательность 7, try acting as a Wizard】 \n At midnight, there's actually a bookstore still open?",
    ["GTA连环杀手破防"] = "GTA Serial Killer Armor Break",
    ["<h>Divinate if the warehouse is dangerous</>"] = "<h>Divinate if the warehouse is dangerous</>",
    ["【塔罗学派氛围】会议室-浮雕"] = "[Атмосфера Клуба Таро] Конференц-зал — Рельеф",
    ["tar: Target; \n self: Self; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by skill/Spell Field calculation."] = "tar: Target; \n self: Self; \n tarlist: Target list blackboard value; \n all: All objects filtered by skill/Spell Field calculation.",
    ["bOverrideAttackerSlomoTime为true时，攻击者SlomoTime必须配置且大于1e-4，当前值:%s"] = "Если bOverrideAttackerSlomoTime имеет значение true, SlomoTime злоумышленника должно быть настроено и быть больше 1e-4, текущее значение: %s.",
    ["<P_Heart>（魔药的关键不是掌握和挖掘，而是消化和扮演……是什么意思？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Ключ к зелью - не освоение и копание, а переваривание и действие... что это значит?)</>",
    [" Name: See Me \n Appearance Description: A <Letter_Highlight> transparent crystal </>, about the size of a thumb, clear and flawless. \n Ability Assessment: The holder can 'see' others' true emotions and surface thoughts. Continuous staring at the target can cause them to produce a brief 'sense of agreement', thereby subtly guiding the other party's behavior. \n Side Effect Warning: Each time it is used, the holder <Letter_Highlight> randomly loses </> a segment of their own <Letter_Highlight> memory </>. \n\n Note: Stolen three weeks ago; divination shows it is still in an <Letter_Highlight> active </> state."] = "Имя: Увидеть меня \n Внешний вид Описание: Прозрачный кристалл <Letter_Highlight> </> размером с большой палец, чистый и безупречный. \n Оценка способностей: обладатель может «видеть» истинные эмоции и поверхностные мысли других. Непрерывный взгляд на цель может вызвать у них кратковременное «чувство согласия», тем самым тонко управляя поведением другой стороны. \n Предупреждение о побочных эффектах: при каждом использовании владелец <Letter_Highlight> случайно теряет </> сегмент своей собственной памяти <Letter_Highlight> </>. \n\n Примечание: украдено три недели назад; гадание показывает, что он все еще находится в активном состоянии <Letter_Highlight> </>.",
    ["{{Mr.|Ms.}}, I used to be a magician, skilled at escaping from cages in front of everyone's eyes."] = "{{Mr.|Ms.}}, I used to be a Фокусник, skilled at escaping from cages in front of everyone's eyes.",
    ["Trigger 80% Max Health Shield when HP < 60%"] = "Trigger 80% Max Health Shield when HP < 60%",
    ["BOSS4-品质-左治疗"] = "BOSS4-Качество-Левое исцеление",
    ["【塔罗会·巨斧骑士】+30生命(代替吸血)"] = "【Клуб Таро · Рыцарь с топором】+30 здоровья (заменяет Вампиризм)",
    ["……战争带来的伤害仍未平息。"] = "……The damage caused by the war has yet to subside.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with <Wind-Blessed> trait"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with <Wind-Blessed> trait",
    ["\"We are Guardians, and also a group of poor wretches constantly fighting against danger and madness.\""] = "«Мы Стражи, а также группа несчастных, постоянно борющихся с опасностью и безумием».",
    ["{{player.name}}对{{targetPlayer.name}}进行了安魂，虽然出于好意，但手法略有欠缺，造成<Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</>点理智损失，好心帮了倒忙。"] = "{{player.name}} performed a Requiem on {{targetPlayer.name}}. Although well-intentioned, the technique was slightly lacking, causing <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.N}}</> Рассудок points of loss. A good deed that backfired.",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Beyonder \n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder + 1 Common \n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Common \n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Beyonder \n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Common \n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\nreturn Round(baseprice)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний \n            baseprice  = 150000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний + 1 Common \n            baseprice  = 70000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Common \n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний \n            baseprice  = 30000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Common \n            baseprice  = 10000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    baseprice = 10000\nelse\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\nreturn Round(baseprice)",
    ["[True Form] Each target hit by Grasp of Death. reduces own Cooldown by 1 second, up to 4 seconds. \n Each target hit by Grasp of Death. will extract a Soul Fragment from the target. After extracting 10 Soul Fragments, a Wraith is generated at the target's location. The Wraith performs a Soul Harvest after 3 seconds, dealing damage to surrounding targets. \n If the damage kills the target, it counts as extracting 2 fragments."] = "[True Form] Each target hit by Grasp of Death. reduces own Перезарядка by 1 second, up to 4 seconds. \n Each target hit by Grasp of Death. will extract a Soul Fragment from the target. After extracting 10 Soul Fragments, a Wraith is generated at the target's location. The Wraith performs a Soul Harvest after 3 seconds, dealing damage to surrounding targets. \n If the damage kills the target, it counts as extracting 2 fragments.",
    ["【家族副本】【火龙】冲击波预警"] = "[Family Dungeon] [Fire Dragon] Shockwave Warning",
    ["BOSS Armor Break Mark Buff"] = "БОСС: усиление отметки пробития брони",
    ["　　牢记以下五个步骤。\n第一步：深呼吸，眼神飘忽向上看。\n第二步：我看见了金色的光芒！\n第三步：描述守护灵——身披金甲，手持权杖，背后有光环。\n第四步：它说您三个月内会发大财。\n第五步：请客户为通灵仪式付费。"] = "Помните о следующих пяти шагах.\nШаг 1: Сделайте глубокий вдох, подняв глаза вверх.\nШаг 2: Я вижу золотой свет!\nШаг 3: Опишите Духа-Хранителя — одетого в золотые доспехи, держащего скипетр и нимб позади него.\nШаг 4: Там сказано, что вы заработаете состояние в течение трех месяцев.\nШаг 5: Попросите клиента заплатить за ритуал духовного медиумизма.",
    ["LuaList(IdGroup(技能))"] = "LuaList(IdGroup(Skill))",
    ["【Family Dungeon】【Fire Dragon】Poison Claw Target"] = "【Family Dungeon】【Fire Dragon】Poison Claw Target",
    ["【Advancement】Sequence 8, 1250340"] = "【Advancement】Последовательность 8, 1250340",
    ["【塔罗会·异化猎犬】档4增量(+25%)→累计140%"] = "【Клуба Таро · Чужая гончая】Прирост 4 уровня (+25%) → совокупно 140%",
    ["BOSS对坦克造成高额伤害，需要换人承伤！"] = "БОСС наносит высокий урон танку; нужно вращать человека, получающего урон!",
    ["<Red>钱多压身</>：携带者持有苦难财富超过20秒后，若依然处于战斗中，则会每隔10秒陷入持续5秒的不堪重负状态：降低*f**移动速度和*f**体力恢复速度。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机一条非凡物质词条属性失效。"] = "<Red>Wealth Burden</>: After the carrier has held Wealth of Misery for more than 20 seconds, if they are still in combat, they will fall into an Overburdened state lasting 5 seconds every 10 seconds: reducing *f** Скорость бега and *f** Stamina recovery speed. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["To 非凡者\n    我们是守护者，也是一群\n    时刻对抗着危险和疯狂的\n    可怜虫。\n                 爱潜水的乌贼"] = "To Потусторонний\n Мы - Стражи, а также группа бедняг\n, постоянно борющихся с опасностью и безумием. \n \n Кальмар, который любит нырять",
    ["<Red>Corruption Affixes</> can be purified into Normal or Beyonder Affixes via the gray fog"] = "<Red>Искажение Affixes</> can be purified into Normal or Потусторонний Affixes via the gray fog",
    ["In <Mark> TRPG </> gameplay, after rolling a <Mark> Critical Success </>, Attack increased by <Mark> 125 </>. <Mark>{1,1,（已生效）}</>"] = "In <Mark> TRPG </> gameplay, after rolling a <Mark> Critical Success </>, Attack increased by <Mark> 125 </>. <Mark>{1,1,(applied)}</>",
    ["　　Keep the following five steps in mind.\nStep 1: Take a deep breath, eyes drifting upward.\nStep 2: I see golden light!\nStep 3: Describe the Guardian Spirit—clad in golden armor, holding a scepter, with a halo behind it.\nStep 4: It says you will make a fortune within three months.\nStep 5: Please ask the client to pay for the Spirit Mediumship Ritual."] = "Помните о следующих пяти шагах.\nШаг 1: Сделайте глубокий вдох, подняв глаза вверх.\nШаг 2: Я вижу золотой свет!\nШаг 3: Опишите Духа-Хранителя — одетого в золотые доспехи, держащего скипетр и нимб позади него.\nШаг 4: Там сказано, что вы заработаете состояние в течение трех месяцев.\nШаг 5: Попросите клиента заплатить за ритуал духовного медиумизма.",
    ["<P_Yellow>小丑</>：那个家伙…总以为自己是非凡的主宰，不知道一次失误就是万丈深渊。"] = "<P_Yellow>Клоун</>: That guy... always thinks he is the master of the extraordinary, unaware that a single mistake is an abyss.",
    ["Ms. “Magician”, what were you like…… when you were a child?"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, what were you like…… when you were a child?",
    ["GTA-机械造物-回复霸体"] = "GTA - Mechanical Creation - Restore Суперброня",
    ["……我准备在你身上尝试一个新的仪式魔法了，你这个恶心的小家伙！"] = "...I am preparing to try a new Ritual Magic on you, you disgusting little thing!",
    ["... \n 1350 \n During a Beyonder gathering in Backlund, someone sold a \"<Mark id=\"#159\">Moon Puppet</>\" from the Pas River Valley in the Southern Continent, triggering a murder case. \n \n 1352 \n Fourteen students from the Tingen Technical College held an evil ritual in the suburbs, causing <Mark id=\"#159\"> plants </> to grow wildly at the scene, with only one survivor. \n \n 1353 \n A patch of graves burying the victims of the Backlund Smog was washed away by the river, and broken, old \"Moon Puppets\" were found in several empty graves. \n ..."] = "... \n 1350 \n During a Потусторонний gathering in Бэкланд, someone sold a \"<Mark id=\"#159\">Moon Марионетка</>\" from the Pas River Valley in the Southern Continent, triggering a murder case. \n \n 1352 \n Fourteen students from the Тинген Technical College held an evil ritual in the suburbs, causing <Mark id=\"#159\"> plants </> to grow wildly at the scene, with only one survivor. \n \n 1353 \n A patch of graves burying the victims of the Бэкланд Smog was washed away by the river, and broken, old \"Moon Марионеткаs\" were found in several empty graves. \n ...",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battlefield Background </>\n <Highlight> The apocalypse is near </>, corruption from the starry sky is closing in, and <Highlight> Beyonder incidents </> are frequent. Major Beyonder clubs have spontaneously organized joint drills, simulating confrontations in historical sandboxes to prepare for the coming crisis. The <Highlight> Four-Way League </> is the largest and most realistic training ground among them. <Highlight> Clubs </> compete in the same arena, vying not just for honor, but to hone the ability to <Highlight> protect humanity when the apocalypse arrives </>."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Battlefield Background </>\n <Highlight> The apocalypse is near </>, Искажение from the starry sky is closing in, and <Highlight> Потусторонний incidents </> are frequent. Major Потусторонний clubs have spontaneously organized joint drills, simulating confrontations in historical sandboxes to prepare for the coming crisis. The <Highlight> Four-Way League </> is the largest and most realistic training ground among them. <Highlight> Clubs </> compete in the same arena, vying not just for honor, but to hone the ability to <Highlight> protect humanity when the apocalypse arrives </>.",
    ["<Yellow>奥尔米尔的冠冕</>：将佩戴者的解控技能置换成更强大的<Yellow>荣耀之证</>：\n解除自身控制，进入4秒的<Yellow>光芒牢笼</>状态，期间获得<Yellow>霸体</>和<Yellow>50%</>减伤，将每次受到伤害里不超过生命值上限10%的部分，按<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</>倍反弹给攻击者（对8米外的目标，反弹伤害额外衰减，最多衰减至8米内的20%）。<Yellow>光芒牢笼</>结束时，对周身8米内的最多6名敌对目标造成<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</>点伤害，并对其施加持续<Yellow>10</>秒的<Yellow>眩目</>效果，使其攻击降低<Yellow>*d</>。\n技能冷却时间：30秒。"] = "<Yellow>Almir's Crown</>: Replaces the wearer's Control Break Skill with the more powerful <Yellow>Proof of Glory</>: \nRemoves all control effects from yourself and enter a 4-second <Yellow>Cage of Light</> state, during which you gain <Yellow>Суперброня</> and <Yellow>50%</> Снижение урона. Any portion of damage received that does not exceed 10% of your maximum Health is reflected back to the attacker at <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?0.6}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?0.75}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?0.9}</> times the value (for targets beyond 8 meters, the reflected damage is further reduced, down to a minimum of 20% of the damage within 8 meters). <Yellow>When the Cage of Light</> ends, deal <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085010)=3?*d}</> damage to up to 6 hostile targets within 8 meters, and apply a <Yellow>10</>-second <Yellow>Dazzle</> effect, reducing their Attack by <Yellow>*d</>. \nSkill Перезарядка: 30 seconds.",
    ["<Red>遗恨回响</>：身处战斗中时，携带者间歇性降低理智值，无法获得移动速度提升效果。\n<Red>尸骨诅咒</>：活化土地存在期间，携带者无法主动复活或被队友复活，如果尸体被强制净化，则活化土地只保留生命值恢复效果。\n<Red>排异</>：战斗中每隔30秒，随机两条非凡物质词条属性失效，持续15秒。"] = "<Red>Echo of Regret</>: While in combat, the carrier intermittently loses Рассудок and cannot gain Скорость бега boost effects. \n<Red>Bone Curse</>: While the activated land exists, the carrier cannot actively resurrect or be resurrected by teammates. If the corpse is forcibly purified, the activated land only retains the Health restoration effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Mr. Azik was actually able to bring me into the Underworld; his Beyonder level must be far beyond a Demigod.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Мистер Азик действительно смог привести меня в Подземный мир; его уровень Потустороннего, должно быть, намного выше полубога.) </>",
    ["LuaList(Enum(全技能槽位带空))"] = "LuaList(Enum(All Skill slots including empty))",
    ["Trigger 50% Max Health Shield when HP < 60%"] = "Trigger 50% Max Health Shield when HP < 60%",
    ["【Unlock after advancing to Sequence 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Tingen, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble..."] = "【Unlock after advancing to Последовательность 8, try acting as a Fighter】 \n On the streets of Тинген, an old man is sweeping the floor slowly. Two thugs walk toward him, seemingly looking for trouble...",
    ["“正义”小姐不好意思打扰一下，关于仪式魔法……我翻阅了许多资料，但总觉得纸上谈兵，难以真正把握其精髓。"] = "Мисс «Справедливость», извините за беспокойство по поводу Ритуальной Магии…… Я прочитала много материалов, но мне всегда кажется, что это просто пустые разговоры, и трудно по-настоящему уловить ее суть.",
    ["The requiem process has completely spiraled out of control, You's Sanity <Highlight>-5</>, <Highlight>塔莉娅·赫德森</>'s Sanity <Highlight>-10</>"] = "Процесс реквиема полностью вышел из-под контроля. Ваше здравомыслие <Highlight>-5</>; <Highlight>Thalia Hudson Разум </> <Highlight>-10</>.",
    ["【本相】仪式魔法在第3次伤害时，对于有死亡侵蚀效果的目标伤害额外提升150%，对于无死亡侵蚀的目标有16%概率附加死亡侵蚀效果。"] = "[True Form] On the 3rd hit of Ritual Magic, damage is increased by an additional 150% for targets with the Death Erosion effect, and there is a 16% chance to apply Death Erosion to targets without it.",
    ["“魔术师”：“正义”女士，按照计划，门已打开。"] = "\"Фокусник\": Miss Justice, according to the plan, the door has been opened.",
    ["{{player.name}}在廷根的圣赛琳娜教堂开启了<Chat_Highlight>“神降”仪式</>，祈祷黑夜女神的注视与恩赐。前往协助，或许也有机会获得祂的祝福。<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[前往协助]</>"] = "{{player.name}} has initiated a <Chat_Highlight>\"Divine Descent\" ritual</> at Saint Selena Cathedral in Тинген, praying for the Evernight Goddess's gaze and blessing. Go to assist, and perhaps you too will have a chance to receive Her blessing. <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"luxuryNavigation={{eventMessageParams.worldID}},227295011\">[Go to Assist]</>",
    ["<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The bearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the bearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the bearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, 1 stack is consumed per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the bearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed amount of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP."] = "<Yellow>Life Energy</>: The bearer gains 1 point of Life Energy every <Yellow>20 seconds</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 points. When the cumulative effective healing dealt by the bearer to themselves or friendly units exceeds <Yellow>50%</> of their own maximum HP, 1 point of Life Energy is consumed to apply 3 stacks of <Yellow>Flourishing Growth</> to the target for 10 seconds, and the bearer gains 1 <Yellow>Seed of Life</>, with a maximum capacity of 3 seeds. \n\n<Yellow>Flourishing Growth</>: When HP is not full, 1 stack is consumed per second to restore <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?*d}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?*d}</> HP. \n<Yellow>Seed of Life</>: When the bearer takes damage and their HP is below <Yellow>50%</>, 1 Seed of Life is automatically consumed to restore a fixed amount of <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=1?32%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=2?40%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085006)=3?48%}</> of their maximum HP.",
    ["“0”级封印物？！那伦纳德先生昨夜离开……"] = "Grade 0 Запечатанный артефакт?! Then Mr. Leonard left last night...",
    ["In <Mark> TRPG </> gameplay, after rolling a <Mark> Critical Success </>, Attack increased by <Mark> 125 </>. <Mark>{1,1,(applied)}</>"] = "In <Mark> TRPG </> gameplay, after rolling a <Mark> Critical Success </>, Attack increased by <Mark> 125 </>. <Mark>{1,1,(applied)}</>",
    ["MagicWall_大厅楼梯"] = "MagicWall_Hall stairs",
    ["【塔罗会·子嗣守护】+8双抗"] = "【Клуб Таро · Защита потомства】+8 двойное сопротивление",
    ["{\"Skill Tag%i\"}"] = "{\"Skill Tag%i\"}",
    ["……至少，你没有让她伤害其他人，防止了她的堕落，也保护了更多的廷根市民——作为守护者，你没有失职。"] = "…At the very least, you did not let her harm others, prevented her fall, and protected more Тинген citizens—as a guardian, you have not failed your duty.",
    ["“神降”仪式的材料都准备好后，我将陪同你一起开启仪式，见证奇迹般神降之时。"] = "After the materials for the “divine descent” ritual are all prepared, I will accompany you to start the ritual and witness the miraculous moment of divine descent.",
    ["【Rogue】意识操纵-法术代理"] = "[Rogue] Consciousness Manipulation - Spell Proxy",
    ["Recently, the Tingen City Police Department has received multiple reports of teenagers lighting candles in public restrooms and praying to an unknown deity calling themselves the \"Lord of the Restroom.\" The police remind citizens: Please establish correct beliefs and stay away from all unorthodox prayer activities."] = "Недавно в полицейское управление города Тинген поступило множество сообщений о том, что подростки зажигают свечи в общественных туалетах и ​​молятся неизвестному божеству, называющему себя «Повелителем туалета». Полиция напоминает гражданам: пожалуйста, придерживайтесь правильных убеждений и держитесь подальше от всех неортодоксальных молитвенных действий.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {沉默门徒} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with the {Disciple of Silence} entry",
    ["“黑皇帝”向你投来注视。"] = "The Black Emperor is casting his gaze upon you.",
    ["<P_Heart>（这里残留的非凡特性都被我清理干净了，伊琳不会再遇到危险。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (Здесь я очистил оставшиеся характеристики Потустороннего; Ирен больше не столкнется с опасностью.) </>",
    ["[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 40%."] = "[Proof] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 40%.",
    ["{\n \"Not specified type\": \"\", \n \"Neutral Buff\": \"0\", \n \"Buff\": \"1\", \n \"Debuff\": \"2\" \n}"] = "{\n \"Not specified type\": \"\", \n \"Neutral Buff\": \"0\", \n \"Buff\": \"1\", \n \"Debuff\": \"2\" \n}",
    ["<h>Divining the location of little Elliott</>"] = "<h>Divining the location of little Elliott</>",
    ["{{PlayerName}}！感谢女神让你出现。血腥屠夫的模仿者们控制了波拿巴，品鉴会是圈套，里面至少有两位序列8的非凡者。"] = "{{PlayerName}}! Thank the Goddess for letting you appear. The imitators of the Bloody Butcher have controlled Bonaparte. The tasting party is a trap, and there are at least two Последовательность 8 Потустороннийs inside.",
    ["On the last day of the year, the forest encountered a blizzard unseen in a century, and the Owl Elder called an emergency meeting. \n\n \"The snow above the northern cave has collapsed, and a family of hibernating bats lives inside. We cannot leave them be.\" \n\n All the animals fell silent; they generally did not associate with bats. Only Dunn had visited that cave last spring, but he had long forgotten what it looked like inside. \n\n \"Let's go!\" Daly jumped onto the tips of the antlers. \"Even if you lose your way inside, my singing can lead us to the right path.\" \n\n They entered the cave just like that. The structure inside was intricate and complex, and it took Dunn and Daly quite some effort to find the injured bat family. Just as they were preparing to leave the cave, a gale blew outside, and countless snowflakes were carried by the wind, blocking all light. Dunn tried several more directions. More desperate than not finding the exit was the increasingly weak breathing of the bat family. \n\n Daly flew to his ear and began to sing. The golden melody guided and soothed Dunn's somewhat restless mood, and he walked along the direction where the notes lit up. Ten meters, fifty meters, one hundred meters... There was still no light from the cave entrance in sight. Daly realized that the price of reaching the exit might be higher than imagined. \n\n Without hesitation. \n\n She flew higher, to a place where Dunn couldn't see clearly, singing until there were few feathers left on her back, and she began to fall. \n\n There was still no light in sight."] = "On the last day of the year, the forest encountered a blizzard unseen in a century, and the Owl Elder called an emergency meeting. \n\n \"The snow above the northern cave has collapsed, and a family of hibernating bats lives inside. We cannot leave them be.\" \n\n All the animals fell silent; they generally did not associate with bats. Only Dunn had visited that cave last spring, but he had long forgotten what it looked like inside. \n\n \"Let's go!\" Daly jumped onto the tips of the antlers. \"Even if you lose your way inside, my singing can lead us to the right path.\" \n\n They entered the cave just like that. The structure inside was intricate and complex, and it took Dunn and Daly quite some effort to find the injured bat family. Just as they were preparing to leave the cave, a gale blew outside, and countless snowflakes were carried by the wind, blocking all light. Dunn tried several more directions. More desperate than not finding the exit was the increasingly weak breathing of the bat family. \n\n Daly flew to his ear and began to sing. The golden melody guided and soothed Dunn's somewhat restless mood, and he walked along the direction where the notes lit up. Ten meters, fifty meters, one hundred meters... There was still no light from the cave entrance in sight. Daly realized that the price of reaching the exit might be higher than imagined. \n\n Without hesitation. \n\n She flew higher, to a place where Dunn couldn't see clearly, singing until there were few feathers left on her back, and she began to fall. \n\n There was still no light in sight.",
    ["<P_Heart> (I've cleaned up the remaining Beyonder characteristic here; Irene won't encounter any more danger.) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Здесь я очистил оставшиеся характеристики Потустороннего; Ирен больше не столкнется с опасностью.) </>",
    ["……然后我们全体冲上去，和龙大战了三百回合！"] = "...And then we all charge up and fight the dragon for three hundred rounds!",
    ["<P_Heart>(Shocked)</> You are that customer?! Then how could you be trapped in this Tarot card..."] = "<P_Heart>(в шоке)</> Ты тот клиент?! Тогда как же вы могли оказаться в ловушке этой карты Таро...",
    ["[Placeholder-QTE] Klein quickly constructs a wall of spirituality, sealing off the entire room."] = "[Placeholder-QTE] Klein quickly constructs a wall of Духовность, sealing off the entire room.",
    ["【放置】红月塔罗牌"] = "[Place] Red Moon Tarot Card",
