    ["BOSS进入免伤状态，请及时转火"] = "БОСС вошел в состояние иммунитета к урону, пожалуйста, немедленно поменяйте цели.",
    ["Boss Armor Break Unlocked"] = "Прорыв брони босса разблокирован",
    ["【May Manor Dungeon】Ancestor Armor - Healable mark"] = "【May Manor Dungeon】Ancestor Armor - Healable mark",
    ["<P_Heart>（这看起来像是某种仪式）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Это похоже на какой-то ритуал)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>(This looks like some kind of ritual)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Это похоже на какой-то ритуал)</>",
    ["[Tarot Club Atmosphere] Backlund"] = "[Клуб Таро Atmosphere] Бэкланд",
    ["“魔术师”小姐的新书"] = "Miss \"Фокусник\"'s new book",
    ["Text Block<HighLight>150 times</>Damage Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10% Damage Increase 10%"] = "Текстовый блок<HighLight>150 раз</>Damage Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10% Увеличение урона на 10%",
    ["“呜————”银制的哨子被吹响，像夜莺温柔的呢喃、像夏夜温煦的风。\n失控者停下攻击的动作，疯狂的眼眸中竟又凝起些许理智。\n他看到了所有的遗憾被弥补、所有的不堪被抹去、所有的悲伤还未涌起。他看到了另一种幸福的结局。\n做一场美梦吧，梦中的一切都还未堕落。\n永眠于美梦吧，把今生的痛苦就此掩埋。\n值夜者的猎魔子弹穿过了风，带走失控者的生命。异化后恐怖的身躯摇晃倒下，但是笑着的。\n“愿女神庇佑你。”队友收起枪祈祷，又摸了摸肩上亲昵落下的小鸟，“这件封印物真是无害，毕竟，谁会把这些鸟儿当做负面作用呢？”\n阿诺德拿出存放封印物的箱子，将夜莺银哨轻放了回去，妥帖地收在了身边。\n他身形挺拔、眼神坚定、笑声爽朗，像极了一个故人。\n“或许是因为，曾有一个温柔的灵魂栖息其中。”"] = "— Ууу… — Серебряный свисток раздался, как нежный ропот соловья, как теплый ветерок летней ночи. \nВышедший из-под контроля человек прекратил атаку, и в его безумных глазах застыл проблеск разума. \nОни увидели, как все сожаления были исправлены, все уродство исчезло, а вся печаль еще не возникла. Они увидели еще один счастливый конец. \nПриятной мечты; во сне еще ничего не упало. \nСпи вечно прекрасным сном и похорони боль этой жизни здесь. \nПуля Охотника на демонов Ночного Ястреба прошла сквозь ветер, забрав жизнь вышедшего из-под контроля человека. Ужасающее мутировавшее тело покачнулось и упало, но оно улыбалось. \n«Да защитит тебя Богиня». Товарищ по команде убрал пистолет и помолился, а затем погладил маленькую птичку, которая ласково приземлилась ему на плечо. «Этот Запечатанный Артефакт действительно безвреден; в конце концов, кто может считать этих птиц негативным эффектом?» \nАрнольд достал коробку для хранения Запечатанных Артефактов и аккуратно положил Соловьиный Серебряный Свисток обратно, надежно спрятав его. \nЕго фигура была прямой, глаза твердыми, а смех искренним, и он очень напоминал старого друга. \n\"Возможно, это потому, что когда-то в нём жила нежная душа.\"",
    ["“魔术师”女士，您的能力是怎么来的？"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, how did you obtain your powers?",
    ["Enum(子技能朝向)"] = "Enum (Sub-skill Orientation).",
    ["“海盗女王将贵族小姐按在墙上，邪笑道：‘就算你喊破喉咙也没人来救你的！’话音未落，格尔曼从天而降，逼退女王：‘放开她。’”"] = "«Королева пиратов прижала благородную даму к стене и ухмыльнулась: «Даже если ты будешь кричать до тех пор, пока у тебя не перебьется горло, никто не придет тебя спасти!» Прежде чем слова исчезли, Герман спустился с неба, заставив королеву отступить: «Отпусти ее».",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>词条保存</>\n装备在产出时，会带有随机词条。\n获得<Highlight>带有非凡词条</>的装备时，词条组合<Highlight>将被保存</>，可在重塑界面右侧的“恩赐”中<Highlight>应用</>已保存的词条组合。\n未开启重塑功能的部位，<Highlight>也可以使用</>该保存和应用功能。\n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>随机重塑</>\n开启重塑功能的部位，可对已穿戴装备的随机词条进行重塑，需要消耗<Highlight>重塑材料</>，重塑后将对词条数和所有词条的<Highlight>属性类型、数值</>进行一次随机。\n触发多个非凡词条后，将会获得额外的恩赐效果，不同非凡词条和词条数的恩赐效果有所不同。\n更换装备时，重塑词条<Highlight>无损转移</>（未穿戴对应部位装备时不生效）。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Affix Saving</>\nEquipment comes with random affixes when produced. \nWhen you obtain <Highlight>equipment with Потусторонний affixes</>, the affix combination <Highlight>will be saved</>, and you can <Highlight>apply</> the saved affix combination in the \"Blessing\" section on the right side of the Reshape interface. \nFor parts where the Reshape function is not unlocked, <Highlight>you can still use</> this save and apply function. \n\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Random Reshape</>\nFor parts where the Reshape function is unlocked, you can reshape the random affixes of equipped gear by consuming <Highlight>reshaping materials</>. After reshaping, the number of affixes and all affix <Highlight>attribute types and values</> will be randomized. \nTriggering multiple Потусторонний affixes will grant additional Blessing effects, which vary depending on the different Потусторонний affixes and the number of affixes. \nWhen replacing equipment, reshaped affixes are <Highlight>transferred without loss</> (does not take effect if the corresponding part is not equipped).",
    ["There was already a touch of madness in her eyes, and it looked like it wouldn't be long before her spirit body would be completely corrupted and she would lose control entirely. \n However, in Lovia's gaze at this moment, there was more reason and determination. \n She knew what she was doing, and she was very clear about her current state and her subsequent ending. \n In the howling wind, her collapsing body, along with the shadow \"cloak,\" fell onto the surface of the Dark Angel Sasrir. \n The wriggling flesh and blood eroded into it, and the thick shadows expanded rapidly, binding the two figures together. \n Without needing Lovia to speak, Colin Iliad already understood her intention and immediately roared in a low voice: \n \"Attack!\" \n Bang! \n His two Dawn Greatswords slashed through the void simultaneously, causing silver-white light to erupt around the entangled Lovia and the Dark Angel Sasrir. \n The palace shrouded in grim shadows suddenly brightened, and a huge ball of light filled with holy flames appeared out of thin air, enveloping the Dark Angel and Lovia within it, rapidly dissolving them and igniting their flesh. \n \"Sunlight\"! \n In this brilliant radiance, Lovia's pair of light gray eyes revealed substantial pain, and her voice echoed in a phantom and ethereal manner: \n \"I did not betray the City of Silver...\" \n \n —— Volume 6 \"Light Chaser\", Chapter 113, The Final Guard"] = "В ее глазах уже было легкое безумие, и казалось, что скоро ее духовное тело будет полностью испорчено, и она полностью потеряет контроль. \n Однако во взгляде Ловии в этот момент было больше разума и решимости. \n Она знала, что делает, и очень четко представляла себе свое нынешнее состояние и последующий конец. \n Под завывающим ветром ее рушащееся тело вместе с теневым «плащом» упало на поверхность Темного Ангела Сасрира. \n Извивающаяся плоть и кровь впились в него, и густые тени быстро расширились, связывая две фигуры вместе. \n Даже не нуждаясь в словах Ловии, Колин Илиада уже понял ее намерение и тут же проревел тихим голосом: \n «Атака!» \n Бац! \n Его два Больших Меча Зари одновременно пронзили пустоту, заставив серебристо-белый свет вспыхнуть вокруг запутанной Ловии и Темного Ангела Сасрира. \n Дворец, окутанный мрачными тенями, внезапно прояснился, и из воздуха появился огромный шар света, наполненный священным пламенем, окутывая Темного Ангела и Ловию, быстро растворяя их и воспламеняя их плоть. \n «Солнечный свет»! \n В этом блестящем сиянии пара светло-серых глаз Ловии выражала сильную боль, а ее голос эхом отдавался призрачным и неземным эхом: \n «Я не предавала Серебряный Город...» \n \n —— Том 6 «Охотник за светом», Глава 113, Последний страж",
    ["This {{先生|女士}}, thank you for discovering the abnormality. Perhaps it's not too late... It seems you also have an understanding of Beyonder powers?"] = "Этот {{Sir|Madam}}, спасибо за обнаружение аномалии. Возможно, еще не поздно... Кажется, ты тоже понимаешь силы Потустороннего?",
    ["I became a \"Savant.\" Relying on the power of the potion, I actually recalled all the knowledge I had learned before—physics, chemistry, and so on. \n Not only did I recall them, but I also deeply understood and mastered them. Haha, this is simply a \"profession\" tailor-made for an outsider like me; it maximizes my advantages! I must say, if I went back in this state, back to my senior year of high school, I would definitely become the top scholar. If I had more standardized and in-depth professional training, becoming a scientist wouldn't be too difficult a goal."] = "Я стал «Ученым». Опираясь на силу зелья, я фактически вспомнил все полученные ранее знания — физику, химию и так далее. \n Я не только запомнил их, но и глубоко понял и освоил. Ха-ха, это просто «профессия», созданная специально для такого постороннего человека, как я; это максимизирует мои преимущества! Должен сказать, что если бы я вернулся в этот штат, в последний год обучения в средней школе, я бы определенно стал лучшим учеником. Если бы у меня была более стандартизированная и глубокая профессиональная подготовка, стать ученым не было бы такой уж сложной задачей.",
    ["local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3非凡\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p50     = {score = 2325, min = 1.00, max = 1.20},\n            p70     = {score = 2595, min = 1.20, max = 1.40},\n            p90     = {score = 2865, min = 1.40, max = 1.60},\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡+1普通\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1790, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 2034, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 2278, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+2普通\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1255, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1473, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1691, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3普通\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 720, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 912, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1104, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2非凡\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1550, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1730, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1910, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡+1普通\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1015, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1169, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1323, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2普通\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 480, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 608, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 736, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1非凡\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 775, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 865, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 955, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1普通\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 240, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 304, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 368, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelseif $1 > data.p90.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p90.min, data.p90.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice + $4)"] = "local coeffData = {\n    [3] = {\n        [3] = {  -- 3 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p50     = {score = 2325, min = 1.00, max = 1.20},\n            p70     = {score = 2595, min = 1.20, max = 1.40},\n            p90     = {score = 2865, min = 1.40, max = 1.60},\n            baseprice  = 3000000\n        },\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний + 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1790, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 2034, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 2278, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 2000000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний + 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1255, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1473, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1691, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 500000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 3 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 720, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 912, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1104, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        }\n    },\n    [2] = {\n        [2] = {  -- 2 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1550, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1730, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1910, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 1500000\n        },\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний + 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 1015, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 1169, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 1323, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 200000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 2 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 480, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 608, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 736, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        }\n    },\n    [1] = {\n        [1] = {  -- 1 Потусторонний\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 775, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 865, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 955, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 100000\n        },\n        [0] = {  -- 1 Ordinary\n            Default = {min = 0.70, max = 0.90},\n            p50     = {score = 240, min = 0.90, max = 1.10},\n            p70     = {score = 304, min = 1.10, max = 1.30},\n            p90     = {score = 368, min = 1.30, max = 1.50},\n            baseprice  = 50000\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nlocal data = coeffData[$2] and coeffData[$2][$3]\n\nlocal minCoeff, maxCoeff, baseprice\nif not data  then\n    minCoeff = 0.5\n    maxCoeff = 1.5\n    baseprice = 10000000\nelseif $1 > data.p90.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p90.min, data.p90.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p70.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p70.min, data.p70.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelseif $1 > data.p50.score then\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.p50.min, data.p50.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nelse\n    minCoeff, maxCoeff = data.Default.min, data.Default.max\n    baseprice = data.baseprice\nend\n\nlocal step = 0.05\nlocal steps = Floor((maxCoeff - minCoeff) / step + 0.5)\nlocal randIndex = Random(0, steps)\nlocal result = minCoeff + randIndex * step\n\nreturn Round(Floor(result * 100 + 0.5) / 100 * baseprice + $4)",
    ["【浅见】梦魇命中目标后有30%基础概率附加滞涩，持续3秒，生成的仪式魔法附加5%减速。"] = "[Insight] After Кошмар hits a target, it has a 30% base chance to apply Stagnation for 3 seconds, and the generated Ritual Magic applies a 5% Slow.",
    ["L_IDLE = 101, -- Standing idle \n L_MOVE = 102, -- Movement, such as walk/run/sprint \n L_MOVE_TURN = 103, -- Move turn \n L_DODGE = 104, -- Dash \n L_JUMP = 105, -- Jump \n L_DROPPING = 106, -- Falling"] = "L_IDLE = 101, -- Standing idle \n L_MOVE = 102, -- Movement, such as walk/run/sprint \n L_MOVE_TURN = 103, -- Move turn \n L_DODGE = 104, -- Dash \n L_JUMP = 105, -- Jump \n L_DROPPING = 106, -- Falling",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛程安排</>\n<Highlight>首场四方联赛</>将在开服<Highlight>第一周周日中午12:00</>通过对俱乐部的综合评判划分赛区、分组，并于<Highlight>当日晚18:00</>公示赛区以及分组。联赛以<Highlight>每两场对阵为一轮</>，每一轮持续<Highlight>两周</>，开服第一周周日晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启首轮联赛（特殊），后续调整为每周六晚<Highlight>20:00</>开启四方联赛。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛制规则</>\n每轮比赛由两场对阵组成。每轮第一场开始前，本组第1、2名，第3、4名，第5、6名以及第7、8名将分别进入不同的比赛小组，并在满足该规则的前提下<Highlight>随机分配</>。第一场比赛结束后，各比赛小组<Highlight>前2名进入胜者组</>，后2名进入败者组。第二场比赛将分别进行胜者组与败者组对决，并根据比赛结果确定本轮<Highlight>第1至第8名</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>晋降级规则</>\n每轮第二场比赛结束后，将于当周周六21:00进行本轮晋降级：<Highlight>圣名组及圣名组以上</>分组内前两名晋级上一分组，末两名降级至下一分组；<Highlight>英杰组及英杰组以下</>组内第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组。其中<Highlight>传奇组、史诗组、旅者组</>为特殊分组：传奇组第一、二名晋升一组，第六、七名均降一组，第八名降两组；史诗组第一、二名晋升一组，第七名降级一组，第八名降级两组；旅者组第一名晋升两组，第二名晋升一组，第七、八名降级两组；挑战者组第一名晋升两组，第二、三名晋升一组。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>联盟组规则</>\n排名在旅者组之后的俱乐部将根据<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>划分至<Highlight>挑战者组</>（前八名）及后续<Highlight>联盟组</>（<Highlight>联盟组不参与升降级</>）。联盟组的俱乐部将在每场联赛开始前<Highlight>自动匹配</>其它俱乐部组成联盟，以联盟形式参与四方联赛，联盟内<Highlight>所有俱乐部成员</>均可入场参战，联盟中<Highlight>排名最高俱乐部的会长</>将在局内自动获得<Highlight>联赛指挥权限</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>赛季重置</>\n每个新赛季开始时联赛将<Highlight>重新划分赛区</>，届时将按照<Highlight>上一赛季联赛成绩</>重新匹配对手构建新的赛区。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Schedule </> \n <Highlight> The first Four-Way League </> will divide divisions and groups based on a comprehensive evaluation of clubs on <Highlight> the Sunday at 12:00 PM of the first week </> after the server opens, and the divisions and groups will be announced at <Highlight> 6:00 PM that same day </>. The league consists of <Highlight> two matches per round </>, with each round lasting <Highlight> two weeks </>. The first round of the league (special) will start at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </> on the Sunday of the first week, and subsequent Four-Way Leagues will be adjusted to start every Saturday at <Highlight> 8:00 PM </>. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Tournament Rules </> \n Each round consists of two matches. Before the first match of each round, the 1st/2nd, 3rd/4th, 5th/6th, and 7th/8th place teams in the group will be placed into different match groups and <Highlight> randomly assigned </>, provided this rule is met. After the first match, the <Highlight> top 2 </> of each match group enter the Winners' Bracket, and the bottom 2 enter the Losers' Bracket. The second match will feature matchups within the Winners' and Losers' Brackets respectively, and the <Highlight> 1st to 8th place </> for the round will be determined based on the results. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Promotion and Relegation Rules </> \n After the second match of each round, promotion and relegation for the round will take place on Saturday at 9:00 PM: <Highlight> For the Holy Name Group and above </>, the top two in the group promote to the higher group, and the bottom two relegate to the lower group; <Highlight> For the Hero Group and below </>, the first place in the group promotes two groups, the second place promotes one group, the seventh place relegates one group, and the eighth place relegates two groups. Among them, <Highlight> Legendary Group, Epic Group, and Traveler Group </> are special groups: Legendary Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 6th and 7th both relegate one group, 8th relegates two groups; Epic Group 1st and 2nd promote one group, 7th relegates one group, 8th relegates two groups; Traveler Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd promotes one group, 7th and 8th relegate two groups; Challenger Group 1st promotes two groups, 2nd and 3rd promote one group. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Alliance Group Rules </> \n Clubs ranked after the Traveler Group will be divided into the <Highlight> Challenger Group </> (top eight) and subsequent <Highlight> Alliance Group </> (<Highlight> Alliance Group does not participate in promotion/relegation </>) based on <Highlight> total club Потусторонний rating </>. Before each league match, clubs in the Alliance Group will <Highlight> automatically match </> with other clubs to form an alliance and participate in the Four-Way League as an alliance. <Highlight> All club members </> in the alliance can enter the battlefield, and the <Highlight> President of the highest-ranked club </> in the alliance will automatically receive <Highlight> league command authority </> in the match. \n <img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/> <Title> Season Reset </> \n At the start of each new season, the league will <Highlight> re-divide divisions </>, and opponents will be re-matched to construct new divisions based on <Highlight> the previous season's league results </>. \n",
    ["Miss Magician has asked you to pass a newly released novel to Mr. Moon."] = "Miss Фокусник has asked you to pass a newly released novel to Mr. Moon.",
    ["Obtain 1 Beyonder material with the {Disciple of Silence} entry"] = "Obtain 1 Потусторонний material with the {Disciple of Silence} entry",
    ["…For an ordinary person to investigate a Beyonder who has lost control, you should be thankful you are still alive. Let me check your condition."] = "…For an ordinary person to investigate a Потусторонний who has lost control, you should be thankful you are still alive. Let me check your condition.",
    ["[LV3] [Marionette Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill"] = "[LV3] [Марионетка Skill] Tracking Magic Bullet - Agent Main Skill",
    ["The requiem process has completely spiraled out of control. Your Sanity <Highlight>-5</>; <Highlight>Thalia Hudson</>'s Sanity <Highlight>-10</>."] = "Процесс реквиема полностью вышел из-под контроля. Ваше здравомыслие <Highlight>-5</>; <Highlight>Thalia Hudson Разум </> <Highlight>-10</>.",
    ["【暂代】有人突然高举双手，有人的躯体僵硬地扭曲，开始攻击周围人。人群发出尖叫，四散开来。"] = "[Placeholder] Someone suddenly raises their hands, while others' bodies twist stiffly and begin to attack those around them. The crowd screams and scatters.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Beyonders are divided into two factions. Each match lasts <Highlight> 4 minutes </>. The side with the higher score at the end wins. If scores are tied, the number of kills and then damage dealt are compared; the higher side wins. If all are tied, a random side wins. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mechanism Explanation </>\n<Highlight> Score Acquisition: </> Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete. \n<Highlight> Anchor Convergence: </> Anchor points will appear in the match and last for <Highlight> 15 seconds </>. Based on the <Highlight> required number of people </>, enter the anchor point. Once the requirement is met and held for <Highlight> 3 seconds </>, Beyonders of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Beyonders will receive a temporary attribute bonus. \n<Highlight> Vortex of Strife: </> A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight> countdown ends </>, Beyonders remaining in the vortex will split the points equally. \n<Highlight> Buff Orbs: </> Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield; picking them up grants <Highlight> points and attribute bonuses </>. \n<Highlight> Fate Mushrooms: </> In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Beyonders will drop Fate Mushrooms after dying three consecutive times: allies drop green Fate Mushrooms with Abundance power, which restore health when picked up; enemies drop red Fate Mushrooms with Destruction power, which deduct health when picked up. Please distinguish carefully before picking them up."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mode Introduction </>\n In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs are divided into two factions. Each match lasts <Highlight> 4 minutes </>. The side with the higher score at the end wins. If scores are tied, the number of kills and then damage dealt are compared; the higher side wins. If all are tied, a random side wins. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Mechanism Explanation </>\n<Highlight> Score Acquisition: </> Can be obtained by picking up buff orbs, kills, assists, and entering the Vortex of Strife to compete. \n<Highlight> Anchor Convergence: </> Anchor points will appear in the match and last for <Highlight> 15 seconds </>. Based on the <Highlight> required number of people </>, enter the anchor point. Once the requirement is met and held for <Highlight> 3 seconds </>, Потустороннийs of that faction will be assembled there, and participating Потустороннийs will receive a temporary attribute bonus. \n<Highlight> Vortex of Strife: </> A Vortex of Strife will appear in the middle of the battlefield. When the <Highlight> countdown ends </>, Потустороннийs remaining in the vortex will split the points equally. \n<Highlight> Buff Orbs: </> Buff orbs will appear on the battlefield; picking them up grants <Highlight> points and attribute bonuses </>. \n<Highlight> Fate Mushrooms: </> In the Moment of Fate battlefield, Потустороннийs will drop Fate Mushrooms after dying three consecutive times: allies drop green Fate Mushrooms with Abundance power, which restore health when picked up; enemies drop red Fate Mushrooms with Destruction power, which deduct health when picked up. Please distinguish carefully before picking them up.",
    ["bufflayer决定对应3dUI"] = "Слой баффа определяет соответствующий 3D-интерфейс.",
    ["{\"技能ID%i\"}"] = "{\"Skill ID%i\"}",
    ["<Red>Starry Corruption</>: Firing bullets will apply the Star Plague effect to yourself: take 1% of maximum Health as damage every 2 seconds for 10 seconds, and this effect can stack up to 3 layers; \n<Red>Corrosiveness</>: The Venom Splash effect also applies to yourself; \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Starry Искажение</>: Firing bullets will apply the Star Plague effect to yourself: take 1% of maximum Health as damage every 2 seconds for 10 seconds, and this effect can stack up to 3 layers; \n<Red>Corrosiveness</>: The Venom Splash effect also applies to yourself; \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["\"The pure white one sleeping in the red cocoon, the divine child who rules over rebirth and corruption, the final possibility of the apocalypse.\""] = "\"The pure white one sleeping in the red cocoon, the divine child who rules over rebirth and Искажение, the final possibility of the apocalypse.\"",
    ["[Permanent Trigger] Newspaper"] = "[Permanent Trigger] Newspaper",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Beyonder Build</>\nA Beyonder build is a combination of character skills, talents, and Sealed Artifacts. The current build changes in real-time based on your current setup. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Build Switch</>\nAfter saving a specific setup as a build, you can switch builds to change your current setup with one tap. Builds cannot be switched during combat. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Recommended Builds</>\nRecommended builds include various setups for this pathway, which can be applied to your own build with one tap."] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Потусторонний Build</>\nБилд Потусторонний представляет собой комбинацию навыков персонажа, талантов и запечатанных артефактов. Текущая сборка меняется в режиме реального времени в зависимости от ваших текущих настроек. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Build Switch</>\nПосле сохранения определенной настройки в качестве сборки вы можете переключать сборки, чтобы изменить текущую настройку одним нажатием. Сборки нельзя переключать во время боя. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Рекомендуемые сборки</>\nРекомендуемые сборки включают в себя различные настройки для этого пути, которые можно применить к вашей собственной сборке одним нажатием.",
    ["GVG高塔特效buff冥皇"] = "GVG High Tower Effect Buff Underworld Emperor",
    ["【五月庄园普通】管家-囚笼-非奶T"] = "[May Manor Normal] Butler - Cage - Non-Healer/T",
    ["【Unlocked after becoming Sequence 9, try acting as a Diviner】\n In the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands under the wishing tree, looking around anxiously..."] = "【Unlocked after becoming Последовательность 9, try acting as a Diviner】\n In the Hornacis Sea of Flowers, a lady stands under the wishing tree, looking around anxiously...",
    ["<Red>Echo of Regret</>: While in combat, the carrier intermittently loses sanity and cannot gain movement speed boost effects. \n<Red>Bone Curse</>: While the activated land exists, the carrier cannot actively resurrect or be resurrected by teammates. If the corpse is forcibly purified, the activated land only retains the Health restoration effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Beyonder material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds."] = "<Red>Echo of Regret</>: While in combat, the carrier intermittently loses Рассудок and cannot gain Скорость бега boost effects. \n<Red>Bone Curse</>: While the activated land exists, the carrier cannot actively resurrect or be resurrected by teammates. If the corpse is forcibly purified, the activated land only retains the Health restoration effect. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds during combat, two random Потусторонний material attributes become ineffective for 15 seconds.",
    ["The Church of the God of Steam and Machinery gave me two choices, the start of two Sequence pathways: one is \"Savant,\" which belongs to the complete sequence chain they possess themselves, and the other is \"Mystery Pryer,\" obtained from the Moses Ascetic Order, which lacks higher sequences."] = "Церковь Бога Парохода и Машин предоставила мне два выбора, начало двух путей Последовательности: один — «Савант», который принадлежит к полной цепочке последовательностей, которой они сами обладают, и другой — «Таинственный Жрец», полученный от Аскетического Ордена Моисея, в котором отсутствуют более высокие последовательности.",
    ["Both parties hereby agree to the complete transfer of the small castle territory under the name to <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </>: \n\n From the date of signing this contract, <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </> shall obtain full ownership, exclusive usage rights, and autonomous management rights of the territory. \n\n The territory shall be held permanently and freely disposed of by <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </>; all income, output, and future appreciation generated by the territory shall belong exclusively to <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </>. \n\n This contract is a permanent transfer, effective upon signing by both parties, and holds irrevocable legal force."] = "Both parties hereby agree to the complete transfer of the small castle territory under the name to <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </>: \n\n From the date of signing this contract, <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </> shall obtain full ownership, exclusive usage rights, and autonomous management rights of the territory. \n\n The territory shall be held permanently and freely disposed of by <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </>; all income, output, and future appreciation generated by the territory shall belong exclusively to <TarotTextCurrent> {{PlayerName}} </>. \n\n This contract is a permanent transfer, effective upon signing by both parties, and holds irrevocable legal force.",
    ["[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Moving Shield Break Buff"] = "[May Manor] - [Believer Number One] - Moving Shield Break Buff",
    ["Hello, {{先生|女士}}. As you can see, I am researching a... magical bill regarding sewage treatment."] = "Hello, {{sir|madam}}. As you can see, I am researching a... magical bill regarding sewage treatment.",
    ["Thank you, Magician {{先生|女士}}."] = "Спасибо, Волшебник {{Sir|Madam}}.",
    ["[Empirical] Recovery amount increased by 10%, not exceeding 22% of the caster's maximum health."] = "[Empirical] Recovery amount increased by 10%, not exceeding 22% of the caster's maximum health.",
    ["<Yellow>窥伺冥界</>：携带者获得技能<Yellow>黄昏面具</>：戴上面具，沉入现实和冥界的交界处，在无休止的尖啸刺激下，强化所有战斗技能，提升其<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</>攻击速度，每秒返还其冷却时间<Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28秒}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32秒}</>。携带者可承受<Yellow>20秒</>，期间若造成击杀或助攻，则能延长承受时间<Yellow>5秒</>，延长效果最多可触发<Yellow>2次</>。\n技能冷却时间：60秒。"] = "<Yellow>Peering into the Underworld</>: The wearer gains the skill <Yellow>Twilight Mask</>: Put on the mask to sink into the boundary between reality and the Underworld. Under the endless Screech Stimulation, all Боевой навыкs are strengthened, their <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?36%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?45%}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?54%}</> Скорость атаки is increased, and their Перезарядка time is refunded by <Yellow>{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=1?0.24 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=2?0.28 seconds}{CheckStar(Type=\"sealed\",ID=2085018)=3?0.32 seconds}</> per second. The wearer can endure this for <Yellow>20 seconds</>; during this period, scoring a kill or assist extends the endurance time by <Yellow>5 seconds</>, and the extension effect can trigger at most <Yellow>2 times</>. \nSkill Перезарядка: 60 seconds.",
    ["Ms. “Magician”, to you, what kind of existence is Mr. “Fool”?"] = "Ms. “Фокусник”, to you, what kind of existence is Mr. “Fool”?",
    ["trigger2号"] = "Trigger No. 2",
    ["did给玩家处决技能2"] = "did Grants Player Execution Skill 2",
    ["BOSS 4 - Quality - Needs Attack"] = "БОСС 4 — Качество — требует атаки",
    ["<Red>Fragile</>: When the Shelter effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage taken by the Paper Figurine is reapplied to the owner, and the owner's damage taken is increased by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Beyonder material attribute becomes ineffective."] = "<Red>Fragile</>: When the Shelter effect ends, 15% of the overflow damage taken by the Бумажный человечек is reapplied to the owner, and the owner's damage taken is increased by 15% for the next 15 seconds. \n<Red>Rejection</>: Every 30 seconds in combat, one random Потусторонний material attribute becomes ineffective.",
    ["【秘偶技】命运湍流-白"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Fate Turbulence - White",
    ["[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark Dispersion for Targets without Diffusion Buff"] = "[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark Dispersion for Targets without Diffusion Buff",
    ["一枚泛着星空色泽的古老钱币，能够通过精神体响应灵界、星空。上面镌刻着来自亚伯拉罕家族天使绘制的隐秘铭文，每一次使用如同开启一场星空漫游，能够为使用者带来旅途中的见闻与收获。"] = "An ancient coin with the luster of the starry sky, capable of responding to the Spirit World and the cosmos through the Духовное тело. Engraved with secret inscriptions drawn by an Angel of the Abraham family, each use is like starting a journey through the stars, bringing the user insights and gains from the journey.",
    ["A heavy, sturdy small box containing some strange materials: tin cans with silver patterns, test tubes filled with black powder, dark vials, and more. The materials are arranged neatly, and the box has a label that reads \"Seer Potion Materials.\""] = "A heavy, sturdy small box containing some strange materials: tin cans with silver patterns, test tubes filled with black powder, dark vials, and more. The materials are arranged neatly, and the box has a label that reads \"Провидец Potion Materials.\"",
    ["【金秋湖-困难】-德鲁伊-无治疗点无分摊的dps"] = "[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark DPS without Healer and without Sharing",
    ["【风闻】使用通灵仪式时会召唤出邓恩的灵体，为范围内的友方提供10%的加速，并降低范围内敌人10%的移动速度。"] = "[Rumor] Using the Spirit Mediumship Ritual will summon Dunn's Духовное тело, providing 10% Acceleration to allies in range and reducing the Скорость бега of enemies in range by 10%.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Ice Flame Breath"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Ice Flame Breath",
    ["[Secret] Damage dealt each time a Distortion effect is stacked increased by 30%."] = "[Secret] Damage dealt each time a Distortion effect is stacked increased by 30%.",
    ["Stop writing. Let me deal with the corruption on you first."] = "Stop writing. Let me deal with the Искажение on you first.",
    ["[Auto Chess] - Viscountess - Dual Circular Slash - AOE 1 - New Skill Case - Main Skill"] = "[Auto Chess] - Viscountess - Dual Circular Slash - AOE 1 - New Skill Case - Main Skill",
    ["【Trigger】Dried Fish Quest Point"] = "【Trigger】Dried Fish Quest Point",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Hound Charge - Reference Hit"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Hound Charge - Reference Hit",
    ["一夜的辗转，克莱恩第二天早早醒来，前往占卜俱乐部……"] = "After a night of tossing and turning, Klein wakes up early the next day and heads to the Гадание Club...",
    ["[Rumor] After Nightmare hits a target, it generates a Ritual Magic at the target's location. The Ritual Magic lasts 6 seconds and deals damage to enemies within range every second."] = "[Rumor] After Кошмар hits a target, it generates a Ritual Magic at the target's location. The Ritual Magic lasts 6 seconds and deals damage to enemies within range every second.",
    ["【触发点位】观众席位"] = "[Trigger point] Audience seats",
    ["I wonder if there are any Beyonder cases to handle recently. Let's head back to Blackthorn Security to check."] = "I wonder if there are any Потусторонний cases to handle recently. Let's head back to Blackthorn Security to check.",
    ["Dance Together NPC Mark Buff"] = "Dance Together NPC Mark Buff",
    ["One-click boost character to mid-spender player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions."] = "One-click boost character to mid-spender player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
    ["一只扭曲的爪子，曾经疯狂的颤动如今归于平静，仿佛某种喧嚣终于安息。"] = "A twisted claw; the once frantic twitching has now settled into calm, as if some clamor has finally found rest.",
    ["一号信徒连线打断buff1"] = "Believer Number One connection interrupt buff 1",
    ["一号信徒连线打断buff2"] = "Believer Number One connection interrupt buff 2",
    ["However, I must congratulate you on becoming a true Beyonder."] = "However, I must congratulate you on becoming a true Потусторонний.",
    ["[Preload] Klein drinks potion"] = "[Preload] Klein drinks potion",
    ["【Evernight Goddess】When dealing damage to enemies with less than 18% Health, execute them immediately."] = "【Evernight Goddess】When dealing damage to enemies with less than 18% Health, execute them immediately.",
    ["上行链路：生命值+180，法力恢复+3。"] = "Uplink: Health +180, Mana recovery +3.",
    ["【秘偶技】河豚子弹-伤害"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Pufferfish Bullet - Damage",
    ["一键将角色提升到中R玩家的属性，并解锁系统，提升序列，添加药品。"] = "One-click boost character to mid-spender player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
    ["It must be from <P_Yellow>Selena</>. She said she wanted to invite our family to a dinner party and also said she learned a new divination to show me."] = "It must be from <P_Yellow>Selena</>. She said she wanted to invite our family to a dinner party and also said she learned a new Гадание to show me.",
    ["不……我的仪式……"] = "No... my ritual...",
    ["【灵魂吸取者】+10%吸血"] = "【Soul Absorber】+10% Вампиризм",
    ["下水道恶臭？和议员有什么关系……这也是非凡事件？"] = "A foul stench from the sewers? What does that have to do with the councilman... Is this also a Потусторонний incident?",
    ["一只非常奇特的小猫，会像变魔术一样突然出现在家里。"] = "A very peculiar little kitten that would suddenly appear in the house as if by magic.",
    ["【预加载】克莱恩喝魔药"] = "[Preload] Klein drinks potion",
    ["Sewer trigger"] = "Sewer trigger",
    ["Don't mind it; I just enjoy this, but my divinations and interpretations are sometimes quite accurate, really..."] = "Don't mind it; I just enjoy this, but my Гаданиеs and interpretations are sometimes quite accurate, really...",
    ["One is the origin of counting. \n \n Unfortunately, it also became the end for this deceased person; except for a notebook, all information including the person himself has been erased by the corruption on him."] = "One is the origin of counting. \n \n Unfortunately, it also became the end for this deceased person; except for a notebook, all information including the person himself has been erased by the Искажение on him.",
    ["Last time someone questioned if she used magic, she was so angry she didn't take that person's orders for three days."] = "Last time someone questioned if she used magic, she was so angry she didn't take that person's orders for three days.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-梦境分析-法术代理attack2"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis - Spell Agent Attack 2",
    ["不以血缘相连，却以血为契。从此命脉相系，生死与共。队伍或团队中，3~8人处于同一家族，获得1次额外复活次数，9人及以上处于同一家族，获得2次额外复活次数。离开家族后有24小时的生效冷却期。"] = "Not connected by blood, but bound by blood. From now on, your lifelines are linked, sharing life and death. When 3-8 people in a party or team are in the same Family, gain 1 extra Resurrection count; when 9 or more are in the same Family, gain 2 extra Resurrection counts. There is a 24-hour Перезарядка period after leaving a Family.",
    ["A survivor of disaster, a smear of corrupted knowledge. The closer one gets to the truth, the closer one gets to distortion and madness..."] = "A survivor of disaster, a smear of corrupted knowledge. The closer one gets to the truth, the closer one gets to distortion and Безумие...",
    ["不同颜色有不同的含义代表着情绪或者身体的状态"] = "Different colors have different meanings, representing emotions or physical states",
    ["Good afternoon! Miss \"Justice,\" Miss \"Magician,\" Mr. \"The Star,\" why are you all here?"] = "Good afternoon! Miss \"Justice,\" Miss \"Фокусник,\" Mr. \"The Star,\" why are you all here?",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-冰霜吐息-法术代理"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Frost Breath - Spell Agent",
    ["一个落满灰尘的笔记本，记录着某位神秘学探索者的努力、热爱、疯狂……与最终的结局。"] = "A dusty notebook recording the efforts, passion, Безумие... and the final ending of a certain mysticism explorer.",
    ["一个血月格外明亮的夜晚之后，许多有关“罗塞尔大帝”的旧物出现在廷根市，不断引发非凡事件。\n郡警察厅向值夜者小队转交了案件档案，你正在展开调查……"] = "After a night when the blood moon was exceptionally bright, many antiques related to \"Emperor Roselle\" appeared in Тинген, continuously triggering extraordinary events. The \n County Police Department transferred the case files to the Ночные Ястребы squad, and you are currently launching an investigation...",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Star Mark"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Star Mark",
    ["A yellowed piece of parchment with a few lines of blurred incantations written in ancient Hermes, faintly sensing the powerful spiritual force connected to the other side of the contract."] = "A yellowed piece of parchment with a few lines of blurred incantations written in ancient Hermes, faintly sensing the powerful spiritual force connected to the other side of the contract.",
    ["一份“绝望魔镜”的线索卷宗。"] = "A dossier of clues regarding the Magic Mirror of Despair.",
    ["不断使用升级技能，把战斗力提升到极限！"] = "Keep using upgrade skills to push your combat power to the limit!",
    ["No, Edith, this power is magical, but also dangerous. Knowing too much is not good for you; having me to protect you is enough."] = "No, Edith, this power is magical, but also dangerous. Knowing too much is not good for you; having me to protect you is enough.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-奇迹牌雨"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Miracle Card Rain",
    ["不可诱惑当前非凡者哦"] = "You cannot charm this Потусторонний.",
    ["Afternoon Tea Encounter Trigger"] = "Afternoon Tea Encounter Trigger",
    ["[General] Invincibility + untargetable for monsters"] = "[General] Invincibility + untargetable for monsters",
    ["One-click boost character to low-spender player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions."] = "One-click boost character to low-spender player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
    ["【风闻】梦魇冲击命中主目标后会引爆暗影能量，造成范围伤害。"] = "[Rumor] After Кошмар Impact hits the main target, it detonates shadow energy, causing area damage.",
    ["Don't be nervous, our Tarot Club is a loving family. If you encounter difficulties, you can consult the great Lord Arrodes; He will provide the answer..."] = "Don't be nervous, our Клуб Таро is a loving family. If you encounter difficulties, you can consult the great Lord Arrodes; He will provide the answer...",
    ["Good afternoon, my name is Angelica, the receptionist at the Divination Club."] = "Good afternoon, my name is Angelica, the receptionist at the Гадание Club.",
    ["【秘辛】灰雾加持时间内，释放技能自身体力值额外增加2点。"] = "[Secret] During the gray fog Blessing duration, releasing a skill increases own Health by an additional 2 points.",
    ["不填或填≤0代表不考虑时间。填>0代表在指定时间内完成位移距离才触发"] = "Empty or ≤0 means time is not considered. Filling >0 means trigger only if the Displacement distance is completed within the specified time",
    ["Whether it's Seer or Clown, both can be found in a circus."] = "Whether it's Провидец or Клоун, both can be found in a circus.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Pufferfish Bullet LV3"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Pufferfish Bullet LV3",
    ["【超凡生物】棋子造成的伤害提高<HighLight>30%</>；参战<HighLight>4</>个玩家对战回合后，额外获得<HighLight>15%</>伤害减免。"] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>30%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>15%</> Снижение урона.",
    ["Sleepless Pathway | Sequence 3 \"Bishop of Fear\""] = "Бессонный Pathway | Последовательность 3 \"Bishop of Fear\"",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Baboon Blessing - Squad Random Buff LV2"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Baboon Blessing - Squad Random Buff LV2",
    ["One-Stroke Drawing - Start Ritual Magic"] = "One-Stroke Drawing - Start Ritual Magic",
    ["不知谁留在这里的尖碑，用非凡力量记录了几个区域地点。"] = "A stele left here by someone unknown, recording several regional locations with Потусторонний powers.",
    ["[Trigger] (Left Path) Trigger Chant Area 2"] = "[Trigger] (Left Path) Trigger Chant Area 2",
    ["【自走棋】-西尔维娅-普攻-蔓花毒刺"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Sylvia - Базовая атака - Vine Flower Poison Sting",
    ["[Hidden] When triggering the immediate Health restoration effect below 20%, the target gains an additional 4 seconds of Super Armor."] = "[Hidden] When triggering the immediate Health restoration effect below 20%, the target gains an additional 4 seconds of Суперброня.",
    ["Three years ago, I was accidentally affected by the power of a Sealed Artifact, which is why I became like this..."] = "Three years ago, I was accidentally affected by the power of a Запечатанный артефакт, which is why I became like this...",
    ["There must be an Extraordinary factor causing them to go mad... their target is 2-049! Protect the carriage!"] = "There must be an Extraordinary factor causing them to go mad... their target is 2-049! Protect the carriage!",
    ["Do not blame yourself. Activating the ritual was a necessary step to escape from here. You did very well this time."] = "Do not blame yourself. Activating the ritual was a necessary step to escape from here. You did very well this time.",
    ["不是改变占卜。是改变“解读”塔罗的方式。"] = "Not changing the Гадание itself. It's changing the way I \"interpret\" the Tarot.",
    ["[Auto Chess] - Frank - Area Ally Healing"] = "[Auto Chess] - Frank - Area Ally Healing",
    ["不过……为了保护他们，我现在尽量不和他们见面。非凡世界太危险了，我不想让危险波及到他们。"] = "However... to protect them, I try not to see them now. The Extraordinary World is too dangerous, and I don't want the danger to reach them.",
    ["不要被命运相同的能量碰撞到！"] = "Do not get hit by energy of the same fate!",
    ["【自走棋】-弓箭骑士-蓄力射击"] = "[Auto Chess] - Archer Knight - Charged Shot",
    ["Not only is Daisy's death related to the divination result, but this answer also implies it's related to the <P_Yellow>customer who came for a divination</>!"] = "Not only is Daisy's death related to the Гадание result, but this answer also implies it's related to the <P_Yellow>customer who came for a Гадание</>!",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Druid Spirit Body LV1"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Druid Духовное тело LV1",
    ["No, Beyonders are dangerous, you should do clerical work."] = "No, Потустороннийs are dangerous, you should do clerical work.",
    ["A twisted claw; the once frantic twitching has now settled into calm, as if some clamor has finally found rest."] = "A twisted claw; the once frantic twitching has now settled into calm, as if some clamor has finally found rest.",
    ["不老魔女魔药"] = "Unaging Witch Potion",
    ["[Collect] Health"] = "[Collect] Health",
    ["【魔药茶会】"] = "[Potion Tea Party]",
    ["A helpful legendary Beyonder—you can make up any story to trick them into helping, and it works every time."] = "A helpful legendary Потусторонний—you can make up any story to trick them into helping, and it works every time.",
    ["A magical unrated Sealed Artifact that can assist in battle and answer questions. When you ask it a question, its tentacles will tremble slightly and then provide an answer. Although it is a squid, it really knows many things. \n Unrated, unnumbered, no one knows how it manages to do it."] = "A magical unrated Запечатанный артефакт that can assist in battle and answer questions. When you ask it a question, its tentacles will tremble slightly and then provide an answer. Although it is a squid, it really knows many things. \n Unrated, unnumbered, no one knows how it manages to do it.",
    ["[Auto-Chess] - Child of the Evil God - Flash Attack 2"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Child of the Evil God - Flash Attack 2",
    ["不要靠近金秋湖的丰饶之树，否则你的理智将直线下降。"] = "Do not go near the Tree of Abundance at Golden Autumn Lake, or your Рассудок will plummet.",
    ["不朽之志·污染"] = "Will of Immortality - Искажение",
    ["At 2:55 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler was in the dining room organizing the silverware when he heard the master and mistress arguing in the bedroom. </>\nAround 3:00 PM <InvHighlight>, he saw the Baroness leave the bedroom with his own eyes. </>Shortly after, Baron Hawkes felt discomfort in his heart and called for the butler to enter the study to deliver medicine. The butler left two minutes later. \n\nAround 3:20 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler went to find Baron Hawkes and discovered that he was not responding, so he called for others to help him break down the door. </>Baron Hawkes was lying next to the desk with spilled tea on the floor. \n"] = "At 2:55 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler was in the dining room organizing the silverware when he heard the master and mistress arguing in the bedroom. </>\nAround 3:00 PM <InvHighlight>, he saw the Baroness leave the bedroom with his own eyes. </>Shortly after, Baron Hawkes felt discomfort in his heart and called for the butler to enter the study to deliver medicine. The butler left two minutes later. \n\nAround 3:20 PM <InvHighlight>, the butler went to find Baron Hawkes and discovered that he was not responding, so he called for others to help him break down the door. </>Baron Hawkes was lying next to the desk with spilled tea on the floor. \n",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Adsorption"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Adsorption",
    ["一本附着灵性的旧书，字里行间隐约指向金秋湖，似乎藏着某个耗尽生命也要追寻的“真理”。"] = "An old book imbued with Духовность. The lines between the words vaguely point toward Golden Autumn Lake, seemingly hiding a \"truth\" that someone exhausted their life to pursue.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Hidden Stab LV5"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Hidden Stab LV5",
    ["不过——你可是有“愚者”先生的眷顾，在一位强大神明的庇护和注视下完成仪式，不会出问题的。"] = "However—you have the favor of Mr. Fool. Completing the ritual under the protection and gaze of a powerful God, there won't be any problems.",
    ["Oh no, the road is blocked! Everyone, work together to break through it!"] = "Oh no, the road is blocked! Everyone, work together to break through it!",
