    ["一定有非凡因素导致他们疯狂……他们的目标是2-049！保护好马车！"] = "There must be an Extraordinary factor causing them to go mad... their target is 2-049! Protect the carriage!",
    ["Everything is ruined. The carriage is damaged like this. According to the contract, I have to pay for the damaged carriage, but I can't come up with that much money even if I go to jail."] = "Everything is ruined. The carriage is damaged like this. According to the contract, I have to pay for the damaged carriage, but I can't come up with that much money even if I go to jail.",
