    ["一次回眸，如一滴香水坠入静水，就此扩散蔓延。在裙摆摇曳的间隙里，在慌乱的温热鼻息间，所有防线已在芬芳中溃散。臣服吧，甘愿成为那不可抗拒的魅力的战利品、所有物。"] = "A single glance back, like a drop of perfume falling into still water, spreading and extending. In the swaying of the skirt, in the chaotic warm breath, all defenses have collapsed in the fragrance. Submit, willing to become the trophy and possession of that irresistible charm.",
    ["不好，2-049逃脱了，小心它的非凡诅咒！"] = "Oh no, 2-049 has escaped, watch out for its Extraordinary curse!",
    ["A bottle of green, a bottle of gold... are these Beyonder potions?"] = "A bottle of green, a bottle of gold... are these Потусторонний potions?",
    ["was he a good father. I made too many wrong choices and hurt too many people I loved. But if I could do it all over again, I would still choose to protect you, even if you can't see it, even if you hate me.\n        And Charles, Bernadette... my children. May you find your own happiness in this world I changed with my own hands.\n        I may have to sleep again. I don't know which farewell will become the true one. But do not be sad. I, Roselle Gustav, Huang Tao—even if I die, I will die in a blaze of glory! Besides... who says I am truly dead?\n        As long as there is still someone who remembers my name, as long as my story is still being told, as long as this world is still using the inventions and laws I left behind... I have never truly"] = "was he a good father. I made too many wrong choices and hurt too many people I loved. But if I could do it all over again, I would still choose to protect you, even if you can't see it, even if you hate me.\n        And Charles, Bernadette... my children. May you find your own happiness in this world I changed with my own hands.\n        I may have to sleep again. I don't know which farewell will become the true one. But do not be sad. I, Roselle Gustav, Huang Tao—even if I die, I will die in a blaze of glory! Besides... who says I am truly dead?\n        As long as there is still someone who remembers my name, as long as my story is still being told, as long as this world is still using the inventions and laws I left behind... I have never truly",
