    ["【猎人】(4) 暴击+30%"] = "[Охотник] (4) Crit +30%",
    ["Don't be afraid, he was originally a normal person, but he was accidentally affected by the power of a Sealed Artifact and turned into a terrifying gorilla."] = "Don't be afraid, he was originally a normal person, but he was accidentally affected by the power of a Запечатанный артефакт and turned into a terrifying gorilla.",
    ["【风闻】死亡之爪新增二段技能—死亡之握，对目标造成少量伤害，若目标身上具有死亡侵蚀，伤害提升。"] = "[Rumor] Grasp of Death adds a second-stage skill—Grasp of Death., dealing a small amount of damage to the target. If the target is affected by Death Erosion, the damage is increased.",
    ["一些不相干的领域，怎么到处都是罗塞尔大帝？"] = "Some unrelated fields, why is Emperor Roselle everywhere?",
    ["一开始，我忌惮它。它会剥夺使用者的心智，使其丧失相应的情绪能力，严重者甚至会被污染、死亡。"] = "At first, I was wary of it. It would strip away the user's Рассудок, causing them to lose their corresponding emotional capabilities; in severe cases, they could even be corrupted or die.",
