    ["【超凡生物】棋子造成的伤害提高<HighLight>10%</>；参战<HighLight>4</>个玩家对战回合后，额外获得<HighLight>5%</>伤害减免。"] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>10%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>5%</> Снижение урона.",
