    ["三波灵界轰击分别造成<HighLight>140%/140%/280%</>攻击伤害；第一波牵引，第二波使攻击降低15%。"] = "Three waves of Spirit World Bombardment deal <HighLight>140%/140%/280%</> attack damage respectively; the first wave pulls, and the second reduces attack by 15%.",
    ["三波灵界轰击分别造成<HighLight>70%/70%/140%</>攻击伤害；第一波牵引，第二波使攻击降低15%。"] = "Three waves of Spirit World Bombardment deal <HighLight>70%/70%/140%</> attack damage respectively; the first wave pulls, and the second reduces attack by 15%.",
