    ["不够灵敏的占卜家先生，这个架子明明离我更近，如果不是你挡住了路……"] = "Not-so-sharp Mr. Провидец, this shelf is clearly closer to me. If it weren't for you blocking the way...",
    ["三段式尊名不仅是一个名字，它更接近一种神性的注视、一种召唤的咒文。"] = "The three-part honorific name is not just a name, it is closer to a divine gaze, a spell of summoning.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Knight Guard LV3 - Damage Reduction Effect Increase"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Knight Guard LV3 - Снижение урона Effect Increase",
    ["不可选中+无敌"] = "Untargetable + Invincibility",
    ["A special material that can serve as a base for concocting potions; this is your victory alone, which no one can take away."] = "A special material that can serve as a base for concocting potions; this is your victory alone, which no one can take away.",
    ["不是一个好父亲。我做出了太多错误的选择，伤害了太多我爱的人。但如果重来一次，我还是会选择保护你，哪怕你看不到，哪怕你恨我。\n        还有夏尔、博诺瓦……我的孩子们。愿你们能在这个我亲手改变过的世界里，找到属于自己的幸福。\n        我也许又要沉眠了。我不知道，哪一次道别，会成为真正的告别。但不要悲伤。我，罗塞尔·古斯塔夫，黄涛——即使死亡，也要死得轰轰烈烈！况且……谁说我真的死了呢？\n        只要还有人记得我的名字，只要我的故事还在流传，只要这个世界还在使用我留下的发明和律法……我就从未真正"] = "was he a good father. I made too many wrong choices and hurt too many people I loved. But if I could do it all over again, I would still choose to protect you, even if you can't see it, even if you hate me.\n        And Charles, Bernadette... my children. May you find your own happiness in this world I changed with my own hands.\n        I may have to sleep again. I don't know which farewell will become the true one. But do not be sad. I, Roselle Gustav, Huang Tao—even if I die, I will die in a blaze of glory! Besides... who says I am truly dead?\n        As long as there is still someone who remembers my name, as long as my story is still being told, as long as this world is still using the inventions and laws I left behind... I have never truly",
