    ["[Hidden] During the gray fog Blessing duration, each time Health is recovered via a skill, gain additional Armor, stacking up to 3 layers, lasting 5 seconds."] = "[Hidden] During the gray fog Blessing duration, each time Health is recovered via a skill, gain additional Armor, stacking up to 3 layers, lasting 5 seconds.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Druid Spirit Body LV3"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Druid Духовное тело LV3",
