    ["A wisp of hazy Beyonder characteristic fragments. The moment it is held in the palm, it carries a heavy weight, as if holding a will that has yet to be fully expressed."] = "A wisp of hazy Потусторонний characteristic fragments. The moment it is held in the palm, it carries a heavy weight, as if holding a will that has yet to be fully expressed.",
