    ["[Hidden] Each attack has a 10% chance to increase the Current effect duration by 1 second, up to a maximum of 5 seconds, triggering at most once every 0.5 seconds."] = "[Hidden] Each attack has a 10% chance to increase the Current effect duration by 1 second, up to a maximum of 5 seconds, triggering at most once every 0.5 seconds.",
