    ["【秘偶技】骑士守护LV4-暴击效果提升"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Knight Guard LV4 - Critical Hit Effect Increase",
    ["No need, it's just a small matter. We'll just wait nearby; spirituality will guide it back here."] = "No need, it's just a small matter. We'll just wait nearby; Духовность will guide it back here.",
    ["Some unrelated fields, why is Emperor Roselle everywhere?"] = "Some unrelated fields, why is Emperor Roselle everywhere?",
    ["However... to protect them, I try not to see them now. The Extraordinary World is too dangerous, and I don't want the danger to reach them."] = "However... to protect them, I try not to see them now. The Extraordinary World is too dangerous, and I don't want the danger to reach them.",
