    ["Once one becomes an Angel, they are inevitably affected by their Beyonder characteristic, becoming increasingly cold, cruel, and indifferent to life. Therefore, one must have sufficient anchors, and the universal anchor is the faith of mortals."] = "Once one becomes an Angel, they are inevitably affected by their Потусторонний characteristic, becoming increasingly cold, cruel, and indifferent to life. Therefore, one must have sufficient anchors, and the universal anchor is the faith of mortals.",
