    ["不久，混乱世界出现多个有魔力的湖泊，湖下再次分裂出新的秩序世界....."] = "Before long, multiple magical lakes appeared in the chaotic world, and new orderly worlds split off from beneath the lakes again...",
    ["A Beyonder potion, through the outer glass wall, you can see the golden mist permeating inside."] = "A Потусторонний potion, through the outer glass wall, you can see the golden mist permeating inside.",
    ["不知是哪条途径的非凡者，如此出众！"] = "I wonder which Pathway this Потусторонний belongs to; they are so outstanding!",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Phantom Form"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Phantom Form",
    ["【秘偶技】德鲁伊灵体-子弹LV1"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Druid Духовное тело - Bullet LV1",
    ["[General] Super Armor for monsters"] = "[General] Суперброня for monsters",
    ["[Auto Chess] - Merlin - Area Ally Shield"] = "[Auto Chess] - Merlin - Area Ally Shield",
    ["不是我想唱，是魔药的要求。想消化“海洋歌者”的魔药，必须在海上歌唱，用歌声引发风暴。"] = "It's not that I wanted to sing; it was a requirement of the potion. To digest the 'Sea King' potion, one must sing at sea, using the voice to trigger storms.",
    ["一张蕴含庞大灵性的卡牌，持有者可以此媒介沟通灵界，进行运气与命运的交换，从灵界中获取宝物。"] = "A card containing vast Духовность. The holder can use this medium to communicate with the Spirit World, exchange luck and fate, and obtain treasures from the Spirit World.",
    ["Sleepless Pathway | Sequence 7 \"Nightmare\""] = "Бессонный Pathway | Последовательность 7 \"Кошмар\"",
    ["Do not get hit by energy of the same fate!"] = "Do not get hit by energy of the same fate!",
    ["Tarot Card"] = "Tarot Card",
    ["[Rumor] After Nightmare hits a target, it weakens the target's Skill Block for 5 seconds."] = "[Rumor] After Кошмар hits a target, it weakens the target's Блок навыков for 5 seconds.",
    ["【转弯操控】<Quality_3>普通</>\n【车辆速度】<Quality_5>3级</>\n<Dark>廷根制造局出厂的优秀款式，零件易换，故障少有，动力系统足够支持每一次畅行，属于是中产阶级最宠爱的居家出行必备交通工具。</>"] = "[Turning Control] <Quality_3>Normal</>\n [Vehicle Speed] <Quality_5>Level 3</>\n<Dark> An excellent model from the Тинген Manufacturing Bureau. Parts are easy to replace, breakdowns are rare, and the power system is sufficient for every smooth journey—it is the essential home travel tool most loved by the middle class.</>",
    ["【自走棋】-巨龙传承羁绊-全屏伤害200"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Giant Dragon Inheritance Bond - Full-screen Damage 200",
    ["[Hidden] Grasp of Death. deals the same amount of damage to the enemy and targets within a 6-meter radius."] = "[Hidden] Grasp of Death. deals the same amount of damage to the enemy and targets within a 6-meter radius.",
    ["[Potion Tea Party] Pathfinding Divination 1"] = "[Potion Tea Party] Pathfinding Гадание 1",
    ["【秘偶技】狒狒祝福-随机扔东西-暂时未用"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Baboon Blessing - Random Item Throw - Temporarily Unused",
    ["Different colors have different meanings, representing emotions or physical states"] = "Different colors have different meanings, representing emotions or physical states",
    ["Not only that, it even sounds pleasant when it farts, otherwise why would it be called 'Fart Beauty'? What a magical pig..."] = "Not only that, it even sounds pleasant when it farts, otherwise why would it be called 'Fart Beauty'? What a magical pig...",
    ["[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark DPS without Healer and without Sharing"] = "[Golden Autumn Lake-Hard]-Druid-Mark DPS without Healer and without Sharing",
    ["一次又一次……他展现的知识，他回应的祈求，他对塔罗会和白银城的庇护……"] = "Time and time again... the knowledge he displayed, the prayers he answered, his protection of the Клуб Таро and Silver City...",
    ["七月的馈赠，让灵性如酒般流淌。"] = "The gift of July, letting Духовность flow like wine.",
    ["【触发器】最后路段-看到障碍物"] = "[Trigger] Last section-See obstacle",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Pufferfish Bullet - Damage"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Pufferfish Bullet - Damage",
    ["The next batch of crazy Dragon Hunter gang members is about to arrive..."] = "The next batch of crazy Dragon Охотник gang members is about to arrive...",
    ["A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday\n wishes written on it, like a secret code yet to be spoken.\n\n '<P_Yellow>Happy Birthday</>, grow up healthy—Love, your brother.'"] = "A greeting card with a birthday cake drawn on it, with a line of birthday\n wishes written on it, like a secret code yet to be spoken.\n\n '<P_Yellow>Happy Birthday</>, grow up healthy—Love, your brother.'",
    ["【黑夜女神】对生命值低于25%的敌人造成伤害时，将其立即斩杀。"] = "【Evernight Goddess】When dealing damage to enemies with less than 25% Health, execute them immediately.",
    ["【表演】灵体史密斯太太2"] = "[Performance] Spirit Mrs. Smith 2",
    ["一次形式完备的祈祷。是否被聆听，属于不可知领域。"] = "A complete ritual of prayer. Whether it was heard belongs to the realm of the unknowable.",
    ["A fountain pen writes: \n \"The ritual for the offspring was a success! Although Klein discovered the serial deaths in the slums, this does not affect the continuation of the story."] = "A fountain pen writes: \n \"The ritual for the offspring was a success! Although Klein discovered the serial deaths in the slums, this does not affect the continuation of the story.",
    ["I wonder if there are any Beyonder cases to handle recently. Let's go back to Blackthorn and see."] = "I wonder if there are any Потусторонний cases to handle recently. Let's go back to Blackthorn and see.",
    ["[Rumor] Imperial Flag Health increased by 15%."] = "[Rumor] Imperial Flag Health increased by 15%.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Spinning Slash"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Spinning Slash",
    ["[Potion Tea Party]"] = "[Potion Tea Party]",
    ["一枚不规则多面骰子，散发着金芒，触手温热，像有意识在内部缓缓翻动。握住它掷出时，仿佛命运在那一瞬主动倾身，眷顾即将到来的落点。"] = "An irregular multi-sided die that emits a golden glow, warm to the touch, as if something is slowly turning inside with consciousness. When you hold it and roll it, it feels as if fate leans in actively at that moment, favoring the upcoming landing point.",
    ["不用谢，这只是一个街头魔术师的日常表演。"] = "No need to thank me, this is just a daily performance for a street Фокусник.",
    ["【自走棋】-苏茜-区域友军治疗"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Susie - Area Ally Healing",
    ["一颗仍在跳动的火山，烫穿了持有者的理智。"] = "A volcano still beating, burning through the holder's Рассудок.",
    ["【秘偶技】隐匿刺击LV3"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Hidden Stab LV3",
    ["不过这本笔记目前也在值夜者组织，而且……之前看到值夜者的保密资料中，没有提供占卜家序列8和7的魔药名称，难道里面还藏着什么秘辛？"] = "However, this notebook is currently with the Ночные Ястребы, and... I saw in the Ночные Ястребы' confidential documents that they didn't provide the potion names for Провидец Последовательность 8 and 7. Could there be some hidden secret inside?",
    ["万一他们真是失控非凡者……还是去看看吧"] = "In case they really are out-of-control Потустороннийs... better go take a look.",
    ["【Performance】Spirit Sam 2"] = "【Performance】Spirit Sam 2",
    ["Do not add new buffs directly at the bottom"] = "Do not add new buffs directly at the bottom",
    ["No external magic mirror effect fixed point"] = "No external magic mirror effect fixed point",
    ["Anyway, I have to find a place to hide first... it would be bad if I were caught studying all night secretly relying on potions."] = "Anyway, I have to find a place to hide first... it would be bad if I were caught studying all night secretly relying on potions.",
    ["【风闻】梦魇命中目标后削弱目标技能抵挡，持续5秒。"] = "[Rumor] After Кошмар hits a target, it weakens the target's Блок навыков for 5 seconds.",
    ["【触发器】（左侧路）碰壁提示区域"] = "【Trigger】(Left Path) Wall Collision Prompt Area",
    ["【黑夜女神】对生命值低于12%的敌人造成伤害时，将其立即斩杀。"] = "【Evernight Goddess】When dealing damage to enemies with less than 12% Health, execute them immediately.",
    ["不以血缘相连，却以誓言共筑。在这个非凡与疯狂并存的世界里，你选择了最珍贵的事——相信彼此。"] = "Not connected by blood, but built together by oaths. In this world where the extraordinary and Безумие coexist, you have chosen the most precious thing—trusting each other.",
    ["[Auto-Chess] Astrolabe User Skill - [Star Cutting]"] = "[Auto-Chess] Astrolabe User Skill - [Star Cutting]",
    ["【秘辛】仪式魔法造成的伤害增加40%。"] = "[Secret] Damage caused by Ritual Magic increased by 40%.",
    ["上次有人质疑她用魔法，她气得三天没接那人的单。"] = "Last time someone questioned if she used magic, she was so angry she didn't take that person's orders for three days.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Viscountess Ghost - Death Random Target Selection - First Time"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Viscountess Ghost - Death Random Target Selection - First Time",
    ["[Hunter] (2) Crit +15%"] = "[Охотник] (2) Crit +15%",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis - Spell Agent Attack 2"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis - Spell Agent Attack 2",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-星云斩击"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Nebula Slash",
    ["不要紧张，我们塔罗学派是一个友爱的大家庭，遇到困难可以咨询伟大的阿罗德斯大人，祂会给出答案的……"] = "Don't be nervous, our Клуб Таро is a loving family. If you encounter difficulties, you can consult the great Lord Arrodes; He will provide the answer...",
    ["[Insight] When releasing the Spirit Mediumship Ritual (only at the moment of release), dispel Slow effects on allies within range."] = "[Insight] When releasing the Spirit Mediumship Ritual (only at the moment of release), dispel Slow effects on allies within range.",
    ["一种特殊的材料，能够作为调配魔药的基底，此为独属于你的胜利，无人可夺。"] = "A special material that can serve as a base for concocting potions; this is your victory alone, which no one can take away.",
    ["【通用】给怪物的无敌+不可被选中"] = "[General] Invincibility + untargetable for monsters",
    ["不是掌握，是消化。\n不是发掘，是<Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight_HW\" id=\"#160\" u=\"1\">扮演</>。\n魔药的名称不只是象征，还是意象，更是消化的钥匙。"] = "It is not mastery, it is digestion.\nIt is not excavation, it is <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight_HW\" id=\"#160\" u=\"1\">acting</>.\nThe name of the potion is not just a symbol, but an imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Knight Guard LV6 - Final Grace Effect Increase"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Knight Guard LV6 - Final Grace Effect Increase",
    ["[Trigger] Last segment - Chant 3-1"] = "[Trigger] Last segment - Chant 3-1",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Flame Breath Area Attack"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Flame Breath Area Attack",
    ["[Auto-Chess] Hound Basic Attack Double Strike - Hit 2"] = "[Auto-Chess] Hound Базовая атака Double Strike - Hit 2",
    ["No... my ritual..."] = "No... my ritual...",
    ["【秘偶技】德鲁伊灵体-子弹LV3"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Druid Духовное тело - Bullet LV3",
    ["[Auto-Chess] Hound Basic Attack Double Strike - Hit 1"] = "[Auto-Chess] Hound Базовая атака Double Strike - Hit 1",
    ["【采集】占卜确认安全"] = "【Collect】Гадание confirms safety",
    ["A single glance back, like a drop of perfume falling into still water, spreading and extending. In the swaying of the skirt, in the chaotic warm breath, all defenses have collapsed in the fragrance. Submit, willing to become the trophy and possession of that irresistible charm."] = "A single glance back, like a drop of perfume falling into still water, spreading and extending. In the swaying of the skirt, in the chaotic warm breath, all defenses have collapsed in the fragrance. Submit, willing to become the trophy and possession of that irresistible charm.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Druid Spirit Body - Bullet LV5"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Druid Духовное тело - Bullet LV5",
    ["【自走棋】-弗兰克-区域友军治疗"] = "[Auto Chess] - Frank - Area Ally Healing",
    ["下一神性等级解锁时间：<Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>认知经验获取</>\n足够的认知有利于扮演的推进。完成主线、支线、时代与漫游任务，以及参与各类日常玩法（包括<Yellow>轻松躺赢、以战养战、世界冒险</>等），均可获得大量认知经验。当你重历“愚者”先生的历史时，受“嫁接”的力量影响，同样可以获取属于自己的那份认知经验。玩家到达扮演等级上限之后，获取的认知经验将被转化，继续提升神性等级。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>等级限制规则</>\n扮演等级提升至最终上限后，继续积累的认知经验将以一定比例转化，用于提升神性等级。当非凡者的神性等级达到当前上限，将无法继续获取认知经验。直到开放新的神性等级，方可继续提升。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>扮演中的人性与神性</>\n“万物皆有神性，当扮演超出限度，你将逐步走向最初的神性。”\n非凡者通过日常的体验、任务与探索，不断接受关于这个世界的认知，并将其转化为<Yellow>认知经验</>。积累认知经验，可逐步提升自我的<Yellow>扮演等级</>，通过扮演以巩固精神与存在的稳定性。\n然而，认知与扮演本身蕴含风险，扮演的每一步也在支付着代价。当扮演等级提升至最终上限后，人性将无法维持扮演带来的影响——后续的扮演将开始塑造神性。非凡者将在扮演中逐步走向神性，从而提升<Yellow>神性等级</>。\n为防止短时间内接收过量认知导致精神崩溃，您被“愚者”先生赋予了限制等级的保护性祝福。在当前的扮演等级或神性等级下，身体与精神必须经历足够的适应与沉淀，方能突破等级限制，承受更高层次的认知，迈向下一阶段。"] = "Next Divinity Level unlock time: <Yellow>%s</>\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Cognitive Experience Acquisition</>\nSufficient cognition is beneficial for the advancement of Acting. Completing main quests, side quests, Era and Roaming quests, and participating in various daily activities (including <Yellow>Easy Wins, War-Driven Growth, World Adventure</>, etc.) will grant a large amount of Cognitive Experience. When you relive the history of Mr. Fool, influenced by the power of \"Grafting,\" you can also obtain your own share of Cognitive Experience. After players reach the Acting Level cap, the Cognitive Experience gained will be converted to continue increasing the Divinity Level. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Level Limit Rules</>\nAfter the Acting Level reaches the final cap, accumulated Cognitive Experience will be converted at a certain ratio to increase the Divinity Level. When a Потусторонний's Divinity Level reaches the current cap, you will no longer be able to gain Cognitive Experience until a new Divinity Level is opened. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Humanity and Divinity in Acting</>\n\"All things have divinity; when Acting exceeds the limit, you will gradually move toward the original divinity.\"\nПотустороннийs continuously accept cognition about this world through daily experiences, quests, and exploration, converting it into <Yellow>Cognitive Experience</>. Accumulating Cognitive Experience can gradually improve your <Yellow>Acting Level</>, consolidating the stability of your spirit and existence through Acting. \nHowever, cognition and Acting themselves contain risks, and every step of Acting comes with a price. When the Acting Level reaches the final cap, humanity will be unable to maintain the influence brought by Acting—subsequent Acting will begin to shape divinity. Потустороннийs will gradually move toward divinity during Acting, thereby increasing their <Yellow>Divinity Level</>. \nTo prevent mental collapse from receiving excessive cognition in a short period, you have been granted a protective blessing by Mr. Fool that limits your level. At the current Acting Level or Divinity Level, your body and spirit must undergo sufficient adaptation and precipitation before you can break through the level limit, withstand higher levels of cognition, and move to the next stage.",
