    ["下水道系统需要持续建设，\r\n使用【】，\r\n才能真正缓解城市污染。"] = "The sewer system requires Continuous construction,\r\nusing【】,\r\nto truly alleviate the city's Искажение.",
    ["Don't look down on people with a lower Sequence than you; a Sequence 8 can also defeat a Sequence 5..."] = "Don't look down on people with a lower Последовательность than you; a Последовательность 8 can also defeat a Последовательность 5...",
