    ["一面复古梳妆镜，镜框缠绕着花纹，镜面却异常地清澈——在这座充满迷雾的玫瑰天堂里，它干净得近乎突兀。\n镜框边缘渗出淡淡的灵性，像是有生命般缓缓流动……"] = "A vintage vanity mirror with a patterned frame, yet the mirror surface is unusually clear—in this fog-filled Rose Paradise, it is clean to the point of being abrupt. \n Faint Духовность seeps from the edge of the frame, flowing slowly as if it were alive...",
    ["Once entering battle, the Misfortune Doll will wait for an opportunity to cause trouble. When a skill hits an enemy, the doll will possess them, reducing their Defense and critical resistance, and transfer as you Switch targets. When it returns to you, you bear the misfortune."] = "Once entering battle, the Misfortune Doll will wait for an opportunity to cause trouble. When a skill hits an enemy, the doll will possess them, reducing their Defense and critical resistance, and transfer as you Switch targets. When it returns to you, you bear the misfortune.",
    ["不可能，菲利普是个胆小鬼，哪敢开枪。"] = "Impossible, Philip is a coward, how would he dare to pull the trigger.",
    ["One-click boost character to standard active player stats, unlock systems, advance Sequence, and add potions."] = "One-click boost character to standard active player stats, unlock systems, advance Последовательность, and add potions.",
