    ["【表演】灵体山姆3"] = "[Performance] Spirit Sam 3",
    ["【表演】灵体山姆2"] = "【Performance】Spirit Sam 2",
    ["[Rumor] If the target's Health is below 20% while the Scrutiny effect is active, it immediately restores 15% of the target's max Health, not exceeding 20% of the caster's Health, and can only take effect once. If the effect is not triggered, the caster can use a second-stage skill within 5 seconds to immediately heal the target."] = "[Rumor] If the target's Health is below 20% while the Scrutiny effect is active, it immediately restores 15% of the target's max Health, not exceeding 20% of the caster's Health, and can only take effect once. If the effect is not triggered, the caster can use a second-stage skill within 5 seconds to immediately heal the target.",
    ["【秘偶技】星之虫-冰焰吐息"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Ice Flame Breath",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Pufferfish Bullet LV5"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Pufferfish Bullet LV5",
    ["It is not mastery, it is digestion.\nIt is not excavation, it is <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight_HW\" id=\"#160\" u=\"1\">acting</>.\nThe name of the potion is not just a symbol, but an imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion."] = "It is not mastery, it is digestion.\nIt is not excavation, it is <Tips stylename=\"Letter_Highlight_HW\" id=\"#160\" u=\"1\">acting</>.\nThe name of the potion is not just a symbol, but an imagery, and even more so, the key to digestion.",
    ["【表演】蒙特利死亡。他的身上析出了一些亮晶晶的东西（门的非凡特性）。给旁边散乱的面具板子一个镜头。"] = "[Performance] Monterey is dead. Some shiny things (Потусторонний characteristic of the Door) are extracted from his body. Give a shot of the scattered mask boards nearby.",
    ["一瓶名为“焦糖炸弹”的神秘饮料让你邂逅了人生中最急促的肠道危机。你闯入盥洗室，却撞见两个虔诚的学生对着马桶颂念尊名。原来“神圣毒药”的受害者不止你一人。你与饮料发明者谢尔敏试图优化这款罪恶甜水。几番折腾，配方越改越神秘，绝望的谢尔敏将残液倒进马桶，马桶竟然变得光洁如新！ 一周后，廷根市民人手一瓶柠檬味清洁药剂，而在盥洗室点蜡烛祈祷的学生，至今仍盼望着“焦糖炸弹”重新归来。"] = "A mysterious drink called 'Caramel Bomb' leads you to the most urgent intestinal crisis of your life. You rush into the restroom, only to find two devout students chanting a holy name toward the toilet. It turns out you are not the only victim of this 'sacred poison'. You and the drink's inventor, Shermin, try to optimize this sinful sweet water. After several attempts, the formula becomes increasingly mysterious, and a desperate Shermin pours the residue into the toilet—the toilet becomes as clean as new! A week later, every Тинген citizen has a bottle of lemon-scented cleaning agent, while the students who light candles and pray in the restroom are still hoping for the return of the 'Caramel Bomb'.",
    ["You are not the owner of the current castle scene; you need to return to your own castle to perform operations."] = "You are not the owner of the current castle scene; you need to return to your own castle to perform operations.",
    ["[Marionette Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Worm of Star - Dream Analysis",
    ["Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>30%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>15%</> Damage Reduction."] = "Damage dealt by [Supernatural Creature] pieces is increased by <HighLight>30%</>; after participating in <HighLight>4</> player combat rounds, gain an additional <HighLight>15%</> Снижение урона.",
    ["[Trigger] Final Segment - Lyrics 3-2"] = "[Trigger] Final Segment - Lyrics 3-2",
    ["一个人常携带的事物往往和他们自身有强烈的关联。通过占卜，可以追踪到主人的位置。"] = "The things a person carries often share a strong connection with them. Through Гадание, they can be used to track their owner's location.",
    ["【自走棋】-魅欲女妖-能量召唤"] = "[Auto-Chess] - Charm Succubus - Energy Summon",
    ["[Performance] Spirit Knight"] = "[Performance] Spirit Knight",
    ["一把铁黑色的左轮手枪，克莱恩最珍视的武器之一。\n操作简单、威力惊人，当它上膛的一刻开始，鲜血和哀嚎不绝于耳。\n其实克莱恩更期盼无须流血的结局，但现实总是事与愿违。\n许多生灵都被命运推搡到枪口之下。\n“请饶恕我……”丑陋的灵魂乞求着。戴半高丝绸礼帽的身影步步逼近，因斯·赞格威尔盯着那双褐色的眼眸，却没看见里面映照出任何一样东西，只余死亡的倒影。\n砰！\n丧钟为谁而鸣？\n丧钟为他而鸣。"] = "An iron-black revolver, one of Klein's most cherished weapons. \n Simple to operate and devastating in power, from the moment it is loaded, blood and wails become constant companions. \n In truth, Klein longed for an outcome that required no bloodshed, but reality always defied his wishes. \n Many living beings were pushed by fate beneath its muzzle. \n \"Please, spare me...\" the ugly soul begged. The figure in the tall silk hat stepped closer; Ince Zangwill stared into those brown eyes, yet saw nothing reflected within them, only the shadow of death. \n Bang! \n For whom does the death knell toll? \n The death knell tolls for him.",
    ["However, the path of a Beyonder is always dangerous and mad; heading toward loss of control and death is also expected."] = "However, the path of a Потусторонний is always dangerous and mad; heading toward loss of control and death is also expected.",
    ["一个好的占卜师，解读的不仅是牌面。"] = "A good diviner interprets more than just the cards.",
    ["A treasure chest with a simple seal applied to it. Our goal is to break it. This is a perfect \"unsealing\" ritual for beginners to practice."] = "A treasure chest with a simple seal applied to it. Our goal is to break it. This is a perfect \"unsealing\" ritual for beginners to practice.",
    ["【风闻】完成转运仪式后为周围的友方目标释放历史明灯，使其获得少量护盾，持续10秒，并且获得历史明灯标志。"] = "[Rumor] After completing the Fortune-Turning Ritual., release Historical Beacon to surrounding allies, granting them a small Shield for 10 seconds and the Historical Beacon mark.",
    ["三段式连招，安抚友方精神，每段回复友方目标*d/*d/*d点生命。\n仅<HighLight>空想姿态</>可用，<HighLight>噩梦姿态</>下切换为<HighLight>意识冲击</>。"] = "A three-stage combo that pacifies the minds of allies, each stage restoring *d/*d/*d Health to allied targets. \n Only available in <HighLight> Стойка фантазии </>; switches to <HighLight> Consciousness Shock </> in <HighLight> Стойка кошмара </>.",
    ["[Auto Chess] - Swain - Thunder Tide Finish"] = "[Auto Chess] - Swain - Thunder Tide Finish",
