    ["[Marionette Skill] Baboon Blessing - Summon LV2"] = "[Марионетка Skill] Baboon Blessing - Summon LV2",
    ["不管多少钱也赎不回我在暗无天日的大牢里咽下的冤屈和折磨，承不起我用自己的血水浇铸、骨头打磨出的复仇之剑。"] = "No amount of money can redeem the injustice and torment I swallowed in the dark prison, nor can it bear the sword of revenge I cast with my own blood and polished with my bones.",
