    ["4 hours later, go to the entrance of the <P_Yellow> Back Street Coffee Shop </>, there is a flower bed there."] = "4 hours later, go to the entrance of the <P_Yellow> Back Street Coffee Shop </>, there is a flower bed there.",
    ["<DecH>Crafting: </>Camel Tweed - Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter thanks to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow."] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Camel Tweed - Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter thanks to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Carved Flower Bed】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Carved Flower Bed display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Carved Flower Bed】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Carved Flower Bed display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["5231246   书店   单人位面"] = "5231246 Bookstore Single-Player Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Crow of Time】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Crow of Time. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Crow of Time】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Crow of Time. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["5200229 Club Other Dungeon"] = "5200229 Club Other Dungeon",
    ["<InvDefault>1.【Club War Declaration】</>\n<InvDefault>1）The basic declaration-of-war experience has been improved, increasing the point lead required for an early victory from 5000 to 15000. After the adjustment, when one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the side with the higher score will win immediately.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after </><InvHighlight>August 27</><InvHighlight>at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>2）The club-war points awarded for kills and assists have been reduced.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after August 27 at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>"] = "<InvDefault>1.【Club War Declaration】</>\n<InvDefault>1）The basic declaration-of-war experience has been improved, increasing the point lead required for an early victory from 5000 to 15000. After the adjustment, when one side leads the other by more than 15000 points, the side with the higher score will win immediately.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after </><InvHighlight>August 27</><InvHighlight>at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>\n<InvDefault>2）The club-war points awarded for kills and assists have been reduced.</><InvHighlight>The adjustment will take effect for declaration matches after August 27 at 20 o'clock</><InvDefault>.</>",
    ["<P_Heart> (Shy) </> This {{英俊的先生|优雅的女士}}, please forgive me, I... haven't thought about this question yet."] = "<P_Heart> (Shy) </> This {{handsome gentleman|elegant lady}}, please forgive me, I... haven't thought about this question yet.",
    ["<ChatTag_Fight>[战斗]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Fight>[Battle]</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Historian II</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Progression-Growth\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Unlock 3 relationships with the \"Original Work\" tag"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historian II</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Progression-Growth\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Unlock 3 relationships with the \"Original Work\" tag",
    ["<Highlight>Leonard</> has been staying at the Club recently, collecting Objects of Phenomenon scattered everywhere. \nIf you have collected a sufficient number of Objects of Phenomenon, you can go to the <Highlight>Club scene</> to exchange them for generous rewards from Leonard."] = "<Highlight>Leonard</> has been staying at the Club recently, collecting Objects of Phenomenon scattered everywhere. \nIf you have collected a sufficient number of Objects of Phenomenon, you can go to the <Highlight>Club scene</> to exchange them for generous rewards from Leonard.",
    ["<ChatTag_World>[World]</>"] = "<ChatTag_World>[World]</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Cross-Server Friends] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Cross-Server Friends </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System> Under the Friends - Add tab, enter the character nickname or character numeric ID to search for and add cross-server friends. </>\n Friend Gifting: <Assistant_Title2> You can use </> Friends - Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner <Assistant_System> to exchange gifts with cross-server friends and increase friendliness. </>\n Recommended Searches: <Assistant_Title3></>, {SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Cross-Server Friends] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Cross-Server Friends </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System> Under the Friends - Add tab, enter the character nickname or character numeric ID to search for and add cross-server friends. </>\n Friend Gifting: <Assistant_Title2> You can use </> Friends - Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner <Assistant_System> to exchange gifts with cross-server friends and increase friendliness. </>\n Recommended Searches: <Assistant_Title3></>, {SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
