    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Special Cut - Scorching Sun] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Special Cut - Scorching Sun; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </><Assistant_System> Unlocked via cumulative summons in Summon - Astral Strange Attire"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Special Cut - Scorching Sun] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Special Cut - Scorching Sun; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </><Assistant_System> Unlocked via cumulative summons in Summon - Astral Strange Attire",
