    ["<Chat_Highlight> {{eventMessageParams.winnerName}} </> has countered the charm of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.loserName}}</>, easily taming them, and sighed that the Taste of the Witch is truly quite good. (Status lasts for <Chat_Highlight>15</> minutes)"] = "<Chat_Highlight> {{eventMessageParams.winnerName}} </> has countered the charm of <Chat_Highlight>{{eventMessageParams.loserName}}</>, easily taming them, and sighed that the Taste of the Witch is truly quite good. (Status lasts for <Chat_Highlight>15</> minutes)",
    ["3名以上家族/3名以上俱乐部成员通关一次"] = "Clear once with at least 3 Family members/3 Club members.",
    ["<P_Heart>（但这样的事在此地常有，我对此也无能为力。本就是投机者的游戏，赢了也许一夜乍富，输了就是地覆天翻。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (But things like this happen often here, and I'm powerless to help. It's a speculator's game; win, and you might be rich overnight, lose, and everything is turned upside down.) </>",
    ["3名以上家族/x人名上俱乐部成员通关一次"] = "Clear once with 3 or more family/x club members",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> succeeded <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> and became the new %s of the club."] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> succeeded <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> and became the new %s of the club.",
    ["1.当旗帜不在当前分线时，可点击右上角小地图上方的<Highlight>切换分线</>寻找。\n2.选择传送点即可传送至<Highlight>旗帜所在分线</>，迅速投入战斗。"] = "1. When the Flag is not in the current sub-channel, you can click <Highlight> Switch Sub-channel </> above the mini-map in the top right corner to find it. \n 2. Select a Teleport point to Teleport to the <Highlight> sub-channel where the Flag is located </> and quickly join the battle.",
    ["5230215   QA资源测试模版关卡   位面"] = "5230215 QA Resource Test Template Level Plane",
    ["1: Show, 0: Hide; x1, y1 top-left coordinates; x2, y2 bottom-right; e.g., 1, 100, 100, 1024, 1024."] = "1: Show, 0: Hide; x1, y1 top-left coordinates; x2, y2 bottom-right; e.g., 1, 100, 100, 1024, 1024.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Normal Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level<Assistant_Red> 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity: </>A voice room can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speaking Mode: </>Normal voice rooms default to free-speaking mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the current voice room mode is set to host-controlled speaking permissions or speaking order, you must click the microphone button to request to speak, and you can unmute after the host approves.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speaking mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and also adjust room information and types or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share voice room links or distribute voice room gifts in the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Gameplay Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Permanent Room]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Normal Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level<Assistant_Red> 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity: </>A voice room can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speaking Mode: </>Normal voice rooms default to free-speaking mode; click the microphone button next to the input box to automatically unmute. If the current voice room mode is set to host-controlled speaking permissions or speaking order, you must click the microphone button to request to speak, and you can unmute after the host approves.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speaking mode in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and also adjust room information and types or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings interface.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share voice room links or distribute voice room gifts in the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Gameplay Voice Room]|1397}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room - Permanent Room]|1398}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【家族】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>开放等级：</>认知等级<Assistant_Red>37级</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-家族</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250091}\n<Assistant_Title2>系统介绍：</>以家族之名，以誓言为锁，在命运的深渊边缘互为锚点。寻找有着共同目标的友人缔结家族契约关系，完成家族任务提升家族等级，获得<Assistant_Property1>同行纹章</>以换取<Assistant_Property1>珍贵奖励</>。\n<Assistant_Title3>细节规则：</>{SendAnswer:[家族-契约方式]|666}，{SendAnswer:[家族-奖励说明]|667}，{SendAnswer:[家族-等级规则]|668}，{SendAnswer:[家族-展台规则]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Unlock Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>37</>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu-Family</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250091}\n<Assistant_Title2> System Introduction: </>In the name of the Family, with oaths as locks, serve as anchors for each other on the edge of the abyss of fate. Find friends with common goals to conclude a Family contract, complete Family quests to increase Family level, and obtain <Assistant_Property1>Companion Emblems</> to exchange for <Assistant_Property1>precious rewards</>.\n<Assistant_Title3> Detailed Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Family-Contract Methods]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family-Reward Explanation]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family-Level Rules]|668}, {SendAnswer:[Family-Display Stand Rules]|669}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>强化！完美法则</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>所有装备强化8级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening! Perfect Law</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 8",
