    ["<Assistant_Title1>【午后咖啡】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得午后咖啡套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-誓约</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Afternoon Coffee】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Gameplay Reward Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Afternoon Coffee set; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Gameplay-Covenant</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>烙印装备</>\n\n<Assistant_Title2>装备说明：</>烙印装备带有专属的烙印词条效果，但不带有套装效果。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>获取途径：</>\n\n1、参与副本玩法，可获得冒险倾向的烙印装备。\n\n2、开启以战养战秘宝，或在报销商店中兑换，可获得竞技倾向的烙印装备。\n\n3、此外，还可通过完成任务和探索获取烙印装备。"] = "<Assistant_Title1> Imprint Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Description: </> Imprint equipment comes with exclusive imprint affix effects but does not have set bonuses. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Sources: </>\n\n 1. Participate in dungeon activities to obtain adventure-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 2. Open War-forged treasures or exchange in the Reimbursement Shop to obtain competition-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 3. Additionally, imprint equipment can be obtained by completing quests and exploration.",
    ["60装等金色装备"] = "60 Item Level Gold Equipment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Achievement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Description: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Collection - Achievement</> to view achievements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the achievement system, the list on the left can switch between achievement <Assistant_Red>categories and subcategories</>. The input box above can be used to search for <Assistant_Red>achievement names</> within that category. When there are claimable achievement rewards, you can click <Assistant_Red>\"Claim All\"</> in the bottom right corner to claim all rewards within that category. \n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Rewards: </>A large amount of <Assistant_Red>Bound Gold Pound</>, <Assistant_Red>Titles</>, etc. \n<Assistant_Title2>Inquiry Guide: </>Enter the corresponding achievement name in the Strategy Assistant to query specific achievements."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Achievement】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Description: </>Click <Assistant_System>Menu - Collection - Achievement</> to view achievements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Usage Guide: </>After entering the achievement system, the list on the left can switch between achievement <Assistant_Red>categories and subcategories</>. The input box above can be used to search for <Assistant_Red>achievement names</> within that category. When there are claimable achievement rewards, you can click <Assistant_Red>\"Claim All\"</> in the bottom right corner to claim all rewards within that category. \n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Rewards: </>A large amount of <Assistant_Red>Bound Gold Pound</>, <Assistant_Red>Titles</>, etc. \n<Assistant_Title2>Inquiry Guide: </>Enter the corresponding achievement name in the Strategy Assistant to query specific achievements.",
