    ["<Highlight> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Backlund; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\""] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Pearl Ornament \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Бэкланд; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I've said it many times, I'm not a Toxin Expert. I'm just quite good at getting plants and animals to produce certain special compounds."] = "<P_Heart> (Sighs) </> I've said it many times, I'm not a Toxin Expert. I'm just quite good at getting plants and animals to produce certain special compounds.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Play Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Play voice rooms default to Host-Set Speech Order mode; you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Heartbeat Signal: </>Players on the mic sequence automatically gain guest status; the player on Mic 1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their 'Light Up' status. You can view the current speaking and 'Light Up' status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner of the room.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech order in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information, extend the duration of a permanent room, or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[语音房-房主权限]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-普通语音房]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[语音房-常驻房间]|1398}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Voice Room - Play Voice Room】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 10</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Voice Room</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250316}\n<Assistant_Title2>Capacity Limit: </>Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people.\n<Assistant_Title2>Default Speech Mode: </>Play voice rooms default to Host-Set Speech Order mode; you must click the unmute button to request to speak, and the host must approve it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Heartbeat Signal: </>Players on the mic Последовательность automatically gain guest status; the player on Mic 1 is the Guest of Honor. All guests in the voice room can express emotions by switching their 'Light Up' status. You can view the current speaking and 'Light Up' status of all guests more intuitively via the live interface in the top right corner of the room.\n<Assistant_Title2>Host Operations: </>The host can adjust the speech order in member permission settings, set mutes and room blacklists, and adjust room information, extend the duration of a permanent room, or transfer host status in the right sidebar settings.\n<Assistant_Title2>Other Operations: </>You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Host Permissions]|1395}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Standard Voice Room]|1396}, {SendAnswer:[Voice Room-Permanent Room]|1398}",
