    ["<Assistant_Title1>【幽灵船舵】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得幽灵船舵，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ghost Ship Helm】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Ghost Ship Helm; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["2级-充实"] = "Level 2 - Enriched",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>离开了俱乐部，有缘再会"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> has left the club; hope to see you again.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【颂诗礼服】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得颂诗礼服套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ode Dress】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ode Dress set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["Obtained by exchanging at the <Highlight> Blackthorn Shop </>"] = "Obtained by exchanging at the <Highlight> Blackthorn Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Level Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rapport and Level: </>Complete weekly family Quests to earn Rapport and increase the family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Assistant_Red>2000 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Quests: </>Family members can earn Rapport by teaming up to participate in corresponding gameplay. \n    <Assistant_Property1>High-Multiplier Rapport: </>Earned during the first few completions of each quest per week; after exceeding this limit, only the normal multiplier is granted. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Refresh Time: </>Quests refresh weekly. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[家族]|665}, {SendAnswer:[家族-契约方式]|666}, {SendAnswer:[家族-奖励说明]|667}, {SendAnswer:[家族-展台规则]|669}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Level Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Rapport and Level: </>Complete weekly family Quests to earn Rapport and increase the family level. The weekly Rapport acquisition cap is <Assistant_Red>2000 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Weekly Quests: </>Family members can earn Rapport by teaming up to participate in corresponding gameplay. \n    <Assistant_Property1>High-Multiplier Rapport: </>Earned during the first few completions of each quest per week; after exceeding this limit, only the normal multiplier is granted. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Refresh Time: </>Quests refresh weekly. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Covenant Method]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Description]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Showcase Rules]|669}",
    ["02任务交互物"] = "02 Quest interaction object",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【内搭】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Inner Wear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default outfit.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<P_Heart>（不……我也弄反了啊。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (No... I got it backwards too.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎还挺有意思的，要不要看看？）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Seems quite interesting, should I take a look?)</>",
    ["<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the City of Cities."] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the City of Cities.",
    ["<Highlight>在激活时间内</>，寻找并击败地图中游荡的<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">守卫者</>。|击败守卫者：<Highlight>%d</>/3"] = "<Highlight> Within the activation time </>, find and defeat the <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Guardians </> wandering the map.|Defeat Guardians: <Highlight>%d</>/3",
    ["<Chat_Red>未知目标</>的<Chat_Highlight>%s</>对你造成了<Chat_Highlight>%s</><Chat_Highlight>%s</>。"] = "The <Chat_Red> unknown target </>'s <Chat_Highlight> %s </> dealt <Chat_Highlight> %s </> <Chat_Highlight> %s </> to you.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Apprentice】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Apprentice】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["2049 Filter NPC & Player Stagnation"] = "2049 Filter NPC & Player Stagnation",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [The Beginning and End of the Doorway] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2> Acting Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Heard someone's cry for help... \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After completing the main storyline Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 19 </> in Acting, go to {Location: [Tingen (892, 1117)] | -10798; 11732; -1882; 2; 5200002; 0 } and talk to the <Assistant_Red> man stuck in the wall </> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [The Beginning and End of the Doorway] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2> Acting Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> Heard someone's cry for help... \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After completing the main storyline Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era\" and reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 19 </> in Acting, go to {Location: [Тинген (892, 1117)] | -10798; 11732; -1882; 2; 5200002; 0 } and talk to the <Assistant_Red> man stuck in the wall </> to accept the quest. \n<Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Cognitive Experience, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Moments from the Original Work】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction</>\nThe great Mr. Fool also lived here once; past memories and footprints have condensed into moments worth remembering. Welcome back to the old place, meet old friends, and explore that old dream from the original work. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Enter Gameplay</>\nYou can head to 【Original Work's Old Dream】 via the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TRPG Entry:</>Open the menu to enter 【TRPG】, join any organization, select the 【Moments from the Original Work】 gameplay in the 【Order World】, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry: Open the map, switch to the 【Exploration】 tab, view the 【Moments from the Original Work】 gameplay icon in 【World Details】, follow the icon's guidance to find the corresponding marker on the map, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Complete Interaction</>\nAfter reaching the target location, interact by clicking 【Touch】 to relive past memories.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Obtain Rewards</>\nAfter 【Touching】, you will receive rewards and increase the completion progress of the corresponding Order World map."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Moments from the Original Work】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction</>\nThe great Mr. Fool also lived here once; past memories and footprints have condensed into moments worth remembering. Welcome back to the old place, meet old friends, and explore that old dream from the original work. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Guide</>\n<Assistant_Title3>1. Enter Gameplay</>\nYou can head to 【Original Work's Old Dream】 via the following methods:\n<Assistant_Property2>TRPG Entry:</>Open the menu to enter 【TRPG】, join any organization, select the 【Moments from the Original Work】 gameplay in the 【Order World】, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Property1>Map Entry: Open the map, switch to the 【Exploration】 tab, view the 【Moments from the Original Work】 gameplay icon in 【World Details】, follow the icon's guidance to find the corresponding marker on the map, and click 【Go】 to automatically pathfind.\n<Assistant_Title3>2. Complete Interaction</>\nAfter reaching the target location, interact by clicking 【Touch】 to relive past memories.\n<Assistant_Title3>3. Obtain Rewards</>\nAfter 【Touching】, you will receive rewards and increase the completion progress of the corresponding Order World map.",
    ["<P_Heart> (I heard the two people next to me say his name is Sam? And something about... an illegitimate child... inheritance... a mistress?) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (I heard the two people next to me say his name is Sam? And something about... an illegitimate child... inheritance... a mistress?) </>",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>撤销了<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>的%s一职"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> revoked <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </>'s position as %s.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Let's stabilize it first.)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Let's stabilize it first.)</>",
    ["<ChatTag_GVG>[战场]</>"] = "<ChatTag_GVG>[Battlefield]</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>收容传奇</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>穿戴3件烙印装备"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Containment Legend</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Equip 3 Imprinted items",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌剧魅影-搭配规则】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>搭配阶段：</>本场主题公布后，满足资格的俱乐部成员可以进入搭配界面，根据主题关卡进行时装搭配。保存搭配后会计算搭配评分，并进入俱乐部本场评分排名。动作搭配主要影响表演效果，不影响评分。\n<Assistant_Title2>风格：</>每件外观拥有5组对立风格中的属性，如优雅/嬉皮、光明/黑暗、简约/奢华、纯真/冷酷、春夏/秋冬。每场会指定主风格和次风格，主风格权重更高。\n<Assistant_Title2>分数来源：</>单件服饰风格分会根据和每场主题的匹配度计算出基本分数，还会根据不同的染色等级受到染色加成；最终总分还会受到风尚鉴赏收集度的全局加成影响。\n<Assistant_Title2>参赛选手：</>进入调整阶段后，搭配会被锁定，俱乐部本场搭配评分前<Assistant_Red>5</>的成员自动成为参赛选手。\n<Assistant_Title2>调整顺序：</>有权限的管理者可以调整5名参赛选手的出场顺序；比赛前一段时间会禁止继续调整。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera - Coordination Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Coordination Phase: </>After the theme for the round is announced, eligible club members can enter the coordination interface to perform fashion coordination based on the theme level. After saving the coordination, the coordination score will be calculated, and you will enter the club's score ranking for this round. Action coordination mainly affects performance effects and does not affect the score. \n<Assistant_Title2>Style: </>Each appearance has attributes from 5 opposing style groups, such as Elegant/Hippie, Light/Dark, Minimalist/Luxurious, Innocent/Cold, Spring-Summer/Autumn-Winter. Each round will specify a main style and a secondary style, with the main style having a higher weight. \n<Assistant_Title2>Score Source: </>The style score of a single piece of clothing will be calculated based on the matching degree with each round's theme, and will also receive dyeing bonuses based on different dyeing levels; the final total score will also be affected by the global bonus of Fashion Appreciation collection. \n<Assistant_Title2>Contestants: </>After entering the adjustment phase, the coordination will be locked, and the top <Assistant_Red>5</> members in the club's coordination score for this round will automatically become contestants. \n<Assistant_Title2>Adjusting Order: </>Authorized managers can adjust the appearance order of the 5 contestants; adjusting will be prohibited for a period of time before the match.",
    ["3级灵界生物"] = "Level 3 Spirit World Creature",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【赏金猎手】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得赏金猎手套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Bounty Охотник】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Bounty Охотник outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon-Trading Tips】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective: </>Buy goods at a low price at a station and sell them at a high price at a subsequent station that acquires those goods to earn the price difference. \n<Assistant_Title2>Judging Prices: </>When you see goods significantly lower than the base price, consider buying; when you see purchase orders significantly higher than the base price, prioritize selling. The quantity that can be bought and sold at each station is limited, influenced by the station, goods multiplier, regional multiplier, and agreement bonuses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Advanced Advice: </>High-difficulty routes are longer, and sometimes you need to reserve a certain amount of tickets to deal with subsequent high-value opportunities. Before reaching the destination, try to sell goods at a high point to obtain maximum profit or ensure the converted value is sufficient to reach the rating."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon-Trading Tips】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective: </>Buy goods at a low price at a station and sell them at a high price at a subsequent station that acquires those goods to earn the price difference. \n<Assistant_Title2>Judging Prices: </>When you see goods significantly lower than the base price, consider buying; when you see purchase orders significantly higher than the base price, prioritize selling. The quantity that can be bought and sold at each station is limited, influenced by the station, goods multiplier, regional multiplier, and agreement bonuses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Advanced Advice: </>High-difficulty routes are longer, and sometimes you need to reserve a certain amount of tickets to deal with subsequent high-value opportunities. Before reaching the destination, try to sell goods at a high point to obtain maximum profit or ensure the converted value is sufficient to reach the rating.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【铁路大亨-交易技巧】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>核心目标：</>在站点低价买入货物，在后续会收购该货物的站点高价卖出，赚取差价。\n<Assistant_Title2>判断价格：</>看到明显低于基础价的商品，可考虑买入；看到明显高于基础价的订购单，可优先卖出。每站可购买和可出售数量有限，受站点、货物倍率、区域倍率与协议加成影响。\n<Assistant_Title2>进阶建议：</>高难度路线更长，有时需要保留一定票券应对后续高价值机会。临近终点前，尽量把货物在高点卖出获取最大收益或确保折算价值足够冲评级。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon-Trading Tips】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Core Objective: </>Buy goods at a low price at a station and sell them at a high price at a subsequent station that acquires those goods to earn the price difference. \n<Assistant_Title2>Judging Prices: </>When you see goods significantly lower than the base price, consider buying; when you see purchase orders significantly higher than the base price, prioritize selling. The quantity that can be bought and sold at each station is limited, influenced by the station, goods multiplier, regional multiplier, and agreement bonuses. \n<Assistant_Title2>Advanced Advice: </>High-difficulty routes are longer, and sometimes you need to reserve a certain amount of tickets to deal with subsequent high-value opportunities. Before reaching the destination, try to sell goods at a high point to obtain maximum profit or ensure the converted value is sufficient to reach the rating.",
    ["1. You can choose up to 4 different types of appearances. \n 2. The number of appearance gifts is equal to the number of appearance items placed by the player."] = "1. You can choose up to 4 different types of appearances. \n 2. The number of appearance gifts is equal to the number of appearance items placed by the player.",
    ["22条"] = "22 items",
    ["<Default>正在拼点分配下列资源，</><Tips>优先分配给想要的玩家。</>"] = "<Default>Rolling for these resources. </><Tips>Interested players get priority.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【枫树】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件枫树，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Maple】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Maple display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<P_Heart> (Maybe I can act as a clown and win him some tips...) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (Maybe I can act as a Клоун and win him some tips...) </>",
    ["5200268   Club   Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200268   Club   Multiplayer Scene",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【露营物语】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得露营物语套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Camping Story】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Camping Story outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<P_Heart>(Pressing hand to chest)</> Praise the Goddess."] = "<P_Heart>(Pressing hand to chest)</> Praise the Goddess.",
    ["5200093   QA资源测试模版关卡   大世界"] = "5200093 QA Resource Test Template Level Open World",
