    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Ancestor Armor】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ancestor Armor set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Garden</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ancestor Armor】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ancestor Armor set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - May Manor · Garden</>",
    ["Level 64 Adventure Equipment Selection Box"] = "Level 64 Adventure Equipment Selection Box",
    ["11_Frankie Apartment"] = "11_Frankie Apartment",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Death's Lament] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </> <Assistant_Property2> Side Quest </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> The Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person commission. Frye wants you to join the investigation. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 61 </> in Acting Level, you can accept the side quest in the quest log. \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Bound Gold Pounds, Gold Thread, Bound Soles, Cognition EXP, Waist Ornament [Eternal Darkness Candle]"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Death's Lament] </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Type: </> <Assistant_Property2> Side Quest </> \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Description: </> The Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person commission. Frye wants you to join the investigation. \n <Assistant_Title2> How to Accept: </> After reaching <Assistant_Red> Level 61 </> in Acting Level, you can accept the side quest in the quest log. \n <Assistant_Title2> Quest Rewards </>: Bound Gold Pounds, Gold Thread, Bound Soles, Cognition EXP, Waist Ornament [Eternal Darkness Candle]",
    ["1.事件目标：在特定区域参与并完成出现的突发事件，即可获得丰厚奖励。\n2.事件类型：事件包含<Highlight>“剧情”、“挑战”、“竞技”</>三种类型。\n3.刷新规则：当玩家进入“罪恶廷根”后会直接刷新出所有满足条件的事件，其中<Highlight>“竞技”事件报名时间为两分钟</>，突发事件刷新时间间隔，会取玩家进入场景的时间，<Highlight>“挑战”事件每间隔约10秒钟后会进行刷新</>，如果事件已结束则会再次出现。\n4.奖励规则：不同事件类型的奖励规则不同，<Highlight>“剧情”事件成功可领奖，“挑战”事件有不同的分档奖励，“困难·挑战”不设分档奖励，“竞技”事件会根据玩家排名发奖。</>\n5.奖励上限：单个玩家每周通过事件获得奖励的次数无上限，但是<Highlight>每周悬赏值有上限</>。\n6.失败条件：若在事件时限内未能完成目标（若有），则视为事件失败。\n7.脱离判定：若在事件完成前离开事件区域过远，会被判定为放弃事件，无法获得奖励。\n8.玩家战力：进入“罪恶廷根”位面会进行属性平衡，玩家在其中的“剧情”、困难·挑战”、“竞技”都为属性平衡玩法，<Highlight>“激战·邦尼”会受玩家战力影响，根据玩家战力转化梯度的属性平衡</>。"] = "1. Event Objective: Participate in and complete the sudden events that appear in specific areas to receive generous rewards.\n2. Event Types: Events include three types: <Highlight>\"Story\", \"Challenge\", and \"Competition\".</>\n3. Refresh Rules: When players enter \"Sinful Тинген\", all events meeting the conditions will be refreshed immediately. Among them, the registration time for <Highlight>\"Competition\" events is two minutes</>. The refresh interval for sudden events is based on the time the player enters the scene; <Highlight>\"Challenge\" events refresh approximately every 10 seconds</>, and if an event has ended, it will reappear.\n4. Reward Rules: Reward rules vary by event type. <Highlight>\"Story\" events grant rewards upon success, \"Challenge\" events have tiered rewards, \"Hard · Challenge\" events do not have tiered rewards, and \"Competition\" events distribute rewards based on player ranking.</>\n5. Reward Limit: There is no limit to the number of times a single player can receive rewards from events per week, but <Highlight>there is a weekly cap on Bounty Points.</>\n6. Failure Conditions: If the objective (if any) is not completed within the event time limit, the event is considered failed.\n7. Departure Judgment: If you move too far away from the event area before the event is completed, it will be judged as abandoning the event, and you will not be able to receive rewards.\n8. Player Combat Power: Attribute balancing will be applied upon entering the \"Sinful Тинген\" plane. The \"Story\", \"Hard · Challenge\", and \"Competition\" modes within it are all attribute-balanced gameplay. <Highlight>\"Fierce Battle · Bonnie\" is affected by player combat power, with attribute balancing based on a gradient converted from the player's combat power.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雕花花瓶】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>探索奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台组件雕花花瓶，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>探索</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Carved Vase】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Exploration\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Carved Vase display component. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Exploration</> acquisition.",
    ["<P_Heart>（再根据卜杖的指引，就可以找到珍妮在哪里。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Then according to the guidance of the dowsing rod, I can find where Jenny is.)</>",
    ["<P_Heart>那么，我应该选哪条途径呢？</>"] = "<P_Heart>So, which pathway should I choose?</>",
