    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>花费了%d俱乐部基金，将%s升级到%d级"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Name\" u=\"role=%s\"> [%s] </> spent %d club funds to upgrade %s to level %d.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Key Cultivation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Progression-Growth\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 2 Legendary Connections from a five-pull"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Key Cultivation</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Progression-Growth\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain 2 Legendary Connections from a five-pull",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【歌剧魅影】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>歌剧魅影</>是俱乐部之间，比拼外观搭配的玩法，整体赛制和俱乐部联赛类似，但各位需要搭配外观，在魅影长廊一决高下。玩法会按赛季/轮次进行，和俱乐部联赛节奏保持一致。\n<Assistant_Title2>核心流程：</>每周指定时间公布本场主题 → 成员进行时装搭配并形成评分排名 → 开赛前锁定搭配评分前5名参赛选手 → 俱乐部管理调整出场顺序 → 晚间开赛进行俱乐部间 5 场对抗 → 结算胜负与奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与条件：</>俱乐部需满足赛区/等级等条件，成员需要为正式成员，候补成员无法参与。\n<Assistant_Title2>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[歌剧魅影-搭配规则]|910},{SendAnswer:[歌剧魅影-比赛与奖励]|911}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </><Assistant_System>Phantom of the Opera</> is a gameplay mode where clubs compete in appearance coordination. The overall tournament format is similar to the Club League, but you will need to coordinate outfits to compete in the Phantom Corridor. The gameplay follows a seasonal/round-based schedule, consistent with the rhythm of the Club League. \n<Assistant_Title2> Core Process: </> The theme for the current round is announced at a designated time each week → Members perform fashion coordination to generate a score ranking → The top 5 scoring contestants are locked in before the match starts → Club management adjusts the entry order → 5 club-vs-club matches take place in the evening → Results and rewards are settled. \n<Assistant_Title2> Participation Requirements: </> The club must meet division/level requirements, and members must be official members; substitute members cannot participate. \n<Assistant_Title2> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Coordination Rules]|910}, {SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Matches and Rewards]|911}",
    ["<P_Heart>（似乎不对，这是接下来要出现的纪元的，再试试。）</>"] = "<P_Heart>(That doesn't seem right; this one belongs to the next epoch. Let me try again.)</>",
    ["<HighLight>致迷途的羔羊与渴求庇护的灵魂</>：\n能占用一下您的时间吗？我想给您讲一讲我们的道标和救主，“愚者”先生。\n我主自称愚者，在过去，在现在，也在未来，他是支配灵界的伟大主宰，也是执掌好运的黄黑之王，更是每个生灵追求永恒的道标。\n他是怜悯的，他是仁慈的，他是这个世界的救主，他让我们以他来代称，而非祂。\n他的仁爱播撒在人间，为家家户户带去温暖。我们将这关怀化作触手可及的回馈，将愚者的福音传遍大地——\n每月购买愚者福音，您将获得每日返现，以及福音定期馈赠的材料物资。我们还将为您带来每日福音券的抽取，解读运势。\n聆听《愚者圣典》，赞美愚者！赞美愚者的馈赠！愿我主的恩典在您身边日夜相伴，愿这福音成为您前行路上永不熄灭的灯火！"] = "<HighLight>To the lost lambs and souls seeking shelter</>: \nMay I have a moment of your time? I would like to tell you about our beacon and savior, Mr. Fool. \nMy Lord calls himself Шут. In the past, in the present, and in the future, He is the great ruler who dominates the Spirit World, the King of Yellow and Black who holds good luck, and the beacon for every living creature pursuing eternity. \nHe is compassionate, He is merciful, and He is the savior of this world. He lets us refer to Him as 'him' instead of 'He'. \nHis benevolence is spread across the human world, bringing warmth to every household. We transform this care into tangible rewards, spreading the Gospel of Шут throughout the land—\nPurchase the Gospel of Шут every month to receive daily cashbacks, as well as materials and supplies gifted regularly by the Gospel. We will also bring you daily Gospel Ticket draws and fortune readings. \nListen to the 'Scripture of Шут', praise Шут! Praise the gifts of Шут! May the grace of my Lord accompany you day and night, and may this Gospel become the never-extinguishing lamp on your path forward!",
    ["5230227   求助女子的房屋   位面"] = "5230227 House of the Woman Seeking Help Plane",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\">小怪</>击杀概率掉落"] = "Dropped by <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Minions </> with a certain probability",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Updates】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Post Update: </>In the Mystery Circle interface, click the <Assistant_System>Post</> button to edit and publish an update. When posting, you can edit text, upload images, set topics, define visibility, and manage comment and repost permissions.\n<Assistant_Title2>Share to Mystery Circle: </>In the share interface, click the <Assistant_System>Share to Mystery Circle</> button to take a screenshot of the content and share it to the Mystery Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Delete Mystery Circle Posts and Comments: </>On your own updates and comments, click the '...' more button to delete them.\n<Assistant_Title2>Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mystery Circle updates, comments, or images are non-compliant, they will be removed.</>If you discover any violations or abnormal behavior by other players, please report them or contact customer support promptly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[诡秘圈]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-关系]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-页签]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[诡秘圈-话题]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Updates】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Post Update: </>In the Mystery Circle interface, click the <Assistant_System>Post</> button to edit and publish an update. When posting, you can edit text, upload images, set topics, define visibility, and manage comment and repost permissions.\n<Assistant_Title2>Share to Mystery Circle: </>In the share interface, click the <Assistant_System>Share to Mystery Circle</> button to take a screenshot of the content and share it to the Mystery Circle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Delete Mystery Circle Posts and Comments: </>On your own updates and comments, click the '...' more button to delete them.\n<Assistant_Title2>Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mystery Circle updates, comments, or images are non-compliant, they will be removed.</>If you discover any violations or abnormal behavior by other players, please report them or contact customer support promptly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Topics]|1394}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Being with you makes us the \"best partners.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the side story \"Dreams Come True (Part 1)\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>42</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Nightingale Silver Whistle, Holy Robe"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Being with you makes us the \"best partners.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the side story \"Dreams Come True (Part 1)\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>42</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Nightingale Silver Whistle, Holy Robe",
