    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Pistol Gesture】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand action rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand · Pistol Gesture. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Pistol Gesture】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand action rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand · Pistol Gesture. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【桃心糖饼】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得桃心糖饼，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Heart Sugar Cookie】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Heart Sugar Cookie. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>",
    ["<P_Heart> (lowering voice) </> And look, the cost of living in Tingen is much cheaper than in Backlund; it's more cost-effective to buy here."] = "<P_Heart> (lowering voice) </> And look, the cost of living in Тинген is much cheaper than in Бэкланд; it's more cost-effective to buy here.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Honorary Knighthood</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Duke rank in Dominator's Clash"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Clash! Honorary Knighthood</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Duke rank in Dominator's Clash",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【美梦成真】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>支线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我和你在一起，就是“最佳搭档”。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成支线剧情《美梦成真（上）》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>42级</>后，可在任务面板手动领取\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、金纺线、夜莺银哨、圣洁道袍"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dreams Come True】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Being with you makes us the \"best partners.\"\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing the side story \"Dreams Come True (Part 1)\" and reaching an Acting Level of <Assistant_Red>42</>, you can manually accept it in the quest panel.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Sol, Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Nightingale Silver Whistle, Holy Robe",
    ["1.俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n2.俱乐部活动途径人数限制：部分俱乐部活动对参与成员的途径人数有限制要求，详情可见俱乐部活动说明。"] = "1. Club member locking rules: During club-based activities (such as the Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, City of Dragon Hunting, Plateau Battle), clubs are not allowed to add or remove members. \n 2. Club activity pathway participation limits: Some club activities have restrictions on the number of participants per pathway; see the club activity instructions for details.",
    ["5231159 Backlund - Single-player Instance"] = "5231159 Бэкланд - Single-player Instance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【浮光】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得浮光，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Floating Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Floating Light after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Cross of No Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>First-top-up reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Cross of No Darkness. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>First-top-up reward"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Cross of No Darkness】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>First-top-up reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Cross of No Darkness. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>First-top-up reward",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【喵乌贼】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得喵乌贼，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Meow Squid】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Meow Squid. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
