    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Spirit World Floating Butterfly】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Spirit World Floating Butterfly. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spirit World Floating Butterfly】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Fashion Corridor accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Spirit World Floating Butterfly. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via <Assistant_System>Fashion Corridor</> collection progress.",
    ["1、征服声望每周获取上限，上限可累积两周；\n2、通过战略服终末猎杀获取的征服声望每周有上限，不可累积；\n3、装配环身“律令扉页（头部）”后，获得战功时会额外获得征服声望，该方式获得的征服声望不计算在上限中。"] = "1. There is a weekly cap on Conquest Prestige acquisition, which can be accumulated for two weeks; \n2. Conquest Prestige obtained through the strategic server's Final Hunt has a weekly cap and cannot be accumulated; \n3. After equipping the ring \"Law Decree Page (Head),\" you will receive additional Conquest Prestige when gaining War Merit. This method of obtaining Conquest Prestige does not count towards the cap.",
    ["0:\"默认第一偏移点到目标的连线作为起始方向\",1:\"使用表格内部的偏移\",2:\"不使用偏移，目标朝向\"。"] = "0: \"Default to the line connecting the first offset point to the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\".",
