    ["<Assistant_Title1>【追风雪的人】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>一位老先生坐在雪地上，不知道是在休息，还是需要帮助？\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[霍纳奇斯山脉(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0}，和<Assistant_Red>老先生</>对话可接取任务\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chaser of Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow. Is he resting, or does he need help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountain Range(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and speak with the <Assistant_Red>Old Gentleman</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>翡翠织锦・珍珠华饰・优雅室内裙\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Emerald Brocade · Pearl Ornament · Elegant Indoor Skirt \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Бэкланд; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Showcase Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Family - Edit Showcase</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Editing Permissions: </>Different family members have different permissions to change showcase content. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Ordinary Members: </>Only their own character. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Chief: </>All member characters (the configurable action range is limited to what the corresponding player has unlocked), <Assistant_Property1>Camera</>, <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (configurable range is limited to what the Chief has unlocked), <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (configurable range is limited to what the Chief has unlocked), <Assistant_Property1>Wind Direction</>, <Assistant_Property1>Color Grading</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Showcase Removal: </>When a family member leaves the family, the following content for that player will be automatically removed from the showcase: \n    <Assistant_Property1>Showcase Character</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (if used) \n    <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (if used) \n<Assistant_Title2>Showcase Unlocks: </>As the family level increases, exclusive family showcase scenes are unlocked at level 2 and level 6. These scenes can only be used in the family showcase. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Contract Methods]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Explanation]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Level Rules]|668}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family - Showcase Rules】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Family - Edit Showcase</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Editing Permissions: </>Different family members have different permissions to change showcase content. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Ordinary Members: </>Only their own character. \n    <Assistant_Property1>Chief: </>All member characters (the configurable action range is limited to what the corresponding player has unlocked), <Assistant_Property1>Camera</>, <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (configurable range is limited to what the Chief has unlocked), <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (configurable range is limited to what the Chief has unlocked), <Assistant_Property1>Wind Direction</>, <Assistant_Property1>Color Grading</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Showcase Removal: </>When a family member leaves the family, the following content for that player will be automatically removed from the showcase: \n    <Assistant_Property1>Showcase Character</>\n    <Assistant_Property1>Scene</> (if used) \n    <Assistant_Property1>Set Pieces</> (if used) \n<Assistant_Title2>Showcase Unlocks: </>As the family level increases, exclusive family showcase scenes are unlocked at level 2 and level 6. These scenes can only be used in the family showcase. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Family]|665}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Contract Methods]|666}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Reward Explanation]|667}, {SendAnswer:[Family - Level Rules]|668}",
    ["66级6人本Boss困难"] = "Level 66 6-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>星光织锦・旅迹裁量・短斗篷套装\n星空浩瀚，凡门皆达。披戴此身，愿旅途的星辉指引你们永不迷失。"] = "<Highlight> Craft: </> Starlight Brocade · Journey Measurement · Short Cape Set \n The starry sky is vast, and all Doors can be reached. Wearing this, may the starlight of your journey guide you so you never get lost.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【金狮之首】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>神眷池饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得金狮之首，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>召唤-灵界焕容</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Golden Lion Head】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>God-Favored Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Golden Lion Head; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon-Spirit World Renewal</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【旅行的初始】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>人脉玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得旅行的初始套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-往事陈列馆</>使用记忆珍匣兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Beginning of the Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Beginning of the Journey set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【星盘的启迪】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得星盘的启迪套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Enlightenment of the Star Chart】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Enlightenment of the Star Chart set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mysterious Hardcover Notebook】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Store Direct Purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After purchasing from the store, obtain the Mysterious Hardcover Notebook; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysterious Hardcover Notebook】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Store Direct Purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After purchasing from the store, obtain the Mysterious Hardcover Notebook; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Storm Tear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Storm Tear. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Storm Tear】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Storm Tear. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Astral Wonders</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【星月烛台】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得星月烛台，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Star-Moon Candlestick】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward display component\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Star-Moon Candlestick. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>人脉商店</>\n<Assistant_Title2>查看：</>\n点击<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-兑换</>即可打开{SendAnswer:人脉商店|558}。\n<Assistant_Title2>兑换：</>\n可使用{SendAnswer:投影片段|557}兑换相应道具奖励，获取后可在背包使用。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[投影片段]|557}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Shop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>View:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to open the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop|558}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Exchange:</>\nYou can use {SendAnswer:Projection Fragments|557} to exchange for corresponding item rewards, which can be used in your Inventory after acquisition.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Connection]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Projection Fragments]|557}, {SendAnswer:[Make Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【星盘的裁断】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得星盘的裁断套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Judgment of the Star Chart] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Cult Level Reward Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After use, gain the Judgment of the Star Chart set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Unlocked by Cult Level",
    ["1. 在大世界范围中探索，解锁奉献之灵、收集奉献之灵或完成各类隐匿恩赐解谜，提升完成度；\n2. 完成度达到对应档位要求后，玩家可以领取该档位奖励；"] = "1. Explore the open world, unlock Spirits of Devotion, collect them, or complete various Hidden Grace puzzles to increase your completion progress; \n 2. Once your completion progress reaches the required threshold, you can claim the corresponding rewards.",
    ["<P_Heart>(Are they blackmailing that old man? Let's go help!)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(Are they blackmailing that old man? Let's go help!)</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </><Assistant_System>Phantom of the Opera</> is a gameplay mode where clubs compete in appearance coordination. The overall tournament format is similar to the Club League, but you will need to coordinate outfits to compete in the Phantom Corridor. The gameplay follows a seasonal/round-based schedule, consistent with the rhythm of the Club League. \n<Assistant_Title2> Core Process: </> The theme for the current round is announced at a designated time each week → Members perform fashion coordination to generate a score ranking → The top 5 scoring contestants are locked in before the match starts → Club management adjusts the entry order → 5 club-vs-club matches take place in the evening → Results and rewards are settled. \n<Assistant_Title2> Participation Requirements: </> The club must meet division/level requirements, and members must be official members; substitute members cannot participate. \n<Assistant_Title2> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Coordination Rules]|910}, {SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Matches and Rewards]|911}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Phantom of the Opera】</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Gameplay Instructions: </><Assistant_System>Phantom of the Opera</> is a gameplay mode where clubs compete in appearance coordination. The overall tournament format is similar to the Club League, but you will need to coordinate outfits to compete in the Phantom Corridor. The gameplay follows a seasonal/round-based schedule, consistent with the rhythm of the Club League. \n<Assistant_Title2> Core Process: </> The theme for the current round is announced at a designated time each week → Members perform fashion coordination to generate a score ranking → The top 5 scoring contestants are locked in before the match starts → Club management adjusts the entry order → 5 club-vs-club matches take place in the evening → Results and rewards are settled. \n<Assistant_Title2> Participation Requirements: </> The club must meet division/level requirements, and members must be official members; substitute members cannot participate. \n<Assistant_Title2> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Coordination Rules]|910}, {SendAnswer:[Phantom of the Opera - Matches and Rewards]|911}",
    ["Level 98 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard"] = "Level 98 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Connection Shop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>View:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Exchange</> to open the {SendAnswer:人脉商店|558}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Exchange:</>\nYou can use {SendAnswer:投影片段|557} to exchange for corresponding item rewards, which can be used in your Inventory after acquisition. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}, {SendAnswer:[投影片段]|557}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Shop</>\n<Assistant_Title2>View:</>\nClick <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Exchange</> to open the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop|558}. \n<Assistant_Title2>Exchange:</>\nYou can use {SendAnswer:Projection Fragments|557} to exchange for corresponding item rewards, which can be used in your Inventory after acquisition. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Projection Fragments]|557}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Morning Sun】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Morning Sun after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Morning Sun】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Morning Sun after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [\"Star\"] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Pool Outfit \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain the \"Star\" set; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [\"Star\"] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Pool Outfit \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain the \"Star\" set; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>",
    ["1. Disconnection <Highlight>%d </> minutes will retain your queue status; you can continue queuing after reconnecting. \n 2. If disconnected for over <Highlight> %d </> minutes, the queue will be automatically canceled. \n 3. If you reach your turn while disconnected, you can <Highlight> skip the queue </> and enter the game directly; this expires the next day."] = "1. Disconnection <Highlight>%d </> minutes will retain your queue status; you can continue queuing after reconnecting. \n 2. If disconnected for over <Highlight> %d </> minutes, the queue will be automatically canceled. \n 3. If you reach your turn while disconnected, you can <Highlight> skip the queue </> and enter the game directly; this expires the next day.",
    ["<P_Heart>（你趁着店主不注意偷偷摸了摸小猫）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (You took advantage of the shopkeeper's inattention to secretly pet the kitten) </>",
    ["<Highlight_L>猎场告急</>：我方猎手<HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>在<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[猎龙之城(%d,%d)]</>惨遭%s<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</>猎杀！这是对我方猎手的公然挑衅！<HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">【前往驰援】</>"] = "<Highlight_L>Hunt Emergency</>: Our Охотник <HyperLink stylename=\"Our_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> was tragically hunted by %s<HyperLink stylename=\"Enemy_Name\" u=\"role=%s\">[%s]</> at <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">[City of Dragon Hunting(%d,%d)]</>! This is a blatant provocation against our Охотникs! <HyperLink stylename=\"Chat_Hyperlink\" u=\"pvlhpos=%s,%s,%s,%s\">【Go to Reinforce】</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【How to Join a Covenant】</>\nOnce the Covenant is unlocked, you can enter the joining process through the <Assistant_System>TRPG</> entrance or by finding the corresponding Covenant NPC.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Joining Process:</>\n1. Open the Covenant selection interface.\n2. Select the Covenant you wish to join.\n3. View the abilities, faith, and recommended attributes of that Covenant.\n4. Confirm after completing attribute point allocation.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Selection and Attribute Allocation]|1274}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【How to Join a Covenant】</>\nOnce the Covenant is unlocked, you can enter the joining process through the <Assistant_System>TRPG</> entrance or by finding the corresponding Covenant NPC.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Joining Process:</>\n1. Open the Covenant selection interface.\n2. Select the Covenant you wish to join.\n3. View the abilities, faith, and recommended attributes of that Covenant.\n4. Confirm after completing attribute point allocation.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Selection and Attribute Allocation]|1274}",
    ["<P_Heart> (You pull out a ticket covered in blood with the word \"Help\" written all over it) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (You pull out a ticket covered in blood with the word \"Help\" written all over it) </>",
    ["52级6人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 52 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["2个"] = "2 items",
    ["<Highlight>工艺：</>精鞣皮革・轻便裁剪・都市漫步装\n身着雾霭和尘埃，在万都之都的角落寻找属于自己的晴天。"] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Tanned Leather・Lightweight Cut・Urban Stroll Outfit\nDressed in mist and dust, searching for your own sunny day in the corners of the City of Cities.",
    ["<ChatTag_Team>[Group]</>"] = "<ChatTag_Team>[Group]</>",
    ["3引导"] = "3 Guide",
    ["1. In some dungeons, if the team is not full, you can post a request for help. \n 2. Successfully helping others with their requests grants a certain amount of bound Gold Pounds. \n 3. Failing to provide support also grants a small amount of bound Gold Pounds."] = "1. In some dungeons, if the team is not full, you can post a request for help. \n 2. Successfully helping others with their requests grants a certain amount of bound Gold Pounds. \n 3. Failing to provide support also grants a small amount of bound Gold Pounds.",
    ["<EquipHighLight>When changing equipment, </>transfer Strengthening effects without loss<EquipHighLight></>"] = "<EquipHighLight>When changing equipment, </>transfer Strengthening effects without loss<EquipHighLight></>",
    ["5200081 Backlund Open World"] = "5200081 Бэкланд Open World",
    ["Selecting Cinematic graphics at 4K resolution results in a heavy rendering load, and the native frame rate may be limited. Enabling frame generation can effectively increase the frame rate and improve visual fluidity."] = "Selecting Cinematic graphics at 4K resolution results in a heavy rendering load, and the native frame rate may be limited. Enabling frame generation can effectively increase the frame rate and improve visual fluidity.",
    ["35装等装备随机箱"] = "Level 35 Equipment Random Box",
    ["5230408 Pressure Plate Test - Copy"] = "5230408 Pressure Plate Test - Copy",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant System】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Covenant System</> is a social gameplay where two players who are friends form a team, go to Mrs. Sammer to apply for a covenant relationship, and then participate in team activities together to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>① Both parties must reach <Assistant_Red>Level 30</> to unlock the Covenant System. ② Both parties must be friends and have a <Assistant_Red>Friendship Level of 200 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rules: </>① Players who meet the requirements form a team and go to <Assistant_Red>Mrs. Sammer in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers</>, where the captain initiates the covenant invitation. ② After the invitee accepts, they enter the process of writing vows to each other. ③ After writing the vows, both parties exchange, view, and accept each other's vows, then enter the wedding photo process. ④ Both parties select a photo template, and after final confirmation, the photo process is completed, and the two parties form a covenant relationship."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant System】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Covenant System</> is a social gameplay where two players who are friends form a team, go to Mrs. Sammer to apply for a covenant relationship, and then participate in team activities together to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>① Both parties must reach <Assistant_Red>Level 30</> to unlock the Covenant System. ② Both parties must be friends and have a <Assistant_Red>Friendship Level of 200 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rules: </>① Players who meet the requirements form a team and go to <Assistant_Red>Mrs. Sammer in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers</>, where the captain initiates the covenant invitation. ② After the invitee accepts, they enter the process of writing vows to each other. ③ After writing the vows, both parties exchange, view, and accept each other's vows, then enter the wedding photo process. ④ Both parties select a photo template, and after final confirmation, the photo process is completed, and the two parties form a covenant relationship.",
    ["45级鞋靴词条"] = "Level 45 Footwear Affix",
    ["<Chat_Locate> Range Settings </>"] = "<Chat_Locate> Range Settings </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【聊天-表情包】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>聊天-输入框旁表情按钮</>\n<Assistant_Title2>表情包：</>包含emoji表情、系统表情和自定义表情。\n<Assistant_Title2>上传自定义表情：</>在自定义表情页签，点击+按钮，可以自行上传自定义表情，审核通过后即可使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>自定义表情上限：</>自定义表情上限为50个。\n<Assistant_Title2>表情同步：</>同一个账号下的不同角色，默认同步所有表情包。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[聊天]|1413}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Chat - Emoticons】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Chat - Emoticon button next to input box</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticons: </>Includes emojis, system emoticons, and custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Upload Custom Emoticons: </>In the Custom Emoticons tab, click the + button to upload your own; they can be used after approval. \n<Assistant_Title2>Custom Emoticon Limit: </>Limit is 50 custom emoticons. \n<Assistant_Title2>Emoticon Sync: </>All characters under the same account sync all emoticons by default. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Chat]|1413}",
    ["<Highlight>%s</>后恢复1点体力，可使用道具快速恢复体力"] = "1 Stamina restored after <Highlight>%s</>, use items to restore stamina quickly",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 20</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club</>{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1250052}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>Once your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a Club or create your own. Participate in various Club activities to earn generous rewards and Peer Emblems, which can be exchanged for reward items in the Club Shop.\n<Assistant_Title2>Creating a Club: </>Creating a Club requires a creation fee. After creation, if the number of responses reaches 4 within 24 hours, the creation is successful; otherwise, it fails.<Assistant_Red>Neither failed creation nor voluntary cancellation will result in a refund of the creation fee.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Types: </>Clubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs. You can adjust this in the Club Information modification section. Leisure Clubs will not display Extraordinary Ratings in the member list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rename Item: </>You can purchase a Renaming Notice in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</> to change the Club's name and emblem text.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Restrictions: </>1. Club Member Lock Rule: During Club-based activities (such as <Assistant_System>Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Highland War</>), Clubs <Assistant_Red>do not allow members to join or leave.</>\n2. Club Activity Pathway Limit: Some Club activities have restrictions on the number of <Assistant_Red>Pathways</> participating; see the Club activity instructions for details.\n3. Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation. <Assistant_Red>Some activities only support Official Members participating</>. Official Members are the backbone of the Club and can participate in Club activities; Reserve Members are the reserve force of the Club and cannot participate in some activities. You can maintain an active status and contact management to be promoted to an Official Member.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部建筑和资金]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部职位]|1402}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃]|1403}, {SendAnswer:[场景-俱乐部]|567}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Required Level: </>Cognition Level <Assistant_Red>Level 20</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1250052}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction: </>Once your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a Club or create your own. Participate in various Club activities to earn generous rewards and Peer Emblems, which can be exchanged for reward items in the Club Shop.\n<Assistant_Title2>Creating a Club: </>Creating a Club requires a creation fee. After creation, if the number of responses reaches 4 within 24 hours, the creation is successful; otherwise, it fails.<Assistant_Red>Neither failed creation nor voluntary cancellation will result in a refund of the creation fee.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Club Types: </>Clubs are divided into Leisure Clubs and Combat Clubs. You can adjust this in the Club Information modification section. Leisure Clubs will not display Extraordinary Ratings in the member list.\n<Assistant_Title2>Rename Item: </>You can purchase a Renaming Notice in the <Assistant_System>Mall - Secret Collection</> to change the Club's name and emblem text.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Restrictions: </>1. Club Member Lock Rule: During Club-based activities (such as <Assistant_System>Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Highland War</>), Clubs <Assistant_Red>do not allow members to join or leave.</>\n2. Club Activity Pathway Limit: Some Club activities have restrictions on the number of <Assistant_Red>Pathways</> participating; see the Club activity instructions for details.\n3. Before participating in activities, please confirm the position allocation. <Assistant_Red>Some activities only support Official Members participating</>. Official Members are the backbone of the Club and can participate in Club activities; Reserve Members are the reserve force of the Club and cannot participate in some activities. You can maintain an active status and contact management to be promoted to an Official Member.\n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Details: </>{SendAnswer:[Club - Club Buildings and Funds]|1401}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Positions]|1402}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}, {SendAnswer:[Scene - Club]|567}",
