    ["3正式文本未确定，此为流程用临时文本。"] = "3 Formal text not yet determined; this is temporary text for the workflow.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Event Goal: </>Various unexpected events will constantly occur in the City of Shadows. Participate in and complete events to obtain bounty rewards and advance gameplay progress.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize completing {SendAnswer:剧情事件|879} to gradually unlock more {SendAnswer:挑战事件|880} and {SendAnswer:竞技事件|881} and experience the complete City of Shadows content.\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Event Types (includes three types): </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Advance the plot and unlock more gameplay content.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Complete boss challenges, racing, and other gameplay to obtain rich rewards. Note: Fierce Battle · Bonnie will convert attributes based on the player's combat power, affecting the challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Participate in resource contention, chases, and compete with other players in the same arena.\n<Assistant_Title2>2. Event Refresh Rules: </>Only events that are currently unlocked and meet the activation conditions will be displayed. As the plot progresses, more events will be gradually unlocked.\n<Assistant_Title3>Plot Events: </>Unlocked after completing prerequisites; they will not refresh randomly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Challenge Events: </>Continuously refresh after meeting activation conditions; they reappear approximately 10 seconds after completion.\n<Assistant_Title3>Competition Events: </>Open for matchmaking at specified times daily; starts after successful matchmaking.\n<Assistant_Title2>3. Reward Rules: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Complete to claim rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Racing challenges distribute rewards based on ranking; Fierce Battle · Bonnie has tiered rewards based on performance; difficult boss events do not have tiered rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Rewards are distributed based on final ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>4. Reward Cap: </>There is no limit to the number of times event rewards can be claimed, but there is a weekly cap on the Bounty Value that can be obtained. You can continue to participate in events after reaching the cap, but you will not continue to receive Bounty Value.\n<Assistant_Title2>5. Failure Conditions: </>\nFailure to complete event objectives within the specified time.\nLeaving the event area too far during the event is considered a voluntary abandonment."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Event Goal: </>Various unexpected events will constantly occur in the City of Shadows. Participate in and complete events to obtain bounty rewards and advance gameplay progress.\n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize completing {SendAnswer:Plot Events|879} to gradually unlock more {SendAnswer:Challenge Events|880} and {SendAnswer:Competition Events|881} and experience the complete City of Shadows content.\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Event Types (includes three types): </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Advance the plot and unlock more gameplay content.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Complete boss challenges, racing, and other gameplay to obtain rich rewards. Note: Fierce Battle · Bonnie will convert attributes based on the player's combat power, affecting the challenge.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Participate in resource contention, chases, and compete with other players in the same arena.\n<Assistant_Title2>2. Event Refresh Rules: </>Only events that are currently unlocked and meet the activation conditions will be displayed. As the plot progresses, more events will be gradually unlocked.\n<Assistant_Title3>Plot Events: </>Unlocked after completing prerequisites; they will not refresh randomly.\n<Assistant_Title3>Challenge Events: </>Continuously refresh after meeting activation conditions; they reappear approximately 10 seconds after completion.\n<Assistant_Title3>Competition Events: </>Open for matchmaking at specified times daily; starts after successful matchmaking.\n<Assistant_Title2>3. Reward Rules: </>\n<Assistant_Title3>① Plot Events: </>Complete to claim rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>② Challenge Events: </>Racing challenges distribute rewards based on ranking; Fierce Battle · Bonnie has tiered rewards based on performance; difficult boss events do not have tiered rewards.\n<Assistant_Title3>③ Competition Events: </>Rewards are distributed based on final ranking.\n<Assistant_Title2>4. Reward Cap: </>There is no limit to the number of times event rewards can be claimed, but there is a weekly cap on the Bounty Value that can be obtained. You can continue to participate in events after reaching the cap, but you will not continue to receive Bounty Value.\n<Assistant_Title2>5. Failure Conditions: </>\nFailure to complete event objectives within the specified time.\nLeaving the event area too far during the event is considered a voluntary abandonment.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Death's Aria】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person case, and Frye hopes you will join the investigation.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 61</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Instructions: </>During the steps of following the candlelight's guidance, the first candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33663,61051)]|33663;61051;145;2;5231160;0}, the second candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(31670,63540)]|31670;63540;453;2;5231160;0}, the third candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33690,66955)]|33690;66955;343;2;5231160;0}, the fourth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(38130,66653)]|38130;66653;400;2;5231160;0}, the fifth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(45100,66387)]|45100;66387;380;2;5231160;0}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards:</>Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Bound Sol, Cognition EXP, Waist Accessory [Everdark Candle], Title"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Death's Aria】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Side Quest</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Blackthorn Security Company has received a complex missing person case, and Frye hopes you will join the investigation.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 61</>, you can accept this side quest in the quest log.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Instructions: </>During the steps of following the candlelight's guidance, the first candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33663,61051)]|33663;61051;145;2;5231160;0}, the second candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(31670,63540)]|31670;63540;453;2;5231160;0}, the third candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(33690,66955)]|33690;66955;343;2;5231160;0}, the fourth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(38130,66653)]|38130;66653;400;2;5231160;0}, the fifth candle coordinate {Location:[Gate of the Underworld(45100,66387)]|45100;66387;380;2;5231160;0}.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards:</>Bound Gold Pound, Gold Thread, Bound Sol, Cognition EXP, Waist Accessory [Everdark Candle], Title",
