    ["<Assistant_Title1>【永暗蜡烛】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>剧情奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得永暗蜡烛，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过阿兹克支线获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Everdark Candle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Plot Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Everdark Candle. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via the Azik side quest",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Prayer】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Prayer】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand action\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Highlight>Tingen</>, a city located in the northern part of the Loen Kingdom. Noisy mornings, hurried workers, and flowing street vendors constitute the background of its daily life. In this city, Klein met the reliable Captain Dunn, who had a poor memory, got to know the kind and stubborn teacher Old Neil, and found Mr. Azik, a mentor who spanned a long history."] = "<Highlight>Тинген</>, a city located in the northern part of the Loen Kingdom. Noisy mornings, hurried workers, and flowing street vendors constitute the background of its daily life. In this city, Klein met the reliable Captain Dunn, who had a poor memory, got to know the kind and stubborn teacher Old Neil, and found Mr. Azik, a mentor who spanned a long history.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Silent Covenant] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Silent Covenant; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Silent Covenant] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> God's Favor Hairstyle \n<Assistant_Title2> Use: </> After use, obtain Silent Covenant; click <Assistant_System> Appearance - Change Outfit </> to view and use, or exchange for <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained via <Assistant_System> Summon - Spirit World Renewal </>, or purchase using <Assistant_Red> 1 </> God's Favor Card in the <Assistant_System> Goddess's Gift Shop </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【荒诞马戏】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>副本掉落时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得荒诞马戏套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>副本-安提哥努斯笔记</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Absurd Circus】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Dungeon Drop Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Absurd Circus set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Dungeon - Antigonus Notebook</>",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>象牙缎面・珠链点缀・宫廷骑装\n宫廷马场的大门再次敞开时，步伐与仪态，同样不曾松懈半分。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Ivory Satin · Bead Chain Ornament · Court Riding Suit \n When the gates of the court stables open again, the pace and demeanor are just as sharp as ever.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Strategy Cards and Routes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategy Cards: </>Before heading to the next station, you can choose a strategy card, which will take effect upon arrival based on specific conditions. Common effects include gaining Chamber of Commerce tickets, obtaining cargo, or cargo conversion. Most cards are related to guessing the station type; understanding the station sequence can significantly increase the success rate of your strategy cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Route Tips: </>When choosing a strategy card, you can deduce the most likely next station type based on your current and remaining stations. Low-difficulty modes provide clearer information about subsequent stations and will not feature consecutive identical stations, which you can use to determine the next station type. In high-difficulty modes, there is no concept of regions, and you can only see the most frequent station types for the next 3 stops. At this point, you may need to combine predictive information from previous stations to make a comprehensive judgment on the station type. \n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize cards that involve guessing stations when you are certain of the next type; consider choosing stable income cards when uncertain. Some cards require combinations to exert greater effects; once you have laid the groundwork for buying and selling cargo, the strength of certain cards will significantly increase."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Railway Tycoon - Strategy Cards and Routes】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Strategy Cards: </>Before heading to the next station, you can choose a strategy card, which will take effect upon arrival based on specific conditions. Common effects include gaining Chamber of Commerce tickets, obtaining cargo, or cargo conversion. Most cards are related to guessing the station type; understanding the station Последовательность can significantly increase the success rate of your strategy cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Route Tips: </>When choosing a strategy card, you can deduce the most likely next station type based on your current and remaining stations. Low-difficulty modes provide clearer information about subsequent stations and will not feature consecutive identical stations, which you can use to determine the next station type. In high-difficulty modes, there is no concept of regions, and you can only see the most frequent station types for the next 3 stops. At this point, you may need to combine predictive information from previous stations to make a comprehensive judgment on the station type. \n<Assistant_Title2>Tips: </>Prioritize cards that involve guessing stations when you are certain of the next type; consider choosing stable income cards when uncertain. Some cards require combinations to exert greater effects; once you have laid the groundwork for buying and selling cargo, the strength of certain cards will significantly increase.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Floating Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Floating Light】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand scene\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
