    ["<Assistant_Title1>投影片段</>\n<Assistant_Title2>道具介绍：</>\n是{SendAnswer:结交人脉|554}重复获得{SendAnswer:人脉|550}时获得的积分，可在{SendAnswer:人脉商店|558}兑换各种奖励。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取方式：</>\n通过结交人脉获取重复人脉时，可获得投影片段。重复的人脉品质越高，获得的数量越多。\n<Assistant_Title2>消耗方式：</>\n通过<Assistant_System>菜单-人脉-兑换</>可打开<Assistant_System>人脉商店</>，兑换相应道具。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}，{SendAnswer:[人脉商店]|558}，{SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Projection Fragments</>\n<Assistant_Title2> Item Introduction: </>\n These are points obtained when {SendAnswer:Making Connections| 554 } results in obtaining a duplicate {SendAnswer:Connection| 550 }. They can be used to exchange for various rewards in the {SendAnswer:Connection Shop| 558 }. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Obtain: </>\n When making connections and obtaining a duplicate connection, you can receive Projection Fragments. The higher the quality of the duplicate connection, the more you receive. \n<Assistant_Title2> How to Consume: </>\n You can open the <Assistant_System>Connection Shop</> via <Assistant_System>Menu-Connections-Exchange</> to exchange for corresponding items. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Connection Shop]|558}, {SendAnswer:[Making Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Dog Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Dog Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fluffy Dog Ears】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Fluffy Dog Ears. You can view and equip them by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["1. 消耗金镑可发送绑金礼金，领取礼金可获得等价绑定金镑；\n2. 绑金礼金发出24小时后，未被领取的礼金将返还等额绑金；\n3. 外观馈赠若有时装在24小时后未领取完，则会返还购买该时装时消耗的等额金镑与赠礼额度；\n4. 外观馈赠获得的道具为绑定道具"] = "1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Appearance gifts obtained are bound items.",
    ["<P_Heart> (For example, putting a long table here...) </>"] = "<P_Heart> (For example, putting a long table here...) </>",
    ["<Highlight> Muted: </> Muted players will not be able to use real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The room owner can set this in the mute management tab. \n <Highlight> Blacklist: </> Blacklisted players will be kicked out of this voice room and will not be able to enter it again. The room owner can set this in the blacklist tab."] = "<Highlight> Muted: </> Muted players will not be able to use real-time voice, send voice messages, or send text messages in this voice room. The room owner can set this in the mute management tab. \n <Highlight> Blacklist: </> Blacklisted players will be kicked out of this voice room and will not be able to enter it again. The room owner can set this in the blacklist tab.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [In the Evening Breeze] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Mall Direct-Sale Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After purchasing in the Mall, gain the In the Evening Breeze set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained through <Assistant_System> Mall </>"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [In the Evening Breeze] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Description: </> Mall Direct-Sale Fashion \n<Assistant_Title2> Usage: </> After purchasing in the Mall, gain the In the Evening Breeze set, which can be viewed and used by clicking <Assistant_System> Appearance - Dress Up </>. \n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition: </> Obtained through <Assistant_System> Mall </>",
