    ["<Highlight>躺赢</>中含有各类玩法，点击这里打开菜单进入"] = "<Highlight>Leisure</> contains various gameplay modes. Click here to open the menu and enter.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>翡翠织锦・珍珠华饰・优雅室内裙\n“我们有一颗足以照亮整座贝克兰德的宝石，她的智慧，她的美貌，她的品格，她的礼仪，都无可挑剔。”"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Emerald Brocade · Pearl Ornament · Elegant Indoor Skirt \n \"We have a gem bright enough to illuminate all of Бэкланд; her wisdom, her beauty, her character, and her etiquette are all impeccable.\"",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【安魂花簇】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得安魂花簇，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Requiem Flower Cluster】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Requiem Flower Cluster. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>跻身从神之列</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>以战养战-征伐\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>参与众神之巅玩法后取得四强荣誉称号"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Ranking Among the Lesser Gods</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Conquest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Obtain the Top 4 honorary title after participating in Peak of the Gods",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Watcher】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Watcher. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Watcher】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Watcher. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
    ["<DecH>Crafting: </>Camel Tweed - White Lining - Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter thanks to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow."] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Camel Tweed - White Lining - Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter thanks to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
