    ["<P_Heart>（不得不说，这样的日子还是很幸福的……）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (I have to say, a life like this is still quite blissful...) </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【威尔冰淇淋】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>玩法奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得威尔冰淇淋，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>玩法-家族</>获得"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Will's Ice Cream】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Accessory rewarded for gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Will's Ice Cream. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain through <Assistant_System>Gameplay - Family</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The One Chasing the Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow, not sure if he is resting or needs help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountains(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the old gentleman </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The One Chasing the Wind and Snow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>An old gentleman is sitting on the snow, not sure if he is resting or needs help?\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 65</>, head to {Location:[Hornacis Mountains(684,554)]|58497;45487;3362;2;5200086;0} and talk to <Assistant_Red> the old gentleman </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灰雾之上】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>原著主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>关于这枚古怪的金币，似乎还有别的秘密……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第一天解锁。扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>20级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、历史明灯"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Above the Gray Fog】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Original Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Regarding this strange gold coin, there seem to be other secrets... \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the first day of the first season. Automatically accepted after reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 20</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Bound Gold Pound, Historical Beacon",
