    ["Level 2 All-or-Nothing"] = "Level 2 All-or-Nothing",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity Allowance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Welfare - Activity Allowance</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250320}\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </>Complete Activity Allowance quests to earn Companion Emblems, Club Activity, and Club Fund rewards. \nClub Activity is the sum of individual activity points of current club members; reaching corresponding values allows you to claim extra rewards. \nActivity Allowance rewards refresh every Monday at 8:00 AM. Please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Dividends]|1405}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity Allowance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Access: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Club - Welfare - Activity Allowance</>{JumpToUI:[【View】]|1250320}\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </>Complete Activity Allowance quests to earn Companion Emblems, Club Activity, and Club Fund rewards. \nClub Activity is the sum of individual activity points of current club members; reaching corresponding values allows you to claim extra rewards. \nActivity Allowance rewards refresh every Monday at 8:00 AM. Please claim your rewards in time.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Dividends]|1405}, {SendAnswer:[Club - Club Activity]|1403}",
    ["64 Item Level Orange Equipment Box"] = "64 Item Level Orange Equipment Box",
    ["2. After the merger, the remaining Club funds of the applicant Club are merged into the receiving Club. Club information such as Club name, Club level, and building levels will be based on the receiving Club. After the applicant Club's members are migrated to the target Club, they will no longer hold positions and will all become ordinary members. Original Club Apprentices remain Apprentices in the new Club."] = "2. After the merger, the remaining Club funds of the applicant Club are merged into the receiving Club. Club information such as Club name, Club level, and building levels will be based on the receiving Club. After the applicant Club's members are migrated to the target Club, they will no longer hold positions and will all become ordinary members. Original Club Apprentices remain Apprentices in the new Club.",
    ["68装等竞技烙印装备自选箱"] = "Level 68 Competitive Brand Equipment Selection Box",
    ["Level 64 big spender + large amount of money."] = "Level 64 big spender + large amount of money.",
    ["<Highlight>【段位奖励说明】</>\n\n1、段位玩法包括：冒险、同行、副本、趣斗、主宰争锋、神座之争、命运时刻、终末猎杀。\n\n2、游玩每种玩法可分别积累对应胜点，继而提升段位，获得段位奖励。\n\n3、每个段位的奖励<Highlight>至多领取三次</>，可自由选择喜欢的3种玩法体验，<Highlight>无需全部游玩</>。\n\n4、系统会自动把当前段位最高的三个玩法列在主要位置，点击各个模块可快捷前往对应玩法界面。\n\n5、段位重置后，段位奖励也会重置。"] = "<Highlight>【Rank Reward Description】</>\n\n 1. Ranked modes include: Adventure, Companion, Dungeon, Fun Fight, Dominator's Clash, Battle for the Throne of God, Moment of Fate, and Final Hunt.\n\n 2. Playing each mode accumulates corresponding victory points, which increase your rank and grant rank rewards.\n\n 3. Rewards for each rank can be claimed <Highlight>up to three times</>. You can freely choose 3 modes you enjoy; <Highlight>you do not need to play all of them</>.\n\n 4. The system automatically lists the three modes with your highest rank in the primary positions. Click on each module to quickly navigate to the corresponding mode interface.\n\n 5. Rank rewards will reset when the rank resets.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Invite】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Invite. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand - Invite】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Team gameplay reward display action.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Display Stand - Invite. You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Companion Emblems in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Companion Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【展台·研习】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>世界冒险玩法奖励展台动作\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得展台·研习，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-冒险商店</>使用冒险勋章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Display Stand · Study】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand action rewarded for World Adventure gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Display Stand · Study. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Adventure Medals in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Adventure Shop</>.",
    ["Level 1 - Scattered"] = "Level 1 - Scattered",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Social Gifts】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </>In <Assistant_System>Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity</>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to give to friends or other players.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Friend Chat - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send friendship gifts, which will increase the friendship level between both parties.\n<Assistant_Title2>Personal Homepage Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send homepage gifts, which will increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If both parties are friends, it will additionally increase the friendship level.\n<Assistant_Title2>Voice Room Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gift</>, you can send voice room gifts, which will increase the current voice room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friend-Friendship]|1410}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Social Gifts】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </>In <Assistant_System>Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity</>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to give to friends or other players.\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Friend Chat - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send friendship gifts, which will increase the friendship level between both parties.\n<Assistant_Title2>Personal Homepage Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Gift in the bottom right corner</>, you can send homepage gifts, which will increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If both parties are friends, it will additionally increase the friendship level.\n<Assistant_Title2>Voice Room Gifts: </>In <Assistant_System>Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gift</>, you can send voice room gifts, which will increase the current voice room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Search: </>{SendAnswer:[Friend-Friendship]|1410}",
    ["<P_Heart>（停下来了……他的状态还是很不稳定。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (It stopped... his state is still very unstable.) </>",
