    ["<Assistant_Title1>【永恒之梦】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>小程序签到奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得永恒之梦，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>小程序签到获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Eternal Dream】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Mini-program check-in reward accessory.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain Eternal Dream. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via mini-program check-in.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>驼色软呢・洁白内衬・外出便服\n晚风之中，步伐因舒适的衣衫而更加轻盈。明日也将是美好的明日。"] = "<DecH>Crafting: </>Camel Tweed - White Lining - Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter thanks to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Family Responsibility】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Reward outfit from social gameplay.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Family Responsibility outfit. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Memory Caskets in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Family Responsibility】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Reward outfit from social gameplay.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Use to obtain the Family Responsibility outfit. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Memory Caskets in <Assistant_System>Shop - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>.",
    ["<Italic>—You feel a long-lost, uncontrollable power surging within your body. It makes your blood flow faster, and every punch you throw lands heavier than before—but are you sure it's really power? Or is it just that your perception of pain is quietly changing? You begin to no longer care about the perception of pain, nor do you care that your vision shakes silently at certain moments, like a painting with a corner torn off by someone.</>"] = "<Italic>—You feel a long-lost, uncontrollable power surging within your body. It makes your blood flow faster, and every punch you throw lands heavier than before—but are you sure it's really power? Or is it just that your perception of pain is quietly changing? You begin to no longer care about the perception of pain, nor do you care that your vision shakes silently at certain moments, like a painting with a corner torn off by someone.</>",
    ["1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Items obtained from appearance gifts are bound items."] = "1. Consuming Gold Pounds can send bound gold gifts. Claiming gifts can obtain equivalent bound Gold Pounds; \n 2. 24 hours after the bound gold gift is sent, unclaimed gifts will be returned as an equivalent amount of bound gold; \n 3. If there are outfits in the appearance gift that have not been claimed after 24 hours, the equivalent Gold Pounds and gift quota consumed when purchasing the outfit will be returned; \n 4. Items obtained from appearance gifts are bound items.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【苍银之风】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得苍银之风，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过终末猎杀拍卖获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Wind of Pale Silver】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Competition gameplay accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Wind of Pale Silver. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtain through the Final Hunt auction.",
