    ["The new dye content of <Highlight>%s</> will overwrite and be stored in the current dye scheme. Confirm?"] = "The new dye content of <Highlight>%s</> will overwrite and be stored in the current dye scheme. Confirm?",
    ["<P_Heart>(Low chuckle)</>... I have no questions to ask. <P_Yellow>No matter what instructions fate gives, I will answer 'good'</>. This is what we lambs should do."] = "<P_Heart>(Low chuckle)</>... I have no questions to ask. <P_Yellow>No matter what instructions fate gives, I will answer 'good'</>. This is what we lambs should do.",
