    ["<Assistant_Title1>【第九军装】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>竞技玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得第九军装套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-凯旋商店</>使用凯旋徽章兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Ninth Uniform】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Outfit rewarded for Competition gameplay\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Ninth Uniform set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Triumph Badges in the <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Triumph Shop</>.",
