    ["1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Court Roleplay voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar."] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Court Roleplay voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Everdark Candle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Plot Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Everdark Candle. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via the Azik side quest"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Everdark Candle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Plot Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Everdark Candle. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via the Azik side quest",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【隔墙有暖】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>扮演故事</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>有一家人的屋内好像不太暖和……\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>完成主线剧情第二章《时代的浪潮》且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>19级</>后，前往{Location:[金秋湖(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0}处，与<Assistant_Red>屋内的声音</>交互接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、世界冒险秘宝进度、冒险勋章、发票单据"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Warmth Through the Wall】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Stories</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>It doesn't seem very warm inside one of the houses...\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After completing Chapter 2 of the main storyline, \"Tides of the Era,\" and reaching Acting Level <Assistant_Red>19</>, head to {Location:[Golden Autumn Lake(325,90)]|22557;-916;607;2;5200085;0} and interact with the <Assistant_Red>voice from inside the house</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medals, Invoices",
    ["55 Item Level Gold Equipment"] = "55 Item Level Gold Equipment",
    ["......知识指引我至此。"] = "......Knowledge has guided me here.",
    ["<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・White Lining・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow."] = "<Highlight>Craft: </>Camel Tweed・White Lining・Casual Outing Wear\nIn the evening breeze, your steps feel lighter due to the comfortable clothing. Tomorrow will also be a beautiful tomorrow.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【雾都漫游】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得雾都漫游套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Fog City Roaming】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Fog City Roaming set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Initiate Order-Keeper Uniform】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Reward for following the official account\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Initiate Order-Keeper Uniform set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Reward for following the official Lord of Mysteries account."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Initiate Order-Keeper Uniform】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Reward for following the official account\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Initiate Order-Keeper Uniform set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Reward for following the official Повелитель Тайн account.",
    ["<DecH>Craft: </>Battle Flag Brocade & Ever-Victorious Pauldrons\nThe ever-victorious warrior sets out, decorated for the next victory."] = "<DecH>Craft: </>Battle Flag Brocade & Ever-Victorious Pauldrons\nThe ever-victorious warrior sets out, decorated for the next victory.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【等待戈多】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>时代逸闻</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>我们走吧。我们不能。我们在等待戈多。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>65级</>后，前往{Location:[睡莲小镇(170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0}与<Assistant_Red>艾斯特</>对话接取任务。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、发票单据、冒险勋章、世界冒险秘宝进度"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Waiting for Godot】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type:</><Assistant_Property2>Era Anecdote</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description:</>Let's go. We can't. We're waiting for Godot.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain:</>After reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 65</>, go to {Location:[Water Lily Town (170,30)]|6801;-7084;-2854;2;5200052;0} and speak with <Assistant_Red>Ester</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive EXP, Invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure Progress.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Level: </>Club activity levels are divided from high to low into \nQuiet Affairs (<720)\nRoutine Operations (720~2400)\nProsperous Affairs (>2400)\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Activity: </>Activity Allowance\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </>The higher the Club activity, the higher the weekly Club dividend reward.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Consumption: </>Daily Club maintenance will deduct 5% of the current activity. If the activity remains at 'Quiet Affairs' for 7 consecutive days, the Council Hall level will be reduced by 1.<Assistant_Red>If the Council Hall level is lower than level 1, the Club will be automatically disbanded.</>\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[俱乐部]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部活跃津贴]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[俱乐部-俱乐部分红]|1405}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Club - Club Activity】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Level: </>Club activity levels are divided from high to low into \nQuiet Affairs (<720)\nRoutine Operations (720~2400)\nProsperous Affairs (>2400)\n<Assistant_Title2>Source of Activity: </>Activity Allowance\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Description: </>The higher the Club activity, the higher the weekly Club dividend reward.\n<Assistant_Title2>Activity Consumption: </>Daily Club maintenance will deduct 5% of the current activity. If the activity remains at 'Quiet Affairs' for 7 consecutive days, the Council Hall level will be reduced by 1.<Assistant_Red>If the Council Hall level is lower than level 1, the Club will be automatically disbanded.</>\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Club]|1400}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Activity Allowance]|1404}, {SendAnswer:[Club-Club Dividends]|1405}",
    ["Level 35 Weapon Box"] = "Level 35 Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【好友-跨服好友】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>系统入口：</><Assistant_System>菜单-好友-跨服好友</>\n<Assistant_Title2>好友添加：</><Assistant_System>好友-添加</>页签下，输入角色昵称或角色数字ID可以搜索添加跨服好友。\n<Assistant_Title2>好友赠礼：</>可以通过<Assistant_System>好友-私聊-右下角赠礼</>，与跨服好友互相赠礼，提升好友度。\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}，{SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}，{SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}，{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}，{SendAnswer:[好友-删除拉黑]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Friends - Cross-Server Friends】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Menu - Friends - Cross-Server Friends</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Adding Friends: </><Assistant_System>Under the Friends - Add tab, you can search for and add cross-server friends by entering their character nickname or character numeric ID.</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Friend Gifts: </>You can exchange gifts with cross-server friends to increase your Friendliness via <Assistant_System>Friends - Private Chat - Gift in the bottom right corner</>.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}",
