    ["<InvDefault>Drag the text on the right into the blank spaces on the left to restore the correct answer and complete this task.</>"] = "<InvDefault>Drag the text on the right into the blank spaces on the left to restore the correct answer and complete this task.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>深入超凡</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-成长\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>扮演等级升到60级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Deepening the Extraordinary</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Development\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Reach Acting Level 60",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>See You in Spring</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Side Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the side quest \"The Piano Sounds Gentle Tonight\"."] = "<Assistant_Title1>See You in Spring</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Plot - Side Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete the side quest \"The Piano Sounds Gentle Tonight\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【誓约系统】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法说明：</><Assistant_System>誓约系统</>是由两名互为好友的玩家组队前往萨默尔太太处申请结成誓约关系后通过一起参与组队活动获取誓约值与同行纹章的社交玩法。\n<Assistant_Title2>参与条件：</>①需要双方等级都达到<Assistant_Red>30级</>解锁誓约系统。②双方互为好友且<Assistant_Red>好友度达到200点</>。\n<Assistant_Title2>玩法规则：</>①达到参与条件的玩家组队前往<Assistant_Red>霍纳奇斯花海萨默尔太太处</>，由队长发起结成誓约邀请。②被邀请方接受邀请后进入互相书写誓言流程。③书写完誓言后双方互相交换查看收下对方的誓言，进入拍婚纱照流程。④双方选择拍照模版，最终确认后完成拍照流程，双方结成誓约关系。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Covenant System】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Description: </><Assistant_System>Covenant System</> is a social gameplay where two players who are friends form a team, go to Mrs. Sammer to apply for a covenant relationship, and then participate in team activities together to earn Covenant Points and Companion Emblems. \n<Assistant_Title2>Participation Requirements: </>① Both parties must reach <Assistant_Red>Level 30</> to unlock the Covenant System. ② Both parties must be friends and have a <Assistant_Red>Friendship Level of 200 points</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Rules: </>① Players who meet the requirements form a team and go to <Assistant_Red>Mrs. Sammer in the Hornacis Sea of Flowers</>, where the captain initiates the covenant invitation. ② After the invitee accepts, they enter the process of writing vows to each other. ③ After writing the vows, both parties exchange, view, and accept each other's vows, then enter the wedding photo process. ④ Both parties select a photo template, and after final confirmation, the photo process is completed, and the two parties form a covenant relationship.",
    ["5230143 Outside the Club Plane"] = "5230143 Outside the Club Plane",
    ["Dropped by <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Minions </> with a certain probability"] = "Dropped by <HyperLink stylename=\"Clickable\" u=\"\"> Minions </> with a certain probability",
    ["<M_Orange> [%s]</> has accepted the declaration of war initiated by our club. The duel will begin on <M_Orange>[Today%s]</>. The flames of war have arrived, and the outcome is about to be revealed—the Hornacis Mountain Range will witness the end of this duel. For our shared glory, all members, take your positions. \nYou can click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【Club Declaration of War Gameplay Guide】</> to view the gameplay guide!"] = "<M_Orange> [%s]</> has accepted the declaration of war initiated by our club. The duel will begin on <M_Orange>[Today%s]</>. The flames of war have arrived, and the outcome is about to be revealed—the Hornacis Mountain Range will witness the end of this duel. For our shared glory, all members, take your positions. \nYou can click <HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"tipsId=6427619\">【Club Declaration of War Gameplay Guide】</> to view the gameplay guide!",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【秘藏学者】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>人脉玩法奖励时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得秘藏学者套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城-百货-往事陈列馆</>使用记忆珍匣兑换"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Hidden Scholar】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Connection gameplay reward outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain the Hidden Scholar set. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Mall - General Goods - Past Exhibition Hall</>, redeem using Memory Treasure Boxes",
    ["5200247 Nightclub Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200247 Nightclub Multiplayer Scene",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【蛇心】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>教团等级奖励饰品\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得蛇心，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>教团等级解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Snake Heart】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Coven level reward accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use: </>Use to obtain Snake Heart. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Coven level unlock",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wish</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nIn the permanent befriending event within the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Befriend Connections</> interface, click the Wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the Wish interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>After wishing for </>a specific Connection, you can increase the probability of obtaining that Connection when befriending. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wish Rules:</>\nOnly Legendary Connections that can be befriended are eligible for a wish. \nAfter making a wish, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of it being your wish target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the Legendary Connection obtained is not your wish target, the next Legendary Connection you obtain is guaranteed to be your wish target. \nIn permanent befriending, <Assistant_Property1>each week</> you can use <Assistant_Property1>2 times</> of the wish effect, which resets on Monday. Every time you befriend <Assistant_Property1>110 times</>, you can obtain an additional wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count. \nAfter wishing for a Connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the Cancel Wish button to cancel it. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[人脉]|550}, {SendAnswer:[关系]|551}, {SendAnswer:[结交人脉]|554}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Connection Wish</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Gameplay Instructions:</>\nIn the permanent befriending event within the <Assistant_System>Menu - Connections - Befriend Connections</> interface, click the Wish button at the bottom left of the video to enter the Wish interface. \n<Assistant_Property2>After wishing for </>a specific Connection, you can increase the probability of obtaining that Connection when befriending. \n<Assistant_Title2>Wish Rules:</>\nOnly Legendary Connections that can be befriended are eligible for a wish. \nAfter making a wish, when you obtain a Legendary Connection, the probability of it being your wish target increases to <Assistant_Property1>80%</>. If the Legendary Connection obtained is not your wish target, the next Legendary Connection you obtain is guaranteed to be your wish target. \nIn permanent befriending, <Assistant_Property1>each week</> you can use <Assistant_Property1>2 times</> of the wish effect, which resets on Monday. Every time you befriend <Assistant_Property1>110 times</>, you can obtain an additional wish count. This count will not be reset, and its consumption priority is lower than the weekly reset count. \nAfter wishing for a Connection, if you accidentally select the wrong target, you can click the Cancel Wish button to cancel it. \n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Connections]|550}, {SendAnswer:[Relationship]|551}, {SendAnswer:[Befriend Connections]|554}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Proficient</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 3"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Proficient</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 3",
