    ["1. Prepare Video"] = "1. Prepare Video",
    ["<Highlight>戴莉·西蒙妮</>，原廷根市值夜者小队队员，是阿霍瓦郡最有名的通灵者，因自行总结出扮演法导致晋升极快而被圣堂注意，后调往贝克兰德。她与邓恩队长的关系似乎非同一般。"] = "<Highlight>Daly Simone</>, a former member of the Тинген Ночные Ястребы squad, is the most famous Spirit Medium in Awwa County. She was noticed by the Holy Cathedral because she summarized the Acting Method herself, leading to extremely fast advancement, and was later transferred to Бэкланд. Her relationship with Captain Dunn seems to be unusual.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Vehicle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>A type of cosmetic.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>Vehicles can be obtained in various ways, such as through quests, events, the Mall, or specific gameplay rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>View and Switch: </>Click Menu - Cosmetics - Vehicle to preview and switch vehicles, or change their appearance.\n<Assistant_Title2>Summon Vehicle: </>Click the mount button in the bottom right to summon your vehicle; on PC, you can also use the shortcut key T to summon it."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Vehicle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>A type of cosmetic.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Obtain: </>Vehicles can be obtained in various ways, such as through quests, events, the Mall, or specific gameplay rewards.\n<Assistant_Title2>View and Switch: </>Click Menu - Cosmetics - Vehicle to preview and switch vehicles, or change their appearance.\n<Assistant_Title2>Summon Vehicle: </>Click the mount button in the bottom right to summon your vehicle; on PC, you can also use the shortcut key T to summon it.",
    ["2引导1"] = "2 Guide 1",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Velvet Klein-Cat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Pre-registration Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Velvet Klein-Cat; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via pre-registering for the Lord of Mysteries game"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Velvet Klein-Cat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description:</>Pre-registration Reward Accessory\n<Assistant_Title2>Use:</>After use, obtain the Velvet Klein-Cat; you can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition:</>Obtained via pre-registering for the Повелитель Тайн game",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Echo of the Divine Rank</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete 20 rounds of Battle for the Throne of God"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Echo of the Divine Rank</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Battle for Growth - Competition\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Complete 20 rounds of Battle for the Throne of God",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Pryer】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Подглядывающий за Тайнами】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【绿野之旅】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>商城直售时装\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>商城购买后获得绿野之旅套装，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Green Field Journey】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Shop Direct-Purchase Outfit\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Purchase in the shop to obtain the Green Field Journey outfit. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Shop</>",
    ["<Chat_Telegram>赞美愚者！</>{{player.name}}<Chat_Telegram>被命运眷顾，自灵界召唤获得了</>{{item.name}}<Chat_Telegram>，令风尚之光重现世间！</>"] = "<Chat_Telegram> Praise Шут! </>{{player.name}}<Chat_Telegram> has been favored by fate and has summoned </>{{item.name}}<Chat_Telegram> from the Spirit World, bringing the light of fashion back to the world! </>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Undying Flame】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Hairstyle\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Undying Flame. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>, or exchange using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards in the <Assistant_System>Goddess's Gift Shop</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Undying Flame】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>God-favored Hairstyle\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Undying Flame. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Change Outfit</> to view and use it, or exchange it for <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards. \n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation</>, or exchange using <Assistant_Red>2</> God-favored Cards in the <Assistant_System>Goddess's Gift Shop</>",
    ["0:\"默认第一偏移点到目标的连线作为起始方向\",1:\"使用表格内部的偏移\",2:\"不使用偏移，目标朝向\",3:\"子弹朝向仅取决于Action配置\""] = "0: \"Default to the line between the first offset point and the target as the starting direction\", 1: \"Use the offset inside the table\", 2: \"Do not use offset, use target orientation\", 3: \"Bullet orientation depends only on Action configuration\".",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Organization Selection and Attribute Point Allocation】</>\nWhen joining an organization, you will enter a process similar to TRPG character creation, mainly divided into three steps: <Assistant_Property1>Organization</>, <Assistant_Property1>Belief</>, <Assistant_Property1>Attributes</>.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Rule Description:</>\n1. After selecting an organization, its abilities and beliefs will be automatically determined.\n2. Each organization has recommended attribute schemes, which you can use directly.\n3. The base attribute value is at least 8 and at most 16, with a total of 44 attribute points.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[教团属性说明]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[如何加入教团]|1273}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Organization Selection and Attribute Point Allocation】</>\nWhen joining an organization, you will enter a process similar to TRPG character creation, mainly divided into three steps: <Assistant_Property1>Organization</>, <Assistant_Property1>Belief</>, <Assistant_Property1>Attributes</>.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Rule Description:</>\n1. After selecting an organization, its abilities and beliefs will be automatically determined.\n2. Each organization has recommended attribute schemes, which you can use directly.\n3. The base attribute value is at least 8 and at most 16, with a total of 44 attribute points.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Organization Attribute Description]|1275}, {SendAnswer:[How to Join an Organization]|1273}",
    ["1级-零散"] = "Level 1 - Scattered",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Social Gifting] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </> In <Assistant_System> Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity </>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to send to friends or other players. \n<Assistant_Title2> Friend Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Friend Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send friendliness gifts to increase mutual friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Personal Homepage Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Personal Homepage - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send homepage gifts to increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If you are friends, it will additionally increase friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Voice Room Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gifting </>, you can send voice room gifts to increase the current room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Social Gifting] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </> In <Assistant_System> Mall - Image Inscription - Social Popularity </>, you can spend Bound Pounds and Unbound Pounds to purchase social gifts to send to friends or other players. \n<Assistant_Title2> Friend Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Friend Private Chat - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send friendliness gifts to increase mutual friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Personal Homepage Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Personal Homepage - Gifting in the bottom right corner </>, you can send homepage gifts to increase the recipient's personal homepage fame. If you are friends, it will additionally increase friendliness. \n<Assistant_Title2> Voice Room Gifting: </> In <Assistant_System> Voice Room - Click Player Avatar - Voice Room Gifting </>, you can send voice room gifts to increase the current room's popularity and the recipient's personal homepage fame. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}",
    ["<Letter_Highlight> Pick Herbs </>: Pick Hellebore during the sunrise in the third month, 6 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Short-term Employment </>: Hire a bodyguard with sailing experience for one month, 600 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Golden Indus District Case </>: A vicious home invasion and murder occurred in the Golden Indus District this week. Anyone who provides relevant clues that are verified as effective will receive a 10-pound reward. \n <Letter_Highlight> Wanted Bounty </>: Wanted pirate Gus has appeared in Tingen. 5 pounds per effective clue. \n <Letter_Highlight> Lost Dog Notice </>: My beloved dog, Vina, went missing on Daffodil Street three days ago. She is all black with a white face. If you have any clues, a generous reward will be given!"] = "<Letter_Highlight> Pick Herbs </>: Pick Hellebore during the sunrise in the third month, 6 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Short-term Employment </>: Hire a bodyguard with sailing experience for one month, 600 pounds. \n <Letter_Highlight> Golden Indus District Case </>: A vicious home invasion and murder occurred in the Golden Indus District this week. Anyone who provides relevant clues that are verified as effective will receive a 10-pound reward. \n <Letter_Highlight> Wanted Bounty </>: Wanted pirate Gus has appeared in Тинген. 5 pounds per effective clue. \n <Letter_Highlight> Lost Dog Notice </>: My beloved dog, Vina, went missing on Daffodil Street three days ago. She is all black with a white face. If you have any clues, a generous reward will be given!",
    ["95级12人本BOSS困难"] = "Level 95 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【初誓】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得初誓，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【First Vow】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain First Vow after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Welcome to Water Lily Town.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 64</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town(134,-14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red> read the notes </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Water Lily Town Roaming Guide】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Anecdotes of the Era</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>Welcome to Water Lily Town.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>After your Acting level reaches <Assistant_Red>Level 64</>, head to {Location:[Water Lily Town(134,-14)]|3733;-11328;-3242;2;5200052;0} and <Assistant_Red> read the notes </> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, invoices, Adventure Medals, World Adventure Treasure progress",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Friendliness] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Friend Private Chat - Heart icon in the top right corner </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Source: </> Team up with a friend to defeat 1 team/squad dungeon boss, defeat a world boss as a team, complete 1 competition activity as a team, chat privately with a friend, complete 1 duo social action, or ride together to increase friendliness. Friendliness can also be increased by sending social gifts and cosmetic items. \n<Assistant_Title2> Clearing Friendliness: </><Assistant_Red> Deleting or blocking a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Delete/Block]|1412}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Friendliness] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Friend Private Chat - Heart icon in the top right corner </>\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Source: </> Team up with a friend to defeat 1 team/squad dungeon boss, defeat a world boss as a team, complete 1 competition activity as a team, chat privately with a friend, complete 1 duo social action, or ride together to increase friendliness. Friendliness can also be increased by sending social gifts and cosmetic items. \n<Assistant_Title2> Clearing Friendliness: </><Assistant_Red> Deleting or blocking a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {Sen