    ["<Assistant_Title1> Imprint Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Description: </> Imprint equipment comes with exclusive imprint affix effects but does not have set bonuses. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Sources: </>\n\n 1. Participate in dungeon activities to obtain adventure-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 2. Open War-forged treasures or exchange in the Reimbursement Shop to obtain competition-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 3. Additionally, imprint equipment can be obtained by completing quests and exploration."] = "<Assistant_Title1> Imprint Equipment </>\n\n<Assistant_Title2> Equipment Description: </> Imprint equipment comes with exclusive imprint affix effects but does not have set bonuses. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Acquisition Sources: </>\n\n 1. Participate in dungeon activities to obtain adventure-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 2. Open War-forged treasures or exchange in the Reimbursement Shop to obtain competition-oriented imprint equipment. \n\n 3. Additionally, imprint equipment can be obtained by completing quests and exploration.",
