    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Memory Spider Web】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Memory Spider Web. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Cutting Knives in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Astral Secret Vault Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Memory Spider Web】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Memory Spider Web. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Cutting Knives in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Astral Secret Vault Shop</>.",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>压纹皮革・银铆轻铠・轻便战甲\n永不流动的黄昏停滞于肩甲，哪怕此身沐浴落日，仍有唤醒黎明之志。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Embossed Leather - Silver Rivet Light Armor - Lightweight Battle Armor \n The never-flowing sunset lingers on the shoulder armor; even if this body is bathed in the setting sun, there is still the ambition to awaken the dawn.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Museum Romance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Museum Romance set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Museum Romance】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Store Direct-Purchase Fashion\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After purchasing in the store, you will obtain the Museum Romance set. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Dress Up</> to view and use it. \n<Assistant_Title2>Obtain: </>Obtained via <Assistant_System>Store</>",
    ["<InvDefault>拖拽右侧的文字至左侧空白格内，还原正确答案即可完成本题</>"] = "<InvDefault>Drag the text on the right into the blank spaces on the left to restore the correct answer and complete this task.</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【How to Join a Covenant】</>\nOnce the Covenant is unlocked, you can enter the joining process through the <Assistant_System>TRPG</> entrance or by finding the corresponding Covenant NPC.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Joining Process:</>\n1. Open the Covenant selection interface.\n2. Select the Covenant you wish to join.\n3. View the abilities, faith, and recommended attributes of that Covenant.\n4. Confirm after completing attribute point allocation.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[教团选择与属性加点]|1274}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【How to Join a Covenant】</>\nOnce the Covenant is unlocked, you can enter the joining process through the <Assistant_System>TRPG</> entrance or by finding the corresponding Covenant NPC.\n\n<Assistant_Title2>Joining Process:</>\n1. Open the Covenant selection interface.\n2. Select the Covenant you wish to join.\n3. View the abilities, faith, and recommended attributes of that Covenant.\n4. Confirm after completing attribute point allocation.\n\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Covenant Selection and Attribute Allocation]|1274}",
    ["<P_Heart>（他过于焦虑了，是时候帮他卸下一些心理负担了！）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (He is too anxious, it's time to help him unload some psychological burden!) </>",
    ["<Highlight>将猩红遗物材料呈交猎杀管家</>，推进<Highlight>猎杀进度</>，解锁阶段<Highlight>丰厚奖励</>。请注意：<Highlight>猩红遗物仅在猎龙之城内有效</>，离开后将<Highlight>自动失效并清除</>。"] = "<Highlight> Submit Crimson Relic materials to the Hunt Butler </> to advance <Highlight> Hunt Progress </> and unlock <Highlight> rich rewards </> for each stage. Please note: <Highlight> Crimson Relics are only effective within the City of Dragon Hunting </>; they will <Highlight> automatically expire and be cleared </> upon leaving.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Dark Night Bat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Dark Night Bat. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Cutting Knives in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Astral Secret Vault Shop</>."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Dark Night Bat】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Star Coin Pool display stand sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Dark Night Bat. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Exchange using Cutting Knives in the <Assistant_System>Summon - Spirit World Transformation - Astral Secret Vault Shop</>.",
    ["<P_Heart>(For example, placing a long table here with numerous high-backed chairs carved with ancient patterns and filled with a mysterious aura, and I would sit at the very head...)</>"] = "<P_Heart>(For example, placing a long table here with numerous high-backed chairs carved with ancient patterns and filled with a mysterious aura, and I would sit at the very head...)</>",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>强化精通</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-装备\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>所有装备强化3级"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Strengthening Proficient</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment strengthened to Level 3",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Mysteries Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302512}\n<Assistant_Title2>My Mysteries Circle: </><Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Mysteries Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302302}\n<Assistant_Title2>Mysteries Circle Data: </>You can view your Mysteries Circle following list and follower list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302302}. You can view like data in <Assistant_System>Like List - Mysteries Circle</>; Mysteries Circle likes are not counted toward the total like count on your personal homepage. \n<Assistant_Title2>Mysteries Circle Actions: </>Within the Mysteries Circle, you can like, comment on, repost, and share other people's Mysteries Circle updates. \n<Assistant_Title2>Message Center: </>In the <Assistant_System>Message Center</> at the top right corner of the Mysteries Circle, you will receive red dot notifications for others liking, commenting/replying to, reposting, or @-ing you in the Mysteries Circle. \n<Assistant_Title2>Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mysteries Circle updates, comment content, or images are non-compliant, they will be removed. </>If you discover any violations or abnormal behavior by other players, please report them or contact customer service promptly. \n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Detail Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Topics]|1394}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mysteries Circle】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Entry: </><Assistant_System>Chat Panel - Mysteries Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302512}\n<Assistant_Title2>My Mysteries Circle: </><Assistant_System>Personal Homepage - Mysteries Circle</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302302}\n<Assistant_Title2>Mysteries Circle Data: </>You can view your Mysteries Circle following list and follower list on your <Assistant_System>Personal Homepage</>{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302302}. You can view like data in <Assistant_System>Like List - Mysteries Circle</>; Mysteries Circle likes are not counted toward the total like count on your personal homepage. \n<Assistant_Title2>Mysteries Circle Actions: </>Within the Mysteries Circle, you can like, comment on, repost, and share other people's Mysteries Circle updates. \n<Assistant_Title2>Message Center: </>In the <Assistant_System>Message Center</> at the top right corner of the Mysteries Circle, you will receive red dot notifications for others liking, commenting/replying to, reposting, or @-ing you in the Mysteries Circle. \n<Assistant_Title2>Note: </><Assistant_Red>If Mysteries Circle updates, comment content, or images are non-compliant, they will be removed. </>If you discover any violations or abnormal behavior by other players, please report them or contact customer service promptly. \n<Assistant_Title3>Basic Function Detail Rules: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Tabs]|1393}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle - Topics]|1394}",
