    ["5200229   俱乐部   其他副本"] = "5200229 Club Other Dungeon",
    ["1. 语音房间最多可容纳1000人。\n2. 法庭扮演语音房间默认是房主设置发言顺序模式，需点击开麦按钮发起上麦申请，房主通过后即可开麦。\n3. 房主可在成员权限设置处调整发言顺序，设置禁言和房间黑名单，也可在右侧侧边栏设置界面，调整房间信息、进行常驻房间续时、转让房主操作。\n4. 在右侧侧边框可分享语音房间链接、发放语音房间礼金。"] = "1. Voice rooms can hold up to 1000 people. \n 2. Court Roleplay voice rooms default to Host-Controlled Speech Order mode; you must click the microphone button to request to speak; once the host approves, you can unmute. \n 3. The host can adjust speech order, set mutes, and manage the room blacklist in Member Permissions. They can also adjust room info, extend the room's duration, or transfer ownership in the right sidebar settings. \n 4. You can share the voice room link or distribute voice room gifts via the right sidebar.",
    ["<HighLight>[%s]</>与<HighLight>[%s]</>的俱乐部宣战已正式开战，胜负即将揭晓！"] = "<HighLight>[%s]</> and <HighLight>[%s]</>'s club war has officially begun, the outcome will soon be revealed!",
    ["Level 60 Competitive Equipment Selection Box"] = "Level 60 Competitive Equipment Selection Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【时之鸦】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>段位奖励展台贴纸\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得时之鸦，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</><Assistant_System>躺赢-段位天梯</>达到一定段位获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Crow of Time】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Rank Reward Display Stand Sticker\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain Crow of Time. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance-Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </><Assistant_System>Easy Win-Ranked Ladder</>Obtained upon reaching a certain rank",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【古典竖琴】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>七日任务奖励展台组件\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>使用后获得古典竖琴，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>七日任务解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Classical Harp】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Display stand component rewarded for 7-Day Quest\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>After use, you will obtain the Classical Harp. You can click <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</> to view and use it.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlock via 7-Day Quest.",
    ["1. Invincible and untargetable when monster spawns."] = "1. Invincible and untargetable when monster spawns.",
    ["Level 64 Equipment Random Box"] = "Level 64 Equipment Random Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【灵视】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1.功能：</>灵视可帮助你发现探索过程中隐藏的重要信息，包括宝箱、任务线索及可交互的解谜点。\n<Assistant_Title2>2.操作：</>探索过程中，点击灵视按钮即可进入灵视状态。\n<Assistant_Title2>3.适用场景：</>探索地图、寻找宝箱、追踪任务目标或解开场景机关时，都可以使用灵视辅助探索。\n<Assistant_Title1>【温馨提示】</>\n遇到找不到目标、无法继续探索或怀疑附近存在隐藏内容时，不妨开启灵视查看周围环境。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Spirit Vision】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>1. Function: </>Spirit Vision helps you discover important hidden information during exploration, including treasure chests, quest clues, and interactive puzzle points. \n<Assistant_Title2>2. Operation: </>During exploration, tap the Spirit Vision button to enter the Spirit Vision state. \n<Assistant_Title2>3. Applicable Scenarios: </>You can use Spirit Vision to assist exploration when exploring maps, searching for treasure chests, tracking quest targets, or solving environmental mechanisms. \n<Assistant_Title1>【Warm Tips】</>\nIf you encounter trouble finding targets, cannot continue exploring, or suspect hidden content nearby, try activating Spirit Vision to check the surrounding environment.",
    ["<Chat_Locate>范围设置</>"] = "<Chat_Locate> Range Settings </>",
    ["<Highlight>金色</>的任务为效率更高的任务，推荐优先完成。"] = "<Highlight>Golden</> quests are more efficient and are recommended to be completed first.",
    ["Level 55 Weapon Box"] = "Level 55 Weapon Box",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【The Unfinished Letter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a small house on the old street of the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era,\" advance to Sequence 9, go to {Location:[廷根(1294,979)]|29459;-2027;-2121;2;5200002;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Edith</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【The Unfinished Letter】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Acting Story</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>There is a small house on the old street of the East District whose owner passed away three months ago. Neighbors say they can hear someone rummaging through things in the house every night.\n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Complete the main story Chapter 2 \"Tides of the Era,\" advance to Последовательность 9, go to {Location:[Тинген(1294,979)]|29459;-2027;-2121;2;5200002;0}, and speak with <Assistant_Red>Edith</> to accept the quest.\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognitive Experience, World Adventure Treasure Progress, Adventure Medal, Invoices",
    ["Level 39 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal"] = "Level 39 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Delete/Block] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Click Avatar </>, \n<Assistant_Title2> Deleting Friends: </> Deleting a friend will mutually terminate the friendship, and they will no longer appear in your friend list. <Assistant_Red> Deleting a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title2> Blocking Friends: </> If you are currently friends, blocking will automatically terminate the friendship mutually, and you will no longer receive private messages from them after blocking. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[好友]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友列表]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[好友-私聊]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[好友-群聊]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[好友-好友度]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[好友-跨服好友]|1411}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Friends - Delete/Block] </>\n<Assistant_Title2> System Entry: </><Assistant_System> Menu - Friends - Click Avatar </>, \n<Assistant_Title2> Deleting Friends: </> Deleting a friend will mutually terminate the friendship, and they will no longer appear in your friend list. <Assistant_Red> Deleting a friend will clear the friendliness between both parties and cannot be recovered </>. Please proceed with caution. \n<Assistant_Title2> Blocking Friends: </> If you are currently friends, blocking will automatically terminate the friendship mutually, and you will no longer receive private messages from them after blocking. \n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Friends]|1406}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friend List]|1407}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Private Chat]|1408}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Group Chat]|1409}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Friendliness]|1410}, {SendAnswer:[Friends - Cross-Server Friends]|1411}",
    ["5200261 Raker Bookstore Multiplayer Scene"] = "5200261 Raker Bookstore Multiplayer Scene",
    ["1. Event Objective: Participate in and complete the sudden events that appear in specific areas to receive generous rewards.\n2. Event Types: Events include three types: <Highlight>\"Story\", \"Challenge\", and \"Competition\".</>\n3. Refresh Rules: When players enter \"Sinful Tingen\", all events meeting the conditions will be refreshed immediately. Among them, the registration time for <Highlight>\"Competition\" events is two minutes</>. The refresh interval for sudden events is based on the time the player enters the scene; <Highlight>\"Challenge\" events refresh approximately every 10 seconds</>, and if an event has ended, it will reappear.\n4. Reward Rules: Reward rules vary by event type. <Highlight>\"Story\" events grant rewards upon success, \"Challenge\" events have tiered rewards, \"Hard · Challenge\" events do not have tiered rewards, and \"Competition\" events distribute rewards based on player ranking.</>\n5. Reward Limit: There is no limit to the number of times a single player can receive rewards from events per week, but <Highlight>there is a weekly cap on Bounty Points.</>\n6. Failure Conditions: If the objective (if any) is not completed within the event time limit, the event is considered failed.\n7. Departure Judgment: If you move too far away from the event area before the event is completed, it will be judged as abandoning the event, and you will not be able to receive rewards.\n8. Player Combat Power: Attribute balancing will be applied upon entering the \"Sinful Tingen\" plane. The \"Story\", \"Hard · Challenge\", and \"Competition\" modes within it are all attribute-balanced gameplay. <Highlight>\"Fierce Battle · Bonnie\" is affected by player combat power, with attribute balancing based on a gradient converted from the player's combat power.</>"] = "1. Event Objective: Participate in and complete the sudden events that appear in specific areas to receive generous rewards.\n2. Event Types: Events include three types: <Highlight>\"Story\", \"Challenge\", and \"Competition\".</>\n3. Refresh Rules: When players enter \"Sinful Тинген\", all events meeting the conditions will be refreshed immediately. Among them, the registration time for <Highlight>\"Competition\" events is two minutes</>. The refresh interval for sudden events is based on the time the player enters the scene; <Highlight>\"Challenge\" events refresh approximately every 10 seconds</>, and if an event has ended, it will reappear.\n4. Reward Rules: Reward rules vary by event type. <Highlight>\"Story\" events grant rewards upon success, \"Challenge\" events have tiered rewards, \"Hard · Challenge\" events do not have tiered rewards, and \"Competition\" events distribute rewards based on player ranking.</>\n5. Reward Limit: There is no limit to the number of times a single player can receive rewards from events per week, but <Highlight>there is a weekly cap on Bounty Points.</>\n6. Failure Conditions: If the objective (if any) is not completed within the event time limit, the event is considered failed.\n7. Departure Judgment: If you move too far away from the event area before the event is completed, it will be judged as abandoning the event, and you will not be able to receive rewards.\n8. Player Combat Power: Attribute balancing will be applied upon entering the \"Sinful Тинген\" plane. The \"Story\", \"Hard · Challenge\", and \"Competition\" modes within it are all attribute-balanced gameplay. <Highlight>\"Fierce Battle · Bonnie\" is affected by player combat power, with attribute balancing based on a gradient converted from the player's combat power.</>",
    ["Level 1 - Acquaintance"] = "Level 1 - Acquaintance",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Topics】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Create Topic: </>You can add topics when posting updates. You can click the topic button to select an existing topic or add a new one using the #TopicName# format.\n<Assistant_Title2>Topic Leaderboard: </>The Topic tab displays a ranking of popular topics.\n<Assistant_Title2>Topic Updates: </>Click on a topic to view all updates under that topic.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Mystery Circle - Topics】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Create Topic: </>You can add topics when posting updates. You can click the topic button to select an existing topic or add a new one using the #TopicName# format.\n<Assistant_Title2>Topic Leaderboard: </>The Topic tab displays a ranking of popular topics.\n<Assistant_Title2>Topic Updates: </>Click on a topic to view all updates under that topic.\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches: </>{SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle]|1390}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Updates]|1391}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Relationships]|1392}, {SendAnswer:[Mysteries Circle-Tabs]|1393}",
    ["1：解除限制，其他：恢复"] = "1: Remove restriction, other: Restore",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>历史学者·二</>\n<Assistant_Title2>成就分类：</>养成-成长\n<Assistant_Title2>解锁条件：</>解锁3个有“原著”标签的关系"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Historian II</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Progression-Growth\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>Unlock 3 relationships with the \"Original Work\" tag",
    ["60级12人本Boss困难"] = "Level 60 12-Player Dungeon Boss Hard",
    ["2件随机装备 + 8金币"] = "2 random Equipment + 8 Gold Coins",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【剧情事件】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>介绍：</>剧情事件记录着罪恶廷根中发生的各类案件。完成剧情事件可推进罪恶廷根主线故事，逐步解锁新的支线剧情，并揭开隐藏在城市暗面中的秘密。\n<Assistant_Title2>开启规则：</>\n1.完成指定前置剧情事件。\n2.部分事件达到等级要求。\n<Assistant_Title2>助手建议：</>\n1.首次进入玩法优先通关剧情事件。\n2.剧情事件将解锁新的挑战事件、竞技事件以及更多剧情内容，推进玩法进度。"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Story Event】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Introduction: </>Story Events record various cases that occur in Sinful Тинген. Completing Story Events advances the main storyline of Sinful Тинген, gradually unlocking new side quests and uncovering secrets hidden in the dark side of the city. \n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Rules: </>\n1. Complete the specified prerequisite Story Event. \n2. Some events have level requirements. \n<Assistant_Title2>Assistant's Advice: </>\n1. Prioritize completing Story Events when first entering the gameplay. \n2. Story Events will unlock new Challenge Events, Competition Events, and more story content, advancing your gameplay progress.",
    ["72级12人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 72 12-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【前往查看】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>After Story Mode is enabled, the camera will zoom in to a cinematic perspective within story planes to enhance immersion. You can manually toggle it on/off by clicking the switch under the photo button on the lower left of the screen, or permanently disable it in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Dynamic Story Mode Activation</>. Once disabled, Story Mode will no longer activate upon entering story planes (except for some combat scenes).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[剧情模式下外观隐藏]|1324}"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Story Mode】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>System Settings:</>Menu-Settings-Perspective-Story Mode{JumpToUI:[【Go to View】]|1302534}\n<Assistant_Title2>System Introduction:</>After Story Mode is enabled, the camera will zoom in to a cinematic perspective within story planes to enhance immersion. You can manually toggle it on/off by clicking the switch under the photo button on the lower left of the screen, or permanently disable it in <Highlight>Settings-Perspective-Story Mode-Dynamic Story Mode Activation</>. Once disabled, Story Mode will no longer activate upon entering story planes (except for some combat scenes).\n<Assistant_Title3>Recommended Searches:</>{SendAnswer:[Hide Appearance in Story Mode]|1324}",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>Alchemist</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment refinement reaches 100%"] = "<Assistant_Title1>Alchemist</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Achievement Category: </>Growth - Equipment\n<Assistant_Title2>Unlock Condition: </>All equipment refinement reaches 100%",
    ["62级12人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 62 12-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<DecH>工艺：</>浅金柔缎・红绒菱格・安眠睡袍\n像旧宅走廊铺了一冬的地砖，踩上无声，却藏着说不清的安稳与温存。"] = "<DecH> Craft: </> Light Gold Soft Satin · Red Velvet Diamond Pattern · Slumber Robe \n Like the floor tiles of an old house corridor that have been laid for a winter, stepping on them is silent, yet they hide an indescribable stability and warmth.",
    ["Level 40 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal"] = "Level 40 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【Surprised】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand expression.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default."] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Surprised】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand expression.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【飒爽】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>创角发型\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>创角后获得飒爽，可点击<Assistant_System>外观-换装</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>创角时可选择获取一款发型，剩余发型后续可通过<Assistant_System>商城</>获取"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Brisk】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Character creation hairstyle.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>Obtain Brisk after character creation. You can view and equip it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Outfits</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Choose one hairstyle during character creation; remaining hairstyles can be obtained later via <Assistant_System>Shop</>.",
    ["<Assistant_Title1>【生气】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>描述：</>默认展台表情\n<Assistant_Title2>使用：</>可点击<Assistant_System>外观-展台</>查看并使用。\n<Assistant_Title2>获取：</>默认解锁"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Angry】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Description: </>Default display stand expression.\n<Assistant_Title2>Usage: </>You can view and use it by clicking <Assistant_System>Appearance - Display Stand</>.\n<Assistant_Title2>Acquisition: </>Unlocked by default.",
    ["1.点击邮件正文收藏按钮可将邮件加入收藏夹\n2.收藏前需先领取完邮件中的所有附件\n3.加入收藏夹，可在收藏夹中永久保留此邮件"] = "1. Click the favorite button in the email body to add the email to your favorites. \n2. You must collect all attachments in the email before favoriting. \n3. Once added to favorites, this email will be permanently kept in your favorites folder.",
